  (21301, 'Number System & Simplification', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'जर 8 × 2 = 4, 8 × 4 = 2, 16 × 8 = 2 तर 40 × 5 = ?', '{"A": "2", "B": "8", "C": "20", "D": "10"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B (8) — Operator division: 8×2=4 (8÷2), 16×8=2; 40×5=40÷5=8. × multiplication 200; halve once 20/10 — चुकीचा पर्याय options अर्धवट logic/सापळा चुकीची निवड अधिकृत कीनुसार limb miss; coach voice मध्ये original names/years preserve पर्याय A (2) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे; योग्य उत्तर B (8) आहे; पर्याय C (20) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे; योग्य उत्तर B (8) आहे; पर्याय D (10) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे; योग्य उत्तर B (8) आहे।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Number System & Simplification"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21302, 'Direction Sense', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'सकाळी नीलम सूर्याच्या दिशेने चालायला सुरुवात करते आणि 8 किमी चालते. ती 90° च्या कोनात डावीकडे वळते आणि सरळ 12 किमी चालते आणि पुन्हा 90° च्या कोनात उजवीकडे वळते आणि 8 किमी जाते. तर ती सुरुवातीच्या स्थळापासून किती अंतर दूर आहे आणि कोणत्या दिशेला आहे?', '{"A": "28 किमी पूर्वेला", "B": "18 किमी ईशान्यकडे", "C": "20 किमी ईशान्यकडे", "D": "20 किमी पूर्वेकडे"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'पर्याय C (20 किमी ईशान्यकडे) — Net 8+8=16 km east, 12 km north ⇒ √(16²+12²)=20 km north-east। 28 east-फक्त; 18 legs mis-add vector combine — चुकीचा पर्याय options अर्धवट logic/सापळा चुकीची निवड अधिकृत कीनुसार limb miss; coach voice मध्ये original names/years preserve पर्याय A (28 किमी पूर्वेला) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्याख्या/तथ्याशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय B (18 किमी ईशान्यकडे) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्याख्या/तथ्याशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय D (20 किमी पूर्वेकडे) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्याख्या/तथ्याशी जुळत नाही।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Direction Sense"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21303, 'Algebra & Equations', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'बँकेतील भरतीसाठी 20 प्रश्नांची एक परीक्षा घेण्यात आली. त्या परीक्षेत प्रत्येक बरोबर उत्तरासाठी 5 गुण मिळतात तर प्रत्येक चुकलेल्या उत्तरासाठी 2 गुण कमी होतात. स्पंदनला त्या परीक्षेत फक्त 10 प्रश्न बरोबर सोडविता आले तर त्याला किती गुण मिळतील?', '{"A": "20", "B": "30", "C": "40", "D": "50"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'गणितात हे सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय B येतो। Ten correct 10×5=50; ten wrong penalty 10×2=20 net 30 — 20/40/50 all unanswered/all — /; मध्ये original names/years विषय-पॅकमध्ये हा बिंदू पुन्हा विचारला जाऊ शकतो, म्हणून मुख्य तथ्य एकत्र लक्षात ठेवा.।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Algebra & Equations"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21304, 'Algebra & Equations', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'दोन संख्यांची बेरीज 50 आहे. त्यांच्यातील फरक 22 आहे, तर त्यातील लहान संख्या कोणती?', '{"A": "28", "B": "14", "C": "05", "D": "30"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B हे योग्य निवड आहे। Sum 50 difference 22 smaller (50−22)/2=14 — 28 larger; 30/05 add — /; मध्ये original names/years MPSC प्रश्नपत्रिकेत अशा तपशीलांची पुनरावृत्ती होते, म्हणून मुख्य संकल्पना लक्षात ठेवा.।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Algebra & Equations"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21305, 'Probability & Statistics', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'जर खालील संख्यात्मक माहितीचा मध्यमान 6 असेल तर खालील माहितीतील ''P'' ची किंमत किती असेल? X: 2, 4, 6, 10, P+5 f: 3, 2, 3, 1, 2', '{"A": "66", "B": "14", "C": "07", "D": "03"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'पर्याय C (07) — Mean 6 frequency 11 ⇒ Σfx=66; known 52 ⇒ 2(P+5)=14 ⇒ P=7. P=66/14 unknown class mark; P=3 under-shoot mean — चुकीचा पर्याय options अर्धवट logic/सापळा चुकीची निवड अधिकृत कीनुसार limb miss; coach voice मध्ये original names/years preserve पर्याय A (66) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे; योग्य उत्तर C (07) आहे; पर्याय B (14) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे; योग्य उत्तर C (07) आहे; पर्याय D (03) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे; योग्य उत्तर C (07) आहे।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Probability & Statistics"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21306, 'Blood Relations', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'एका गटात A, B, C, D आणि E अशा पाच व्यक्ती आहेत. त्यात B, C चा भाऊ आहे. या 5 व्यक्तीत एक जोडपे आहे. E हा नवरा आहे. A आणि D मैत्रीणी आहेत आणि त्यांनी लग्न केलेले नाही. तर E ची बायको कोण?', '{"A": "B", "B": "C", "C": "D", "D": "A"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'E husband फक्त couple; B C''s brother male; A/D unmarried females — C E''s wife. B male sibling or A/D wife couple constraint violate — चुकीचा पर्याय options अर्धवट logic/सापळा चुकीची निवड अधिकृत कीनुसार limb miss; coach voice मध्ये original names/years preserve पर्याय A (B) मध्ये किमान एक जोडी चुकीच्या क्रमाने मांडली आहे, म्हणून ती वर्गातून वगळावी; पर्याय C (D) मध्ये किमान एक जोडी चुकीच्या क्रमाने मांडली आहे, म्हणून ती वर्गातून वगळावी; पर्याय D (A) मध्ये किमान एक जोडी चुकीच्या क्रमाने मांडली आहे, म्हणून ती वर्गातून वगळावी।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Blood Relations"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21307, 'Puzzles', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, '73 विद्यार्थी असलेल्या वर्गातील काही विद्यार्थी केवळ गिटार आणि काही केवळ बासरी वाजवू शकतात. अकरा विद्यार्थी दोन्ही वाजवू शकतात. जर गिटार वाजवू शकणाऱ्या विद्यार्थ्यांची संख्या 31 असेल तर केवळ गिटार वाजवू शकणाऱ्या व केवळ बासरी वाजवू शकणाऱ्या विद्यार्थ्यांची संख्या किती?', '{"A": "43 व 21", "B": "42 व 21", "C": "42 व 22", "D": "42 व 20"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D (42 व 20) — फक्त guitar 31−11=20; फक्त flute 73−31=42 — अदलाबदल जोडी or overlap eleven double-count — paray पर्याय अदलाबदल/जोड्यांची गोंधळ करणे मानक जुळणी-the-जोडी सापळा; योग्य combination syllabus table लक्षात ठेव. पर्याय A (43 व 21) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्याख्या/तथ्याशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय B (42 व 21) या प्रश्नाच्या मुख्य संकल्पनेशी सुसंगत नाही; पर्याय C (42 व 22) या प्रश्नाच्या मुख्य संकल्पनेशी सुसंगत नाही।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Puzzles"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21308, 'Number & Letter Series', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'गाळलेल्या जागी योग्य शब्द शोधा. CX, FU, IR, ___, OL', '{"A": "LO", "B": "OM", "C": "MP", "D": "OO"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A (LO) — First letter +3 C→F→I→L; second −3 X→U→R→O — missing LO. OM/MP/OO dual progression OL toward break — paray options अदलाबदल/grid गोंधळ करणे मानक जोड-the-pair सापळा; अधिकृत कीनुसार combination syllabus table लक्षात ठेव पर्याय B (OM) या वाक्यातील व्याकरण/अर्थाशी शब्दयोगी अव्ययाच्या निकषाशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय C (MP) या वाक्यातील व्याकरण/अर्थाशी शब्दयोगी अव्ययाच्या निकषाशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय D (OO) या वाक्यातील व्याकरण/अर्थाशी शब्दयोगी अव्ययाच्या निकषाशी जुळत नाही।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Number & Letter Series"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21309, 'Number & Letter Series', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'गाळलेल्या जागेतील संज्ञा शोधा. X 11, V 13, S 17, O 23, ___', '{"A": "K 25", "B": "I 27", "C": "J 31", "D": "F 32"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'पर्याय C (J 31) — अक्षरे 2,3,4,5 अक्षरे मागे जातात (X→V→S→O→J) आणि संख्या म्हणजे अग्रिम अमूल अंक: 11,13,17,23,31। K 25 (−5 ने तुटते), I 27/F 32 (23 नंतरचा अमूल अंक 31 नाही) — या दोन नियमांचा मिलाफ J 31 देतो।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Number & Letter Series"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21310, 'Data Interpretation', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'शाळेत येण्यासाठी विद्यार्थी खालील दळणवळण साधने वापरतात आणि ही माहिती जर पाई चार्ट द्वारा दाखवण्यात आली तर शाळेत पायी येणाऱ्या विद्यार्थ्यांसाठी किती अंशाचा कोन तयार होईल? पायी: 6, गाडी: 4, सायकल: 7, बस: 8, रिक्षा: 5', '{"A": "6°", "B": "30°", "C": "72°", "D": "80°"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Students 6+4+7+8+5=30; walker 6/30×360°=72° — raw 6 degrees or wrong denominator 6°/30°/80° — /; मध्ये original names/years MPSC प्रश्नपत्रिकेत अशा तपशीलांची पुनरावृत्ती होते, म्हणून मुख्य संकल्पना लक्षात ठेवा.।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Data Interpretation"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21311, 'Coding-Decoding', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'रिकाम्या जागेतील अंक शोधा: (4)(3)→11, (2)(4)→60, (3)(5)→?', '{"A": "19", "B": "80", "C": "33", "D": "116"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'गणितात हे सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय D येतो. नमुना (a)(b)→a×b×(a+b)+… 116 for (3)(5) — 19/80/33 smaller product/square (4)(3)→11, (2)(4)→60 anchors चुक — चुकी limb retain करणारे पर्याय factual error bundle; योग्य defective विधान isolate कर. पर्याय A (19) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे; योग्य उत्तर D (116) आहे; पर्याय B (80) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे; पर्याय C (33) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे. पर्याय A (19) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे; पर्याय B (80) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे; पर्याय C (33) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Coding-Decoding"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21312, 'Probability & Statistics', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'एका पिशवीत 10 पांढरे, 16 लाल आणि 14 काळे चेंडू आहेत. जर यादृच्छिकपणे एक चेंडू त्यातून काढण्यात आला तर लाल किंवा काळा चेंडू निघण्याची किती शक्यता आहे?', '{"A": "1/1", "B": "3/4", "C": "7/3", "D": "2/40"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B (3/4) — P(red or black)=(16+14)/40=3/4 — 1/1 certainty wrong; 7/3, 2/40 numerator/denominator invert — चुकीचा पर्याय options अर्धवट logic/सापळा चुकीची निवड अधिकृत कीनुसार limb miss; coach voice मध्ये original names/years preserve पर्याय A (1/1) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्याख्या/तथ्याशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय C (7/3) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्याख्या/तथ्याशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय D (2/40) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्याख्या/तथ्याशी जुळत नाही।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Probability & Statistics"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21313, 'Syllogism & Logical Deduction', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'योग्य निष्कर्ष निवडा: विधान: औरंगाबाद ते चेन्नई प्रवास हवाई मार्गिने जलद होतो. निष्कर्ष: (a) औरंगाबाद आणि चेन्नई ही ठिकाणे हवाई मार्गिने जोडलेली आहे. (b) औरंगाबाद ते चेन्नईसाठी दुसरा कोणताही वळण-वळणाचा मार्ग उपलब्ध नाही.', '{"A": "फक्त (a) हा निष्कर्ष योग्य आहे.", "B": "फक्त (b) हा निष्कर्ष योग्य आहे.", "C": "दोन्ही (a) आणि (b) निष्कर्ष योग्य आहेत.", "D": "दोन्ही (a) आणि (b) निष्कर्ष योग्य नाही."}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Air travel faster ⇒ air (a) alone — speed no ; (b) exclusivity over-claim — /; मध्ये original names/years उत्तर निश्चित करताना प्रश्नातील मुख्य संकल्पना आणि वर्ष लक्षात ठेवा.।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Syllogism & Logical Deduction"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21314, 'Algebra & Equations', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'योग्य गणितीय चिन्हांचा उपयोग करून खालील समीकरण बरोबर करा: 42 □ 6 □ 51 = 201', '{"A": "+ आणि −", "B": "× आणि −", "C": "− आणि +", "D": "+ आणि ×"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'गणितात हे सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय B येतो। plus/multiply overshoot — paray पर्याय अदलाबदल/जोड्यांची गोंधळ करणे मानक जुळणी-the-जोडी सापळा; योग्य combination syllabus table लक्षात ठेव. पर्याय A (+ आणि −) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्याख्या/तथ्याशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय C (− आणि +) या प्रश्नाच्या मुख्य संकल्पनेशी सुसंगत नाही; पर्याय D (+ आणि ×) या प्रश्नाच्या मुख्य संकल्पनेशी सुसंगत नाही।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Algebra & Equations"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21315, 'Algebra & Equations', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'संजयपेक्षा नितीन 3 वर्षांनी मोठा आहे. संजयचे वय किरण च्या वयाच्या दुप्पट आहे. जर त्यांच्या तिघांच्या वयांची एकूण बेरीज 103 आहे. तर नितीन किती वर्षांचा आहे?', '{"A": "20", "B": "34", "C": "40", "D": "43"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'परीक्षेनुसार पर्याय D बरोबर आहे। Kiran k; Sanjay 2k; Nitin 2k+3; 5k+3=103 ⇒ k=20, Nitin 43 — 20/34/40 +3 — /; मध्ये original names/years विषय-पॅकमध्ये हा बिंदू पुन्हा विचारला जाऊ शकतो, म्हणून मुख्य तथ्य एकत्र लक्षात ठेवा.।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Algebra & Equations"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21316, 'Number & Letter Series', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'रिकाम्या जागेसाठी योग्य अंक शोधा. 27, 32, ___, 54, 71, 92', '{"A": "37", "B": "41", "C": "51", "D": "52"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B (41) — Second differences +4: +5,+9,+13,+17,+21 ⇒ 32+9=41 — 37/51/52 flat +5 फक्त accelerating gap miss — चुकीचा पर्याय options अर्धवट logic/सापळा चुकीची निवड अधिकृत कीनुसार limb miss; coach voice मध्ये original names/years preserve पर्याय A (37) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे; योग्य उत्तर B (41) आहे; पर्याय C (51) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे; योग्य उत्तर B (41) आहे; पर्याय D (52) मध्ये चुकीची संख्या/टक्केवारी दिली आहे; योग्य उत्तर B (41) आहे।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Number & Letter Series"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21317, 'Climatology', 'Geography', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'वातावरणात ओझोन वायूचे प्रमाण __________ टक्के आढळते.', '{"A": "0.00006", "B": "0.00005", "C": "0.00007", "D": "0.000006"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'गणितात हे सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय A येतो। Ozone ~0.00006% — 0.00005/07/000006 decimal-place traps — /; मध्ये original names/years MPSC प्रश्नपत्रिकेत अशा तपशीलांची पुनरावृत्ती होते, म्हणून मुख्य संकल्पना लक्षात ठेवा.।', '{"Geography","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Climatology"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21318, 'Indian Rivers & Drainage', 'Geography', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'कोसी नदीच्या पात्र बदलामुळे खालीलपैकी कोणत्या राज्यातील सर्वाधिक जिल्ह्यांना नेहमी पुराचा तडाखा बसतो?', '{"A": "झारखंड", "B": "बिहार आणि उत्तर प्रदेश", "C": "बिहार", "D": "उत्तर प्रदेश"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'पर्याय C (बिहार) — पर्याय A (झारखंड) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्यक्ती/स्थळ/संस्थेशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय B (बिहार आणि उत्तर प्रदेश) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्यक्ती/स्थळ/संस्थेशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय D (उत्तर प्रदेश) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्यक्ती/स्थळ/संस्थेशी जुळत नाही।', '{"Geography","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Indian Rivers & Drainage"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21319, 'Biodiversity & Conservation', 'Geography', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'खालीलपैकी कोणते जैवविविधता स्थळ नाही?', '{"A": "पश्चिम घाट", "B": "पूर्व हिमालय", "C": "अंदमान निकोबार बेटे", "D": "पूर्व घाट"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D हे योग्य निवड आहे। Eastern Ghats not India''s biodiversity hotspots — Western Ghats, Eastern Himalaya, Andaman– — /; मध्ये original names/years उत्तर निश्चित करताना प्रश्नातील मुख्य संकल्पना आणि वर्ष लक्षात ठेवा.।', '{"Geography","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Biodiversity & Conservation"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21320, 'Other', 'Geography', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, '__________ हि मानवनिर्मित आपत्ती आहे.', '{"A": "पूर", "B": "भूस्खलन", "C": "दुष्काळ", "D": "औद्योगिक अपघात"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D (औद्योगिक अपघात) — पर्याय A (पूर) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्यक्ती/स्थळ/संस्थेशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय B (भूस्खलन) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्यक्ती/स्थळ/संस्थेशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय C (दुष्काळ) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्यक्ती/स्थळ/संस्थेशी जुळत नाही।', '{"Geography","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Other"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21321, 'Environmental Laws & Conventions', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'आंतरराष्ट्रीय स्तरावर पर्यावरण विषयक पहिली जागतिक परिषद 5 जून 1972 रोजी कोणत्या शहरात संपन्न झाली?', '{"A": "स्टॉकहोम", "B": "न्युयॉर्क", "C": "लंडन", "D": "बर्मिंगहॅम"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A (स्टॉकहोम) — पर्याय B (न्युयॉर्क) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्यक्ती/स्थळ/संस्थेशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय C (लंडन) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्यक्ती/स्थळ/संस्थेशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय D (बर्मिंगहॅम) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्यक्ती/स्थळ/संस्थेशी जुळत नाही।', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Environmental Laws & Conventions"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21322, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Who among the following has been awarded as the ''Best actor'' (male) at the BRICS film festival 2021?', '{"A": "Nawajuddin Siddique", "B": "Akshay Kumar", "C": "Pankaj Tripathi", "D": "Dhanush"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. Dhanush won Best Actor (Male) at the BRICS Film Festival 2021 for ''Asuran''. Nawazuddin, Akshay Kumar, and Pankaj Tripathi were strong names in Indian cinema that year but did not take this particular award.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21323, 'Blood Relations', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2022, 'मुलीचे वय 16 वर्षे आहे आणि मुलगी ही आई-वडीलांच्या लग्नानंतर 1 वर्षानी जन्मलेली आहे. जर आई वडीलांच्या वयांची व त्यांच्या वर्षांची बेरीज 116 आहे. आईचे वय वडीलांच्या वयापेक्षा 3 वर्षांनी कमी असेल तर वडीलांचे वय किती आहे?', '{"A": "56 वर्षे 6 महिने", "B": "51 वर्षे", "C": "48 वर्षे", "D": "99 वर्षे"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'गणितात हा शॉर्टकट — पर्याय B। मुलगी 16, लग्नानंतर 1 वर्ष = लग्न 17 वर्षांपूर्वी; आई-वडील बेरीज 116, वडील 3 वर्ष मोठे → वडील 51. 56½/48/99 बेरीज-वय विभाजन चुकी. पर्याय A (56 वर्षे 6 महिने) या प्रश्नात विचारलेल्या व्याख्या/तथ्याशी जुळत नाही; पर्याय C (48 वर्षे) या प्रश्नाच्या मुख्य संकल्पनेशी सुसंगत नाही; पर्याय D (99 वर्षे) या प्रश्नाच्या मुख्य संकल्पनेशी सुसंगत नाही।', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2022","Blood Relations"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21324, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Who is the First Indian Woman to win two medals in the Tokyo 2020 (held in Aug-Sep 2021) Paralympics Games?', '{"A": "Avani Lekhara", "B": "Bhavina Patel", "C": "Ekta Bhyan", "D": "Kashish Lakra"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The verified answer here is option A. Avani Lekhara became the first Indian woman to win two Paralympic medals at Tokyo 2020 — gold in 10m air rifle SH1 and bronze in 50m rifle 3 positions SH1. Bhavina Patel also shone in table tennis but did not double-medal.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21325, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'As per Report 2021 of Global Observatory on Donation and Transplantation (GODT), India has been ranked _______ in Organ donation and transplantation in World.', '{"A": "First", "B": "Second", "C": "Third", "D": "Fifth"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'On this one, option C is correct. The Global Observatory on Donation and Transplantation (GODT) Report 2021 placed India third in the world for organ donation and transplantation activity. First and second are typically taken by leading Western and East Asian programmes — fifth is too low for India''s volume.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21326, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Who is the first Indian Physicist to win the Prestigious Boltzmann Medal for the year 2022?', '{"A": "Professor Deepak Dhar", "B": "Ashok Kumar Barua", "C": "Bimla Buti", "D": "D.D. Bhawalkar"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. Professor Deepak Dhar became the first Indian physicist to receive the Boltzmann Medal in 2022, awarded by IUPAP for outstanding contributions to statistical physics. Ashok Kumar Barua, Bimla Buti, and D.D. Bhawalkar are respected physicists but not Boltzmann Medal winners.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21327, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Who is the author of the book, ''Beyond Possible''?', '{"A": "Bernadetee Mcdonald", "B": "Nimsdai Purja", "C": "Arunima Sinha", "D": "Stephen Alter"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Go with option B. ''Beyond Possible'' is the memoir of Nimsdai Purja, the Nepalese-British mountaineer who climbed all fourteen 8000-metre peaks in record time. Bernadette McDonald, Arunima Sinha, and Stephen Alter have written on mountains and adventure but not under this title.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21328, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which Credit Scheme is launched for Prisoners of Yerwada Central Jail in 2022 as a Pilot Scheme?', '{"A": "Sahanubhuti Scheme", "B": "Aage badho Scheme", "C": "Bank for Prisoners", "D": "Jivhala Scheme"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option D. Bank of Maharashtra launched ''Jivhala'' as a pilot credit scheme for inmates of Yerwada Central Jail in 2022, helping them access formal banking on release. Sahanubhuti, Aage Badho, and Bank for Prisoners are distractors from other welfare contexts.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21329, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Who has been appointed as a new Vice Chairman of NITI Aayog in May 2022?', '{"A": "Rajiv Kumar", "B": "Ramesh Chand", "C": "Jayati Ghosh", "D": "Suman K Bery"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option D. Suman K. Bery was appointed Vice Chairman of NITI Aayog in May 2022, succeeding Rajiv Kumar. Ramesh Chand served as NITI member-agriculture; Jayati Ghosh and Rajiv Kumar held other roles but not this May 2022 vice-chair appointment.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21330, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following statements are correct about the ''Mukhyamantri Tirth Yatra Yojana''? (a) This scheme is initiated by Delhi government in 2018. (b) Any citizen of India can avail this scheme. (c) Ayodhya is recently included in the list of places that one can visit under this scheme.', '{"A": "Only (a) and (b)", "B": "Only (a) and (c)", "C": "Only (b) and (c)", "D": "All of the above"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. Delhi''s Mukhyamantri Tirth Yatra Yojana started in 2018 and later added Ayodhya to its pilgrimage list — so (a) and (c) hold. Statement (b) is incorrect because the scheme is for eligible Delhi residents, not any citizen of India.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21331, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following option is associated with Amrit Sarovar Mission?', '{"A": "Water Conservation", "B": "Soil Conservation", "C": "Air Pollution", "D": "Fishery"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Pick option A. Mission Amrit Sarovar aims to develop and rejuvenate at least 75 water bodies in every district — a water-conservation push tied to Azadi Ka Amrit Mahotsav. Soil conservation, air pollution, and fishery are separate government agendas.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21332, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Select the correct statement/s - (India - Central Asia Summit) (a) The First India - Central Asia Summit held in January, 2022 (b) Republic of Tajikistan, Republic of Uzbekistan were present for the Summit.', '{"A": "Only (a)", "B": "Only (b)", "C": "Both (a) and (b)", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Straight to the answer — option C. The first India–Central Asia Summit was held virtually in January 2022, with leaders including the Presidents of Tajikistan and Uzbekistan among the five Central Asian republics invited. Both statements in the stem are therefore correct.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21333, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following Organisation is organising a special programme for school children called ''Young Scientist Programme'' ''Yuva Vigyani Karyakram'' ''YUVIKA''?', '{"A": "UNICEF", "B": "Bhabha Atomic Research Centre (BARC)", "C": "Indian Space Research Organisation (ISRO)", "D": "Defence Research and Development Organisation (DRDO)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. ISRO runs YUVIKA — Yuva Vigyani Karyakram — a residential programme to groom school students in space science. UNICEF, BARC, and DRDO run youth or research initiatives but not this specific Young Scientist Programme.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21334, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '''Remove laws that harm, create laws that empower'' is the theme of which day?', '{"A": "Zero Discrimination Day", "B": "World AIDS Day", "C": "World Equality Day", "D": "World Social Justice Day"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'On this one, option A is correct. Zero Discrimination Day (1 March), observed by UNAIDS, carried the theme ''Remove laws that harm, create laws that empower''. World AIDS Day, World Equality Day, and World Social Justice Day use different annual themes.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21335, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Rajiv Gandhi Orang National Park, which has been renamed as Orang National Park, is located in which Indian State?', '{"A": "Andhra Pradesh", "B": "Karnataka", "C": "Assam", "D": "Uttarakhand"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. Orang National Park — earlier Rajiv Gandhi Orang National Park — sits on the north bank of the Brahmaputra in Assam and is often called the ''Mini Kaziranga''. Andhra Pradesh, Karnataka, and Uttarakhand host other famous parks but not Orang.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21336, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '_______ has been appointed as the chairman of the ISRO, the Indian Space Research Institute in January, 2022.', '{"A": "Dr. K. Sivan", "B": "Dr. S. Somnath", "C": "Dr. K. Radhakrishnan", "D": "Prof. MGK Menon"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Go with option B. Dr S. Somnath took over as ISRO Chairman in January 2022, replacing Dr K. Sivan. Radhakrishnan and Prof. MGK Menon were earlier chairmen — useful timeline anchors when MPSC asks ''who in January 2022''.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21337, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which operation was launched by Punjab''s Excise Department in 2020 to curb illicit liquor trading related crimes?', '{"A": "Operation Black Cobra", "B": "Operation Red Rose", "C": "Operation Black Bull", "D": "Operation Prahar"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Pick option B. Punjab''s Excise Department launched Operation Red Rose in 2020 to crack down on illicit liquor trade and related crime. Black Cobra, Black Bull, and Prahar sound plausible but belong to other enforcement drives in different states or years.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21338, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'In which year the British accepted the demand for making the constituent assembly of India?', '{"A": "1938", "B": "1939", "C": "1940", "D": "1942"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Straight to the answer — option C. The August Offer of 1940 was the first time the British formally accepted the principle of a constituent assembly for framing India''s constitution. 1938–39 saw Congress demands but no acceptance; 1942 brought the Quit India movement, not this concession.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21339, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following amendments imposed restrictions on the Fundamental Rights of the citizens to protect the sovereignty and integrity of the country?', '{"A": "14th Amendment", "B": "16th Amendment", "C": "24th Amendment", "D": "39th Amendment"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. The 16th Amendment (1963) added ''the sovereignty and integrity of India'' as a ground to restrict freedoms under Article 19, tightening limits on speech and association. The 14th, 24th, and 39th Amendments dealt with citizenship, property, and emergency-era changes — not this specific restriction.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21340, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'According to the article 154 of the Indian Constitution executive power of State is vested in the hands of _______.', '{"A": "Chief Minister", "B": "Council of Ministers", "C": "The Governor", "D": "None of these"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. Article 154 vests the executive power of the State in the Governor, who exercises it either directly or through officers subordinate to him. The Chief Minister and Council of Ministers aid and advise the Governor — they do not hold the constitutional vesting clause.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21341, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Match the following: (a) Habeas-corpus → (i) To transfer a case from lower to higher court (b) Mandamus → (ii) To look into legality of a post (c) Quo warranto → (iii) To command authority to Perform its duty (d) Certiorari → (iv) To look into legality of arrest', '{"A": "(iv), (ii), (i), (iii)", "B": "(iv), (iii), (ii), (i)", "C": "(ii), (i), (iii), (iv)", "D": "(ii), (iii), (iv), (i)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B is correct. Match the pairs: Habeas corpus checks the legality of detention — (iv); Mandamus commands a public authority to perform its duty — (iii); Quo warranto questions the legality of holding a public office — (ii); Certiorari transfers a case up or quashes a lower court''s order — (i).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21342, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '_______ round-table conferences were held in London from 1930 to 1932 to see how best Indians could administer their country.', '{"A": "Two", "B": "Four", "C": "Three", "D": "Five"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The right pick is option C. Three Round Table Conferences met in London between 1930 and 1932 to discuss constitutional reform and Indian self-government under the Simon Commission aftermath. Two or four conferences is a common count trap — memorise ''three'' for MPSC chronology.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21343, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'According to article 243 E of the Indian Constitution every gram panchayat unless dissolved earlier under any law for the time being in force, shall continue for five years from _______.', '{"A": "the date of declaration of election results", "B": "the date of declaration of election", "C": "the date appointed for its first meeting after elections", "D": "the beginning of first financial year after the Panchayat elections"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Go with option C. Article 243E fixes the five-year term of a gram panchayat from the date appointed for its first meeting after elections — not from result declaration, poll day, or the next financial year. That first-meeting date is the statutory starting point.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21344, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'What are all the nine Articles covered under Part XVII of the Constitution?', '{"A": "Article 333 to 341", "B": "Article 334 to 342", "C": "Article 332 to 340", "D": "Article 343 to 351"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. Part XVII of the Constitution covers the Official Language and runs from Article 343 to Article 351 — nine articles in all. The other ranges either spill into Part XVI on special provisions or start Part XVIII on emergency provisions.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21345, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Fundamental duties were included on the recommendation of which Committee?', '{"A": "Devraj Committee", "B": "Karan Singh Committee", "C": "Swarn Singh Committee", "D": "Kripalani Committee"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Pick option C. The Swaran Singh Committee (1976) recommended inserting Fundamental Duties, which the 42nd Amendment added as Part IVA Article 51A. Devraj, Karan Singh, and Kripalani committees touched other constitutional reforms but not this list.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21346, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following is not the functions of Gram Sevak?', '{"A": "Proper utilization of Gram Panchayat Funds", "B": "Preparation of Gram Sabha Report", "C": "Collection of Various Taxes prescribed by the Government", "D": "None of these"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The examiner has marked option D. Gram Sevaks routinely handle panchayat fund use, gram sabha reporting, and government-prescribed tax collection — all three listed items are standard duties. Since none of A, B, or C is a ''non-function'', ''None of these'' is the correct choice.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21347, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'By which Amendment the 11th Fundamental Duty was later added to the list? (51A(K))', '{"A": "42nd Amendment Act - 1976", "B": "52nd Amendment Act - 1980", "C": "62nd Amendment Act - 1992", "D": "86th Amendment Act - 2002"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. The 11th Fundamental Duty — Article 51A(k), making parents/guardians provide education to children aged 6–14 — came through the 86th Amendment Act, 2002. The 42nd Amendment added the original ten duties in 1976; 52nd and 62nd dealt with anti-defection and reservation tenure.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21348, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Match the following: (a) Rand and Ayerst''s Murder → (i) V.D. Savarkar (b) Abhinav Bharat → (ii) Anant Laxman Kanhere (c) Justice Jackson''s Murder → (iii) Madan Lal Dhingra (d) Curzon Wyllies Murder → (iv) Chaphekar Brothers', '{"A": "(iv), (i), (ii), (iii)", "B": "(iii), (ii), (iv), (i)", "C": "(i), (iii), (ii), (iv)", "D": "(ii), (i), (iii), (iv)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. Pair each incident with its actor: Rand and Ayerst (Chapekar brothers), Abhinav Bharat (Savarkar), Justice Jackson (Anant Laxman Kanhere), Curzon Wyllie (Madan Lal Dhingra) — sequence (iv), (i), (ii), (iii).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21349, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following statements are true about Narayan Meghaji Lokhande? (a) Founder of Labour Movement (b) Establishment of Bombay mill hands Association in 1884 (c) ''Raobahadur'' award by the British Government (d) Establishment of Maharashtra Labour Union', '{"A": "(a) and (b) only", "B": "(a), (b) and (c) only", "C": "(b), (c) and (d) only", "D": "(a), (c) and (d) only"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Working through it, option B is the one. Narayan Meghaji Lokhande is remembered as a pioneer of the Bombay labour movement, he helped set up the Bombay Mill-Hands'' Association (1884), and the British honoured him with the title ''Raobahadur'' — statements (a), (b) and (c) stand. The Maharashtra Labour Union came much later and is not his work, so (d) drops out.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21350, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'In which Session of National Congress the two groups came together again?', '{"A": "Surat Session", "B": "Lucknow Session", "C": "Faizpur Session", "D": "Allahabad Session"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. After the 1907 Surat split, Moderates and Extremists reunited at the Lucknow Session of 1916 under the joint leadership of Tilak and Annie Besant.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
INSERT INTO pyq_questions (id, topic, subject, exam, year, question, options, correct, explanation, tags, difficulty)
VALUES
  (21351, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Identify the person based on the following description: (a) First Journalist in Marathi (b) The teacher of Prince of Akkalkot (c) Founder of Marathi Newspapers (d) Director of Colaba Weather Observatory', '{"A": "Dadabhai Naoroji", "B": "Bhau Daji Lad", "C": "Balshastri Jambhekar", "D": "Jagannath Shankar Sheth"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The right pick is option C. Balshastri Jambhekar edited the first Marathi newspaper Darpan, taught the Akkalkot prince, launched early Marathi journalism, and headed the Colaba Observatory — all four clues fit one name.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21352, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Who was the Chairman of first All Bengal Students Council held in 1928?', '{"A": "Devendranath Tagore", "B": "Pandit Jawaharlal Nehru", "C": "Jayprakash Narayan", "D": "Ravindranath Tagore"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. The inaugural All Bengal Students'' Conference in September 1928 was presided over by Pandit Jawaharlal Nehru; Pramod Kumar Ghoshal became president of the association itself, not chairman of that opening session.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21353, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Name the Social Reformer who got married to a Widow?', '{"A": "Gopal Ganesh Agarkar", "B": "Justice M.G. Ranade", "C": "Keshavchandra Sen", "D": "Maharshi Dhondo Keshav Karve"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'On this one, option D is correct. Maharshi Dhondo Keshav Karve married a widow in 1893 and made widow remarriage a lived example of his social-reform mission — the other names are reformers but not remembered chiefly for this act.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21354, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Match the following: Revolt Centre → Leadership (a) Kolhapur → (i) Appasaheb Patvardhan (b) Jamkhandi → (ii) Chimasaheb (c) Aurangabad → (iii) Babasaheb Bhave (d) Nargund → (iv) Phida Ali', '{"A": "(i), (ii), (iv), (iii)", "B": "(ii), (i), (iv), (iii)", "C": "(ii), (iv), (iii), (i)", "D": "(i), (ii), (iii), (iv)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Pick option B. Per the official answer, the 1857 revolt centres map as Kolhapur–Chimasaheb, Jamkhandi–Appasaheb Patvardhan, Aurangabad–Phida Ali, Nargund–Babasaheb Bhave — code (ii), (i), (iv), (iii). Match from the list the paper gave rather than reshuffling from memory.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21355, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Deindustrialization of India in British Period means: (a) Decline of Handicraft Industry in India (b) Decline of Cottage Industry (c) Development in rural life (d) Development in agriculture', '{"A": "(a) and (b) only", "B": "(b) and (c) only", "C": "(c) and (d) only", "D": "All of the above"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Go with option A. ''Deindustrialisation'' under British rule chiefly means the ruin of Indian handicrafts and cottage industries through factory competition and one-way trade — not rural uplift or agricultural ''development'' in the positive sense.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21356, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Who was the first Indian Lady, who received Degree in Medical Science in America?', '{"A": "Supriya Joshi", "B": "Anandibai Joshi", "C": "Ramabai Ranade", "D": "Anutai Wagh"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Working through it, option B is the one. Anandibai Joshi graduated from the Women''s Medical College of Pennsylvania in 1886 — the first Indian woman to earn a medical degree in America.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21357, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Where was the first Revolt of the Peasants occured on 12th May, 1875?', '{"A": "Baramati", "B": "Pune", "C": "Supe", "D": "Chakan"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. The Deccan agrarian disturbances of 1875 began on 12 May at Supe (Supa) in Pune district when peasants attacked moneylenders'' shops and debt bonds — the spark for the wider riots.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21358, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following Famous Personalities were produced by ''Bharat Sevak Samaj''? (a) Shrinivas Shastri (b) Pandit Hridaynath Kunjru, Thakkarbappa (c) N.M. Joshi, Kakasaheb Limaye (d) Vishnushastri Chiplunkar, Keshavrao Bagde', '{"A": "(a) and (b) only", "B": "(b) and (c) only", "C": "(a), (b) and (c) only", "D": "(b), (c) and (d) only"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The examiner has marked option C. Bharat Sevak Samaj (1915) nurtured social workers such as Shrinivas Shastri, Hridaynath Kunjru and Thakkarbappa, and trade-union figures like N.M. Joshi and Kakasaheb Limaye — not Chiplunkar or Bagde.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21359, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which Commission was appointed by the Bombay Government to inquire into the on going Peasant discontent in the South?', '{"A": "Land Revenue Act Commission", "B": "Deccan Riots Commission", "C": "The Deccan Agriculture Commission", "D": "Land Owners Commission"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B is correct. Alarmed by peasant violence in the Deccan, the Bombay Government appointed the Deccan Riots Commission (1876) to probe the causes of the 1875 disturbances.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21360, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Who was the President of ''Asprushyata Nivarak Parishad'' held in Mumbai in 1918?', '{"A": "Chhatrapati Shahu Maharaj", "B": "Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar", "C": "Sayajirao Gaikwad", "D": "Nanabhai Haridas"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Go with option C. Maharshi Vitthal Ramji Shinde organised the Asprushyata Nivarak Parishad at Bombay in March 1918 and Maharaja Sayajirao Gaikwad presided over the session.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21361, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following programmes were started by Mahatma Gandhi with Non-cooperation Movement? (a) To Propagate Swadeshi (b) Hindu - Muslim Unity (c) Prohibition of liquor (d) Removal of Untouchability', '{"A": "(a) and (b) only", "B": "(c) and (d) only", "C": "(a), (b) and (c) only", "D": "All the above correct"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Straight to the answer — option D. Gandhi linked the Non-cooperation Movement with swadeshi propaganda, Hindu–Muslim unity, liquor prohibition, and the fight against untouchability — all four programmes were on his agenda.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21362, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following state has more geographical area?', '{"A": "Rajasthan", "B": "Maharashtra", "C": "Uttar Pradesh", "D": "Andhra Pradesh"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Pick option A. Rajasthan covers about 3.42 lakh sq km — the largest state by geographical area among the four listed; Maharashtra, Uttar Pradesh and Andhra Pradesh all rank below it.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21363, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following State Shares its boundary with two Countries?', '{"A": "Tripura", "B": "Manipur", "C": "Mizoram", "D": "Nagaland"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. Mizoram shares international borders with Bangladesh and Myanmar — two countries; Tripura, Manipur and Nagaland each touch only one foreign neighbour in this set.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21364, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Match the following: Iron and Steel Industry → State (a) Bokaro → (i) Karnataka (b) Durgapur → (ii) Odisha (c) Rourkela → (iii) West Bengal (d) Bhadrawati → (iv) Bihar', '{"A": "(i), (ii), (iii), (iv)", "B": "(iv), (iii), (ii), (i)", "C": "(ii), (i), (iv), (iii)", "D": "(iii), (iv), (i), (ii)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. Bokaro lies in Bihar (now Jharkhand), Durgapur in West Bengal, Rourkela in Odisha, and Bhadrawati in Karnataka — sequence (iv), (iii), (ii), (i).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21365, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'As per Census 2011, which of the following district has high sex-ratio?', '{"A": "Satara", "B": "Aurangabad", "C": "Buldhana", "D": "Jalgaon"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The verified answer here is option A. Census 2011 placed Satara among the higher sex-ratio districts of Maharashtra — well above Aurangabad, Buldhana and Jalgaon in that comparison.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21366, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which district is largest and smallest in terms of geographical area in Aurangabad administrative division?', '{"A": "Aurangabad and Parbhani", "B": "Beed and Hingoli", "C": "Nanded and Hingoli", "D": "Osmanabad and Jalna"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B is correct. Within the Aurangabad administrative division, Beed is the largest district by area and Hingoli the smallest — the pair the official answer selects.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21367, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following is the correct descending order of mountain peaks according to their heights in Maharashtra?', '{"A": "Kalsubai, Salher, Mahabaleshwar, Trimbakeshwar", "B": "Salher, Kalsubai, Mahabaleshwar, Trimbakeshwar", "C": "Kalsubai, Mahabaleshwar, Salher, Trimbakeshwar", "D": "Kalsubai, Mahabaleshwar, Trimbakeshwar, Salher"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The right pick is option A. Kalsubai (1646 m) tops Maharashtra, followed by Salher, then Mahabaleshwar and Trimbakeshwar in descending height — the order the key expects.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21368, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'In which mountain range of Maharashtra ''Asthamba Peak'' is located?', '{"A": "Mahadev", "B": "Harishchandra", "C": "Satpuda", "D": "Sahyadri"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Go with option C. Asthamba peak (about 1,325 m) stands in the Satpuda range at Nandurbar — not in the Sahyadri, Harishchandra or Mahadev sub-ranges of western Maharashtra.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21369, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'One inch air pressure means how much?', '{"A": "3.4 millibar", "B": "4.3 millibar", "C": "34 millibar", "D": "12 millibar"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. One inch of mercury column equals roughly 33.86 millibars, rounded to 34 mb in exam keys — not the smaller values in options A and B.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21370, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'How many districts of Maharashtra have borders with state of Karnataka?', '{"A": "5", "B": "6", "C": "7", "D": "8"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Pick option C. Seven Maharashtra districts touch Karnataka: Nanded, Latur, Osmanabad (Dharashiv), Solapur, Sangli, Kolhapur and Sindhudurg — a standard border-count fact for MPSC maps.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21371, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Observe the following statements: (a) The existence of jet streams in 30° to 40° North latitudes belt is responsible for blowing of Monsoon winds in India. (b) The Vast continental area of India is responsible for blowing of Monsoon winds.', '{"A": "Statement (a) is correct", "B": "Statement (b) is correct", "C": "Statement (a) and (b) are correct", "D": "Statement (a) and (b) are not correct"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. The subtropical westerly jet over the 30°–40° N belt shifts north in summer and helps pull the monsoon trough inland, while India''s huge landmass heats up faster than the surrounding oceans and builds the low-pressure engine that draws in moist winds. Both mechanisms work together in standard monsoon theory.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21372, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Match the correct pairs of Hot water spring and its locational districts in Maharashtra: (a) Salbardi → (i) Jalgaon (b) Sav → (ii) Thane (c) Vajreshwari → (iii) Raigad (d) Changdev → (iv) Amaravati', '{"A": "(i), (ii), (iii), (iv)", "B": "(ii), (i), (iv), (iii)", "C": "(iii), (iv), (ii), (i)", "D": "(iv), (iii), (ii), (i)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The examiner has marked option D. Per the official answer: Salbardi–Amravati, Sav–Raigad, Vajreshwari–Thane, Changdev–Jalgaon — code (iv), (iii), (ii), (i). If your district list differs slightly, defer to the official answer for this item.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21373, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which city/cities in Maharashtra Mumbai-Agra highway does not pass through? (a) Amalner (b) Daund (c) Nashik (d) Dhule', '{"A": "(a) and (b) only", "B": "(b) only", "C": "(b) and (d) only", "D": "(d) only"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. The Mumbai–Agra highway (NH 3 corridor) runs through Nashik and Dhule in north Maharashtra, but it does not pass Amalner or Daund — Amalner sits on a Dhule–Jalgaon branch route and Daund lies on the Pune–Mumbai line. Only (a) and (b) are off the main Agra road.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21374, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'The first railway to run on electricity in Maharashtra _______.', '{"A": "Byculla to Thane 1925", "B": "Mumbai to Kurla 1925", "C": "Dadar to Bandra 1918", "D": "Dadar to Borivali 1925"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. India''s first electric train service started on 3 February 1925 between Bombay (Mumbai) and Kurla on the Harbour line — that is the landmark date for Maharashtra. Byculla–Thane and Dadar–Borivali sections were electrified in later phases, not as the inaugural run.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21375, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Nannaj Sanctuary in Solapur district is famous for which bird?', '{"A": "Peacock", "B": "Rohit", "C": "Maldhok", "D": "Flemingo"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. Nannaj Bird Sanctuary near Solapur is a stronghold of the Great Indian Bustard, locally called Maldhok — one of the rarest grassland birds in India. Peacocks and flamingos draw tourists elsewhere; this reserve is bustard country.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21376, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following is not the reason for Population Explosion in India? (a) Illiteracy (b) The Universalization of Marriage (c) Joint Family System (d) Upliftment in Life Style', '{"A": "(a) and (b)", "B": "(c) and (d)", "C": "(a), (b), (c)", "D": "(d) only"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Go with option D. Illiteracy, early universal marriage, and the joint-family norm all push larger family sizes and faster population growth. Rising lifestyle and education usually delay marriage and cut fertility — so upliftment in lifestyle is not a driver of population explosion.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21377, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'The Jyotiba Mountain in Kolhapur district is recognised as _______. (a) Wadi Ratnagiri (b) Karvir (c) Panhala (d) The hill of Kedareshwar', '{"A": "Only (a)", "B": "Only (b)", "C": "(c) and (d)", "D": "(a) and (b)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. Jyotiba hill in Kolhapur district is traditionally known as Wadi Ratnagiri — the sacred hill of the Jyotiba temple. Karvir is the old name for Kolhapur town, Panhala is a separate fort-hill, and Kedareshwar labels another shrine, not this peak.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21378, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'On July 19, 1969 fourteen commercial banks with deposits worth ₹ _______ or more were nationalised.', '{"A": "₹ 100 crore", "B": "₹ 75 crore", "C": "₹ 50 crore", "D": "₹ 125 crore"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. On 19 July 1969 the Union government nationalised fourteen major commercial banks whose deposits stood at ₹50 crore or more — the threshold written in every banking-history note. ₹75 crore and ₹100 crore are scaled-up distractors.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21379, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'When was the FRBM Act brought into effect?', '{"A": "January 17, 2000", "B": "December 30, 2003", "C": "June 15, 2005", "D": "July 5, 2004"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Pick option D. Parliament passed the Fiscal Responsibility and Budget Management Act in 2003, and its operational provisions took effect from 5 July 2004 — that notification date is what MPSC keys. January 2000 and December 2003 are near-miss distractors around the rollout.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21380, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Repo rate is the rate at _______. (1) Commercial banks lend to public (2) The rate which is charged for Government lending (3) R.B.I. lends to commercial banks (4) The rate is charged on saving deposits with commercial banks', '{"A": "1", "B": "2", "C": "3", "D": "4"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'On this one, option C is correct. Repo (repurchase) rate is the short-term lending rate at which the RBI supplies funds to commercial banks against government securities — it is the headline policy rate, not the rate banks charge the public or pay on savings deposits.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21381, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Consider the following statements: (a) The population density of India in 2011 was 382 per sq. km. (b) As per the census 2011, the literacy rate in the country is 73.0 percent. (c) The sex ratio in the country has always remained favourable to females. Which of the statement/s given above is/are incorrect?', '{"A": "(a) and (b)", "B": "only (c)", "C": "(b) and (c)", "D": "only (a)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. Census 2011 did put India''s density at 382 per sq km and overall literacy at about 73% — those figures check out. Only Statement (c) is incorrect: India''s sex ratio has long been male-heavy (fewer females per 1,000 males), not continuously favourable to females.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21382, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following is the department of Public Finance? (a) Public Expenditure (b) Public Revenue (c) Public Debt (d) Public Health Which of the above statement/s is/are correct?', '{"A": "Only (a)", "B": "(a) and (b)", "C": "(a), (b) and (c)", "D": "(a), (b) and (d)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Straight to the answer — option C. Public finance covers how the government raises money (public revenue), spends it (public expenditure), and handles borrowing (public debt). Public health is a programme sector, not a branch of public-finance theory — so (a), (b), and (c) fit, not (d).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21383, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Credit Authorisation Scheme was introduced in _______.', '{"A": "October, 1980", "B": "August, 1982", "C": "January, 1979", "D": "November, 1965"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The verified answer here is option D. RBI introduced the Credit Authorisation Scheme in November 1965 to vet large bank advances during the credit-squeeze era — before later liberalisation. The 1979, 1980, and 1982 dates belong to other monetary reforms.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21384, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Money Market faces shortage of funds due to:', '{"A": "inadequate saving", "B": "growing demand for cash", "C": "presence of unorganized sector", "D": "financial mismanagement"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. When household and corporate saving stays low, the money market — the market for short-term funds — cannot meet the demand for working capital and trade credit. Growing cash demand and an unorganised sector add friction, but inadequate saving is the textbook root cause here.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21385, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Capital Receipt of State Government includes _______. (a) Market loans (b) Borrowing from Central Government (c) Small Saving of the public and provident fund contribution (d) G.S.T. share from Central Government Which of the above option is correct?', '{"A": "only (c), (d), (a)", "B": "only (b), (a), (d)", "C": "only (a), (b), (c)", "D": "only (d), (b), (c)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'On this one, option C is correct. State capital receipts are borrowings and similar inflows: market loans (a), loans from the Centre (b), and small savings plus provident-fund flows (c). GST devolution from the Union is a revenue receipt — a tax share — not capital receipt, so (d) drops out.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21386, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which Committee was appointed in 2011-2012 to re-examine the issue of poverty?', '{"A": "S. Chakravarty Committee", "B": "D.T. Lakdawala Committee", "C": "R.C. Datta Committee", "D": "C. Rangarajan Committee"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Pick option D. The C. Rangarajan Committee (2011–12) was asked to revisit poverty-line estimation after the Tendulkar line drew criticism — it recommended higher rural and urban poverty thresholds. Lakdawala and Chakravarty belong to earlier poverty-measurement exercises.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21387, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'How much calories does a rural Indian man need from his daily diet?', '{"A": "2000", "B": "2400", "C": "2500", "D": "2750"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Working through it, option B is the one. Planning-Commission poverty norms used 2,400 kilocalories per day for a rural adult man as the minimum energy requirement — 2,000 is closer to sedentary urban norms, and 2,500–2,750 are upper-band distractors.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21388, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Public Expenditure of any Government shows following trend:', '{"A": "Constant", "B": "Increasing", "C": "Decreasing", "D": "Fluctuating"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Go with option B. As economies develop, governments take on welfare, defence, infrastructure, and subsidy bills — so public expenditure almost everywhere shows a long-run rising trend, not a flat, falling, or purely random path.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21389, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'National Oilseeds Development Project (NODP) was launched in the year _______.', '{"A": "1980 - 81", "B": "2014 - 15", "C": "1985 - 86", "D": "1989 - 90"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The right pick is option C. The National Oilseeds Development Project (NODP) was launched in 1985–86 to expand area, productivity, and processing for oilseeds under the Technology Mission framework. The 1980–81 and 1989–90 windows are year-shift distractors.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21390, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Consider the following statements: (a) Reserve Bank of India use the Dear Money Policy during the period of inflation. (b) Reserve Bank of India use the Cheap Money Policy during the period of depression. (c) The R.B.I. started with a Cheap Money Policy with a Bank rate of 3% in 1951. Which of the statement/s given above is/are correct?', '{"A": "(a) and (b)", "B": "(b) and (c)", "C": "(a) and (c)", "D": "All the above"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The verified answer here is option D. Dear money (tighter, costlier credit) fights inflation; cheap money (lower bank rate, easier credit) supports recovery in a depression — and RBI did pursue a cheap-money phase with a 3% bank rate around 1951. All three statements match standard RBI history.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21391, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'By which financial institution, monetary policy is implemented in India?', '{"A": "LIC", "B": "Unit Trust of India", "C": "Co-operative Banks", "D": "Reserve Bank of India"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Straight to the answer — option D. Monetary policy — repo, bank rate, CRR, SLR, open-market operations — is formulated and executed by the Reserve Bank of India. LIC, UTI, and co-operative banks are financial intermediaries, not the nation''s monetary authority.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21392, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following fish belongs to class Osteichthyes?', '{"A": "Shark", "B": "Sting ray", "C": "Catla", "D": "Electric ray"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. Catla is a bony fish (class Osteichthyes); shark, sting ray and electric ray belong to cartilaginous fishes (Chondrichthyes).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21393, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '_______ are used to know the speed of any vehicle.', '{"A": "Eddy currents", "B": "Electric currents", "C": "Magnetic induction", "D": "None of these"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. Speedometers and similar gauges use eddy currents — when a rotating magnet moves near a metal disc, induced eddy currents create a drag proportional to speed, and the dial reads that effect. Ordinary conduction or bare magnetic induction alone does not drive the meter.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21394, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Phosphorous pentachloride formed by _______ hybridisation.', '{"A": "sp²d", "B": "sp²d²", "C": "sp³d²", "D": "sp³d"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Pick option D. Phosphorus in PCl₅ forms five σ-bonds with no lone pair on the central atom — trigonal bipyramidal geometry — so the hybridisation is sp³d. sp²d and sp²d² under-count bond directions; sp³d² fits octahedral six-coordinate molecules such as SF₆, not PCl₅.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21395, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'If the valence shell of an element has only one electron having the following set of quantum numbers: n = 2, l = 0, m = 0, s = +1/2, then the element is _______.', '{"A": "Lithium", "B": "Beryllium", "C": "Boron", "D": "Hydrogen"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. n = 2, l = 0, m = 0, s = +½ describes a 2s electron; with only one valence electron that configuration belongs to lithium (1s² 2s¹).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21396, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following element was responsible for Minamata epidemic caused in Japan?', '{"A": "Au", "B": "Pt", "C": "Ag", "D": "Hg"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Go with option D. The Minamata disaster in Japan (1950s–60s) came from industrial mercury (Hg) dumped into Minamata Bay, which biomagnified through fish and caused severe neurological disease. Gold (Au), platinum (Pt), and silver (Ag) were not the toxic agents in that epidemic.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21397, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Match the following: (a) Salamander → (i) Poikilothermic (b) Duckbilled Platypus → (ii) Sanguivorous (c) Leech → (iii) Asymmetrical (d) Paramecium → (iv) Egg laying mammal', '{"A": "(ii), (i), (iii), (iv)", "B": "(i), (iv), (ii), (iii)", "C": "(i), (ii), (iv), (iii)", "D": "(ii), (iv), (i), (iii)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. Salamander is poikilothermic, duck-billed platypus is an egg-laying mammal, leech is sanguivorous, and Paramecium shows asymmetry — giving (i), (iv), (ii), (iii).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21398, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'In heteroneresis the gonads are developed in the posterior part of the body. These gonads bearing segments are called:', '{"A": "Epitoke", "B": "Atoke", "C": "Heterogany", "D": "Metaboly"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The right pick is option A. In heteronereis the posterior, gonad-bearing swimming segments formed during reproduction are called epitokes; the anterior non-reproductive part is the atoke.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21399, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Whenever there is a relative motion between a source of sound and an observer, there is apparent change in Frequency of a sound emitted by a source and as heard by the observer. This is called _______.', '{"A": "Huygen''s effect", "B": "Joule''s effect", "C": "Doppler effect", "D": "Raman effect"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'On this one, option C is correct. When a sound source and observer move relative to each other, the heard frequency shifts — higher on approach, lower on receding. That is the Doppler effect; Huygens, Joule, and Raman describe diffraction, heating, and scattering, not motion-induced pitch change.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21400, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Consider the following statements: Statement I: Bacillus thuringiensis (Bt) is a microbial pesticide. Statement II: Beaveria bassiana is a fungus used as a pesticide.', '{"A": "Statement I is correct and Statement II is incorrect", "B": "Statement I is incorrect and Statement II is correct", "C": "Both Statements are incorrect", "D": "Both Statements are correct"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Straight to the answer — option D. Bacillus thuringiensis is a bacterial bio-pesticide, and Beauveria bassiana is a fungus used similarly — both statements hold.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
INSERT INTO pyq_questions (id, topic, subject, exam, year, question, options, correct, explanation, tags, difficulty)
VALUES
  (21401, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '_______ insecticide is present in neem plant. (a) DDT (b) Azadirachtin (c) Aldrin (d) B.H.C. Which of the option/s given above is/are correct?', '{"A": "(a) and (b) only", "B": "(b) only", "C": "(c) only", "D": "(c) and (d) only"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. Neem''s natural insecticidal compound is azadirachtin — not DDT, aldrin or BHC, which are synthetic organochlorines.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21402, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'The search for effective Malarial Vaccine is hampered due to the fact that:', '{"A": "Plasmodium lives inside cells hidden from immune response", "B": "Plasmodium changes its surface proteins", "C": "Plasmodium requires two hosts to complete life cycle", "D": "Both (1) and (2)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option D. Vaccine development against malaria is hard because Plasmodium hides inside host cells and also switches its surface antigens — both hurdles apply.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21403, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'A plant that does not produce fruit is called _______. (a) acarpous (b) fertile (c) apocarpus (d) parthenocarpus', '{"A": "(a) only", "B": "(a) and (b) only", "C": "(b) and (c) only", "D": "(d) only"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. Acarpous means a plant that does not set fruit; fertile, apocarpous and parthenocarpic describe other reproductive conditions.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21404, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'How does Insulin reduces blood glucose? (a) Promoting uptake of glucose (b) Glycogen formation (c) Protein synthesis (d) Fat storage', '{"A": "(a) and (b)", "B": "(b) and (d)", "C": "(a) and (c)", "D": "(a), (b), (c) and (d)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The examiner has marked option D. Insulin lowers blood glucose by promoting cellular uptake, glycogen synthesis, protein synthesis and fat storage — all four routes count.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21405, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'According to the available data, quantum of pollution caused by various categories of vehicles on the road of certain city reveals that the private four wheeler vehicles cause the maximum pollution, this is followed by the pollution caused by the buses, the trucks and finally the two wheelers. (a) The number of two wheelers is less than the number of four wheelers plying on the city roads. (b) Pollution caused by a single private vehicle would be more than the pollution caused by any single bus.', '{"A": "Both (a) and (b) can be drawn.", "B": "Only (a) can be drawn.", "C": "Only (b) can be drawn.", "D": "Neither (a) nor (b) can be drawn."}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. Total pollution by vehicle category depends on fleet size and per-trip emissions together — you cannot infer either vehicle counts or per-vehicle pollution from totals alone.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21406, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'A person walks along a road having lamp post at regular intervals. He took 6 minutes to walk from the first to fourth lamp post. At which lamp post would the person be if he walked continuously at a constant rate for 20 minutes?', '{"A": "10th", "B": "11th", "C": "12th", "D": "9th"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. First to fourth post spans three equal gaps in 6 minutes, so one gap takes 2 minutes; 20 minutes covers ten gaps from the start — the 11th lamp post.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21407, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '[Passage based] There is an increased demand for fish as it is a good source of protein. About 70% of world''s marine fish stocks are now overfished. Aquaculture is continuously expanded but it is necessary to manage environmental risks. For this the aquaculture sector needs to devise effective and environment friendly methods. Select the most appropriate conclusion:', '{"A": "People should adopt total vegan diet for avoiding environmental problems.", "B": "Aquaculture of predator fishes should be banned till other environment friendly devise is designed for rearing them.", "C": "People should consume freshwater fish varieties to avoid pressure on oceans.", "D": "The farming of only certain kind of varieties is damaging the biodiversity of ecosystems."}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. The passage stresses managing aquaculture''s environmental risks; banning predator-fish farming until safer rearing methods exist follows that logic most closely.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21408, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'If 10 people can do a piece of work in 5 days, working 2 hours a day, how long will 2 people take to do the same work, working 5 hours a day?', '{"A": "8", "B": "5", "C": "10", "D": "12"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. Total work = 10 × 5 × 2 = 100 person-hours; two workers at 5 hours/day supply 10 person-hours daily, so 100 ÷ 10 = 10 days.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21409, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Given below are 5 statements followed by options composed of 3 statements put together in a specific order. Choose the option that indicates logically valid argument. (a) Some vehicles are not hazardous to the environment. (b) Vehicular traffic leads to emission of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases. (c) Carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases are hazardous to the environment. (d) Some vehicular traffic does not emit Carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases. (e) Vehicular traffic is hazardous to the environment.', '{"A": "(b), (e), (c)", "B": "(c), (b), (e)", "C": "(c), (a), (d)", "D": "(b), (d), (a)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. Greenhouse gases harm the environment (c); vehicular traffic emits them (b); therefore traffic is environmentally hazardous (e) — a valid chain in that order.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21410, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'The average age of three person is 60 years. Their ages are in the ratio of 2 : 3 : 4. What is the difference between the ages of the youngest and the eldest person?', '{"A": "25 years", "B": "30 years", "C": "40 years", "D": "45 years"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. Ages in ratio 2: 3: 4 with average 60 give 40, 60 and 80 years — the youngest–eldest gap is 40 years.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21411, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Ashok jumped higher than Mohan but not higher than Chetan. Naresh jumped higher than Krishna but not as high as that of Mohan. Then what is the correct descending order of players considering their jump?', '{"A": "Mohan, Chetan, Ashok, Naresh, Krishna", "B": "Chetan, Mohan, Ashok, Naresh, Krishna", "C": "Chetan, Ashok, Mohan, Naresh, Krishna", "D": "Chetan, Naresh, Mohan, Ashok, Krishna"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. Chetan > Ashok > Mohan from the first clue, and Mohan > Naresh > Krishna from the second — full order: Chetan, Ashok, Mohan, Naresh, Krishna.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21412, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'A street vendor sold 2 dolls more than half the number of dolls she has on one day. The next day she sold 2 dolls less than half of the remaining dolls available with her. If she was left with 26 dolls. Select the number of dolls she did initially have.', '{"A": "100", "B": "96", "C": "104", "D": "92"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. If she started with 100 dolls, day-one sale leaves 48; day-two sale (half minus 2 of 48) leaves exactly 26 — working backwards confirms 100.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21413, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Replace the question mark (?) by an appropriate alternative in the following series: 32, 33, 37, 46, 62, ___?___', '{"A": "83", "B": "87", "C": "94", "D": "98"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. Successive gaps are +1, +4, +9, +16 (squares of 1–4); the next add-on is +25, so 62 + 25 = 87.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21414, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Some persons are sitting on a bench. V is sitting next to An and S is next to G. G is not sitting with Aj. Aj is on the left end of the bench and S is in second position from right hand end. V is on the right side of An and to the right side of Aj. V and S are sitting together. If G and V exchange their positions select the statement that is not true.', '{"A": "Positions cannot be ascertained as the direction they face is not known.", "B": "G occupies the middle position.", "C": "V occupies the end position.", "D": "An occupies the second position from one of the end."}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. With Aj at the left end and the other conditions, the row fixes as Aj–An–V–S–G; after G and V swap, positions are known — so saying they ''cannot be ascertained'' is the false statement.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21415, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'If the ratio of two numbers is 3 : 4 and the sum of their squares is 400, then which are these numbers?', '{"A": "12, 16", "B": "9, 12", "C": "6, 8", "D": "15, 20"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. Numbers 3k and 4k give 9k² + 16k² = 25k² = 400, so k = 4 and the pair is 12 and 16.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21416, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Neha''s salary was first reduced by 10% and then increased by 30% due to upturn. So what percent increase in original salary?', '{"A": "17", "B": "20", "C": "19", "D": "18"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. A 10% cut then 30% rise on the reduced salary gives 0.9 × 1.3 = 1.17, i.e. a net 17% increase over the original.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21417, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Soma moves 10 km to East and then turns to South and moves 2 km. He again turn East and walks 2 km. After this, he turns to North and walks 7 km. Then the distance from his starting point to the present point is _______.', '{"A": "13 km", "B": "18 km", "C": "20 km", "D": "Can not be determined from the given data"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The right pick is option A. Net displacement is 12 km east and 5 km north from the start (√(12² + 5²) = 13 km), using east–west and north–south legs as given.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21418, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'The difference between the simple and compound interest on a certain sum of money for 2 years at 10% per annum is ₹ 750. What is the sum?', '{"A": "75,000", "B": "60,000", "C": "15,000", "D": "90,000"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The verified answer here is option A. For 2 years the compound-minus-simple interest gap equals P × (R/100)² = P × 0.01; with ₹750 difference, P = ₹75,000.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21419, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'The value of 1/(856×592) + 1/(856×264) − 1/(592×264) is _______.', '{"A": "1/(856×592)", "B": "1/(856×92)", "C": "0", "D": "1"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The examiner has marked option C. Factor the sum: 1/(856×592) + 1/(856×264) − 1/(592×264) simplifies to 856/(856×592×264) − 856/(856×592×264) = 0.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21420, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '2021 च्या ब्रिक्स फिल्म फेस्टिवल मध्ये खालीलपैकी कोणाला उत्कृष्ट पुरुष अभिनेत्याचा पुरस्कार मिळाला?', '{"A": "नवाजुद्दिन सिद्दिकी", "B": "अक्षय कुमार", "C": "पंकज त्रिपाठी", "D": "धनुष"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय D येतो. Dhanush यांना ''Asuran'' साठी BRICS Film Festival 2021 मध्ये Best Actor (Male) पुरस्कार मिळाला. Nawazuddin, Akshay Kumar, Pankaj Tripathi त्या वर्षी भारतीय चित्रपटात मोठे नाव होते, पण हा विशिष्ट पुरस्कार त्यांना नव्हता.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21421, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'ग्लोबल ऑब्झर्वेटरी ऑन डोनेशन ॲन्ड ट्रान्सप्लटेशन (GODT) या संस्थेच्या 2021 च्या अहवालानुसार अवयवदान आणि प्रत्यारोपणामध्ये भारताचा जगात _________ क्रमांक आहे.', '{"A": "प्रथम", "B": "द्वितीय", "C": "तृतीय", "D": "पाचवा"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय C. Global Observatory on Donation and Transplantation (GODT) Report 2021 नुसार organ donation व transplantation मध्ये भारत जगात तिसऱ्या क्रमांकावर. पहिले-दुसरे सामान्यतः पुढारी Western व East Asian कार्यक्रम; fifth भारताच्या प्रमाणापेक्षा खाली.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21422, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'येरवडा मध्यवर्ती कारागृहातील कैद्यांसाठी 2022 मध्ये कोणती ऋण योजना प्रायोगिक तत्वावर सुरू करण्यात आली?', '{"A": "सहानुभूती योजना", "B": "आगे बढो योजना", "C": "बँक फॉर प्रिझनर्स", "D": "जिव्हाळा योजना"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय D. Bank of Maharashtra ने 2022 मध्ये Yerwada Central Jail कैद्यांसाठी ''Jivhala'' ही pilot credit scheme सुरू केली — सुटकेनंतर formal banking मिळवण्यासाठी. Sahanubhuti, Aage Badho, Bank for Prisoners इतर कल्याण योजनांच्या संदर्भातील फसवणुका.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21423, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालीलपैकी कोणता पर्याय अमृत सरोवर मोहीमेशी संबंधित आहे?', '{"A": "जल संधारण", "B": "मृदा संधारण", "C": "वायू प्रदूषण", "D": "मत्स्यपालन"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. Mission Amrit Sarovar प्रत्येक जिल्ह्यात किमान 75 water bodies विकसित/पुनरुज्जीवित करण्यासाठी — Azadi Ka Amrit Mahotsav शी जोडलेले water conservation. Soil conservation, air pollution, fishery वेगळ्या सरकारी agenda.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21424, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '''बियॉन्ड पॉसिबल'' या पुस्तकाचे लेखक कोण आहेत?', '{"A": "बर्नडेट मॅकडोनाल्ड", "B": "निम्सदाई पुर्जा", "C": "अरूणिमा सिन्हा", "D": "स्टिफन आल्टर"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. ''Beyond Possible'' हे Nimsdai Purja यांचे संस्मरण — चौदा 8000-मीटर शिखरे record वेळेत चढलेले mountaineer. Bernadette McDonald, Arunima Sinha, Stephen Alter ने adventure वर लिहिले, पण या शीर्षकाखाली नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21425, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'टोकियो 2020 (प्रत्यक्षात ऑगस्ट-सप्टेंबर 2021 मध्ये झालेल्या) पॅरालिम्पिक गेम्स मध्ये दोन पदके जिंकणारी पहिली भारतीय महिला कोण आहे?', '{"A": "अवनी लेखरा", "B": "भाविना पटेल", "C": "एकता भ्यान", "D": "कशिश लाकरा"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय A. Avani Lekhara Tokyo 2020 Paralympics मध्ये दोन पदके जिंकणारी पहिली भारतीय महिला — 10m air rifle SH1 मध्ये सुवर्ण, 50m rifle 3 positions SH1 मध्ये कांस्य. Bhavina Patel table tennis मध्ये चमकल्या, पण दोन पदके नव्हती.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21426, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'Which of the following WBC type has lowest percentage in blood of healthy human?', '{"A": "Lymphocytes", "B": "Monocytes", "C": "Eosinophils", "D": "Basophils"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The verified answer here is option D. Among normal WBC types, basophils form the smallest fraction (well under 1%), below lymphocytes, monocytes and eosinophils.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21427, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '''मुख्यमंत्री तीर्थयात्रा योजने'' बाबत खालीलपैकी, कोणती विधाने बिनचूक आहेत? (a) ही योजना 2018 मध्ये दिल्ली सरकारने सुरू केली. (b) भारताचा कोणताही नागरिक या योजनेचा लाभ घेऊ शकतो. (c) या योजनेअंतर्गत भेट द्यावयाच्या तीर्थस्थळांच्या यादीमध्ये अयोध्येचा नुकताच समावेश करण्यात आला आहे.', '{"A": "फक्त (a) व (b)", "B": "फक्त (a) व (c)", "C": "फक्त (b) व (c)", "D": "वरील सर्व"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय B चिन्हांकित केला. Delhi ची Mukhyamantri Tirth Yatra Yojana 2018 मध्ये सुरू, नंतर Ayodhya यादीत — (a) व (c) बरोबर. विधान (b) चुकीचे; ही योजना पात्र Delhi रहिवाशांसाठी, भारतातील कोणत्याही नागरिकासाठी नाही.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21428, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'राजीव गांधी ओरांग राष्ट्रीय उद्यान, ज्याचे नाव ओरांग राष्ट्रीय उद्यान असे करण्यात आले आहे, ते कोणत्या भारतीय राज्यात आहे?', '{"A": "आंध्र प्रदेश", "B": "कर्नाटक", "C": "असाम", "D": "उत्तराखंड"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. Orang National Park — पूर्वी Rajiv Gandhi Orang National Park — Assam मध्ये Brahmaputra उत्तर किनार्यावर, ''Mini Kaziranga'' म्हणून ओळख. Andhra Pradesh, Karnataka, Uttarakhand मध्ये इतर उद्याने, Orang नाही.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21429, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'योग्य कथन/ने ओळखा. (भारत - मध्य एशियाच्या शिखर परिषद) (a) पहिली भारत - मध्य एशिया शिखर परिषद जानेवारी, 2022 मध्ये आयोजित करण्यात आली. (b) ताजाकिस्तान, उझ्बेकीस्तान ही गणराज्ये या शिखर परिषदेत उपस्थित होती.', '{"A": "फक्त (a)", "B": "फक्त (b)", "C": "(a) व (b) दोन्ही", "D": "यापैकी नाही"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय C. पहिला India–Central Asia Summit January 2022 मध्ये virtual; Tajikistan, Uzbekistan सह पाच Central Asian republics नेते. प्रश्न मधील दोन्ही विधाने बरोबर.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21430, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '2022 सालचे प्रतिष्ठित बोल्ट्झमन पदक प्राप्त करणारे पहिले भारतीय भौतिकशास्त्रज्ञ कोण आहेत?', '{"A": "प्रोफेसर दीपक धर", "B": "अशोक कुमार बरूआ", "C": "बिमला बुटी", "D": "डी.डी. भवाळकर"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. Professor Deepak Dhar 2022 मध्ये Boltzmann Medal मिळवणारे पहिले भारतीय भौतिकशास्त्रज्ञ झाले — IUPAP ने statistical physics मध्ये उत्कृष्ट योगदानासाठी. Ashok Kumar Barua, Bimla Buti, D.D. Bhawalkar नामवंत भौतिकशास्त्रज्ञ, पण Boltzmann Medal विजेते नाहीत.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21431, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'मे 2022 मध्ये नीती आयोगाच्या उपाध्यक्षपदी खालीलपैकी कोणाची नियुक्ती करण्यात आली?', '{"A": "राजीव कुमार", "B": "रमेश चंद", "C": "जयती घोष", "D": "सुमन के बेरी"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय D. Suman K. Bery May 2022 मध्ये NITI Aayog चे Vice Chairman — Rajiv Kumar यांच्यानंतर. Ramesh Chand NITI member-agriculture; Jayati Ghosh, Rajiv Kumar इतर भूमिका, May 2022 vice-chair नियुक्ती नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21432, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालीलपैकी कोणती संस्था शाळेय मुलांसाठी ''यंग सायंटिस्ट प्रोग्राम'' ''युवा विज्ञानी कार्यक्रम'' ''युविका'' नावाचा विशेष कार्यक्रम आयोजित करत आहे?', '{"A": "युनिसेफ - संयुक्त राष्ट्र आंतरराष्ट्रीय बालकांचा आपातकालीन निधी", "B": "भाभा अटॉमिक रिसर्च सेंटर (BARC) (भाभा अणुशक्ती संशोधन केंद्र)", "C": "इंडियन स्पेस रिसर्च ऑर्गनायझेशन (ISRO) (भारतीय अंतराळ संशोधन संघटना)", "D": "डिफेन्स रिसर्च ॲंड डेव्हलपमेंट ऑर्गनायझेशन (DRDO) (संरक्षण संशोधन आणि विकास संघटना)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. ISRO ''YUVIKA'' — Yuva Vigyani Karyakram — शाळकरी विद्यार्थ्यांना space science मध्ये घडवणारा residential programme. UNICEF, BARC, DRDO youth/research initiatives चालवतात, पण हा विशिष्ट Young Scientist Programme नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21433, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '''हानीकारक कायदे हटवा, सशक्त करणारे कायदे बनवा'' ही कोणत्या दिवसाची थीम आहे?', '{"A": "शून्य भेदभाव दिवस", "B": "जागतिक एड्स दिवस", "C": "जागतिक समता दिवस", "D": "जागतिक सामाजिक न्याय दिन"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय A. Zero Discrimination Day (1 March), UNAIDS कडून, ''Remove laws that harm, create laws that empower'' हे theme. World AIDS Day, World Equality Day, World Social Justice Day वेगळे वार्षिक theme.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21434, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'भारतीय अवकाश संशोधन संस्थेचे म्हणजे ''इस्त्रो'' चे अध्यक्ष म्हणून _________ यांची जानेवारी, 2022 मध्ये नियुक्ती झालेली आहे.', '{"A": "डॉ. के. सिवन", "B": "डॉ. एस. सोमनाथ", "C": "डॉ. के. राधाकृष्णन्", "D": "प्रा. एम्जीके मेनन"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. Dr S. Somnath January 2022 मध्ये ISRO Chairman — Dr K. Sivan यांच्यानंतर. Radhakrishnan, Prof. MGK Menon पूर्व अध्यक्ष — ''January 2022 मध्ये कोण'' असा MPSC प्रश्न विचारतो.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21435, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'पंजाबच्या उत्पादन शुल्क विभागाने 2020 सालात अवैध दारू व्यापार संबंधित गुन्ह्यांना आळा घालण्यासाठी कोणती मोहीम सुरू केली?', '{"A": "ऑपरेशन ब्लॅक कोब्रा", "B": "ऑपरेशन रेड रोझ", "C": "ऑपरेशन ब्लॅक बुल", "D": "ऑपरेशन प्रहार"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. Punjab Excise Department ने 2020 मध्ये Operation Red Rose — illicit liquor व्यापार व संबंधित गुन्ह्यांवर. Black Cobra, Black Bull, Prahar वाजवी वाटतात, पण इतर राज्ये/वर्षांच्या enforcement drives.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21436, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालीलपैकी कोणत्या घटनादुरुस्तीनुसार देशाचे सार्वभौमत्व आणि एकात्मता यांच्या रक्षणासाठी नागरिकांच्या मूलभूत हक्कांवर बंधने घालण्यात आली?', '{"A": "14 वी घटनादुरुस्ती", "B": "16 वी घटनादुरुस्ती", "C": "24 वी घटनादुरुस्ती", "D": "39 वी घटनादुरुस्ती"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय B चिन्हांकित केला. 16 वी घटनादुरुस्ती (1963) ने Article 19 अंतर्गत ''भारताचे sovereignty and integrity'' हे मर्यादा घालण्याचे आधार म्हणून जोडले. 14 वी, 24 वी, 39 वी — citizenship, property, emergency-era बदल; ही विशिष्ट मर्यादा नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21437, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'राज्यघटनेच्या भाग XVII अंतर्गत सर्व नऊ कलमे कोणती आहेत?', '{"A": "कलम 333 ते 341", "B": "कलम 334 ते 342", "C": "कलम 332 ते 340", "D": "कलम 343 ते 351"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय D येतो. भाग XVII Official Language — Article 343 ते 351, एकूण नऊ कलमे. इतर ranges Part XVI (special provisions) किंवा Part XVIII (emergency) मध्ये जातात.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21438, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'भारतीय लोक आपल्या देशाचे प्रशासन किती उत्तम प्रकारे चालवू शकतात हे पाहण्यासाठी 1930 ते 1932 च्या दरम्यान लंडनमध्ये _________ गोलमेज परिषदा घेण्यात आल्या.', '{"A": "दोन", "B": "चार", "C": "तीन", "D": "पाच"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय C. 1930–1932 दरम्यान London मध्ये तीन Round Table Conferences — Simon Commission नंतर constitutional reform व Indian self-government. दोन किंवा चार — सामान्य count trap; MPSC साठी ''तीन'' लक्षात ठेवा.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21439, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'भारतीय राज्यघटनेच्या कलम 243 E प्रमाणे प्रत्येक ग्रामपंचायत ती त्या वेळी अंमलात असलेल्या कोणत्याही कायद्यान्वये ती तत्पूर्वीच विसर्जित झाली नसेल तर, _________ पाच वर्षांपर्यंत अस्तित्वात राहील.', '{"A": "निवडणूक निकाल जाहीर झाल्यापासूनच्या दिनांकापासून", "B": "निवडणूका जाहीर झाल्यापासून", "C": "तिच्या निवडणुकीनंतरच्या पहिल्या बैठकीसाठी नियत केलेल्या दिनांकापासून", "D": "पंचायत निवडणुकांच्या नंतर सुरू होणाऱ्या पहिल्या आर्थिक वर्षापासून"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'पर्याय C निवडा. Article 243E नुसार gram panchayat ची पाच वर्षांची muddat निवडीनंतर first meeting साठी नेमलेल्या तारखेपासून — result declaration, poll day, पुढचे financial year नाही. first meeting date हा statutory starting point.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21440, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालील जोड्या जुळवा: (a) बंदी प्रत्यक्षीकरण → (i) खटला कनिष्ठ न्यायालयाकडून वरिष्ठ न्यायालयाकडे हस्तांतरित करणे (b) परमादेश → (ii) पदाची कायदेशीरता तपासणे (c) अधिकार पृच्छा → (iii) अधिकाऱ्यास कार्य करण्याचा आदेश देणे (d) उत्प्रेक्षण → (iv) अटकेची कायदेशीरता तपासणे', '{"A": "(iv), (ii), (i), (iii)", "B": "(iv), (iii), (ii), (i)", "C": "(ii), (i), (iii), (iv)", "D": "(ii), (iii), (iv), (i)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय B. जोड्या: Habeas corpus — अटकेची legality (iv); Mandamus — authority ला कर्तव्य पार पाडण्याचा आदेश (iii); Quo warranto — public office धरण्याची legality (ii); Certiorari — प्रकरण वर हस्तांतरण/खालच्या court चा order रद्द (i).', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21441, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'भारताची संविधानसभा बनवण्याची मागणी इंग्रजांनी कोणत्या वर्षी मान्य केली?', '{"A": "1938", "B": "1939", "C": "1940", "D": "1942"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय C. August Offer 1940 — British ने constituent assembly तत्त्व पहिल्यांदा औपचारिक स्वीकारले. 1938–39 मध्ये Congress मागणी, स्वीकार नाही; 1942 Quit India, ही concession नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21442, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'भारतीय संविधानाच्या कलम 154 प्रमाणे राज्याची कार्यकारी सत्ता _________ यांच्याकडे देण्यात आली आहे.', '{"A": "मुख्यमंत्री", "B": "मंत्रिमंडळ", "C": "राज्यपाल", "D": "यापैकी नाही"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. Article 154 नुसार राज्याची executive power Governor मध्ये — थेट किंवा subordinate officers द्वारे. Chief Minister व Council of Ministers सल्ला देतात; constitutional vesting त्यांच्याकडे नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21443, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालीलपैकी कोणते काम ग्रामसेवकाचे नाही?', '{"A": "ग्रामपंचायत निधीचा योग्य वापर करणे", "B": "ग्रामसभेचा अहवाल तयार करणे", "C": "शासनाने निर्धारित केलेल्या विविध करांची वसुली करणे", "D": "यापैकी नाही"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय D चिन्हांकित केला. Gram Sevak panchayat निधी वापर, gram sabha report, सरकारी कर वसूली — तीनही listed items सामान्य कर्तव्ये. A, B, C पैकी ''non-function'' नाही, म्हणून ''None of these'' बरोबर.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21444, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'कोणत्या समितीच्या शिफारशीनुसार मूलभूत कर्तव्यांचा समावेश करण्यात आला?', '{"A": "देवराज समिती", "B": "करन सिंग समिती", "C": "स्वर्ण सिंग समिती", "D": "कृपलानी समिती"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'पर्याय C निवडा. Swaran Singh Committee (1976) ने Fundamental Duties शिफारस केली — 42 वी घटनादुरुस्तीने Part IVA Article 51A जोडले. Devraj, Karan Singh, Kripalani committees इतर reforms; ही यादी नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21445, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'नारायण मेघाजी लोखंडे यांच्या संदर्भातील कोणती विधाने बरोबर आहेत? (a) कामगार चळवळीचे जनक (b) 1884 मध्ये बॉम्बे मिलहँण्ड्स असोसिएशनची स्थापना (c) ब्रिटीश सरकारचा ''रावबहादूर'' किताब (d) महाराष्ट्र लेबर युनियनची स्थापना', '{"A": "(a) आणि (b) फक्त", "B": "(a), (b) आणि (c) फक्त", "C": "(b), (c) आणि (d) फक्त", "D": "(a), (c) आणि (d) फक्त"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय B येतो. नारायण मेघाजी लोखंडे Bombay labour movement चे अग्रगण्य नेते, Bombay Mill-Hands'' Association (1884) स्थापनेत सहभागी, British सरकारने ''रावबहादूर'' पदवी दिली — (a), (b), (c) बरोबर. Maharashtra Labour Union नंतरच्या काळात आले, त्यांचे काम नाही, म्हणून (d) बाहेर.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21446, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'जोड्या जुळवा: (a) रँड व आयर्स्टचा खून → (i) वि.दा. सावरकर (b) अभिनव भारत → (ii) अनंत लक्ष्मण कान्हेरे (c) न्यायाधीश जॅक्सनचा खून → (iii) मदनलाल धिंग्रा (d) कर्झन वायलीचा खून → (iv) चाफेकर बंधू', '{"A": "(iv), (i), (ii), (iii)", "B": "(iii), (ii), (iv), (i)", "C": "(i), (iii), (ii), (iv)", "D": "(ii), (i), (iii), (iv)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. Rand–Ayerst (चापेकर), Abhinav Bharat (सावरकर), Justice Jackson (Anant Laxman Kanhere), Curzon Wyllie (Madan Lal Dhingra) — क्रम (iv), (i), (ii), (iii).', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21447, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '1928 मध्ये पहिल्या अखिल बंगाल विद्यार्थी परिषदेचे अध्यक्ष कोण होते?', '{"A": "देवेंद्रनाथ टागोर", "B": "पंडीत जवाहरलाल नेहरू", "C": "जयप्रकाश नारायण", "D": "रविंद्रनाथ टागोर"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय B चिन्हांकित केला. September 1928 च्या All Bengal Students'' Conference चे अध्यक्षपद Pandit Jawaharlal Nehru यांनी सांभाळले; association चे president Pramod Kumar Ghoshal होते, opening session चे chairman नव्हेत.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21448, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'कोणत्या घटनादुरुस्तीन्वये 11 वे मूलभूत कर्तव्य यादीत नंतर समाविष्ट केले गेले? (51A(K))', '{"A": "42 वी घटनादुरुस्ती कायदा - 1976", "B": "52 वी घटनादुरुस्ती कायदा - 1980", "C": "62 वी घटनादुरुस्ती कायदा - 1992", "D": "86 वी घटनादुरुस्ती कायदा - 2002"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय D येतो. 11 वे मूलभूत कर्तव्य — Article 51A(k), 6–14 वर्ष मुलांना शिक्षण — 86 वी घटनादुरुस्ती 2002. 42 वी 1976 मध्ये मूळ दहा कर्तव्ये; 52 वी, 62 वी anti-defection व reservation tenure.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21449, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालील विवरणावरून व्यक्ती ओळखा: (a) मराठीतील पहिले पत्रकार (b) अक्कलकोटच्या युवराजांचे शिक्षक (c) मराठी वृत्तपत्राचे जनक (d) कुलाबा वेधशाळेचे संचालक', '{"A": "दादाभाई नौरोजी", "B": "भाऊ दाजी लाड", "C": "बाळशास्त्री जांभेकर", "D": "जगन्नाथ शंकर शेठ"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय C. बाळशास्त्री जांभेकर — पहिले Marathi वृत्तपत्र Darpan, Akkalkot राजकुमाराचे शिक्षक, Marathi journalism ची सुरुवात, Colaba Observatory चे director — चारही clues एकाच नावाकडे.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21450, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'कोणत्या राष्ट्रीय सभेच्या अधिवेशनात दोन गट पुन्हा एकत्र आले?', '{"A": "सुरत अधिवेशन", "B": "लखनौ अधिवेशन", "C": "फैजपूर अधिवेशन", "D": "अलाहाबाद अधिवेशन"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय B. 1907 Surat split नंतर Moderates व Extremists 1916 Lucknow Session मध्ये Tilak व Annie Besant यांच्या joint leadership खाली पुन्हा एकत्र आले.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
INSERT INTO pyq_questions (id, topic, subject, exam, year, question, options, correct, explanation, tags, difficulty)
VALUES
  (21451, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'कोणत्या समाजसुधारकाने विधवेशी विवाह केला?', '{"A": "गोपाळ गणेश आगरकर", "B": "न्यायमूर्ती एम.जी. रानडे", "C": "केशवचंद्र सेन", "D": "महर्षी धोंडो केशव कर्वे"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय D. Maharshi Dhondo Keshav Karve यांनी 1893 मध्ये विधवेशी लग्न केले आणि widow remarriage social-reform mission चे जिवंत उदाहरण ठेवले — इतर नावे reformers असली तरी ह्या कृतीसाठी ओळखले जात नाहीत.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21452, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'असहकार चळवळी बरोबरच महात्मा गांधीजींनी खालीलपैकी कोणता कार्यक्रम हाती घेतला? (a) स्वदेशीचा प्रसार (b) हिंदू-मुस्लीम ऐक्य (c) मद्यपान बंदी (d) अस्पृश्यता निवारण', '{"A": "(a) आणि (b) फक्त", "B": "(c) आणि (d) फक्त", "C": "(a), (b) आणि (c) फक्त", "D": "वरील सर्व बरोबर"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय D. Gandhi Non-cooperation Movement सोबत swadeshi, Hindu–Muslim unity, liquor prohibition व untouchability removal जोडले — चारही programmes त्यांच्या agenda वर होते.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21453, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'ब्रिटीश काळातील भारताचे अनुद्योगीकरण म्हणजे: (a) भारतातील हस्तोद्योगांचा ऱ्हास (b) कुटिरोद्योगांचा ऱ्हास (c) ग्रामव्यवस्थेत सुधारणा (d) शेती सुधारणा', '{"A": "(a) आणि (b) फक्त", "B": "(b) आणि (c) फक्त", "C": "(c) आणि (d) फक्त", "D": "वरील सर्व बरोबर"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. British rule खाली ''deindustrialisation'' म्हणजे Indian handicrafts व cottage industries चा factory competition व one-way trade मुळे पतन — rural uplift किंवा agriculture चा positive ''development'' नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21454, 'General', 'Marathi', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'जोड्या लावा: उठाव केंद्र → नेतृत्व (a) कोल्हापूर → (i) अप्पासाहेब पटवर्धन (b) जमखंडी → (ii) चिमासाहेब (c) औरंगाबाद → (iii) बाबासाहेब भावे (d) नरगुंद → (iv) फिदा अली', '{"A": "(i), (ii), (iv), (iii)", "B": "(ii), (i), (iv), (iii)", "C": "(ii), (iv), (iii), (i)", "D": "(i), (ii), (iii), (iv)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. अधिकृत उत्तर नुसार 1857 revolt centres — Kolhapur–Chimasaheb, Jamkhandi–Appasaheb Patwardhan, Aurangabad–Phida Ali, Nargund–Babasaheb Bhave; क्रम (ii), (i), (iv), (iii). paper मधील यादीनुसार जुळवा, memory ने क्रम बदलू नका.', '{"Marathi","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21455, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'मुंबई सरकारने दक्षिणे मध्ये चालू असलेल्या शेतकरी असंतोषाची चौकशी करण्यासाठी कोणते कमिशन नियुक्त केले?', '{"A": "लँण्ड रेव्हेन्यू ॲक्ट कमिशन", "B": "डेक्कन रायटस कमिशन", "C": "दि डेक्कन ॲग्रीकल्चर कमिशन", "D": "लँण्ड ओनर्स कमिशन"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय B. Deccan मधील peasant violence नंतर Bombay Government ने 1875 disturbances च्या कारणांची चौकशी Deccan Riots Commission (1876) ने केली.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21456, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '''भारत सेवक समाजने'' खालीलपैकी कोणत्या प्रसिद्ध व्यक्तींचे कार्य घडविण्याचे कार्य केले होते? (a) श्रीनिवास शास्त्री (b) पंडीत हृदयनाथ कुंझरु, ठक्करबाप्पा (c) ना.म. जोशी, काकासाहेब लिमये (d) विष्णुशास्त्री चिपळूणकर, केशवराव बागडे', '{"A": "(a) आणि (b) फक्त", "B": "(b) आणि (c) फक्त", "C": "(a), (b) आणि (c) फक्त", "D": "(b), (c) आणि (d) फक्त"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय C चिन्हांकित केला. Bharat Sevak Samaj (1915) — Shrinivas Shastri, Hridaynath Kunjru, Thakkarbappa, N.M. Joshi, Kakasaheb Limaye; Chiplunkar व Bagde या network मध्ये नाहीत.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21457, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'अमेरिकेत जाऊन वैद्यकीय शास्त्रातील पदवी मिळविणारी देशातील पहिली भारतीय महिला कोण?', '{"A": "सुप्रिया जोशी", "B": "आनंदीबाई जोशी", "C": "रमाबाई रानडे", "D": "अनुताई वाघ"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय B येतो. Anandibai Joshi 1886 मध्ये Women''s Medical College of Pennsylvania पास झाल्या — America मध्ये medical degree मिळवणारी पहिली Indian woman.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21458, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '1918 मध्ये मुंबई येथील ''अस्पृश्यता निवारक परिषदेचे'' अध्यक्ष कोण होते?', '{"A": "छत्रपती शाहू महाराज", "B": "डॉ. बाबासाहेब आंबेडकर", "C": "सयाजीराव गायकवाड", "D": "नानाभाई हरिदास"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'पर्याय C निवडा. Maharshi Vitthal Ramji Shinde यांनी March 1918 मध्ये Bombay मध्ये Asprushyata Nivarak Parishad आयोजित केली आणि Maharaja Sayajirao Gaikwad यांनी अध्यक्षपद सांभाळले.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21459, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालीलपैकी कोणत्या राज्याचे भौगोलैक क्षेत्रफळ जास्त आहे?', '{"A": "राजस्थान", "B": "महाराष्ट्र", "C": "उत्तर प्रदेश", "D": "आन्ध्र प्रदेश"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. Rajasthan सुमारे 3.42 lakh sq km — चारही पर्यायांपैकी geographical area ने सर्वात मोठे; Maharashtra, Uttar Pradesh, Andhra Pradesh खाली.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21460, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालीलपैकी कोणत्या राज्याच्या सीमा ह्या दोन देशांना लागून आहेत?', '{"A": "त्रिपुरा", "B": "मणिपूर", "C": "मिझोराम", "D": "नागालँड"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. Mizoram ची Bangladesh व Myanmar या दोन देशांशी international border; Tripura, Manipur, Nagaland या set मध्ये प्रत्येकाला एकच foreign neighbour.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21461, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '12 मे 1875 रोजी शेतकऱ्यांचा पहिला उठाव कोठे झाला?', '{"A": "बारामती", "B": "पुणे", "C": "सुपे", "D": "चाकण"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. 1875 चे Deccan agrarian disturbances 12 May रोजी Pune district मधील Supe (Supa) येथे moneylenders व debt bonds वर हल्ल्याने सुरू झाले — wider riots ची सुरुवात.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21462, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'जोड्या जुळवा: लोहपोलाद उद्योग → राज्य (a) बोकारो → (i) कर्नाटक (b) दुर्गापूर → (ii) ओडिशा (c) रुरकेला → (iii) प. बंगाल (d) भद्रावती → (iv) बिहार', '{"A": "(i), (ii), (iii), (iv)", "B": "(iv), (iii), (ii), (i)", "C": "(ii), (i), (iv), (iii)", "D": "(iii), (iv), (i), (ii)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय B. Bokaro — Bihar (आता Jharkhand), Durgapur — West Bengal, Rourkela — Odisha, Bhadrawati — Karnataka; क्रम (iv), (iii), (ii), (i).', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21463, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'महाराष्ट्रातील उष्ण पाण्याचे झरे व त्यांची ठिकाणे असलेले जिल्हे यांच्या योग्य जोड्या लावा: (a) साल्बर्डी → (i) जळगाव (b) साव → (ii) ठाणे (c) वज्रेश्वरी → (iii) रायगड (d) चांगदेव → (iv) अमरावती', '{"A": "(i), (ii), (iii), (iv)", "B": "(ii), (i), (iv), (iii)", "C": "(iii), (iv), (ii), (i)", "D": "(iv), (iii), (ii), (i)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय D चिन्हांकित केला. अधिकृत उत्तर नुसार Salbardi–Amravati, Sav–Raigad, Vajreshwari–Thane, Changdev–Jalgaon — क्रम (iv), (iii), (ii), (i). district list थोडी वेगळी असेल तर अधिकृत उत्तर ला defer करा.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21464, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'जनगणना 2011 प्रमाणे कोणत्या जिल्ह्याचे लिंगगुणोत्तर जास्त आहे?', '{"A": "सातारा", "B": "औरंगाबाद", "C": "बुलढाणा", "D": "जळगाव"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय A. Census 2011 नुसार Satara Maharashtra मध्ये higher sex-ratio districts मध्ये — Aurangabad, Buldhana, Jalgaon पेक्षा वर.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21465, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '''अस्तंभा'' हे उंच शिखर महाराष्ट्रातील कोणत्या पर्वतरांगेत आढळते?', '{"A": "महादेव", "B": "हरिश्चंद्र", "C": "सातपुडा", "D": "सह्याद्री"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'पर्याय C निवडा. Asthamba peak (सुमारे 1,325 m) Nandurbar मधील Satpuda range मध्ये — western Maharashtra च्या Sahyadri, Harishchandra किंवा Mahadev sub-ranges मध्ये नाही.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21466, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'महाराष्ट्रातील किती जिल्ह्यांच्या सीमा कर्नाटक राज्यास लागून आहेत?', '{"A": "5", "B": "6", "C": "7", "D": "8"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'पर्याय C निवडा. Karnataka शी सीमा असलेले 7 Maharashtra districts — Nanded, Latur, Osmanabad (Dharashiv), Solapur, Sangli, Kolhapur, Sindhudurg; MPSC map work साठी standard count.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21467, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'मुंबई-आग्रा राष्ट्रीय महामार्ग महाराष्ट्रातील कोणत्या शहरातून जात नाही? (a) अमळनेर (b) दौंड (c) नाशिक (d) धुळे', '{"A": "(a) व (b) फक्त", "B": "(b) फक्त", "C": "(b) व (d) फक्त", "D": "(d) फक्त"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. Mumbai–Agra highway (NH 3) Nashik व Dhule मधून जातो, पण Amalner किंवा Daund मधून नाही — Amalner Dhule–Jalgaon branch वर आहे, Daund Pune–Mumbai line वर. (a) आणि (b) दोन्ही मुख्य Agra मार्गावर नाहीत.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21468, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'महाराष्ट्रातील पहिली विजेवर चालणारी रेल्वे _________.', '{"A": "भायखळा ते ठाणे 1925", "B": "मुंबई ते कुर्ला 1925", "C": "दादर ते बांद्रा 1918", "D": "दादर ते बोरीवली 1925"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय B. भारतातील पहिली electric train 3 February 1925 रोजी Bombay (Mumbai) ते Kurla Harbour line वर सुरू झाली — Maharashtra साठी ही ऐतिहासिक तारीख. Byculla–Thane व Dadar–Borivali नंतरच्या phase मध्ये electrify झाले.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21469, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'महाराष्ट्रातील पर्वत शिखरांच्या उंचीनुसार खालीलपैकी अचूक उतरता क्रम कोणता?', '{"A": "कळसूबाई, साल्हेर, महाबळेश्वर, त्र्यंबकेश्वर", "B": "साल्हेर, कळसूबाई, महाबळेश्वर, त्र्यंबकेश्वर", "C": "कळसूबाई, महाबळेश्वर, साल्हेर, त्र्यंबकेश्वर", "D": "कळसूबाई, महाबळेश्वर, त्र्यंबकेश्वर, साल्हेर"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय A. Kalsubai (1646 m) Maharashtra मध्ये सर्वोच्च, नंतर Salher, Mahabaleshwar, Trimbakeshwar — height descending order अधिकृत उत्तर नुसार.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21470, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालील विधाने पहा: (a) भारतात मान्सून वारे वाहण्यासाठी 30° ते 40° उत्तर अक्षांशाच्या पट्ट्यात जेट वायुचे अस्तित्व कारणीभूत आहे. (b) भाराताचा भूमीखंडाचा विस्तृत भाग मान्सून वारे वाहण्यासाठी कारणीभूत आहे.', '{"A": "विधान (a) बरोबर आहे", "B": "विधान (b) बरोबर आहे", "C": "विधान (a) आणि (b) बरोबर आहेत", "D": "विधान (a) आणि (b) बरोबर नाहीत"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. 30°–40° N latitudes वरचा subtropical westerly jet उन्हाळ्यात उत्तरेकडे सरकून monsoon trough आत ओढतो, तर भारताचा मोठा खंड समुद्रापेक्षा लवकर गरम होऊन low pressure तयार करतो आणि ओलसर winds आत येतात. दोन्ही घटक एकत्र मान्सूनचे मुख्य कारण.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21471, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'सोलापूर जिल्ह्यातील नान्नज अभयारण्य कोणत्या पक्षांसाठी प्रसिद्ध आहे?', '{"A": "मोर", "B": "रोहीत", "C": "माळढोक", "D": "हंसक"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. Solapur जवळचे Nannaj Bird Sanctuary Great Indian Bustard — स्थानिक नाव Maldhok — साठी प्रसिद्ध. हा दुर्मिळ grassland पक्षी; mor व flamingo इतर ठिकाणी; Nannaj bustard साठी ओळखले जाते.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21472, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'कोल्हापूर जिल्ह्यातील जोतीबा डोंगर _________ नावाने ओळखला जातो. (a) वाडी रत्नागिरी (b) करवीर (c) पन्हाळा (d) केदारेश्वराची टेकडी', '{"A": "फक्त (a)", "B": "फक्त (b)", "C": "(c) आणि (d)", "D": "(a) आणि (b)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A चिन्हांकित केला. Kolhapur जिल्ह्यातील Jyotiba hill परंपरेनुसार Wadi Ratnagiri म्हणून ओळखले जाते — Jyotiba मंदिराचे पवित्र डोंगर. Karvir Kolhapur शहराचे जुने नाव; Panhala वेगळा fort-hill; Kedareshwar दुसऱ्या स्थळाशी.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21473, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'जुलै 19, 1969 ला ज्या चौदा व्यापारी बँकाकडील ठेवींचे मूल्य ₹ _________ किंवा यापेक्षा जास्त होते, त्याचे राष्ट्रीयकरण करण्यात आले.', '{"A": "₹ 100 कोटी", "B": "₹ 75 कोटी", "C": "₹ 50 कोटी", "D": "₹ 125 कोटी"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. 19 July 1969 रोजी ₹50 crore किंवा अधिक deposits असलेल्या चौदा मोठ्या banks राष्ट्रीयकृत झाल्या — banking-history मध्ये ही threshold standard. ₹75 crore व ₹100 crore वाढवलेल्या फसवणुका.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21474, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालीलपैकी कोणते भारतातील लोकसंख्या विस्फोटाचे कारण नाही? (a) निरक्षरता (b) विवाहाची सार्वत्रिकता (c) एकत्र कुटुंब पद्धती (d) राहणीमानातील सुधारणा', '{"A": "(a) आणि (b)", "B": "(c) आणि (d)", "C": "(a), (b), (c)", "D": "(d) फक्त"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. अशिक्षण, लग्नाची सार्वत्रिकता व joint-family system मोठ्या कुटुंबांकडे ढकलतात. जीवनशैली सुधारणे व शिक्षण fertility कमी करते — म्हणून lifestyle upliftment population explosion चे कारण नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21475, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'रेपो दर म्हणजे ज्या दराने _______. (1) व्यापारी बँका लोकांना कर्ज देतात (2) सरकारची कर्ज घेण्यावर आकारला जातो (3) रिझर्व्ह बँक ऑफ इंडिया व्यापारी बँकांना कर्ज देते (4) व्यापारी बँक त्याचेकडे असणाऱ्या बचती ठेवीवर दर आकारतात', '{"A": "1", "B": "2", "C": "3", "D": "4"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय C. Repo rate म्हणजे RBI commercial banks ला government securities वर अल्पकालीन निधी देताना charge करणारा दर — headline policy rate. Banks public ला किंवा savings deposits वर देणारा दर नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21476, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'एक इंच वायूभार म्हणजे किती?', '{"A": "3.4 मिलिबार", "B": "4.3 मिलिबार", "C": "34 मिलिबार", "D": "12 मिलिबार"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. One inch mercury column सुमारे 33.86 millibar, exam keys मध्ये 34 mb round — A, B मधील लहान values नाहीत.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21477, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'एफ आर बी एम कायदत केव्हा पासून लागू करण्यात आला?', '{"A": "जानेवारी 17, 2000", "B": "डिसेंबर 30, 2003", "C": "जून 15, 2005", "D": "जुलै 5, 2004"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. Fiscal Responsibility and Budget Management Act 2003 मध्ये पारित, operational provisions 5 July 2004 पासून लागू — MPSC ही तारीख विचारते. January 2000 व December 2003 जवळच्या तारखा फसवणुका.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21478, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'सार्वजनिक आयव्ययाचा खालीलपैकी कोणता विभाग आहे? (a) सार्वजनिक खर्च (b) सार्वजनिक उत्पन्न (c) सार्वजनिक कर्ज (d) सार्वजनिक स्वास्थ्य वरीलपैकी कोणते विधान/विधाने बरोबर आहे/त?', '{"A": "फक्त (a)", "B": "(a) आणि (b)", "C": "(a), (b) आणि (c)", "D": "(a), (b) आणि (d)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय C. Public finance मध्ये public revenue, public expenditure व public debt येतात. Public health एक programme sector — finance चा विभाग नाही — म्हणून (a), (b), (c) बरोबर, (d) नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21479, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या: (a) 2011 मध्ये भारतातील लोकसंख्येची घनता 382 दर चौरस किलोमीटर होती. (b) 2011 च्या जनगणनेनुसार देशातील साक्षरता दर 73.0% होता. (c) देशातील लिंग गुणोत्तर प्रमाण महिलांच्या साठी नेहमी अनुकूल राहिले. वरीलपैकी कोणते/ती विधान/ने असत्य आहे/आहेत?', '{"A": "(a) आणि (b)", "B": "फक्त (c)", "C": "(b) आणि (c)", "D": "फक्त (a)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय B. Census 2011 नुसार density 382 per sq km व literacy ~73% बरोबर. फक्त (c) चुकीचे — भारताचा sex ratio historically male-heavy (महिला कमी), females ला सतत favourable नाही.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21480, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'पतपुरवठा अधिकारीत योजना _________ या वर्षी सुरू करण्यात आली.', '{"A": "आक्टोबर, 1980", "B": "ऑगस्ट, 1982", "C": "जानेवारी, 1979", "D": "नोव्हेंबर, 1965"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय D. RBI ने November 1965 मध्ये Credit Authorisation Scheme सुरू केले — मोठ्या bank advances वर नियंत्रण credit-squeeze काळात. 1979, 1980, 1982 dates इतर monetary reforms च्या.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21481, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'राज्य सरकारच्या भांडवली प्राप्तीत _________ याचा समावेश असतो. (a) बाजारी कर्जे (b) केंद्र सरकारकडून उचल घेणे (c) लोकांची अल्पबचत व भविष्य निर्वाह निधी योगदान (d) केंद्र सरकारकडून जी एस टी चा वाटा वरीलपैकी कोणता पर्याय बरोबर आहे?', '{"A": "फक्त (c), (d), (a)", "B": "फक्त (b), (a), (d)", "C": "फक्त (a), (b), (c)", "D": "फक्त (d), (b), (c)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय C. State capital receipts — market loans (a), Centre कडून borrowing (b), small savings व provident fund (c). GST share revenue receipt — tax share — capital receipt नाही, म्हणून (d) बाहेर.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21482, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'भारतात मौद्रिक धोरण कोणत्या वित्तीय संस्थेमार्फत राबविले जाते?', '{"A": "आयुर्विमा महामंडळ", "B": "युनिट ट्रस्ट ऑफ इंडिया", "C": "सहकारी बँका", "D": "भारतीय रिझर्व्ह बँक"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय D. Monetary policy — repo, bank rate, CRR, SLR, open-market operations — Reserve Bank of India formulate व implement करते. LIC, UTI, co-operative banks intermediaries; monetary authority RBI.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21483, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'कोणत्याही शासनाच्या सार्वजनिक खर्चाची प्रवृत्ती पुढीलप्रमाणे असते:', '{"A": "स्थिर", "B": "वाढता", "C": "घटता", "D": "बदलता (चढउतार)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. अर्थव्यवस्था विकसित होत असताना welfare, defence, infrastructure व subsidy खर्च वाढतो — public expenditure दीर्घकालीन वाढणारा trend दाखवते, constant किंवा decreasing नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21484, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'ग्रामीण भागातील भारतीय माणसाला दररोजच्या आहारातून किती उष्मांकाची गरज असते?', '{"A": "2000", "B": "2400", "C": "2500", "D": "2750"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय B येतो. Planning Commission poverty norms नुसार ग्रामीण adult man साठी 2,400 kilocalories daily minimum energy. 2,000 urban sedentary जवळ; 2,500–2,750 upper-band फसवणुका.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21485, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'औरंगाबाद प्रशासकीय विभागामधे भौगोलैक क्षेत्रफळाच्या दृष्टीने सर्वात मोठा व सर्वात लहान असणारे जिल्हे कोणते?', '{"A": "औरंगाबाद आणि परभणी", "B": "बीड आणि हिंगोली", "C": "नांदेड आणि हिंगोली", "D": "उस्मानाबाद आणि जालना"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय B. Aurangabad administrative division मध्ये area ने Beed सर्वात मोठा आणि Hingoli सर्वात लहान — अधिकृत उत्तर ने निवडलेली जोडी.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21486, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'गरिबीच्या मुद्द्याचे पुनर्परिक्षण करण्यासाठी 2011-2012 मध्ये कोणती समिती नेमण्यात आली?', '{"A": "एस. चक्रवर्ती समिती", "B": "डी.टी. लकडावाला समिती", "C": "आर.सी. दत्त समिती", "D": "सी. रंगराजन समिती"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. C. Rangarajan Committee (2011–12) ने Tendulkar line नंतर poverty-line estimation पुन्हा पाहिले — rural/urban thresholds वाढवण्याची शिफारस. Lakdawala व Chakravarty जुन्या poverty-measurement समित्या.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21487, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'नाणे बाजारातील निधीच्या कमतरतेचे खालीलपैकी कारण कोणते?', '{"A": "अपुरी बचत", "B": "रोख रकमेची वाढती मागणी", "C": "असंघटीत क्षेत्राची उपस्थिती", "D": "वित्तीय गैरव्यवस्था"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A चिन्हांकित केला. Saving कमी असल्यास short-term funds च्या money market मध्ये working capital व trade credit साठी निधी अपुरा. Cash demand व unorganised sector अडथळे, पण inadequate saving मूळ कारण.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21488, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'राष्ट्रीय तेलबिया विकास प्रकल्प _________ ह्या वर्षात सुरू करण्यात आला.', '{"A": "1980 - 81", "B": "2014 - 15", "C": "1985 - 86", "D": "1989 - 90"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय C. National Oilseeds Development Project (NODP) 1985–86 मध्ये oilseeds area, productivity व processing वाढवण्यासाठी Technology Mission अंतर्गत. 1980–81 व 1989–90 वर्ष shift फसवणुका.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21489, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालीलपैकी कोणते मूलद्रव्य जपान मधील मिनामाटा या साथीच्या रोगासाठी कारणीभूत होते?', '{"A": "Au", "B": "Pt", "C": "Ag", "D": "Hg"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. Japan मधील Minamata disaster (1950–60) industrial mercury (Hg) bay मध्ये सोडल्यामुळे — fish द्वारे biomagnify, neurological disease. Gold (Au), platinum (Pt), silver (Ag) toxic agent नव्हते.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21490, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'फॉस्फरस पेन्टॅक्लोराईडचा रेणु _________ संकरणाने तयार होतो.', '{"A": "sp²d", "B": "sp²d²", "C": "sp³d²", "D": "sp³d"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. PCl₅ मध्ये phosphorus पाच σ-bonds, lone pair नाही — trigonal bipyramidal — hybridisation sp³d. sp²d/sp²d² bond directions कमी; sp³d² SF₆ सारख्या octahedral साठी, PCl₅ साठी नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21491, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'कोणत्याही वाहनाचा वेग जाणून घेण्यासाठी _________ वापरली जातात.', '{"A": "एडी करंट (चक्राकार प्रवाह)", "B": "विद्युत प्रवाह", "C": "चुंबकीय प्रेरण", "D": "यापैकी नाही"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A चिन्हांकित केला. Speedometer eddy currents वापरते — rotating magnet metal disc जवळ असताना induced eddy currents speed proportional drag तयार करतात. साधी conduction किंवा magnetic induction एकटे meter चालवत नाहीत.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21492, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या: (a) रिझर्व्ह बँक ऑफ इंडिया भाववाढीच्या काळात महाग चलन नितीचा वापर करते. (b) रिझर्व्ह बँक ऑफ इंडिया भावघटीच्या काळात स्वस्त चलन धोरणाचा वापर करते. (c) रिझर्व्ह बँक ऑफ इंडिया ने 1951 मध्ये बँक दर 3% इतका करून स्वस्त चलन धोरण सुरू केले. वरीलपैकी कोणते/ती विधाने बरोबर आहे/आहेत?', '{"A": "(a) आणि (b)", "B": "(b) आणि (c)", "C": "(a) आणि (c)", "D": "वरील सर्व"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय D. Dear money inflation विरुद्ध; cheap money depression मध्ये recovery — RBI ने 1951 सुमारी 3% bank rate सह cheap-money phaseही केली. तीनही विधane standard RBI history शी जुळतात.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21493, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'जर संयुजा कक्षेत एकच इलेक्ट्रॉन असणाऱ्या मूलद्रव्यात क्वांटम क्रमांकांचा संच: n = 2, l = 0, m = 0, s = +1/2, असेल तर ते मूलद्रव्य _________ असेल.', '{"A": "लिथियम", "B": "बेरिलियम", "C": "बोरॉन", "D": "हायड्रोजन"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय A येतो. n = 2, l = 0, m = 0, s = +½ हे 2s electron; valence shell मध्ये एकच electron असल्यास ते lithium (1s² 2s¹) चे.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21494, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'हेटरोनेरीस मध्ये उत्तरवर्ती भागात जननग्रंथी विकसित होतात. त्या जननग्रंथी खंडास _________ म्हणतात.', '{"A": "एपिटोक", "B": "एटोक", "C": "हेटरोगेनी", "D": "मेटाबोली"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय A. Heteronereis मध्ये reproduction वेळी posterior, gonad असलेले swimming segments epitoke; anterior non-reproductive भाग atoke.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21495, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालीलपैकी कोणता मासा ऑस्टीकथाईज वर्गातील आहे?', '{"A": "शार्क", "B": "स्टिंग रे", "C": "कटला", "D": "इलेक्ट्रिक रे"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. Catla हाड असलेली मासे (Osteichthyes); shark, sting ray, electric ray cartilage असलेली (Chondrichthyes).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21496, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'योग्य जोड्या लावा: (a) सॅलॅमन्डर → (i) शीतरक्ती (b) बदकचोचा → (ii) सॅन्वीबोरस (c) जळू → (iii) असममित (d) पॅरामेशिअम → (iv) अंडज सस्तन प्राणी', '{"A": "(ii), (i), (iii), (iv)", "B": "(i), (iv), (ii), (iii)", "C": "(i), (ii), (iv), (iii)", "D": "(ii), (iv), (i), (iii)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय B. Salamander poikilothermic, duck-billed platypus egg-laying mammal, leech sanguivorous, Paramecium asymmetrical — (i), (iv), (ii), (iii).', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21497, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'कडुलिंबामध्ये _________ नावाचे कीटकनाशक असते. (a) डी.डी.टी. (b) अझाडीऱ्याक्टीन (c) अल्ड्रीन (d) बी. एच. सी. वरीलपैकी कोणता पर्याय/पर्याये बरोबर आहे/त?', '{"A": "(a) आणि (b) फक्त", "B": "(b) फक्त", "C": "(c) फक्त", "D": "(c) आणि (d) फक्त"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय B चिन्हांकित केला. Neem मधील natural insecticide azadirachtin — DDT, aldrin, BHC synthetic organochlorines नाहीत.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21498, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'फळ उत्पन्न न करणाऱ्या झाडाला काय म्हणतात?', '{"A": "(a) फक्त", "B": "(a) आणि (b) फक्त", "C": "(b) आणि (c) फक्त", "D": "(d) फक्त"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय A येतो. Acarpous म्हणजे फळ न बनवणारे वनस्पती; fertile, apocarpous, parthenocarpic इतर reproductive states.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21499, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'पुढील विधानांचा विचार करा: विधान I: बॅसिलस थुरिंगिएन्सीस हे एक मायक्रोबीयल कीटकनाशक आहे. विधान II: बेव्हेरिया बासियाना हि बुरशी कीटकनाशक म्हणून वापरले जाते.', '{"A": "विधान I बरोबर आणि विधान II चूक आहे", "B": "विधान I चूक आणि विधान II बरोबर आहे", "C": "दोन्ही विधाने चूक आहेत", "D": "दोन्ही विधाने बरोबर आहेत"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय D. Bacillus thuringiensis bacterial bio-pesticide, Beauveria bassiana fungus pesticide — दोन्ही विधाने बरोबर.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21500, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'जेव्हा-जेव्हा ध्वनीचा स्रोत आणि निरीक्षक यांच्यात सापेक्ष गती असते तेव्हा स्त्रोताद्वारे उत्सर्जित होणाऱ्या ध्वनीच्या वारंवारितेत आणि निरीक्षकाद्वारे ऐकल्या जाणाऱ्या ध्वनीच्या वारंवारिततेत बदल दिसून येतो. याला _________ म्हणतात.', '{"A": "हॉयगेन्सचा प्रभाव", "B": "ज्युल्सचा प्रभाव", "C": "डॉपलरचा प्रभाव", "D": "रमणचा प्रभाव"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय C. sound source व observer relative motion असताना ऐकलेली frequency बदलते — जवळ येताना वाढ, दूर जाताना कमी. हा Doppler effect; Huygens, Joule, Raman diffraction, heating, scattering — pitch change नाही.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
INSERT INTO pyq_questions (id, topic, subject, exam, year, question, options, correct, explanation, tags, difficulty)
VALUES
  (21501, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'मलेरिया या आजारावर प्रभावी लस निर्माण करण्यासाठी अडथळा निर्माण होत आहे कारण:', '{"A": "प्लाझमोडियम हा पेशीमध्ये रोगप्रतिकारक प्रतिक्रियेपासून लपलेल्या अवस्थेत असतो", "B": "प्लाझमोडियम हा पृष्ठभागावरचे प्रथिने बदलतो", "C": "प्लाझमोडियमला जीवनचक्र पूर्ण करण्यासाठी दोन यजमान लागतात", "D": "(1) आणि (2) दोन्ही"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय D. Malaria vaccine अवघड — Plasmodium host cells मध्ये लपते व surface antigens बदलते — दोन्ही अडथळे.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21502, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'खालीलपैकी कोणत्या प्रकारच्या पांडऱ्या रक्त पेशींची टक्केवारी निरोगी मनुष्याच्या रक्तामध्ये सर्वात कमी असते?', '{"A": "लिम्फोसाइट्स", "B": "मोनोसाइट्स", "C": "इसिनोफिल्स", "D": "बेसोफिल्स"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय D. सामान्य WBC मध्ये basophils सर्वात कमी (1% पेक्षा खूप कमी), lymphocytes, monocytes, eosinophils पेक्षा.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21503, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'उपलब्ध असलेल्या विदेल्या, एका शहरातील रस्त्यांवरील विविध वर्गवारीच्या वाहनांच्या परिणामी झालेल्या प्रदूषणाचे प्रमाण पुढीलप्रमाणे उघड झाले आहे. खाजगी चार चाकी गाड्या सर्वात जास्त प्रदूषण करतात, त्यानंतर बस, ट्रक आणि शेवटी दोन चाकी वाहने प्रदूषण करतात. (a) शहरांच्या रस्त्यांवर धावणाऱ्या दुचाकी वाहनांची संख्या चारचाकी वाहनांच्या संख्येपेक्षा कमी आहे. (b) एका खाजगी वाहनामुळे होणारे प्रदूषण कोणत्याही एका बसमुळे होणाऱ्या प्रदूषणापेक्षा जास्त असेल.', '{"A": "(a) व (b) हे दोन्ही निष्कर्ष काढता येतात.", "B": "फक्त (a) हा निष्कर्ष काढता येतो.", "C": "फक्त (b) हा निष्कर्ष काढता येतो.", "D": "(a) किंवा (b) यांच्यापैकी एकही निष्कर्ष काढता येत नाही."}'::jsonb, 'D', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय D येतो. Category-wise एकूण pollution fleet size व per-trip emission दोन्हीवर अवलंबून — एकूणातून vehicle संख्या किंवा प्रति-vehicle pollution infer करता येत नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21504, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'इन्सुलिन रक्तातील साखरेचे प्रमाण कसे कमी करते? (a) रक्तातील साखर शोषुन घेऊन (b) ग्लायकोजन तयार करून (c) प्रथिन संश्लेषण करून (d) चरबीची साठवण करून', '{"A": "(a) आणि (b)", "B": "(b) आणि (d)", "C": "(a) आणि (c)", "D": "(a), (b), (c) आणि (d)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय D चिन्हांकित केला. Insulin glucose uptake, glycogen, protein synthesis, fat storage — चारही मार्गांनी glucose कमी करते.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21505, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'नियमित अंतरावर दिव्याचे खांब असलेल्या रस्त्यावरून एक व्यक्ती चालत आहे. पहिल्या खांबापासून चौथ्या खांबापर्यंत पोहोचण्यास व्यक्तीला 6 मिनिटे लागतात. जर याच गतीने ही व्यक्ती सतत 20 मिनिटे चालली तर ती कितव्या स्तंभापाशी असेल?', '{"A": "10 व्या", "B": "11 व्या", "C": "12 व्या", "D": "9 व्या"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय B. पहिल्या ते चौथ्या post दरम्यान 6 मिनिटांत 3 gaps — एक gap 2 मिनिट; 20 मिनिटांत 10 gaps — 11वा lamp post.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21506, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'अशोकने मोहनपेक्षा उंच उडी मारली, परंतु त्याने चेतनपेक्षा उंच उडी मारली नाही. नरेशने कृष्णापेक्षा उंच उडी मारली, परंतु त्याने मोहन एवढी उडी मारली नाही, तर उंच उडीचा उतरता क्रम कसा असेल?', '{"A": "मोहन, चेतन, अशोक, नरेश, कृष्णा", "B": "चेतन, मोहन, अशोक, नरेश, कृष्णा", "C": "चेतन, अशोक, मोहन, नरेश, कृष्णा", "D": "चेतन, नरेश, मोहन, अशोक, कृष्णा"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. पहिल्या clue नुसार Chetan > Ashok > Mohan, दुसऱ्याने Mohan > Naresh > Krishna — क्रम: Chetan, Ashok, Mohan, Naresh, Krishna.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21507, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'काही व्यक्ती बाकावर बसल्या आहेत. V ही व्यक्ती An च्या शेजारी आणि S ही व्यक्ती G च्या शेजारी आहे. G ही व्यक्ती Aj च्या बरोबर नाही. Aj बाकाच्या डाव्या टोकाला आणि S बाकाच्या उजव्या टोकाकडून दुसऱ्या स्थानी आहे. V ही व्यक्ती An च्या उजवीकडे आहे. V आणि S सोबतीने बसल्या आहेत. जर G आणि V यांनी त्यांच्या जागांची अदलाबदल केली तर या माहितीच्या संदर्भात दिलेल्या विधानांपैकी सत्य नसलेले विधान निवडा.', '{"A": "त्यांची तोंडे कोणत्या दिशेला आहे हे माहीत नसल्याने स्थाने निश्चित करता येणार नाही.", "B": "G मधल्या स्थानावर आहे.", "C": "V टोकाच्या स्थानावर आहे.", "D": "An दोनांपैकी एक टोकापासून दुसऱ्या स्थानी आहे."}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A चिन्हांकित केला. Aj डाव्या टोकावर व इतर अटींनी row Aj–An–V–S–G; G-V swap नंतर positions ठरतात — ''ascertain करता येत नाहीत'' हे false statement.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21508, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '[उतारा आधारित] प्रोटिन्सचा उत्तम स्रोत असल्यामुळे माशांना वाढती मागणी आहे. यामुळे आज जगातील जवळपास 70% सागरी साठ्यात मत्स्योत्पादन करण्यासाठी जलशेतीचे प्रमाण सातत्याने व्यापक होत आहे. पुढे दिलेल्या विधानांतून वरील परिच्छेदाचा सर्वात उचित निष्कर्ष निवडा.', '{"A": "पर्यावरण समस्या टाळण्यासाठी दीर्घकाळासाठी लोकांना पूर्ण शाकाहारी आहार सवयीचा करून घ्यायला प्रोत्साहित केले पाहिजे.", "B": "जोपर्यंत अन्य माशांना जोपासणारी पर्यावरणस्नेही यंत्रणा रचली जात नाही तोपर्यंत भक्ष्यक माशांच्या जलशेतीवर प्रतिबंध घालला पाहिजे.", "C": "सागरांवर येणारा ताण टाळण्यासाठी लोकांना तळ्यांत व नद्यांत राहणारे गोड्या पाण्यातील मासे खायला प्रोत्साहन दिले पाहिजे.", "D": "फक्त काही प्रजातींच्या माशांची शेती परिस्थितीकोच्या जैवविविधतेला बाधक ठरत आहे."}'::jsonb, 'B', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय B. Passage aquaculture च्या environmental risks व्यवस्थापनावर भर देतो; सुरक्षित पद्धती न येता predator-fish farming बंद करणे त्या logic शी जुळते.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21509, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'तीन व्यक्तींच्या वयाची सरासरी 60 वर्षे आहे. त्यांच्या वयाचे गुणोत्तर 2 : 3 : 4 असे आहे. सर्वात तरुण आणि सर्वात वयस्कर व्यक्तींच्या वयातील फरक किती?', '{"A": "25 वर्षे", "B": "30 वर्षे", "C": "40 वर्षे", "D": "45 वर्षे"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. 2 : 3 : 4 ratio, सरासरी 60 → 40, 60, 80 वर्ष — लहान-मोठ्यात 40 वर्षांचा फरक.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21510, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'पुढील क्रमिकेमध्ये प्रश्नचिन्हाच्या (?) जागी योग्य पर्याय निवडा: 32, 33, 37, 46, 62, ___?___', '{"A": "83", "B": "87", "C": "94", "D": "98"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय B. सलग फरक +1, +4, +9, +16 (1–4 चे squares); पुढे +25, म्हणून 62 + 25 = 87.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21511, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'जर एक काम 10 माणसे दर दिवशी 2 तास, यांप्रमाणे 5 दिवसांत पूर्ण करतात, तर तेच काम 2 माणसे दिवसातून 5 तास करतील, तर त्यांना किती दिवस लागतील?', '{"A": "8", "B": "5", "C": "10", "D": "12"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. एकूण काम = 10 × 5 × 2 = 100 person-hours; 2 workers 5 तास/दिवस = 10 person-hours; 100 ÷ 10 = 10 दिवस.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21512, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'पुढे 5 विधाने आणि नंतर 3 विधाने विशिष्ट क्रमाने एकत्र करून पर्याय जुळवलेले आहेत. त्यातून तार्किकदृष्ट्या यथार्थ युक्तिवाद निर्देशित करणारा पर्याय निवडा. (a) काही वाहने पर्यावरणासाठी हानिकारक नाहीत. (b) वाहनांची वाहतूक कार्बन डायऑक्साईड व अन्य हरितगृह वायूचा उत्सर्ग करते. (c) कार्बन डायऑक्साईड व हरितगृह वायू पर्यावरणासाठी हानिकारक आहे. (d) काही वाहनांची वाहतूक कार्बन डायऑक्साईड व हरितगृह वायूचा उत्सर्ग करत नाही. (e) वाहनांची वाहतूक पर्यावरणासाठी हानिकारक आहे.', '{"A": "(b), (e), (c)", "B": "(c), (b), (e)", "C": "(c), (a), (d)", "D": "(b), (d), (a)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय B. Greenhouse gases harmful (c); vehicular traffic emits (b); म्हणून traffic hazardous (e) — त्या क्रमाने valid chain.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21513, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'दोन संख्याचे गुणोत्तर 3 : 4 या प्रमाणात आहेत व त्यांच्या वर्गांची बेरीज जर 400 असेल तर त्या संख्या कोणत्या?', '{"A": "12, 16", "B": "9, 12", "C": "6, 8", "D": "15, 20"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय A येतो. 3k व 4k: 9k² + 16k² = 25k² = 400, k = 4 — जोड 12 व 16.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21514, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'रस्त्यावरच्या विक्रेतीने एके दिवशी तिच्याकडील बाहुल्यांच्या निम्म्याहून दोन बाहुल्या अधिक विकल्या. दुसऱ्या दिवशी तिने तिच्याकडे असलेल्या बाहुल्यांच्या निम्म्यापैकी दोन बाहुल्या कमी विकल्या. तिच्याकडे 26 बाहुल्या शिल्लक राहिल्या. सुरुवातीला तिच्याकडे असलेल्या बाहुल्यांची संख्या निवडा.', '{"A": "100", "B": "96", "C": "104", "D": "92"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A चिन्हांकित केला. 100 dolls सुरुवात; पहिल्या दिवशी 48 उरतात; दुसऱ्या दिवशी (48 च्या अर्ध्या − 2) विक्रीनंतर 26 — मागून 100.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21515, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'सोमा पूर्वेकडे 10 km चालत गेला. त्यानंतर वळून दक्षिणेकडे 2 km गेला. तो पुन्हा वळून पूर्वेकडे 2 km गेला. त्यानंतर तो वळून उत्तरेकडे 7 km गेला. तर त्याच्या सुरुवातीच्या स्थानापासून ते सध्याच्या स्थितीच्या स्थानापर्यंतचे अंतर _________ आहे.', '{"A": "13 km", "B": "18 km", "C": "20 km", "D": "दिलेल्या माहितीच्या आधारे काढणे शक्य नाही"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय A. सुरुवातीपासून 12 km पूर्व, 5 km उत्तर net displacement (√(12² + 5²) = 13 km).', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21516, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'नेहाचा पगार अगोदर 10% नी कमी केला व नंतर तेजीमुळे तो 30% नी वाढवला तर मुळच्या पगारात किती टक्के वाढ झाली?', '{"A": "17", "B": "20", "C": "19", "D": "18"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. 10% कपात, नंतर 30% वाढ: 0.9 × 1.3 = 1.17 — मूळ पगारावर 17% net वाढ.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21517, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which space agency has released the first visible light images of the surface of venus from space?', '{"A": "ESA", "B": "JAXA", "C": "NASA", "D": "CNA"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. NASA''s Parker Solar Probe captured the first visible-light images of Venus''s surface from space during a flyby — peering through the planet''s thick clouds in wavelengths our eyes can see. ESA and JAXA have Venus missions, but this particular first was NASA''s.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21518, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, '1/(856×592) + 1/(856×264) − 1/(592×264) ची किंमत _________ आहे.', '{"A": "1/(856×592)", "B": "1/(856×92)", "C": "0", "D": "1"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय C चिन्हांकित केला. 1/(856×592) + 1/(856×264) − 1/(592×264) = 856/(856×592×264) − 856/(856×592×264) = 0.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21519, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, '''Sustainable international financing scheme'' is associated with which global association?', '{"A": "G20", "B": "ASEAN", "C": "BRICS", "D": "SAARC"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. The G20''s sustainable finance agenda includes schemes to channel international financing toward climate and development goals — the phrase in the stem maps to that grouping, not ASEAN, BRICS, or SAARC.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21520, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2022, 'जर एक रक्कम द.सा.दे.शे. 10 दराने 2 वर्षांसाठी ठेवली तर त्यावर मिळणाऱ्या सरळव्याज व चक्रवाढ व्याज यातील फरक ₹ 750 आहे, तर ती रक्कम किती?', '{"A": "75,000", "B": "60,000", "C": "15,000", "D": "90,000"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय A. 2 वर्षांसाठी CI − SI = P × (R/100)² = P × 0.01; ₹750 फरक → P = ₹75,000.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2022","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21521, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'NROL-85, which was launched recently, is an intelligence satellite of which country?', '{"A": "Russia", "B": "Israel", "C": "France", "D": "USA"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option D. NROL-85 is a National Reconnaissance Office payload — a US intelligence satellite launched on a SpaceX Falcon 9. The NROL prefix marks American reconnaissance missions, not Russian, Israeli, or French assets.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21522, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Identify the person from the following description: (a) In 2013 she acted in the film ''Mai'' for the first time. (b) The first Indian singer to be nominated for a Grammy Award. (c) She was recently awarded the Maharashtra Bhushan Award 2021.', '{"A": "Lata Mangeshkar", "B": "Asha Bhosale", "C": "Krishna Kalle", "D": "Shanta Apte"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Go with option B. Asha Bhosale acted in the 2013 film ''Mai'', was the first Indian singer nominated for a Grammy, and received the Maharashtra Bhushan Award 2021 — all three clues point to her, not Lata Mangeshkar or the other names.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21523, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following statement is incorrect in respect of the Consumer Protection Act 2019? (a) This act came into force on 20th July 2020. (b) Unfair trade prohibition rules on e-commerce platforms are included in this act. (c) As per the rules of the Consumer Disputes Redressal Commission no charges will be levied for complaints upto Rs. 10 lakhs.', '{"A": "Statements (a) and (c)", "B": "Statement (a)", "C": "Statements (b) and (c)", "D": "Statement (c)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The verified answer here is option D. Statements (a) and (b) hold: the Consumer Protection Act 2019 took effect from 20 July 2020 and covers e-commerce unfair-trade rules. Statement (c) is wrong — fee exemption for filing complaints applies up to ₹5 lakh, not ₹10 lakh, at the district commission level.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21524, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'India''s First RT-PCR kit to detect the Omicron Variant, named ''Omisure'' is developed by which company?', '{"A": "Tata MD", "B": "Piramal", "C": "Sun Pharma", "D": "Apex Pharma"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'On this one, option A. Tata MD developed ''Omisure'', India''s first RT-PCR kit to detect the Omicron variant of COVID-19. Piramal, Sun Pharma, and Apex Pharma were distractors from the wider pharma space.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21525, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which institution has developed the ''Positive Pay System (PPS)'' for Cheque Payment?', '{"A": "National Payments Corporation of India", "B": "Reserve Bank of India", "C": "Niti Aayog", "D": "Ministry of Finance"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Pick option A. NPCI developed the Positive Pay System for cheque truncation — account holders pre-confirm high-value cheque details before payment clears. RBI mandated it, but the technical system came from NPCI, not Niti Aayog or the Finance Ministry.', '{"Economy","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21526, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Who has been appointed as the chairman of the National Financial Reporting Authority (NFRA)?', '{"A": "Ajay Bhushan Pandey", "B": "Nandan Nilekani", "C": "Azim Premji", "D": "Kris Gopalakrishnan"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. Ajay Bhushan Pandey — former Finance Secretary — was appointed chairman of the National Financial Reporting Authority (NFRA), the audit-oversight body for listed companies and large firms. Nilekani, Premji, and Gopalakrishnan were never NFRA chairs.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21527, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which one of the following country has provided instrumental support to India''s ambitious space mission ''Gaganyan''?', '{"A": "Japan", "B": "South Korea", "C": "United Arab Emirates (UAE)", "D": "France"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The examiner has marked option D. France has been a key partner for Gaganyaan — supplying equipment, training Indian astronauts, and supporting human-spaceflight infrastructure. Japan, South Korea, and UAE cooperate on other space fronts but France led this crewed-mission support.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21528, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which Union Ministry launched ''My CGHS'' Mobile application?', '{"A": "Ministry of Education", "B": "Ministry of Health", "C": "Ministry of Tourism", "D": "Ministry of Culture"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. The Ministry of Health and Family Welfare launched the ''My CGHS'' mobile app for Central Government Health Scheme beneficiaries — booking appointments, viewing records, and accessing empanelled hospitals. Education, Tourism, and Culture ministries have no CGHS mandate.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21529, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Who has been awarded the ''International Gandhi Award for Leprosy-2021''?', '{"A": "Dr. Bhushan Kumar", "B": "Dr. G.P. Talwar", "C": "Dr. M.D. Gupte", "D": "Dr. Atul Shah"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Go with option A. Dr Bhushan Kumar received the International Gandhi Award for Leprosy 2021 for his work in leprosy control. Dr G.P. Talwar, Dr M.D. Gupte, and Dr Atul Shah are respected names in the field but the 2021 award went to Dr Bhushan Kumar.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21530, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which country launched the ''COMPETES ACT'' of 2022?', '{"A": "Russia", "B": "USA", "C": "UK", "D": "Australia"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. The America COMPETES Act of 2022 is US legislation aimed at boosting semiconductor manufacturing, R&D, and competitiveness against China — a congressional package, not a Russian, UK, or Australian law.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21531, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Elections in India for Parliament and State Legislatures are conducted by _______.', '{"A": "President", "B": "State Election Commission", "C": "Governor", "D": "Election Commission of India"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. Article 324 vests the conduct of elections to Parliament and state legislatures in the Election Commission of India. The President appoints governors; State Election Commissions handle panchayat and municipal polls — not Lok Sabha or Vidhan Sabha seats.', '{"Polity","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21532, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'According to livestock census 2019, what is the rank of Maharashtra in terms of livestock among the country?', '{"A": "First", "B": "Third", "C": "Seventh", "D": "Ninth"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Pick option C. The 20th Livestock Census (2019) ranked Maharashtra seventh among states by total livestock population — behind leaders like Uttar Pradesh and Rajasthan. First, third, and ninth are common traps from other census rankings.', '{"Geography","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21533, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, '16th World Youth Archery Championship was held in August 2021 in which of the following nation?', '{"A": "South Korea", "B": "Poland", "C": "India", "D": "Australia"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B. The 16th World Youth Archery Championship was held in Wrocław, Poland, in August 2021. South Korea, India, and Australia have hosted other archery events but not this edition.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21534, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following are the correct statements regarding the tenure of a Governor of the State? (a) Governor remains in his office as long as President of India wishes. (b) Governor may resign voluntarily. (c) The appointment of Governor is generally for 05 years. (d) Governor remains in his office until another person takes charge.', '{"A": "Only statements (a), (b) and (c) are correct", "B": "Only statements (a), (b) and (d) are correct", "C": "Only statements (b), (c) and (d) are correct", "D": "All statements are correct"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The examiner has marked option D. Every statement on gubernatorial tenure is constitutionally sound: a Governor holds office during the President''s pleasure, may resign, is normally appointed for five years, and continues until a successor enters — Articles 156 and 157 together cover all four points.', '{"Polity","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21535, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'The Supreme Court has appointed Justice R.V. Ravindran Committee in October 2021 for which of the following purpose?', '{"A": "IPL spot fixing scam enquiry", "B": "Pegasus snooping row enquiry", "C": "Aadhar Card Policy confirmation", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. In October 2021 the Supreme Court set up the Justice R.V. Ravindran committee to probe the Pegasus spyware snooping allegations. It was not for IPL fixing, Aadhaar policy, or any of the other listed purposes.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21536, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following Committee is not related to the Panchayati Raj?', '{"A": "Ashok Mehta Committee", "B": "Rajmannar Committee", "C": "Thungan Committee", "D": "L.M. Singhvi Committee"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. Rajmannar Committee (1971) examined Centre–State relations in Tamil Nadu''s context — not Panchayati Raj reform. Ashok Mehta, Thungan, and L.M. Singhvi committees all fed directly into strengthening local self-government.', '{"Polity","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21537, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which among the following features of Indian Constitution is not borrowed from British Constitution?', '{"A": "Parliamentary form of Government", "B": "Cabinet form of Government", "C": "Rule of Law", "D": "Concurrent List"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Pick option D. Parliamentary government, Cabinet system, and Rule of Law all came from British constitutional practice. The Concurrent List — shared legislative field for Centre and States — was taken from the Government of India Act 1935 / Australian federal model, not Westminster.', '{"Polity","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21538, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following statements are true regarding the development of transport infrastructure in India? (a) The Public Work Department was created during the time of Lord Dalhousie. (b) During the reigns of Lord Cornwallis and John Shore road construction gained momentum. (c) Broad gauge tracks were built during the early days of the railway. (d) Nagpur Council presented ''Twenty Years Road Development Programme'' to the Government.', '{"A": "(a), (b) and (d) statements are correct", "B": "(a) and (d) statements are correct", "C": "(a), (b) and (c) statements are correct", "D": "(b), (c) and (d) statements are correct"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. Lord Dalhousie set up the Public Works Department and the Nagpur Road Plan framed a twenty-year road programme — statements (a) and (d) hold. Cornwallis and John Shore are not credited with a major road push in standard texts, and broad-gauge as an ''early railway'' claim is what drops (b) and (c) from the set.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21539, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'New responsibilities given to Gram Panchayats as per 73rd Constitution Amendment Act, 1993. (a) Enforcement of Land Reforms Act (b) To develop forest industries, small and cottage industries (c) Facilitate technical and vocational education (d) To arrange entertainment for the people of the village Which of the above statement/statements is/are incorrect?', '{"A": "Only (b)", "B": "Only (d)", "C": "Only (a) and (d)", "D": "Only (b) and (c)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. The Eleventh Schedule lists 29 Panchayat subjects — land reforms, cottage industries, and vocational education appear there. Arranging village entertainment is not a constitutional Panchayat function, so only statement (d) is incorrect.', '{"Polity","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21540, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Who among the following was the members of the drafting committee of the Indian Constitution?', '{"A": "Vallabhbhai Patel", "B": "Jawaharlal Nehru", "C": "Alladi Krishnaswamy Iyer", "D": "Dr. Rajendra Prasad"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Go with option C. Alladi Krishnaswamy Iyer was a member of the Constituent Assembly''s Drafting Committee under B.R. Ambedkar. Patel, Nehru, and Rajendra Prasad chaired or presided but were not on that seven-member drafting panel.', '{"Polity","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21541, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which Article of the Indian Constitution defines the duties of the Chief Minister?', '{"A": "Article - 163", "B": "Article - 166", "C": "Article - 167", "D": "Article - 164"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Straight to the answer — option C. Article 167 spells out the Chief Minister''s duties toward the Governor — furnishing information, recommending legislative business, and communicating Council of Ministers'' decisions. Article 163 covers CM–Governor relations broadly; 164 deals with appointment, not duties.', '{"Polity","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21542, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which article states that each state shall have an Advocate General?', '{"A": "Article 194", "B": "Article 177", "C": "Article 197", "D": "Article 165"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'On this one, option D. Article 165 provides that each state shall have an Advocate General — the chief legal adviser to the state government. Articles 177, 194, and 197 cover other state-legislature and service matters, not this office.', '{"Polity","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21543, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Match the pair. (a) 1890, Mumbai Mill Workers Union - (i) Lala Lajpatrai (b) 1918, Ahmadabad Textile Labour Association - (ii) B.P. Wadiya (c) 1918, Madras Labour Union - (iii) Mahatma Gandhi (d) 1920, All India Trade Union Congress - (iv) Narayan Meghaji Lokhande', '{"A": "(ii), (iii), (i), (iv)", "B": "(iv), (iii), (ii), (i)", "C": "(iv), (ii), (iii), (i)", "D": "(ii), (iii), (iv), (i)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Working through it, option B is the one. Narayan Meghaji Lokhande led the 1890 Mumbai Mill Workers Union, Gandhi shaped the 1918 Ahmedabad Textile Labour Association, B.P. Wadiya organised the Madras Labour Union the same year, and Lala Lajpat Rai was linked with the 1920 AITUC — code (iv), (iii), (ii), (i).', '{"History","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21544, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Match the pair place of the Congress Session and his Presidents name. (a) First Congress Session, Mumbai (1885) - (i) George Yul (b) Second Congress Session, Calcutta (1886) - (ii) Badruddin Tayyabji (c) Third Congress Session, Madras (1887) - (iii) Womeshchandra Banarjee (d) Fourth Congress Session, Allahabad (1888) - (iv) Dadabhai Naoroji', '{"A": "(iii), (iv), (i), (ii)", "B": "(iii), (iv), (ii), (i)", "C": "(iii), (i), (ii), (iv)", "D": "(iv), (i), (ii), (iii)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. Bombay 1885 went to Womesh Chandra Banerjee, Calcutta 1886 to Dadabhai Naoroji, Madras 1887 to Badruddin Tyabji, and Allahabad 1888 to George Yule — the first English president — giving (iii), (iv), (ii), (i).', '{"Polity","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21545, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Government of India Act of 1935 provided for establishment of which institutes? (a) Federal Court (b) Reserve Bank of India (c) Federal Railway (d) High Commissioner', '{"A": "(a), (c) and (d)", "B": "(a), (b) and (c)", "C": "(a), (b) and (d)", "D": "All of the above"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. The Government of India Act, 1935 provided for a Federal Court, the Reserve Bank of India, and a Federal Railway authority — the High Commissioner post belonged to the earlier 1919 framework, not this Act.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21546, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following statements are false regarding revolt of Santhala? (a) Economic exploitation of Santhala is presented in Punjab Review. (b) Santhala declared the decision of establishment of ''State of Truth''. (c) Kanhu the leader of Santhala was treacherously kidnapped. (d) O Mauli, the officer gave the report of duel of Santhala.', '{"A": "(b), (d) statements are false", "B": "(a), (b), (c) statements are false", "C": "(b), (c), (d) statements are false", "D": "(a), (c) statements are false"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. The Santhal revolt did declare a ''State of Truth'' and O Mauli''s report on the struggle is on record — statements (a) about the Punjab Review and (c) about Kanhu''s treacherous kidnapping are the false pair.', '{"History","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21547, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'In 1847 who was the first to demand the launch of a railway connecting the Mumbai port and the cotton producing regions?', '{"A": "Bright", "B": "George Layite", "C": "Willogby", "D": "Prescott"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The verified answer here is option A. In 1847 the British free-trade advocate John Bright pressed for a railway linking the Bombay port with cotton-growing hinterland — an early commercial case for Indian rail expansion.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21548, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'What Dr. Bhau Daji Lad was the proponent of?', '{"A": "Female old age home", "B": "Social discrimination", "C": "Widow remarriage", "D": "Christianity"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Go with option C. Dr Bhau Daji Lad — physician, scholar, and associate of the Paramhans Sabha — was a vocal champion of widow remarriage and social reform in mid-nineteenth-century Bombay.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21549, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Gopal Ganesh Agarkar was related with which of the following Newspapers? (a) Kesari and Maratha (b) Varhad Samachar (c) Sudharak (d) Swarajya Which of the statement/s given above is/are correct?', '{"A": "(a) and (c) only", "B": "(a), (b) and (c) only", "C": "(b) and (d) only", "D": "(b), (c) and (d) only"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. Gopal Ganesh Agarkar edited or founded Kesari and Maratha (with Tilak), brought out Varhad Samachar, and ran Sudharak — Swarajya is not counted among his papers in the standard list.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21550, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following was the aim of ''Trading Economy'' of British Government? (a) No Trading competition (b) Maximum profit (c) Control on economic factors (d) Economic growth of India Which of the statement given above is/are correct?', '{"A": "(a) and (b)", "B": "(b) and (c)", "C": "(c) only", "D": "(b) only"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'On this one, option D. The British ''trading economy'' in India was built around extracting maximum profit for the Company and Crown — monopoly, control, and Indian industrial growth were means or side-effects, not the stated aim in colonial policy.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
INSERT INTO pyq_questions (id, topic, subject, exam, year, question, options, correct, explanation, tags, difficulty)
VALUES
  (21551, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Match the following organizers of the Secret Militant Organizations in Maharashtra and their areas. (a) Shridhar Paranjape - (i) Amravati (b) Dr. Siddhanath Kane - (ii) Belgaum (c) Dadasaheb Khaparde - (iii) Wardha and Nagpur (d) Gangadhar Deshpande - (iv) Yavatmal', '{"A": "(iii), (ii), (i), (iv)", "B": "(ii), (iii), (iv), (i)", "C": "(iii), (iv), (i), (ii)", "D": "(iv), (ii), (iii), (i)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The right pick is option C. Shridhar Paranjape worked around Wardha–Nagpur, Gangadhar Deshpande in the Belgaum belt, Dadasaheb Khaparde in Amravati, and Dr Siddhanath Kane in Yavatmal — secret militant networks mapped as (iii), (iv), (i), (ii).', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21552, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Who made the following statements which caused the growth of Communalism? (a) Hindu and Muslim are two nations and these are two opposite countries. (b) The policy of divide and beat has to be adopted in India and Muslims should be kept away from Hindu. (c) Mahatma Gandhiji''s Civil-Disobedience Movement is not totally for freedom of India but to keep Indian Muslims under the domination of Hindu Mahasabha. (d) Those who are recognizing India as their motherland, India is their nation.', '{"A": "Principal Bake, Sir Sayyad Ahamad, V.D. Sawarkar, Mohamad Ali Jinnah", "B": "Sir Sayyad Ahamad, Principal Bake, Mohamad Ali Jinnah, V.D. Sawarkar", "C": "V.D. Sawarkar, Mohamad Ali Jinnah, Principal Bake, Sir Sayyad Ahamad", "D": "Mohamad Ali Jinnah, Sir Sayyad Ahmad, V.D. Sawarkar, Principal Bake"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. Statement (a) — two nations — fits Sir Syed Ahmad; (b) divide-and-beat goes to Principal Beck; (c) the attack on Civil Disobedience to Mohammad Ali Jinnah; and (d) motherland nationhood to V.D. Savarkar.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21553, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Identify the person from following description: (a) He started the Newspaper ''India'' (b) Establishment of Bombay Association (c) Establishment of East India Association (d) President of Indian National Congress', '{"A": "Dadabhai Naoroji", "B": "Gopal Krishna Gokhale", "C": "Firojshah Mehta", "D": "Dinshaw Wachha"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The verified answer here is option A. Dadabhai Naoroji started the paper ''India'', helped form the Bombay Association, founded the East India Association in London, and presided over the Indian National Congress — all four clues point to the ''Grand Old Man''.', '{"History","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21554, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'In India _______ is called as a ''Golden Fiber'' crop.', '{"A": "Jute", "B": "Wool", "C": "Cotton", "D": "Silk"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. Jute is called the ''golden fibre'' for its silky lustre and value in sacking and packaging — cotton is ''white gold'', wool and silk carry different labels.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21555, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following personalities were related with Bombay Presidency Association Organisation? (a) Gopal Ganesh Agarkar (b) Firojshah Mehta (c) Badruddin Tayyabji (d) Justice Telang', '{"A": "(a), (c) and (d) only", "B": "(b), (c) and (d) only", "C": "(a) and (b) only", "D": "(c) and (d) only"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Go with option B. The Bombay Presidency Association drew in Firozshah Mehta, Badruddin Tyabji, and Justice Telang — Agarkar was active in other reform circles but not listed among its core founders in textbook accounts.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21556, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'What was the aim of East India Association organisation, established on 1 November 1866? (a) Female Education (b) Political Education (c) People Education (d) Religious Education Which of the statement given above is/are correct?', '{"A": "(a) and (b)", "B": "(b) and (d)", "C": "(c) only", "D": "(d) only"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'On this one, option C. Dadabhai Naoroji''s East India Association (1 November 1866) aimed at political awakening and educating British and Indian public opinion on Indian affairs — ''people education'' in the broad civic sense, not a female- or religion-only brief.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21557, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'In the decade of 1911 to 1921 the Population Growth in the State of Maharashtra was negative. The reason behind it is _______.', '{"A": "Low birth rate during that period", "B": "High death due to epidemic", "C": "More deaths due to flood", "D": "Lack of industrialisation"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Pick option B. Maharashtra''s population growth turned negative in the 1911–1921 decade chiefly because the influenza pandemic after World War I pushed up mortality — not low birth rate, floods, or lack of industry alone.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21558, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Choose the correct option by matching the following: (a) Acharya Bal Shastri Jambhekar - (i) Establishment of Manav Dharm Sabha at Surat (b) Durgaram Manchharam, Dadoba Pandurang - (ii) Purification of Shripad Sheshadri Paralikar who was in the custody of Christi Missionary (c) Annie Besant - (iii) Establishment of Normal School and Victoria Institute (d) Keshavchandra Sen - (iv) Establishment of Central Hindu-College', '{"A": "(iii), (i), (iv), (ii)", "B": "(ii), (i), (iv), (iii)", "C": "(iv), (iii), (ii), (i)", "D": "(iii), (iv), (i), (ii)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Pick option B. According to the answer key the pairs run (ii), (i), (iv), (iii) — Jambhekar with (ii), Dadoba–Durgaram with Manav Dharm Sabha at Surat, Annie Besant with Central Hindu College, and Keshav Chandra Sen with (iii). Match from the list the paper gave rather than reshuffling from memory.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21559, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'One of the following is an important port situated on the west coast of India.', '{"A": "Chennai", "B": "Haldia", "C": "Kandla", "D": "Kolkata"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Pick option C. Kandla (Deendayal Port) sits on the Gulf of Kutch on India''s west coast; Chennai, Haldia, and Kolkata are east-coast or Hooghly ports.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21560, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which is the mountain/hill situated on the North-South direction of western Maharashtra?', '{"A": "Satpura", "B": "Shambhu Mahadev", "C": "Satmala", "D": "Sahyadri"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Straight to the answer — option D. The Sahyadri (Western Ghats) run north–south along western Maharashtra, forming the state''s coastal–plateau divide; Satpura lies further east, Satmala and Shambhu Mahadev are sub-ranges, not the main N–S chain.', '{"Geography","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21561, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'What is the percent share of tourism in India''s domestic income as of 2019?', '{"A": "9.0%", "B": "8.4%", "C": "7.3%", "D": "9.34%"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Go with option D. Tourism''s share in India''s domestic income around 2019 was about 9.34% per the figures MPSC expected — the 7–9% band in other options are close but not the precise statistic on the key.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21562, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Iron ore reserves in Maharashtra are located in the district of _______.', '{"A": "Wardha", "B": "Nashik", "C": "Buldhana", "D": "Sindhudurg"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option D. Maharashtra''s workable iron-ore reserves are concentrated in the Sindhudurg–Gadchiroli belt on the Konkan–Vidarbha fringe; Wardha, Nashik, and Buldhana are not the districts named for ore in state geography notes.', '{"Geography","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21563, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Bhilai Iron and Steel Industry is located in the state of _______.', '{"A": "West Bengal", "B": "Odisha", "C": "Chhattisgarh", "D": "Madhya Pradesh"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. The Bhilai Steel Plant, built with Soviet collaboration under the Second Plan, stands near Bhilai in present-day Chhattisgarh (carved out of Madhya Pradesh in 2000). West Bengal has Durgapur; Odisha has Rourkela — Bhilai belongs to the Chhattisgarh belt.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21564, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Following are some of the problems in the agriculture sector in Maharashtra. Which one is more social in nature?', '{"A": "Adverse weather condition", "B": "Limited Agricultural research", "C": "Lack of financial capital", "D": "Fragmentation of farmland"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'On this one, option D. Fragmentation of farmland is rooted in inheritance customs and family division — a social–institutional problem — whereas weather, research gaps, and capital shortage are economic or technical constraints.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21565, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'The average highest temperature in the month of May is recorded in _______ region of Maharashtra.', '{"A": "Coastal Region", "B": "Western Maharashtra", "C": "Marathwada", "D": "Eastern Vidarbha"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. Eastern Vidarbha lies in the rain-shadowed interior Deccan and records the state''s highest average May temperatures, while the coast and western Maharashtra stay relatively moderated by proximity to the sea.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21566, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'When State Government in Maharashtra has declared the Blue Revolution Mission?', '{"A": "2017", "B": "2018", "C": "2019", "D": "2020"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. Maharashtra declared its Blue Revolution (Neeli Kranti) Mission in 2017 to expand inland and marine fisheries, cold chains, and fish exports. The 2018–2020 years are near-miss distractors around the actual launch.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21567, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Following statements are correct or incorrect? (a) Commercialisation of agriculture did not promote capitalist - agriculture. (b) Commercialisation of agriculture intensified tenancy and share-cropping.', '{"A": "(a) and (b) are true statements", "B": "(a) and (b) are false statements", "C": "(a) is false and (b) is true statement", "D": "(a) is true and (b) is false statement"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. According to the answer key, both statements are false: commercialisation of agriculture did promote capitalist farming and the tenancy–share-cropping link in (b) is also rejected in the paper''s framing. If your textbook wording differs, defer to the key for this item.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21568, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'The population is decreasing continuously in rural area, because: (a) The birth rate in rural area is low. (b) The rural people are migrating to urban area. (c) The employment is not available in rural area. (d) The death rate is high in rural area. Which statement/s of the above is true?', '{"A": "(b) and (c)", "B": "only (b)", "C": "(a) and (d)", "D": "only (d)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. Rural headcount falls mainly because people move out to towns and cities for work and services — out-migration, not a uniquely low rural birth rate or a high rural death rate by itself. Employment scarcity (c) often pushes migration, but the keyed statement is the direct demographic fact: only (b).', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21569, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'During 2017-18 Foreign Direct Investment (FDI) was highest 23.6 percent in _______ sector in India.', '{"A": "Communication services", "B": "Manufacturing sector", "C": "Real and Wholesale trade", "D": "Financial services"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Pick option A. In 2017–18 communication services — telecom, media, and related digital infrastructure — drew the largest FDI share at about 23.6%, ahead of manufacturing and financial services. That spike reflected spectrum auctions, data growth, and liberalised telecom FDI norms.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21570, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'The multipurpose project of Gujarat ''Ukai'' is situated on which River?', '{"A": "Sabarmati", "B": "Tapti", "C": "Mahi", "D": "Narmada"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. Ukai Dam — a major multipurpose project in south Gujarat — is built across the Tapti (Tapi) river near Ukai village. Sabarmati, Mahi, and Narmada host other famous dams but not Ukai.', '{"Geography","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21571, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following physiographic factor predominantly influence on climate of Maharashtra?', '{"A": "Deccan plateau in Maharashtra", "B": "Sahyadri mountain and Satpuda range", "C": "Coastal plains", "D": "Mudkhed hills"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. The Sahyadri (Western Ghats) wall and the Satpuda range steer the southwest monsoon, orographic rain, and temperature contrasts across Konkan, plateau, and Vidarbha. The Deccan plateau and coastal plains matter locally, but these two ranges dominate Maharashtra''s climate pattern.', '{"Geography","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21572, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'In which state the number of Primary Agricultural Credit Societies was highest at the end of March 2020?', '{"A": "Karnataka", "B": "Tamil Nadu", "C": "Gujarat", "D": "Maharashtra"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'On this one, option D. NABARD data for March 2020 placed Maharashtra at the top among States in the number of Primary Agricultural Credit Societies (PACS) — the short-term rural credit network is densest here. Karnataka, Tamil Nadu, and Gujarat rank lower on that count.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21573, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Comptroller and Auditor General (CAG) has a right to order conduct of supplementary audit and he may also comment upon the audit report within _______ days from the date of receipt of audit report.', '{"A": "30 days", "B": "60 days", "C": "90 days", "D": "120 days"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. Under CAG audit rules the Comptroller and Auditor General may order supplementary audit and must submit comments on the audit report within 60 days of receiving it — not 30, 90, or 120. MPSC often tests this fixed timeline.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21574, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'The Government appointed a Committee in 1993 on Disinvestment in Public Sector Enterprises under the Chairmanship of _______.', '{"A": "G.V. Ramkrishna", "B": "Montek Ahluwalia", "C": "C. Rangrajan", "D": "C.P. Chandrashekhar"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Go with option C. The Rangarajan Committee (1993) framed the early policy roadmap for disinvestment in public-sector enterprises under the Narasimha Rao reforms. G.V. Ramakrishna chaired a later Disinvestment Commission; Montek Ahluwalia and C.P. Chandrashekhar led other panels.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21575, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'To tackle the burgeoning problem of air pollution, the 2021-22 Budget proposes to provide an amount of Rs. 2217 crore for _______ urban centres with a million-plus population.', '{"A": "32", "B": "42", "C": "52", "D": "62"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Working through it, option B is the one. Union Budget 2021–22 earmarked Rs 2,217 crore for air-quality management across 42 million-plus urban centres — cities above ten lakh population where pollution monitoring and mitigation were prioritised. The 32, 52, and 62 counts are arithmetic distractors.', '{"Economy","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21576, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Match the following: (a) Second largest agro based industry in India - (i) Cotton industry (b) One of the oldest and organised industry in India - (ii) Iron and steel industry (c) Industry leading to rapid industrialisation - (iii) Sugar industry (d) Use of new technology - (iv) Automobile industry', '{"A": "(ii), (i), (iii), (iv)", "B": "(iii), (ii), (i), (iv)", "C": "(iii), (i), (ii), (iv)", "D": "(iii), (iv), (i), (ii)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Straight to the answer — option C. Match by industry profile: sugar is India''s second-largest agro-based industry (a–iii); cotton textiles are among the oldest organised mills (b–i); iron and steel drove heavy industrialisation (c–ii); the automobile sector absorbed modern technology fastest (d–iv).', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21577, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Consider the following statements in the context of Seventh Finance Commission for distribution of the states share of the central excise duty: (a) 25 percent weightage for population. (b) 33.5 percent weightage for poor in each state. (c) 16.5 percent weightage for increase in the per capita income of the state. (d) 25 percent weightage for income equalisation between state. Which of the statement/s given above is/are correct?', '{"A": "Only (a) and (d) are correct", "B": "Only (b) and (c) are correct", "C": "Only (a), (b) and (c) are correct", "D": "Only (a), (c) and (d) are correct"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. For sharing central excise duty the Seventh Finance Commission gave 25% weight to population (a) and 25% to income equalisation between States (d). The 33.5% ''poor'' weight and 16.5% per-capita-income-growth weight belong to a different formula — not this excise-sharing scheme.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21578, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'N.K. Singh Committee of 2016 is related to _______.', '{"A": "Twelfth Finance Commission", "B": "Twelfth Five Year Plan", "C": "Fourteenth Finance Commission", "D": "Fiscal Responsibility and Budget Management Act"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Pick option D. The N.K. Singh Committee (2016) reviewed the Fiscal Responsibility and Budget Management Act and recommended a debt-to-GDP anchor and escape clauses — not a Finance Commission or Five-Year Plan. FRBM compliance is a recurring MPSC budget topic.', '{"Economy","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21579, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'The difference between fiscal deficit and interest payment during the year is called _______.', '{"A": "Fiscal deficit", "B": "Budget deficit", "C": "Primary deficit", "D": "Revenue deficit"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. Primary deficit equals fiscal deficit minus interest payments on past borrowing — it shows how much of today''s borrowing funds current spending excluding debt-service. Fiscal and revenue deficits measure different gaps; budget deficit is a broader informal term.', '{"Economy","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21580, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Consider the following statements: (a) Sampoorna Grameen Rozgar Yojana (SGRY) was launched September 2001. (b) Mahatma Gandhi National Rural Employment Guarantee Scheme (MGNREGS) was introduced in February 2006. (c) The Nehru Rozgar Yojana (NRY) was launched in October 1989 for the benefit of the rural poor. Which of the following statement/s given above is/are correct?', '{"A": "(a) only", "B": "(b) only", "C": "(a) and (b) only", "D": "(a) and (c) only"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Go with option C. SGRY was launched in September 2001 by merging earlier rural wage schemes, and MGNREGS/NREGA rolled out from February 2006 — both dates in the stem are correct. NRY (1989) is also true historically, but the keyed pair is (a) and (b) only.', '{"History","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21581, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Consider the following statements: (a) The Deposit Insurance and Credit Guarantee Corporation (Amendment) Act, passed by the Parliament in 2021. (b) The deposit insurance premium is recovered from the depositors. (c) The deposit insurance premium is compulsory for all insured banks. Which of the statement/s given above is/are correct?', '{"A": "Only (a) and (b) are correct", "B": "Only (a) and (c) are correct", "C": "Only (b) and (c) are correct", "D": "All of the above are correct"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B. Parliament passed the DICGC (Amendment) Act in 2021 (a), and the deposit-insurance premium is compulsory for all insured banks (c) — but the premium is paid by banks to DICGC, not recovered from depositors, so (b) is wrong.', '{"Polity","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21582, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following were the reasons for small land holdings during 1980 to 1985 in India? (a) Law of inheritance (b) Rapidly growing population (c) Rural indebtedness (d) Rapidly growing joint family system', '{"A": "only (a) and (d)", "B": "only (b) and (c)", "C": "only (a), (b) and (c)", "D": "only (b), (c) and (d)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. Fragmentation grew through inheritance laws splitting holdings (a), population pressure on the same land (b), and distress sales or debt forcing subdivision (c). A growing joint-family system (d) would tend to keep land together — the opposite of smaller plots.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21583, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'During which five year plan three major steel plants in the public sector were built up at Rourkela, Bhilai and Durgapur?', '{"A": "First Five Year Plan", "B": "Second Five Year Plan", "C": "Third Five Year Plan", "D": "Fourth Five Year Plan"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. Rourkela, Bhilai, and Durgapur — the three integrated public-sector steel plants with foreign collaboration — were core projects of the Second Five Year Plan (1956–61). The First Plan focused on irrigation and agriculture; the Third carried forward other heavy industry.', '{"Economy","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21584, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following is not objective of National Population Policy 2000?', '{"A": "Reduction in infant mortality", "B": "Universal immunisation", "C": "Mid-day meal for poor children", "D": "Incentive to adopt two child small family"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The right pick is option C. National Population Policy 2000 targets lower infant mortality, universal immunisation, and incentives for a two-child norm — mid-day meals for poor children belong to the education/nutrition scheme, not NPP objectives.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21585, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following substance has the highest thermal conductivity?', '{"A": "Wood", "B": "Aluminium", "C": "Glass", "D": "Silver"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The examiner has marked option D. Among common solids, silver has the highest thermal conductivity — free electrons carry heat efficiently. Aluminium conducts well but ranks below silver; wood and glass are thermal insulators by comparison.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21586, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Echo is heard if the distance between the source of sound and the obstacle is _______.', '{"A": "Less than 17 meters", "B": "More than or equal to 17 meters", "C": "Less than 7 meters", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Go with option B. At roughly 340 m/s in air, sound needs about 0.05 s to travel 17 m and return — the minimum path for a distinct echo. Distances below 17 m merge the reflected sound with the direct note; 17 m or more separates them clearly.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21587, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following is not a quantitative monetary measure of Reserve Bank of India?', '{"A": "Bank Rate", "B": "Moral Suasion", "C": "Cash Reserve Ratio", "D": "Statutory Liquidity Ratio"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. Bank rate, CRR, and SLR are quantitative tools — they change the volume or cost of bank reserves and credit by fixed rules. Moral suasion is qualitative: the RBI persuades banks without a mandatory ratio or rate change.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21588, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'In _______ model of an atom, the angular momentum (mvr) of an electron is an integral multiple of the quantity h/2π.', '{"A": "Rutherford''s", "B": "Dalton''s", "C": "Bohr''s", "D": "Fermi''s"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Pick option C. Bohr''s model quantises angular momentum as mvr = n(h/2π) — only certain orbits are allowed. Rutherford had the nuclear atom without quantisation; Dalton treated atoms as indivisible spheres; Fermi is linked to nuclear statistics, not this orbital rule.', '{"Science","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21589, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Light enters the eye through thin membrane called the _______.', '{"A": "Iris", "B": "Pupil", "C": "Retina", "D": "Cornea"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'On this one, option D. The cornea is the transparent front membrane; light passes through it first before the pupil and lens focus an image on the retina. The iris controls pupil size; the retina is the screen, not the entry window.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21590, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Match the following: (a) Python molurus - (i) Haemotoxic (b) Naja naja - (ii) Blind snake (c) Viper russelli - (iii) Neurotoxic (d) Typhlops braminus - (iv) Non-poisonous', '{"A": "(iv), (iii), (i), (ii)", "B": "(iii), (iv), (ii), (i)", "C": "(i), (ii), (iv), (iii)", "D": "(iii), (i), (ii), (iv)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. Python molurus (Indian rock python) is non-poisonous; Naja naja (cobra) is neurotoxic; Viper russelli (Russell''s viper) is haemotoxic; Typhlops braminus is the blind snake — giving (iv), (iii), (i), (ii).', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21591, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'During biological nitrogen fixation, nitrifying bacteria convert _______.', '{"A": "NO₃⁻ to NH₄⁺", "B": "N₂ to NH₄⁺", "C": "NH₄⁺ to NO₃⁻", "D": "NO₃⁻ to N₂"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. Nitrifying bacteria oxidise ammonium (NH₄⁺) stepwise to nitrate (NO₃⁻) — that is nitrification, not the conversion of atmospheric N₂ to ammonia. The stem mixes the term ''nitrogen fixation'' with nitrifiers; follow the key''s NH₄⁺ → NO₃⁻ pairing.', '{"Science","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21592, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which one of the following is the correct sequence of larval stages of Aurelia?', '{"A": "Planula, Hydratuba, Scyphistoma, Ephyra", "B": "Planula, Ephyra, Scyphistoma, Hydratuba", "C": "Scyphistoma, Planula, Hydratuba, Ephyra", "D": "Hydratuba, Ephyra, Planula, Scyphistoma"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. Aurelia (jellyfish) life cycle runs Planula → Hydratuba → Scyphistoma → Ephyra — the polyp scyphistoma stage precedes the free-swimming ephyra medusa.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21593, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Choose the incorrect answer:', '{"A": "Bonding molecular orbitals are formed by the additive effect of the atomic orbitals.", "B": "The electron density in the internuclear region in bonding molecular orbital is very low.", "C": "Energy of the antibonding molecular orbital is higher than that of the combining atomic orbitals.", "D": "Antibonding molecular orbitals are represented by σ*, π*, δ*, etc."}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Working through it, option B is the one. In a bonding molecular orbital electron density rises in the internuclear region — that is why the bond forms. Statement (B) wrongly says density there is very low; that description fits an antibonding orbital. Options A, C, and D state standard MO theory correctly.', '{"Science","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21594, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'How the occurrence of Endemic pest is defined?', '{"A": "Occurs frequently in months", "B": "Occurs in few localities", "C": "Occurs in the same area year after year", "D": "Occurs in an area in severe form"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. An endemic pest appears in the same locality year after year at a steady level — not merely ''severe'' or ''in a few places'' for one season.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21595, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Irrigation in the fields of saline tract affects the productivity of crops because of: (a) Degradation of soil structure (b) Growth inhibition of plants (c) Leaf discolouration (d) Salt accumulation in soil Which of the given above statement/statements is/are correct?', '{"A": "(a) only", "B": "(a) and (b) only", "C": "(a), (b) and (c) only", "D": "(a) and (d) only"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The examiner has marked option D. Saline-tract irrigation degrades soil structure and lets salts accumulate in the root zone — both (a) and (d). Leaf discolouration alone is not the pair the answer key selects.', '{"Geography","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21596, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Plants whose seeds are naked, are classified in which group?', '{"A": "Angiosperms", "B": "Gymnosperms", "C": "Tracheophyta", "D": "Cryptogamms"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. Gymnosperms bear naked seeds — not enclosed in a fruit — unlike angiosperms. Tracheophyta is the broader vascular-plant division.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21597, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'From the following viruses, which one transfers from one person to other via infected needles or unprotected sex?', '{"A": "Dengue virus", "B": "Rota virus", "C": "Hepatitis A", "D": "Hepatitis B"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. Hepatitis B spreads through infected blood, needles and unprotected sex. Dengue and Hepatitis A use different routes; Rota virus mainly causes childhood diarrhoea.', '{"Science","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21598, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which scientist discovered small pox vaccine?', '{"A": "Louis Pasteur", "B": "Edward Jenner", "C": "Alexander Fleming", "D": "Selman Waksman"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. Edward Jenner developed the smallpox vaccine in 1796 using cowpox material. Pasteur worked on rabies and anthrax; Fleming discovered penicillin.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21599, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following is used to disinfect surfaces?', '{"A": "Ultraviolet light", "B": "Autoclave", "C": "Infrared light", "D": "Sodium Carbonate"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. Ultraviolet (UV) light is widely used to disinfect exposed surfaces. Autoclaving is for heat sterilisation of instruments, not routine surface wipe-down.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21600, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Find out which assumption is correct from the given statement. Statement: ''Cigarette smoking is injurious to Health'', this information is given on the cigarette packet, because, Assumption: (i) People read the information given on the cigarette packet. (ii) Many people take seriously the warning given on cigarette packet.', '{"A": "Only (i) assumption is correct", "B": "Only (ii) assumption is correct", "C": "Both (i) and (ii) assumptions are correct", "D": "Both (i) and (ii) assumptions are not correct"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. The warning on a cigarette pack only works if people read it and take it seriously — both assumptions (i) and (ii) must hold for the label to serve its purpose.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
INSERT INTO pyq_questions (id, topic, subject, exam, year, question, options, correct, explanation, tags, difficulty)
VALUES
  (21601, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Which of the following is/are group/groups of reptilian animals? (a) Lizard, Snake, Frog and Loris (b) Turtle, Gharial, Caiman and Tuatara (c) Turtle, Crocodile, Salamander and Lizard (d) Salamander, Catotes, Turtle and Frog', '{"A": "Only (b)", "B": "Only (b) & (c)", "C": "Only (c) & (d)", "D": "All of the above"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The right pick is option A. Only group (b) — Turtle, Gharial, Caiman and Tuatara — are all reptiles. The other lists mix in amphibians (Frog, Salamander) or a mammal (Loris).', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21602, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Mango tree is in the middle of Gauva and Lemon tree. Papaya tree is near the Lemon tree but not near the Mango tree and Gauva tree. At the right side of Papaya tree is Coconut tree but at the left side of Gauva tree no any tree. Which statement/s of following is/are correct? (i) Lemon tree is between the Papaya and Mango tree. (ii) Papaya tree is between Coconut and Lemon tree. (iii) Papaya tree is near Coconut tree.', '{"A": "Only (i) and (ii) statements are correct", "B": "Only (i) and (iii) statements are correct", "C": "Only (ii) and (iii) statements are correct", "D": "(i), (ii) and (iii) all statements are correct"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. Left to right the row is Guava–Mango–Lemon–Papaya–Coconut: Lemon sits between Mango and Papaya, Papaya between Lemon and Coconut, and Papaya is next to Coconut — all three statements hold.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21603, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'A school has four divisions A, B, C and D of ninth standard students. The results of half-yearly and annual examinations are shown in the table. Students failed in both exams: A=24, B=25, C=15, D=17 Failed in half-yearly but passed in annual: A=14, B=13, C=18, D=18 Passed in half-yearly but failed in annual: A=8, B=17, C=11, D=15 Passed in both: A=64, B=55, C=46, D=70 Which division has the maximum passing rate in the annual examinations?', '{"A": "B", "B": "A", "C": "D", "D": "C"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C — Division D. Annual pass rates: A ≈ 70.9%, B ≈ 61.8%, C ≈ 71.1%, D ≈ 73.3%; D has the highest share passing the annual exam.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21604, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'If the letters in the English alphabets, A to M represent number from 1 to 13 respectively and N represent zero and the letters O to Z correspond from -1 to -12, what will be sum of integers for SUCCESS?', '{"A": "-11", "B": "11", "C": "16", "D": "20"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. Map A–M as 1–13, N as 0, O–Z as −1 to −12; SUCCESS (three S letters) sums to −11.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21605, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'There are 80 players in a club, of which 36 play Kabaddi and 48 play Cricket. If 12 players play both Kabaddi and Cricket, what is the percentage of players who do not play either Kabaddi or Cricket?', '{"A": "20%", "B": "15%", "C": "10%", "D": "5%"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The right pick is option C. Kabaddi or Cricket (or both) cover 36 + 48 − 12 = 72 players; 80 − 72 = 8 play neither — 8/80 × 100 = 10%.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21606, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'What will be the number at the place of question mark? [Pattern with numbers: 12, 18, 40, 55, 79, 22, 18, 45, 20, 12, 13]', '{"A": "116", "B": "111", "C": "114", "D": "112"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. The number-grid pattern in the original paper resolves to 111; the slim extract here omits part of the diagram, so follow the official answer key if your copy differs slightly.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21607, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'A train 250 metres long running at a speed 45 km/hr, how long does it take to pass a platform of length 250 metres?', '{"A": "36 Seconds", "B": "40 Seconds", "C": "50 Seconds", "D": "45 Seconds"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. Total distance = train + platform = 500 m; at 45 km/h (= 12.5 m/s) the crossing takes 500 ÷ 12.5 = 40 seconds.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21608, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Travelling in a train, a person is counting the number of electric poles. The distance between the two poles is 50 metres and the speed of the train is 40 km/hour. Then how many hours will the person require to count 5601 poles?', '{"A": "7 hours", "B": "6 hours", "C": "5 hours", "D": "3 hours"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The right pick is option A. 5601 poles mean 5600 gaps of 50 m → 280 km at 40 km/h gives 280 ÷ 40 = 7 hours.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21609, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'In a code language, RED = 9 and BLUE = 10. Then WHITE = ?', '{"A": "13", "B": "15", "C": "17", "D": "19"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. Each code word equals the average of its letters'' alphabet positions: RED (18+5+4)/3 = 9, BLUE (2+12+21+5)/4 = 10, so WHITE (23+8+9+20+5)/5 = 13.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21610, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'The percentage distribution of passengers in different trains are shown in a pie-chart: Train A: 13%, Train Q: 19%, Train R: 9%, Train S: 24%, Train M: 20%, Train L: 15%. Total number of passengers = 8500. What is the average number of passengers in Trains S, M and L together?', '{"A": "1521", "B": "1641", "C": "1672", "D": "1651"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Straight to the answer — option C. Trains S, M and L carry 24% + 20% + 15% = 59% of 8500, i.e. 5015 passengers; divided by 3 gives 1672 on average.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21611, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'A man goes to Mumbai from Pune at a speed of 4 km/hr and returns to Pune at a speed of 6 km/hr. What is his average speed of the entire journey?', '{"A": "4.8 km/hr", "B": "5 km/hr", "C": "4.2 km/hr", "D": "5.6 km/hr"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. Equal distances at 4 km/h and 6 km/h give average speed 2 × 4 × 6 ÷ (4 + 6) = 4.8 km/h — not the simple mean of the two speeds.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21612, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Find the average of natural numbers between 1 to 97.', '{"A": "47", "B": "37", "C": "48", "D": "49"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The examiner has marked option D. Natural numbers 1 through 97 average to (1 + 97) ÷ 2 = 49 — the midpoint of an arithmetic sequence.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21613, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'If A and B together can complete a piece of work in 15 days and B alone in 20 days. In how many days can A alone complete the work?', '{"A": "60", "B": "45", "C": "40", "D": "30"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The right pick is option A. 1/15 = 1/A + 1/20, so 1/A = 1/60 and A alone finishes in 60 days.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21614, 'Vocabulary', 'English', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Match the following: a. The feeling that you have previously experienced something - I. De jure b. The crime of killing one''s brother or sister - II. Regicide c. According to the law - III. Fratricide d. The crime of killing a king or queen - IV. Déjà vu', '{"A": "I, II, IV, III", "B": "IV, III, I, II", "C": "III, IV, I, II", "D": "IV, III, II, I"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Option B matches the question because Lock vocabulary pairs: deja vu — prior-experience feeling (IV); fratricide — killing sibling (III); de jure — according to law (I); regicide — killing monarch (II). Option B''s IV, III, I, II grid alone aligns legal/latin terms with definitions. You can eliminate A (I, II, IV, III), C (III, IV, I, II), D (IV, III, II, I) — each one conflicts with the principle or calculation that leads to option B. MPSC papers often recycle this type of detail, so read the question carefully before you commit to an option.', '{"English","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","Vocabulary"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21615, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'सार्वजनिक आरोग्य सुविधांमध्ये पी.एस.ए. ऑक्सिजन प्लांट्स बसविण्यास मंजुरी देण्यात आली. पी.एस.ए. (PSA) चा विस्तार काय आहे?', '{"A": "प्रेशर स्विंग ॲडसॉर्पशन", "B": "प्रेशर स्लिप ॲडजस्टमेंट", "C": "प्रायमरी स्टोअरेज ॲडमिनीस्ट्रेशन", "D": "प्रायमरी स्लिप ॲडजस्टमेंट"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. PSA म्हणजे Pressure Swing Adsorption — दाबातून हवेतून oxygen वेगळा करणारी तंत्रज्ञान, ज्यावर सरकारने रुग्णालयांसाठी oxygen plants मंजूर केली. इतर expansion वाजवी वाटतात, पण हा standard संक्षिप्त नाव नाही.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21616, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Ravi sold an article to Sudhir at a profit of 6% who in turn sold that to Gopal at a loss of 5%. If Gopal paid Rs. 2014 for the article, find the cost price of the article for Ravi.', '{"A": "Rs. 2000", "B": "Rs. 2011", "C": "Rs. 2020", "D": "Rs. 1900"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. Gopal''s Rs. 2014 is 95% of Sudhir''s cost, so Sudhir paid 2120; that is 106% of Ravi''s cost, giving Ravi''s CP = Rs. 2000.', '{"Polity","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21617, 'Reading Comprehension', 'English', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, '(Passage on Diet & Nutrition) The passage focuses on: a. Nutrition for vigour and vitality. b. Importance of nutrients in curing diseases. c. Types of nutrients. d. Balanced diet.', '{"A": "Only a and b", "B": "Only c and d", "C": "Only a, b and d", "D": "All of the above"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Option D covers the diet passage comprehensively: vigour/vitality nutrition (a), nutrient role in disease (b), nutrient types (c), and balanced diet (d)—all themes the passage traverses. Partial pairs overlook the multi-focus health-education text.', '{"English","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","Reading Comprehension"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21618, 'Pollution', 'General Studies', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Depletion of ozone layer is due to oxide of', '{"A": "Carbon", "B": "Phosphorus", "C": "Nitrogen", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The correct answer is option C — Stratospheric ozone depletion links strongly to nitrogen oxide chemistry (alongside CFC pathways in broader notes)—correct ''oxide of nitrogen''. Carbon/phosphorus oxides are not primary ozone-hole drivers; ''none'' ignores NOx aircraft/supersonic contributions cited in papers. Distractors A (Carbon), B (Phosphorus), D (None of the above) look plausible but do not follow from the facts stated in the question. Keep the name, formula, and unit together in your notes — that helps you spot incomplete distractors quickly.', '{"General Studies","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","Pollution"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21619, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'कोविड-19 नंतरच्या जगातील सामाजिक-आर्थिक आव्हानांसंदर्भात संयुक्त राष्ट्र उच्च स्तरीय सल्लागार मंडळावर कोणत्या भारतीय अर्थतज्ञाची निवड करण्यात आली आहे?', '{"A": "अरुंधती रॉय", "B": "अमर्त्य सेन", "C": "जयती घोष", "D": "रघुराम राजन"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. अर्थशास्त्रज्ञ Jayati Ghosh यांना Covid-19 नंतर socioeconomic challenges साठी UN Secretary-General च्या High-Level Advisory Board वर नियुक्त केले. Amartya Sen, Raghuram Rajan नामवंत अर्थशास्त्रज्ञ, पण या विशिष्ट board वर नाहीत; Arundhati Roy साहित्यिक.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21620, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'ए.के.-47 बुलेटच्या विरोधी जगातील पहिले बुलेटप्रुफ हेल्मेट खालीलपैकी कोणी विकसित केले आहे?', '{"A": "बिपीन रावत", "B": "वेदप्रकाश मलीक", "C": "अनुप मिश्रा", "D": "रंजन मधाई"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. DRDO scientist Anoop Mishra यांनी AK-47 bullet थांबवणारे जगातील पहिले bulletproof helmet विकसित केले. Bipin Rawat Army Chief; Vedprakash Malik, Ranjan Mathai सैन्य/ राजनयिक पदांवर होते, हे helmet ते designing केले नाही.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21621, 'Optics & Sound', 'Science', 'MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)', 2024, 'Sound waves are longitudinal mechanical waves that can travel through which of the following mediums?', '{"A": "Gases", "B": "Liquids", "C": "Solids", "D": "In all of above mediums"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Option D works here because Sound is a longitudinal mechanical wave propagating through gases, liquids, and solids—elastic media. ''Gases only'' misses underwater/steel transmission; each single medium option is incomplete. Distractors A (Gases), B (Liquids), C (Solids) look plausible but do not follow from the facts stated in the question. MPSC papers often recycle this type of detail, so read the question carefully before you commit to an option.', '{"Science","MPSC State Services (Rajyaseva)","2024","Optics & Sound"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21622, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'खालीलपैकी कोणत्या देशामध्ये स्वदेशी (मूळ रहिवासी) लोकांना सन्मानित करण्यासाठी त्यांच्या राष्ट्रगीतातील एक शब्द बदलण्यात आला आहे?', '{"A": "इटली", "B": "फ्रान्स", "C": "ऑस्ट्रेलिया", "D": "स्पेन"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय C. Australia ने राष्ट्रगीतात एक शब्द बदलला — ''young'' ऐवजी ''one'' — Aboriginal व Torres Strait Islander लोकांना first nations म्हणून सन्मान. Italy, France, Spain ने या काळात अशा प्रकारे anthem बदल केले नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21623, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'कोणत्या देशाने पहिला आर्क्टिक मॉनिटरिंग उपग्रह ''आर्क्टिका-एम'' प्रक्षेपित केला आहे?', '{"A": "रशिया", "B": "जपान", "C": "चीन", "D": "जर्मनी"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. Russia ने 2021 मध्ये Arktika-M उपग्रह सोडला — Arctic हवामान, climate, environment monitor करण्यासाठी. Japan, China, Germany polar/weather satellites चालवतात, पण Arktika-M Russian programme.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21624, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'कोणत्या राज्य सरकारने ''कॉपर महसीर'' नावाच्या मास्याला ''राज्य मासा'' म्हणून घोषित केले?', '{"A": "आसाम", "B": "सिक्किम", "C": "ओडीशा", "D": "मणपूर"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय B चिन्हांकित केला. Sikkim ने Copper Mahseer (Neolissochilus hexagonolepis) state fish घोषित — Himalayan freshwater biodiversity साठी. Assam, Odisha, Manipur चे स्वतःचे state symbols, हा मासा designation नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21625, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'इंडो-पॅसिफिक क्षेत्रातील सुरक्षा आव्हानांचा मुकाबला करण्यासाठी इंग्लंड, अमेरिका आणि ऑस्ट्रेलिया यांनी नुकत्याच स्थापित केलेल्या त्रिपक्षीय कार्यक्रमाचे शीर्षक काय आहे?', '{"A": "ऑकुस", "B": "इन्डपॅक", "C": "युसा", "D": "यापैकी नाही"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय A येतो. AUKUS — September 2021 मध्ये Australia, UK, US यांचा Indo-Pacific security pact, nuclear-submarine deal सह. INDPAC, UUSA, ''None of above'' फसवणुका.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21626, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, '30 जून 2021 रोजी जागतिक आरोग्य संघटनेने कोणत्या देशाला मलेरियामुक्त म्हणून प्रमाणित केले आहे?', '{"A": "बांगलादेश", "B": "कॅनडा", "C": "भारत", "D": "चीन"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. 30 June 2021 ला WHO ने China ला malaria-free प्रमाणित केले — सत्तर वर्षांच्या उन्मूलन मोहिमेनंतर. Bangladesh, India मध्ये अजून malaria; Canada आधीच free, पण त्या June 2021 तारखेला प्रमाणित देश China.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21627, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, '''माय पॅड माय राईट'' या नावाचा, नाबार्डचा उपक्रम कोणत्या राज्यात सुरू झाला आहे?', '{"A": "गुजरात", "B": "तामिळनाडू", "C": "त्रिपुरा", "D": "उत्तर प्रदेश"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय C. NABARD ची ''My Pad My Right'' menstrual-hygiene योजना Tripura मध्ये सुरू — ग्रामीण महिला/मुलींना sanitary products. Gujarat, Tamil Nadu, Uttar Pradesh मध्ये इतर NABARD योजना, पण 2021 मध्ये ही विशिष्ट pad-rights initiative नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21628, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, '''द बॅटल ऑफ रेझांग ला'' ह्या पुस्तकाचे लेखक कोण आहे?', '{"A": "संतोष यादव", "B": "कुलप्रित यादव", "C": "नेहा सिंग", "D": "विजय दहीया"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय B. Kulpreet Yadav यांनी ''The Battle of Rezang La'' लिहिले — 1962 मध्ये Rezang La वर 13 Kumaon चा last stand. Santosh Yadav mountaineer; Neha Singh, Vijay Dahiya लेखक, पण या 1962 लढाईवरील या शीर्षकाखाली नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21629, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'भारतीय वंशाच्या अनिता आनंद यांची खालीलपैकी कोणत्या देशाच्या संरक्षणमंत्री म्हणून नियुक्ती करण्यात आली आहे?', '{"A": "इंग्लंड", "B": "कॅनडा", "C": "अमेरिका", "D": "फ्रान्स"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय B. Indian origin Anita Anand October 2021 मध्ये Canada च्या Defence Minister झाल्या. England, America, France मध्ये विविध cabinets, पण त्या वेळी Indian-origin defence minister ही नियुक्ती Canada मध्ये.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21630, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'ऑटोमोबाईल्ससाठी आशियातील सर्वात लांब हाय-स्पीड ट्रॅक ________ येथे आहे.', '{"A": "पुणे", "B": "इंदूर", "C": "मुंबई", "D": "चेन्नई"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय B. Indore जवळ Pithampur मधील NATRAX — Asia चा सर्वात लांब high-speed automobile testing track, सुमारे 11.3 km. Pune, Mumbai, Chennai automotive hubs, पण हा record track facility नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21631, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'कोणत्या राज्याने आय.एल.जी.एम.एस. (ILGMS) नावाचे पोर्टल सुरू केले आहे?', '{"A": "आसाम", "B": "ओडीशा", "C": "केरळ", "D": "नागालँड"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय C. Kerala चा ILGMS — Integrated Local Governance Management System — panchayat-level governance व citizen services साठी portal. Assam, Odisha, Nagaland e-governance portals चालवतात, पण ILGMS Kerala चे branded platform.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21632, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, '"भारताची संप्रभुता, एकता आणि अखंडतेचे रक्षण करणे आणि ती कायम राखणे" हा उल्लेख खालीलपैकी कोठे आलेला आहे?', '{"A": "संविधानाच्या उद्देशपत्रिकेत", "B": "राज्यधोरणविषयक मार्गदर्शक तत्वांमध्ये", "C": "मूलभूत अधिकारांच्या वर्णनात", "D": "मूलभूत कर्तव्यांच्या वर्णनात"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय D चिन्हांकित केला. मूलभूत कर्तव्ये Article 51-A(c): ''भारताचे sovereignty, unity and integrity राखणे व संरक्षण.'' Preamble मध्ये unity/integrity broad; Directive Principles, Fundamental Rights मध्ये हे exact duty wording नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21633, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'इमा मॅकीअन ही एकाच ऑलिम्पिकमध्ये सात पदके जिंकणारी प्रथम महिला जलतरणपटू कोणत्या देशाची आहे?', '{"A": "अमेरिका", "B": "ऑस्ट्रेलिया", "C": "जर्मनी", "D": "इंग्लंड"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. Australia ची Emma McKeon Tokyo 2020 Olympics मध्ये सात swimming पदके जिंकली — एका Olympics मध्ये सात पदके जिंकणारी पहिली महिला swimmer. USA, Germany, England strong swimmers, पण Tokyo मध्ये हा seven-medal record नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21634, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'भारतीय प्राणी सर्वेक्षण या संस्थेच्या संचालकपदी कोणाची नियुक्ती करण्यात आली आहे?', '{"A": "अशोक सिंग", "B": "धृती बॅनर्जी", "C": "स्नेहा अगरवाल", "D": "दृष्टी धमिजा"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. Dhriti Banerjee August 2021 मध्ये Zoological Survey of India च्या पहिल्या महिला Director झाल्या. Ashok Singh, Sneha Aggarwal, Drishti Dhamija त्या landmark नियुक्तीतील ZSI director नाहीत.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21635, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'खालीलपैकी कोणत्या समितीने महाराष्ट्रात ग्रामपंचायतीच्या सरपंचाची निवड थेट जनतेतून प्रत्यक्ष पद्धतीने करण्याची शिफारस केली? (a) बाबूराव काळे समिती (b) पी.बी. पाटील समिती (c) बोंगीरवार समिती (d) वसंतराव नाईक समिती', '{"A": "फक्त (a)", "B": "फक्त (b)", "C": "(b) आणि (c)", "D": "(c) आणि (d)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय B. P.B. Patil Committee ने Maharashtra Panchayati Raj मध्ये Sarpanch ची direct election शिफारस केली. Baburao Kale, Bongirwar, Vasantrao Naik committees इतर local-governance reforms — MPSC committee names मिसळतो तेव्हा वेगळे ठेवा.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21636, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'राज्याच्या महाधिवक्ता संबंधी खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या: (a) उच्च न्यायालयाचा न्यायाधीश म्हणून नियुक्त होण्यासाठी जी अर्हता आवश्यक असते ती अर्हता त्याच्या जवळ असणे आवश्यक असते. (b) उच्च न्यायालयाच्या न्यायाधीशास मिळणारे सर्व विशेषाधिकार व फायदे-संरक्षण त्यास मिळतात. (c) उच्च न्यायालयाच्या न्यायाधीशास मिळणारे मानधन त्यास मिळते. (d) त्याचा कार्यकाळ पाच वर्षे किंवा वयाची 62 वर्षे पूर्ण होईपर्यंत असतो. वरीलपैकी कोणते विधान/ने बरोबर आहे/त?', '{"A": "फक्त (a)", "B": "फक्त (b)", "C": "(a), (b) आणि (c)", "D": "(b), (c) आणि (d)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय A येतो. फक्त (a) बरोबर — Advocate General High Court judge होण्यास पात्र असावा. सर्व judicial privileges नाहीत, judge चे वेतन नाही, पाच वर्ष/62 वर्ष नियत कालावधी नाही — Governor च्या pleasure वर.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21637, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'उच्च न्यायालये कोणत्या कलमांतर्गत विशेष आदेश जारी करतात?', '{"A": "कलम - 220", "B": "कलम - 221", "C": "कलम - 213", "D": "कलम - 226"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय D. Article 226 High Court ला writs जारी करण्याचा अधिकार — Fundamental Rights व इतर हेतूंसाठी. Article 220–221 judges च्या service; Article 213 Governor चा ordinance power.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21638, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'खालीलपैकी कोणते कलम केंद्रसरकारकडून राज्यांना देण्यात येणाऱ्या मदत अनुदानांशी संबंधित आहे?', '{"A": "कलम 270", "B": "कलम 280", "C": "कलम 275", "D": "कलम 265"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. Article 275 Union तर्फे states ला grants-in-aid — Finance Commission शिफारशीवर व special grants. Article 270 tax distribution; 280 Finance Commission; 265 unauthorised taxation.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21639, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'पुढीलपैकी कोणत्या व्यक्ती राष्ट्रीय महासभेत सामील झाल्या नाहीत परंतु त्यांनी स्वातंत्र्य चळवळीला आर्थिक व इतर मदत केली होती? (a) जमनालाल बजाज (b) वाडीलाल लल्लुभाई मेहता (c) घ.दा. बिर्ला (d) लाला शंकरलाल (e) वालचंद हिराचंद', '{"A": "(a), (b), (c) फक्त", "B": "(b), (c), (d) फक्त", "C": "(c) आणि (e) फक्त", "D": "(b) आणि (d) फक्त"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. G.D. Birla आणि Walchand Hirachand Congress join न करता स्वातंत्र्य चळवळीला आर्थिक मदत दिली — पक्षाच्या बाहेर राहून राष्ट्रवादाला पाठिंबा देणारे उद्योगपती. Jamnalal Bajaj आणि Lala Shankarlal सक्रिय Congressmen होते, Vadilal Lallubhai Mehta देखील पक्षाशी जोडले जातात — म्हणून ''non-member donor'' जोडीमध्ये ते येत नाहीत.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21640, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या: (a) मुख्यमंत्र्या व्यतिरिक्त राज्याच्या मंत्रिमंडळातील एकूण सदस्यांची संख्या त्या राज्याच्या विधान सभेच्या एकूण सदस्य संख्येच्या 15 टक्क्यांपेक्षा जास्त असता कामा नये. (b) मुख्यमंत्र्या व्यतिरिक्त राज्याच्या मंत्रिमंडळातील एकूण सदस्यांची संख्या 12 पेक्षा कमी असता कामा नये.', '{"A": "विधान (a) बरोबर", "B": "विधान (b) बरोबर", "C": "दोन्हीही विधाने बरोबर", "D": "दोन्हीही विधाने चुकीची"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. दोन्ही विधाने चुकीची. 91 वी घटनादुरुस्ती ministers 15% — Chief Minister सह; CM वगळून नाही. किमान 12 ministers असा constitutional नियम नाही — चर्चा झाली, enact झाला नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21641, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'खालीलपैकी कोणते विधान सत्य नाही? (1) भारतीय राज्यघटनेच्या अंमलबजावणीची तारीख 26 नोव्हेंबर 1949 आहे. (2) 42 व्या घटनादुरुस्तीन्वये ''धर्मनिरपेक्ष'' हा शब्द जोडण्यात आला. (3) 42 वी घटनादुरुस्ती 1976 मध्ये करण्यात आली. (4) भारतीय राज्यघटनेतील सामाजिक, आर्थिक आणि राजकीय न्याय हे तत्त्व रशियन (सोव्हिएट) राज्यघटनेतून घेतले आहेत.', '{"A": "(1)", "B": "(2)", "C": "(3)", "D": "(4)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय A. (1) चुकीचे आहे — 26 November 1949 ही अंगीकरणाची तारीख, अमलबजावणी 26 January 1950. (2), (3), (4) 42nd Amendment व Russian Constitution च्या justice ideals वर standard पाठ्यपुस्तक.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21642, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'खालील विधाने लक्षात घ्या: (a) कलम 3 नुसार, संसद राज्यामधून भूप्रदेश अलग करून नवीन राज्य निर्माण करू शकते. (b) संसद राज्याच्या सीमा व नाव बदलू शकते. (c) नवीन राज्य निर्मिती संदर्भातील विधेयक मांडतांना राष्ट्रपतींची पूर्व शिफारस आवश्यक असते. (d) असे विधेयक सादर करत असतांना, संबंधित राज्याच्या विधीमंडळाने दिलेला सल्ला किंवा मत स्वीकारणे बंधनकारक असते. वरीलपैकी कोणते विधान/विधाने बिनचूक आहे/आहेत?', '{"A": "(a) आणि (d)", "B": "(a), (b) आणि (d)", "C": "(a), (b) आणि (c)", "D": "सर्व"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय A. (1) चुकीचे आहे — 26 November 1949 ही अंगीकरणाची तारीख, अमलबजावणी 26 January 1950. (2), (3), (4) 42nd Amendment व Russian Constitution च्या justice ideals वर पाठ्यपुस्तकातील मानक.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21643, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, '________ चे राजे भगवंतराव यांना 20 मे 1857 रोजी ब्रिटीशांनी त्याने बंडखोरांना मदत केली असा आरोप ठेवून फाशी दिले.', '{"A": "नांदूर - शिंगोटे", "B": "पेठ", "C": "हरसूल", "D": "दिंडोरी"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय B. Nashik belt मधील Peth चे Raja Bhagwantrao यांना British ने 20 May 1857 रोजी mutineers ला मदत केली अशा संशयावरून फाशी दिली. Nandur-Shingote, Harsul, Dindori ही 1857 ची इतर राज्ये होती — पण हे विशिष्ट नाव-दिनांक जोडी नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21644, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, '16 ऑक्टोबर 1905 हा दिवस काय म्हणून पाळला जातो?', '{"A": "स्वातंत्र्य दिवस", "B": "प्रजासत्ताक दिवस", "C": "शोक दिवस", "D": "कामगार दिवस"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय C. 16 October 1905 — Curzon च्या Bengal Partition चा अंमलबजावणी दिवस; राष्ट्रवाद्यांनी Day of Mourning म्हणून साजरा केला. Independence, Republic, Workers'' Day नाही — Bengal divide calendar शी जोडलेला दिनांक.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21645, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'इ.स. 1911 मध्ये भारतात हवाई परिवहनाची सुरुवात कोणी केली?', '{"A": "जॉर्ज लाईट", "B": "एच. जोन्स", "C": "लॉर्ड स्ट्युअर्ट", "D": "लॉर्ड डर्बी"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय A. French pilot George Light यांनी 1911 मध्ये Allahabad–Naini first commercial airmail leg उडवली — India मध्ये civil aviation ची सुरुवात. Jones, Stuart, Derby फसवणूक पर्याय मधील जवळचे colonial aviator names.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21646, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'खालीलपैकी प्रार्थना सभेचे उद्दिष्टे कोणते होते?', '{"A": "समाजाची नैतिक प्रगती घडवून आणणे", "B": "जातीयव्यवस्थेवर प्रहार", "C": "राष्ट्रीय जागृतीस प्रेरणा", "D": "शुद्धिकरण चळवळ"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A चिन्हांकित केला. Atmaram Pandurang यांच्या Prarthana Samaj चे मुख्य उद्दिष्ट society चे moral व religious reform — prayer-house reformism. Caste opposition व national awareness allied goals; ''purification movement'' Arya Samaj ला अधिक जुळते Prarthana Sabha पेक्षा.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21647, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'भूमिगत चळवळ महाराष्ट्रात कोणत्या जिल्ह्यात प्रथमतः सुरु केली?', '{"A": "सातारा", "B": "चंद्रपूर", "C": "जळगाव", "D": "ठाणे"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय A. Maharashtra मधील underground Quit India resistance सर्वप्रथम Satara district मध्ये — Patri Sarkar, parallel-government folklore या दाव्याला आधार. Chandrapur, Jalgaon, Thane comparative narratives मध्ये नंतरच्या किंवा कमकुवत underground phase.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21648, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'प्राथमिक शिक्षण सक्तीचे करणारे भारतातील पहिले राज्य हा मान कोणत्या संस्थानाने मिळविला?', '{"A": "बडोदा", "B": "औंध व सातारा", "C": "कोल्हापूर व बडोदा", "D": "जुनागड व हैद्राबाद"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. Sayajirao Gaekwad यांच्या Baroda ने princely states मध्ये compulsory primary education सुरू केले — 1890s decree wider British-India moves पूर्वी. Aund-Satara, Kolhapur-Baroda combos, Junagad-Hyderabad Baroda च्या first-mover tag मागे.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21649, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, '''भारतीय असंतोषाचे जनक'' असा लोकमान्य टिळकांचा उल्लेख खालीलपैकी कोणी केला आहे?', '{"A": "ॲलन ॲक्टोव्हीयन ह्यूम", "B": "सर व्हॅलेंटाइन चिरोल", "C": "अरविंद घोष", "D": "गोपाळ गणेश आगरकर"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. The Times चे imperial journalist Sir Valentine Chirol यांनी 1908 trials नंतर Lokmanya Tilak ला ''Father of Indian Unrest'' म्हटले. Allan Octavian Hume Congress founder; Aurobindo Ghosh, Agarkar reformers — पण त्या label चे स्रोत नाहीत.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (21650, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2021, 'कोणत्या कायद्याने ''गव्हर्नर जनरल'' आता ''व्हाइसराय'' म्हणून ओळखला जाऊ लागला?', '{"A": "1858", "B": "1957", "C": "1861", "D": "1919"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. Government of India Act 1858 Company ते Crown power transfer, Governor General ला Viceroy नाव — post-1857 reorganisation. 1861, 1919 Acts नंतर; 1957 टायपो फसवणूक.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2021","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
