  (25350, 'GK 2025-26 Marathon', 'Current Affairs', 'MPSC Practice Subject Test', 2025, 'Who has been appointed as the new Chairman of IRDAI (Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India)?', '{"A": "A R. Doraiswamy", "B": "TV Somnathan", "C": "Ajay Seth", "D": "Siddhartha Mohanty"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Ajay Seth matches the question. The Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority (IRDAI) was set up in 1999 to regulate and license the insurance sector in India. The examiner rewards precision on this item — every option is engineered to feel plausible, but only the marked one matches the exact wording of the source document.', '{"Current Affairs","MPSC Practice Subject Test","2025","GK 2025-26 Marathon"}'::text[], 'Medium')
