  (25438, 'GK 2025-26 Marathon', 'Current Affairs', 'MPSC Practice Subject Test', 2025, 'In which country has Google opened its largest AI infrastructure hardware engineering centre outside the United States?', '{"A": "India", "B": "Taiwan", "C": "Spain", "D": "Japan"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'This resolves to Taiwan. Note that the wrong options carry closely related terminology; a five-second sanity check against the stem is enough to eliminate them.', '{"Current Affairs","MPSC Practice Subject Test","2025","GK 2025-26 Marathon"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
