  (25566, 'GK 2025-26 Marathon', 'Current Affairs', 'MPSC Practice Subject Test', 2025, 'Who became the first woman President of The Indian Cricketers Association in October 2025?', '{"A": "Smriti Mandhana", "B": "Jhulan Goswami", "C": "Mitali Raj", "D": "Shantha Rangaswamy"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option D: Shantha Rangaswamy. The year 2025 anchors this question — the correct option is the fact that dates to that year. This exact fact has appeared in earlier MPSC prelims — practising the wording of the correct option is worth two to three easy marks per paper.', '{"Current Affairs","MPSC Practice Subject Test","2025","GK 2025-26 Marathon"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (25567, 'GK 2025-26 Marathon', 'Current Affairs', 'MPSC Practice Subject Test', 2025, 'What is India''s rank in the ''World Happiness Report 2026''?', '{"A": "105th", "B": "113th", "C": "116th", "D": "118th"}'::jsonb, 'C', '"116th" is the option marked correct in the official key. The year 2026 anchors this question — the correct option is the fact that dates to that year. The three wrong options are the standard distractor set MPSC uses for this topic — one is a chronological neighbour, one is a thematic near-miss and one is a plausible-sounding invention.', '{"Current Affairs","MPSC Practice Subject Test","2025","GK 2025-26 Marathon"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (25568, 'GK 2025-26 Marathon', 'Current Affairs', 'MPSC Practice Subject Test', 2025, 'Who has become the Chairman of 23rd Law Commission?', '{"A": "Gyanesh Kumar", "B": "Anju Rathi Rana", "C": "Vinod Rawat", "D": "Dinesh Maheshwari"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The paper''s official answer is Dinesh Maheshwari. For MPSC prelims, one line of revision is enough to lock this fact into memory — add it to your one-page factual notebook.', '{"Current Affairs","MPSC Practice Subject Test","2025","GK 2025-26 Marathon"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (25569, 'India Defence Exercises', 'Current Affairs', 'MPSC Practice Subject Test', 2024, 'Exercise ''Garuda Shakti'' is a joint military exercise conducted between India and which country?', '{"A": "Indonesia", "B": "Thailand", "C": "Kazakhstan", "D": "South Africa"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'This one comes to Indonesia. The examiner rewards precision on this item — every option is engineered to feel plausible, but only the marked one matches the exact wording of the source document.', '{"Current Affairs","MPSC Practice Subject Test","2024","India Defence Exercises"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
