  (27951, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'योग्य जोड्या जुळवा : अ. प्रमुख बँकांचे राष्ट्रीयकरण - I. 1976 चा कायदा ब. प्रादेशिक ग्रामीण बँकेची (RRBs) स्थापना - II. 1998 क. इम्पेरियल बँक ऑफ इंडियाचे स्टेट बँकेत रूपांतर - III. जुलै, 1969 ड. नरसिंहम समितीचा दुसरा अहवाल - IV. जुलै, 1955', '{"A": "अ-I, ब-III, क-II, ड-IV", "B": "अ-III, ब-I, क-IV, ड-II", "C": "अ-II, ब-IV, क-I, ड-III", "D": "अ-IV, ब-II, क-III, ड-I"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय B. Major banks July 1969 nationalisation, RRBs 1976 Act, Imperial Bank July 1955 SBI, Narasimham Committee Report II 1998 — a–III, b–I, c–IV, d–II.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27952, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या : अ. मौद्रिक धोरणाच्या अंमलबजावणी साठी रिझर्व्ह बँक ऑफ इंडीया ही मुख्य संस्था आहे. ब. आर्थिक विकासाला गती देणे हे मौद्रिक धोरण उद्दिष्ट आहे. क. बँक दर हे मौद्रिक धोरणाचे साधन आहे. वरीलपैकी कोणती विधाने बरोबर आहेत ?', '{"A": "अ आणि ब", "B": "ब आणि क", "C": "अ आणि क", "D": "वरील सर्व"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय D येतो. RBI monetary policy implement, broad aim development + price stability, bank rate classic policy lever — तीनही statements बरोबर.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27953, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या : अ. शिल्लकीचे अंदाजपत्रक महागाईच्या काळात उपयुक्त ठरू शकते. ब. तुटीचे अंदाजपत्रक बेरोजगारी दूर करण्यासाठी उपयुक्त आहे. क. भारतामध्ये शेती मंत्रालयाकडे केंद्र सरकारच्या अंदाजपत्रकाची चौकट तयार करण्याची जबाबदारी आहे. वरीलपैकी कोणते/ती विधान/ने असत्य आहे/आहेत ?', '{"A": "अ आणि ब", "B": "ब आणि क", "C": "फक्त ब", "D": "फक्त क"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय D. Surplus budget inflation cool, deficit demand/jobs — (a), (b) बरोबर. (c) चुकीचे: Union budget Ministry of Finance frame करते, Agriculture Ministry नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27954, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या : अ. ग्रामीण रोजगार निर्मिती कार्यक्रमाचा उद्देश ग्रामीण भागामध्ये स्वयम् रोजगाराच्या संधी निर्माण करणे आहे. ब. स्वर्ण जयंती शहरी रोजगार योजनेचे उद्दिष्टे शहरी भागामध्ये स्वयम् रोजगार आणि वेतन रोजगार या दोन्ही मध्ये रोजगार संधी निर्माण करणे आहे. क. ऑगस्ट 2011 मध्ये संसदेत पास केलेला नवीन कायदा महात्मा गांधी राष्ट्रीय शहरी रोजगार हमी कायदा म्हणून ओळखला जातो. वरीलपैकी कोणती विधाने बरोबर आहेत ?', '{"A": "अ आणि क", "B": "ब आणि क", "C": "अ आणि ब", "D": "वरील सर्व"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'पर्याय C निवडा. REGP rural self-employment, SJSRY urban self/wage employment — पाठ्यपुस्तकातील जोड्या. (c) urban MGNUEGA शोधले; India चा guarantee act rural MGNREGA — urban clone नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27955, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'खालीलपैकी कोणते राजकोषीय धोरणाचे साधन/साधने आहे/आहेत ? अ. विदेशी गुंतवणूक ब. कर क. सार्वजनिक खर्च ड. बँक दर धोरण (BRP)', '{"A": "फक्त अ", "B": "ब आणि क", "C": "अ आणि ड", "D": "फक्त ड"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय B. Fiscal policy taxes, public spending; bank rate monetary policy; foreign investment open-economy flow — core fiscal instrument नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27956, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या : अ. विशेष आर्थिक क्षेत्राची निर्यात वृद्धीसाठी स्थापना केली. ब. वित्त मंत्री श्री नरसिंहराव यांनी 1991 मध्ये नवीन आर्थिक धोरण जाहीर केले. क. सरकारने शेतमाल निर्यातीला प्रोत्साहन देण्यासाठी शेती निर्यात क्षेत्राची संकल्पना जाहीर केली. वरीलपैकी कोणती विधाने बरोबर आहेत ?', '{"A": "अ आणि ब", "B": "ब आणि क", "C": "अ आणि क", "D": "वरील सर्व"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय C. SEZs exports, agri export zones farm exports — (a), (c) बरोबर. (b) Narasimha Rao Finance Minister म्हणते — 1991 reforms Dr. Manmohan Singh FM होते.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27957, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'खालीलपैकी कोणते वाक्य/वाक्ये योग्य आहे/आहेत ? अ. लेखापरीक्षक एखाद्या संस्थेचा प्रत्येक व्यवहार (Transaction) तपासू शकत नाही. ब. लेखापरीक्षण पुरावा हा अंतिम/निर्णायक स्वरूपाचा नसतो. क. लेखापरीक्षक तज्ञावर विश्वास ठेवून असतो.', '{"A": "फक्त अ", "B": "ब आणि क", "C": "फक्त क", "D": "अ, ब आणि क"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय D येतो. Auditor प्रत्येक voucher नाही, sample; audit evidence absolute proof नाही; technical knowledge specialists — तीनही basic audit premises.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27958, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'लोकसंख्या संक्रमण सिद्धांता अनुसार खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या : अ. पहिल्या अवस्थेत अर्थव्यवस्था प्राचीन आणि मागासलेली असते. ब. दुसऱ्या अवस्थेत लोकसंख्येची वृद्धी जलद होते. क. तिसऱ्या अवस्थेत शहरीकरण आणि औद्योगिकीकरण जलद होते. ड. 1921 नंतर भारताने दुसऱ्या अवस्थेत प्रवेश केला. वरीलपैकी कोणती विधाने बरोबर आहेत ?', '{"A": "अ आणि ब", "B": "ब आणि क", "C": "क आणि ड", "D": "वरील सर्व"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. Stage I high birth/death backward economy; Stage II death rate fall, population surge; Stage III industrialisation, urbanisation; India transition 1921 census — चारही बसतात.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27959, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'जर दोन रोध एकसर जोडणीने जोडले, तर त्यांच्या परिणामी रोध 45 Ω होतो आणि जर तेच रोध समांतर जोडणीने जोडले तर त्यांच्या परिणामी रोध 10 Ω होतो, तर त्या रोधाच्या किंमती किती ?', '{"A": "10 Ω, 45 Ω", "B": "10 Ω, 30 Ω", "C": "15 Ω, 30 Ω", "D": "10 Ω, 45 Ω"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. r₁ + r₂ = 45, parallel formula ने r₁r₂ = 450, roots 15 Ω व 30 Ω — series, parallel दोन्ही readings पूर्ण करतात.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27960, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या : अ. रिझर्व्ह बँक ऑफ इंडियाची स्थापना 1 एप्रिल, 1935 रोजी झाली. ब. रिझर्व्ह बँक ऑफ इंडियाचे राष्ट्रीयीकरण 1950 मध्ये झाले. क. भारत सरकारच्या वित्त मंत्रालयाकडून एक रुपयेची नोट आणि सर्व परिमाण नाणी जारी केली जातात. वरीलपैकी कोणते/ती विधान/ने असत्य आहे/आहेत ?', '{"A": "अ आणि ब", "B": "ब आणि क", "C": "फक्त क", "D": "फक्त ब"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय D. RBI 1 April 1935, one-rupee notes Finance Ministry — बरोबर. (b) चुकीचे: nationalisation January 1949, 1950 नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27961, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'पांढऱ्या रंगाचे प्रकाश किरण ''प्रिझम'' मधून गेले असता, त्याच्यात समाविष्ट असणाऱ्या रंगाच्या किरणांमध्ये किंवा तरंगलांबी मध्ये वेग-वेगळे (separated) होतात. या दृष्ट चमत्काराला ________ म्हणतात.', '{"A": "प्रकाशाचे परावर्तन", "B": "प्रकाशाचे अपवर्तन", "C": "प्रकाशाचे अपस्करण", "D": "प्रकाशाचे विवर्तन"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय C चिन्हांकित केला. Prism white light colour spectrum मध्ये split — प्रत्येक wavelength वेगळ्या प्रमाणात bend; separation dispersion, फक्त reflection/refraction/diffraction नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27962, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'जर 0.2 A इतकी विद्युतधारा 100 Ω रोध असलेल्या तारेच्या विद्युतइस्त्री मधून एका मिनीटासाठी प्रवाहित केली, तर किती ज्यूल उष्मा निर्माण होईल ?', '{"A": "24 Joules", "B": "240 Joules", "C": "2400 Joules", "D": "24000 Joules"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय B. Heat H = I²Rt = (0.2)² × 100 × 60 = 240 joules — current squared, resistance, एक minute (60 s).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27963, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'प्रदीर्घ आवर्त सारणीत ______ ह्या दोन मुलद्रव्यांमध्ये विकर्ण संबंध आढळतो.', '{"A": "B आणि Si", "B": "Li आणि Mg", "C": "Be आणि Al", "D": "वरीलपैकी सर्व"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. Periodic table diagonal neighbours — Li–Mg, Be–Al, B–Si — वेगळ्या groups असून similar properties; प्रश्नातील तीनही pairs योग्य.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27964, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'एका 257 g वजनाच्या चेंडूचा वेग 257 m/s असेल तर त्याची तरंगलांबी ______ m इतकी असते. दिले गेले आहे : h = 6.626 × 10⁻³⁴ J/s', '{"A": "10⁻³⁵", "B": "10⁻³²", "C": "10⁻³⁸", "D": "वरीलपैकी कोणतेही नाही"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. de Broglie λ = h/(mv) = 6.626×10⁻³⁴ ÷ (0.257 × 257) ≈ 10⁻³⁵ m — macroscopic mass मुळे wave nature अत्यंत लहान.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27965, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'खालीलपैकी कोणत्या संघात इंद्रिय पातळीचे संघटन आढळते ?', '{"A": "पॉरिफेरा", "B": "आदिजीव (प्रोटोझोआ)", "C": "चपटेकृमी (प्लॅटीहेल्मिंथिस)", "D": "सिलेंटराटा"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय C. Platyhelminthes (flatworms) organ-level organisation — tissues पासून organs. Porifera, Protozoa cellular; Coelenterata tissue level पर्यंत.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27966, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'केंद्रशासनाचे अंदाजपत्रक महसूली खाते आणि भांडवली खाते याप्रमाणे दोन भागात विभागले जाते. केंद्रशासनाच्या महसूली प्राप्तीचे खालीलपैकी कोणते दोन स्रोत/मार्ग आहेत? अ. बाह्य कर्ज ब. कर महसूल क. अल्प बचती ड. करेत्तर महसूल', '{"A": "अ आणि ब", "B": "ब आणि ड", "C": "क आणि ड", "D": "अ आणि क"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. Revenue receipts — Centre ची उत्पन्न, repayment liability नाही: tax revenue, non-tax revenue. External loans, small savings financing items — revenue receipts नाहीत.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27967, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'इथिलिनच्या रेणू मध्ये एकूण किती सिग्मा बंध असतात ?', '{"A": "3", "B": "5", "C": "2", "D": "1"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय B येतो. Ethylene (C₂H₄) मध्ये C=C मधील एक sigma व चार C–H sigma — एकूण पाच sigma bonds; double bond चा दुसरा बंध pi आहे, sigma नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27968, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'झुरळांच्या उदरामध्ये टर्गा (T) आणि स्टर्ना (S) यांचा खरा क्रम हा आहे', '{"A": "T - 10, S - 10", "B": "T - 9, S - 9", "C": "T - 9, S - 10", "D": "T - 10, S - 9"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय D. Cockroach abdomen मध्ये दहा tergites (T) पण फक्त नऊ visible sternites (S) — पहिले sternum absent/fused — म्हणून T-10, S-9.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27969, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'मॅलियस, इंकस् आणि स्टेप्स यांना असे सुद्धा म्हणतात', '{"A": "इयर ऑस्सिकल", "B": "ऑडिटरी वेसिकल", "C": "बोनी इयर", "D": "ऑडिटरी बोन्स्"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय A. Malleus, incus, stapes हे middle-ear चे तीन ossicles — sound vibrations inner ear पर्यंत पोहोचवतात.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27970, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'म्यूकोरेल्स या कवकवर्गीय वनस्पतींना ________ असे म्हणून ओळखतात.', '{"A": "ब्लॅक मोल्डस", "B": "ब्लू मोल्डस", "C": "ग्रीन मोल्डस", "D": "यलो मोल्डस"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय A. Mucorales (Mucor, Rhizopus) black molds म्हणून ओळखले जातात — dark sporangia bread व इतर substrates वर.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27971, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'पिवळ्या-हिरव्या रंगाच्या शेवाळ वनस्पतींना ________ असे संबोधतात.', '{"A": "क्लोरोफायसी", "B": "सायनोफायसी", "C": "फिओफायसी", "D": "झॅन्थोफायसी"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय D चिन्हांकित केला. Yellow-green algae Xanthophyceae वर्गात; Chlorophyceae green, Cyanophyceae blue-green, Phaeophyceae brown.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27972, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'यु.आय.पी. भारतामध्ये 1985 सालापासून आरोग्य व कुटुंब कल्याण मंत्रालयाने राबविण्यास सुरूवात केली आहे. यु.आय.पी. खालीलपैकी कोणत्या पर्यायाचे संक्षिप्त रूप आहे ?', '{"A": "युनीव्हर्सल इम्युनायझेशन प्रोग्राम", "B": "युनिक आयडेंटिफिकेशन प्रोग्राम", "C": "युनायटेड इंडियन पॉलिसी", "D": "वरीलपैकी कोणताही पर्याय नाही"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. UIP म्हणजे Universal Immunization Programme — 1985 Health Ministry अंतर्गत; six vaccine-preventable diseases विरुद्ध लस.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27973, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, '12 ड ही प्रक्रिया अन्नावर केल्यास ______', '{"A": "उष्णतेची प्रक्रिया जी 12 जिवाणू मारते.", "B": "प्रक्रिया करून अन्न साठविण्याच्या 12 (बारा) विविध पद्धती.", "C": "क्लॉस्ट्रिडियम बॉट्यूलिनम (Clostridium botulinum) चा अंतर्गोलाच्या संख्येत 10¹² पटीने कपात होते.", "D": "कोणतीही प्रक्रिया जी अधिक तापमानाला जिवंत राहणाऱ्या जंतूंचा नाश करते."}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. ''12D'' म्हणजे Clostridium botulinum endospores 10¹² पट कमी — low-acid canned foods साठी standard safety target.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27974, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'बंचीटॉप हा रोग विशेषतः कोणत्या पिकांमध्ये आढळतो ?', '{"A": "पपई", "B": "लिंबु", "C": "ऊस", "D": "केळी"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. Banana bunchy top virus banana मध्ये रोग — plant stunted, leaves crown वर bunch; classic banana disease, papaya/citrus नाही.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27975, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'रक्त गोठण्याच्या प्रक्रियेत फायब्रिनोजेनचे फायब्रिनमध्ये रूपांतर होते', '{"A": "हा रक्त गोठण्याच्या प्रक्रियेतील शेवटचा टप्पा आहे व यात अनेक घटकांचा सहभाग आहे", "B": "फायब्रिनोजेन (Fibrinogen) फुटलेल्या रक्तबिंबिकेतून बाहेर टाकले जाते", "C": "ह्याचा संबंध उच्च रक्तदाबाशी असल्याने रोहिणीच्या भिंतींना इजा पोहोचू शकते", "D": "हिमोफिलीया हा आजार असलेल्या व्यक्तींमध्ये हा त्रास होऊ शकतो"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. Thrombin fibrinogen ला fibrin strands मध्ये रूपांतरित करते — clotting factors cascade नंतर clot तयार करणारी final step.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27976, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'पुढील माहितीचा काळजीपूर्वक अभ्यास करून प्रश्नांचे उत्तर द्या. N, U, E, G, I, S आणि X हे सात विद्यार्थी वेगवेगळ्या तीन कॉलेजमध्ये शिकत आहेत. प्रत्येक कॉलेजमध्ये किमान दोघे शिकत आहेत. इंग्रजी, इतिहास, भूगोल, गणित, भौतिकशास्त्र, रसायनशास्त्र आणि जीवशास्त्र या विषयांपैकी प्रत्येकाचा एक विषय आवडता आहे. आवडता विषय याच क्रमाने असण्याची गरज नाही. E याचा आवडता विषय भौतिकशास्त्र आहे आणि तो फक्त N बरोबर नंबर दोन कॉलेज मध्ये शिकतो. I हा नंबर दोन कॉलेजमध्ये शिकत नाही आणि त्याला इंग्रजी आवडतो. G हा नंबर तीन कॉलेजमध्ये शिकतो आणि त्याला गणित आवडत नाही. ज्यांना भूगोल व रसायनशास्त्र आवडतात, ते एकाच कॉलेजमध्ये शिकतात. X ला जीवशास्त्र आवडते आणि तो नंबर एक कॉलेजमध्ये शिकत नाही. S हा I बरोबर शिकत नाही. S ला रसायनशास्त्र आवडत नाही. N ला इतिहास आवडत नाही. S कोणत्या कॉलेजमध्ये शिकतो ?', '{"A": "नंबर एक", "B": "नंबर दोन", "C": "नंबर तीन", "D": "निश्चित सांगता येत नाही"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय C. College 2 मध्ये फक्त E, N; X (Biology) college 3 with G; S देखील college 3 — I college 1 with U, S पासून वेगळा; सर्व clues जुळतात.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27977, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'पुढीलपैकी कोणता पर्याय दिलेल्या संख्या श्रेणीतील प्रश्नार्थक चिन्हाच्या ठिकाणी येईल ? 26, 50, 82, ?', '{"A": "122", "B": "170", "C": "145", "D": "101"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A चिन्हांकित केला. Gap प्रत्येक वेळी 8 ने वाढ — +24, +32, +40 — 82 + 40 = 122.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27978, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'एक व्यक्ती रेल्वेपुलावर उभी असून त्या पूलाची लांबी 180 मी. आहे. एक आगगाडी त्या व्यक्तीस 8 सेंकदात व पूलास 20 सेंकदात ओलांडते, तर त्या आगगाडीची लांबी व वेग शोधा.', '{"A": "115 मी. आणि 15 मी./से.", "B": "120 मी. आणि 10 मी./से.", "C": "110 मी. आणि 15 मी./से.", "D": "120 मी. आणि 15 मी./से."}'::jsonb, 'D', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय D येतो. L/8 = (L+180)/20 → L = 120 m; speed = 120÷8 = 15 m/s — person किंवा bridge, rate समान.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27979, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'एका सांकेतिक भाषेत LANGUAGE हा शब्द NDPJWDIH असा लिहितात. तर OFFICIAL हा शब्द याच सांकेतिक भाषेत कसा लिहाल ?', '{"A": "QIILELCM", "B": "QIHLELCO", "C": "QIILEJCM", "D": "QIHLEKCO"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय B. प्रत्येक अक्षर +2, +3 alternating shift (L→N, A→D …); OFFICIAL वर QIHLELCO.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27980, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'जर PEN = 70, BOOK = 86 असेल तर DUSTER = किती ?', '{"A": "174", "B": "184", "C": "186", "D": "188"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. प्रत्येक शब्द = अक्षर मूल्य बेरीज × 2: PEN → 70, BOOK → 86, DUSTER → 87×2 = 174.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27981, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'दिलेल्या संख्या मालिकेत प्रश्नचिन्हाच्या जागी कोणती संख्या येईल ? 11, 5, 20, 12, 38, ?, 74, 54', '{"A": "42", "B": "32", "C": "26", "D": "22"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय C. दोन interleaved series: odd 11, 20, 38, 74 — gaps 9, 18, 36; even 5, 12, 26, 54 — +7, +14, +28; blank = 26.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27982, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'A, B, C, D आणि E हे उत्तरेकडे तोंड करून मैदानात उभे आहेत. त्यांची स्थिती पुढील प्रमाणे आहे : अ. D च्या उजव्या बाजूस 40 मी. वर B आहे. ब. B च्या दक्षिणेस 60 मी. वर A आहे. क. D च्या पश्चिमेस 25 मी. वर C आहे. ड. A च्या उत्तरेस 90 मी. वर E आहे. तर B च्या डाव्या बाजूस जो आहे, त्याच्या ईशान्य दिशेला कोण आहे', '{"A": "A", "B": "C", "C": "D", "D": "E"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. Positions: D, C — B च्या west; B च्या left = D; E, D च्या north-east (40, 30); B, A, C इतर directions.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27983, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, '1600 चे 60 टक्के हे x च्या 80 टक्क्यांइतके आहेत, तर x ची किंमत किती ?', '{"A": "1000", "B": "1200", "C": "1400", "D": "1600"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय B. 60% of 1600 = 960; 960 = 80% of x → x = 960÷0.8 = 1200.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27984, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'खालील चौकानाकृती ठोकळ्याच्या अवस्थांचे निरीक्षण करा आणि 1 विरुद्ध बाजूचा अंक शोधा. [Diagram: चार ठोकळ्याच्या अवस्था — (1) वर 4, समोर डावी 5, समोर उजवी 3; (2) वर 1, समोर डावी 6, समोर उजवी 2; (3) वर 4, समोर डावी 3, समोर उजवी 6; (4) वर 5, समोर डावी 2, समोर उजवी 3]', '{"A": "2", "B": "4", "C": "5", "D": "3"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय D. चार cube views: 1 चे edges 2, 6 शी; 3 opposite 1 — adjacent faces trace केल्यास 1 च्या समोर 3.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27985, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'दोन जहाजे A व B हे एकमेकांपासून 155 सागरी मैल अंतर असलेल्या दोन बेटांवरून प्रवास सुरू करतात. जहाज A हे B च्या पश्चिमेला असून ते पूर्वेकडे प्रति तास 25 सागरी मैल या वेगाने प्रवास सुरू करते. त्याचवेळेस जहाज B हे दक्षिणेकडे प्रति तास 20 सागरी मैल या वेगाने प्रवास सुरू करते. 3 तासांच्या प्रवासानंतर त्या जहाजांमधील अंतर किती ?', '{"A": "120 सागरी मैल", "B": "100 सागरी मैल", "C": "90 सागरी मैल", "D": "80 सागरी मैल"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय B चिन्हांकित केला. 3 hours: A ने 75 miles closed — 80 east-west; B 60 south — √(80²+60²) = 100 nautical miles.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27986, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'एक पाण्याची टाकी भरायला एका नळाला 4 तास लागतात. टाकीच्या तळाच्या गळतीमुळे टाकी भरायला 6 तास लागतात. जर टाकी पूर्ण भरलेली असेल, तर तिला गळतीमुळे रिकामी होण्यास किती वेळ लागेल ?', '{"A": "24 तास", "B": "16 तास", "C": "12 तास", "D": "10 तास"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. Net 1/6 = 1/4 − 1/L → leakage full tank 1÷(1/4−1/6) = 12 hours.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27987, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'x आणि y व्यस्त चलनात आहेत. जेव्हा x = 3 तेव्हा y = 4 असतात. जर x = 9 असेल तर y ची किंमत किती ?', '{"A": "3/4", "B": "3/7", "C": "5/3", "D": "4/3"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. x, y inversely proportional — xy = 12; x = 9 → y = 12÷9 = 4/3.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27988, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'नुकतीच भारतीय नौदलात समाविष्ट पानबुडी आय.एन.एस. कलवरी कोणत्या देशाच्या सहकार्याने निर्माण केली गेली ?', '{"A": "अमेरिकेची संयुक्त संस्थाने", "B": "जपान", "C": "फ्रान्स", "D": "इस्रायल"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय C. INS Kalvari — Scorpène-class पहिली पाणबुडी Mazagon Dock वर French design आणि Naval Group (DCNS) तंत्रज्ञान transfer सह बांधली — US, Japan किंवा Israel नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27989, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, '20 मजूर रोज 6 तास काम करून एक काम 15 दिवसात पूर्ण करतात. तर तेच काम 15 मजूर रोज 8 तास करून किती दिवसात पूर्ण करतील ?', '{"A": "12 दिवस", "B": "15 दिवस", "C": "20 दिवस", "D": "18 दिवस"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय B. Total work: 20×15×6 = 15×D×8 → D = 1800÷120 = 15 days — workers कमी, hours जास्त, balance.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27990, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'अलिकडेच फेब्रुवारी 2018 फायनान्शियल टेक्नॉलॉजी (फिनटेक) धोरण जाहीर करणारे देशातील पहिले राज्य कोणते ?', '{"A": "महाराष्ट्र", "B": "आंध्र प्रदेश", "C": "कर्नाटक", "D": "गुजरात"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. Maharashtra ने February 2018 मध्ये India ची पहिली Fintech Policy जाहीर केली — Mumbai ला financial-technology hub म्हणून; त्या prelim cycle चा current-affairs मुद्दा.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27991, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'काजूची किंमत प्रतिकिलो ₹ 1,000 तर पिस्त्याची किंमत प्रतिकिलो ₹ 1,200 आहे. जर काजू व पिस्त्याचे मिश्रण प्रतिकिलो ₹ 1,050 विकले, तर त्या मिश्रणात पिस्त्याचे काजूशी असलेले प्रमाण किती ?', '{"A": "1 : 3", "B": "2 : 1", "C": "3 : 1", "D": "3 : 2"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. Alligation: walnut : cashew = (1050−1000) : (1200−1050) = 50:150 = 1:3 — ₹1,050 विक्री किंमतीवर.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27992, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'भारतातील कोणत्या शहरात ग्लोबल एंटरप्रिन्योरशिप समिट, 2017 आयोजित करण्यात आले ?', '{"A": "मुंबई", "B": "हैदराबाद", "C": "नवी दिल्ली", "D": "वाराणसी"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय B. Global Entrepreneurship Summit 2017 India-US सह-आयोजित Hyderabad मध्ये — Ivanka Trump US delegation; Mumbai, Delhi, Varanasi नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27993, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'कोणत्या देशाच्या संघास हरवून फ्रान्सने दहावा डेव्हिस कप जिंकला ?', '{"A": "जर्मनी", "B": "इटली", "C": "सं.रा. अमेरिका", "D": "बेल्जियम"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय D चिन्हांकित केला. France ने November 2017 मध्ये Lille मध्ये Belgium 3–2 हरवून 10वा Davis Cup जिंकला — Germany, Italy, USA final मध्ये नव्हते.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27994, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'या वर्षीचा सर्वोत्कृष्ट फुटबॉलपटूसाठीचा पाचवा "बॅलन डी''ओर" पुरस्कार मिळविणारा ख्रिस्तियानो रोनाल्डो सध्या पुढीलपैकी कोणत्या क्लबकडून खेळतो ?', '{"A": "एफ.सी. बार्सिलोना", "B": "जुव्हेंटस", "C": "रीअल माद्रीद", "D": "ए.सी. मिलान"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. Cristiano Ronaldo ने December 2017 मध्ये Real Madrid मध्ये असतानाच पाचवा Ballon d''Or जिंकला; Juventus ला 2018 च्या उन्हाळ्यात गेला.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27995, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, '48 व्या भारतीय आंतरराष्ट्रीय चित्रपट महोत्सव मध्ये कोणत्या चित्रपटास ''सुवर्ण मयूर'' पुरस्कार प्राप्त झाला ?', '{"A": "एंजल्स वियर व्हाईट", "B": "टेक ऑफ", "C": "क्षितिज", "D": "120 बीट्स पर मिनिट"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय D येतो. ''120 Beats per Minute'' (Robin Campillo) ने 48व्या IFFI Goa (2017) मध्ये Golden Peacock — Best Film; इतर titles स्पर्धेत होती, top prize नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27996, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, '2017 सालच्या IFFI तर्फे दिल्या जाणाऱ्या जीवनगौरव पुरस्काराचे मानकरी कोण ?', '{"A": "ॲटम इगोयान", "B": "हिव्हीयन क्यू", "C": "अमिताभ बच्चन", "D": "किरो रुसो"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. Canadian filmmaker Atom Egoyan ला 48व्या IFFI (2017) मध्ये Lifetime Achievement Award; Amitabh Bachchan आणि इतर नावे त्या वर्षी honoree नव्हते.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27997, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, '''तपी'' प्रकल्प खालीलपैकी कशाशी संबंधित आहे ?', '{"A": "जलविद्युत प्रकल्प", "B": "पेट्रोलियम पुरवठा", "C": "पाइपद्वारे नैसर्गिक वायू पुरवठा प्रकल्प", "D": "अणूऊर्जा प्रकल्प"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय C. TAPI — Turkmenistan–Afghanistan–Pakistan–India natural-gas pipeline project; hydroelectricity, petroleum supply, atomic energy नाही.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27998, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, '''सौभाग्य'' योजना कशाशी संबंधित आहे ?', '{"A": "प्रत्येक घरात वीज", "B": "उत्कृष्ट वाहतूक", "C": "अधिक चांगले रस्ते", "D": "बँक क्षेत्रातील सुधारणा"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय A. SAUBHAGYA (Pradhan Mantri Sahaj Bijli Har Ghar Yojana) — universal household electrification; transport, roads, banking reform नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (27999, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'पुढील विधानांचा विचार करून योग्य पर्याय निवडा : अ. माजी पंतप्रधान डॉ. मनमोहन सिंग हे या वर्षासाठी इंदिरा गांधी शांतता, निशस्त्रीकरण आणि विकास या पुरस्काराचे मानकरी आहेत. ब. त्यांना हा पुरस्कार "जागतिक स्तरावर भारताचे स्थान सुधारण्यासाठी" आणि भारताच्या "आर्थिक, सामाजिक विकासासाठी योगदान देण्यासाठी" मिळाला आहे.', '{"A": "फक्त अ", "B": "फक्त ब", "C": "अ आणि ब दोन्हीही", "D": "वरीलपैकी एकही नाही"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय B चिन्हांकित केला. (b) Manmohan Singh च्या Indira Gandhi Prize citation बरोबर — India''s stature, economic/social development; (a) अधिकृत उत्तर मध्ये ''this year'' वाचनात चुकीचे — scoring साठी अधिकृत पर्याय.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28000, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'स्पेसएक्सच्या खाजगी मंगळयान मोहिमेसाठी खालीलपैकी कोणता प्रक्षेपक पाठविण्यात आला आहे ?', '{"A": "टेस्ला", "B": "स्पेसएक्सएल", "C": "फाल्कन हेवी", "D": "मार्स-वन"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. SpaceX Falcon Heavy February 2018 मध्ये maiden flight — Mars-orbit test payload; Tesla rocket चे नाव नाही, car होती.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
INSERT INTO pyq_questions (id, topic, subject, exam, year, question, options, correct, explanation, tags, difficulty)
VALUES
  (28001, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'सरकारी योजनांचे सामाजिक लेखापरीक्षण हा शासनाच्या कामकाजाचा भाग करणारा कायदा प्रथम अमलात आणणारे राज्य कोणते ?', '{"A": "गोवा", "B": "मेघालय", "C": "कर्नाटक", "D": "महाराष्ट्र"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय B. Meghalaya — government schemes च्या social audit ला mandatory करणारा कायदा प्रथम operational; Goa, Karnataka, Maharashtra नंतर.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28002, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'खालीलपैकी कोणत्या पाणीवाटप तंट्यामध्ये कर्नाटकचा समावेश नाही ?', '{"A": "वंशधारा पाणीवाटप तंटा", "B": "गोदावरी पाणीवाटप तंटा", "C": "महादयी पाणीवाटप तंटा", "D": "कृष्णा पाणीवाटप तंटा"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A चिन्हांकित केला. Vansadhara dispute Odisha–Andhra Pradesh — Karnataka party नाही; Krishna, Mahadayi, Godavari tribunal मध्ये सहभागी.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28003, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'येशी धोंडेन यांना भारत सरकारने नुकतेच पद्मश्री देऊन गौरविले. ______ क्षेत्रातील योगदानासाठी त्यांना पद्मश्री देण्यात आली.', '{"A": "तिबेटीयन बनौषधी", "B": "नवजात अर्भकांचे आजार", "C": "सर्पदंशावरील उपचार", "D": "दुर्गमडोंगरी भागात दवाखाना चालवणे"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय A. Tibetan physician Yeshi Dhonden ला traditional Tibetan medicine साठी Padma Shri; neonatal care, snake-bite, hospital building एकटे नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28004, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'डॉ. बी.आर. आंबेडकरांनी संविधानाच्या कोणत्या कलमास भारतीय संविधानाचा आत्मा मानले आहे ?', '{"A": "कलम 19", "B": "कलम 21", "C": "कलम 51", "D": "कलम 32"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय D येतो. Dr. Ambedkar Article 32 ला Constitution चे ''heart and soul'' म्हणाले — constitutional remedies; त्याशिवाय इतर fundamental rights रिकामे.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28005, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'भारताच्या संविधानाच्या अंतर्गत विषय आणि सूची यांच्या जोड्यांपैकी कोणती जोडी अयोग्य आहे, ते ठरवा.', '{"A": "जंगले – समवर्ती सूची", "B": "स्टॉक एक्सचेंज – समवर्ती सूची", "C": "पोस्ट ऑफिस बचत बँक – केंद्र सूची", "D": "सार्वजनिक आरोग्य – राज्य सूची"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय B. Stock Exchange Union List (Entry 48) — Concurrent List नाही; Forest, Post Office Savings Bank, Public Health इतर जोड्या बरोबर.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28006, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'विजय गोखले यांची भारताच्या परराष्ट्र सचिव नुकतीच नेमणूक करण्यात आली आहे. त्यांच्या संदर्भात खालीलपैकी कोणते विधान चुकीचे आहे ?', '{"A": "गोखले हे भारतीय परराष्ट्र सेवेच्या 1981 च्या तुकडीचे अधिकारी आहेत.", "B": "गोखले हे चीनविषयक प्रश्नांचे तज्ञ मानले जातात.", "C": "परराष्ट्र सचिवपद भूषविणारे ते दुसरे मराठी अधिकारी आहेत.", "D": "गोखले हे मुळचे मुंबईकर आहेत."}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय D. Vijay Gokhale (IFS 1981), China expert, 2018 Foreign Secretary — Pune वरून, Mumbai नाही; batch, China expertise, Marathi-officer status बरोबर.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28007, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'बंधन एक्सप्रेस कोणत्या दोन देशांदरम्यान धावते ?', '{"A": "भारत – नेपाळ", "B": "भारत – पाकिस्तान", "C": "भारत – बांग्लादेश", "D": "भारत – भुतान"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय C. Bandhan Express Kolkata (India)–Khulna (Bangladesh) — November 2017; Nepal, Pakistan, Bhutan routes नाहीत.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28008, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'भारतीय राज्यघटनेच्या निर्मिती दरम्यान संविधान सल्लागार म्हणून कोणाची नियुक्ती केली गेली ?', '{"A": "बी.एन. राव", "B": "एन. गोपालस्वामी अय्यंगार", "C": "श्यामा प्रसाद मुखर्जी", "D": "एम.आर. जयकर"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय A. B.N. Rau Constituent Assembly चे Constitutional Advisor; Ayyangar, Mukherjee, Jayakar इतर drafting roles — ते title नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28009, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'कोणत्या घटनादुरुस्तीद्वारे मूलभूत कर्तव्यांचा भारतीय राज्यघटनेत समावेश करण्यात आला ?', '{"A": "42 वी दुरुस्ती", "B": "44 वी दुरुस्ती", "C": "61 वी दुरुस्ती", "D": "24 वी दुरुस्ती"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A चिन्हांकित केला. Fundamental Duties 42nd Amendment 1976 (Article 51A) — Swaran Singh Committee; 44th, 61st, 24th नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28010, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'खालील विधाने लक्षात घ्या : अ. एम.सी. सेटलवाड हे भारताचे पहिले महान्यायवादी होते. ब. महान्यायवाद्यास भारताच्या सर्व न्यायालयात उपस्थित राहण्याचा अधिकार आहे. क. महान्यायवादी संसदेच्या दोन्ही सभागृहांच्या कामकाजात सहभागी होतो. त्याला तिथे बोलणे व मत देण्याचा अधिकार आहे. वरीलपैकी कोणते विधान/विधाने चूक आहेत ?', '{"A": "फक्त अ", "B": "अ आणि क", "C": "फक्त क", "D": "वरील सर्व"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय C. (a), (b) बरोबर — M.C. Setalvad first AG, सर्व courts मध्ये audience; (c) चुकीचे — AG Parliament मध्ये बोलू शकतो, vote करू शकत नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28011, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'संसदेने पक्षांतरबंदी कायदा कोणत्या घटनादुरुस्ती कायद्यानुसार संमत केला आहे ?', '{"A": "44 वी घटनादुरुस्ती कायदा", "B": "52 वी घटनादुरुस्ती कायदा", "C": "42 वी घटनादुरुस्ती कायदा", "D": "61 वी घटनादुरुस्ती कायदा"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय B येतो. Anti-Defection law 52nd Amendment 1985 (Tenth Schedule); 44th, 42nd इतर constitutional changes.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28012, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'केंद्र व राज्य लोकसेवा आयोगाची स्थापना भारतीय राज्यघटनेतील कोणत्या कलमान्वये करण्यात आलेली आहे ?', '{"A": "अनुच्छेद 325", "B": "अनुच्छेद 320", "C": "अनुच्छेद 318", "D": "अनुच्छेद 315"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय D. Article 315 — Union PSC आणि प्रत्येक राज्यासाठी PSC; Article 318–320 composition, removal, functions.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28013, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2018, 'भारतीय संविधानाच्या कोणत्या अनुच्छेदानुसार मंत्री परिषद लोकसभेला उत्तरदायी असते ?', '{"A": "अनुच्छेद 75", "B": "अनुच्छेद 74", "C": "अनुच्छेद 73", "D": "अनुच्छेद 76"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय A. Article 75(3) — Council of Ministers collectively Lok Sabha ला जबाबदार; Article 74 President ला aid/advice; 73 Union executive power, 76 Attorney General.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28014, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Select the correct statements - (Padma Award, 2019) (a) Tijanbai and Anil Kumar Naik were honoured by Padma Vibhushan Award. (b) Dharampal Gulati and Bachendri Pal were honoured by Padma Bhushan Award. (c) S. Thimakka and Devendra Swaroop were honoured by Padma Bhushan Award. (d) Manoj Vajpayee and Sudam Kate were honoured by Padma Shri Award.', '{"A": "Only (a), (b)", "B": "Only (c), (d)", "C": "Only (a), (b), (d)", "D": "Only (a), (c), (d)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. Padma Vibhushan 2019 went to Teejan Bai and Anil Manibhai Naik; Padma Bhushan to Dharampal Gulati and Bachendri Pal; Padma Shri to Manoj Bajpayee and Sudam Kate. Statement (c) is incorrect because Saalumarada Thimmakka and Devendra Swarup received Padma Shri, not Padma Bhushan.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28015, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Select the incorrect statement - (Seoul Peace Prize)', '{"A": "Prime Minister Narendra Modi was honoured by ''Seoul Peace Prize''.", "B": "Narendra Modi donated two lakh dollar (Prize Amount) to Namami Gange Campaign.", "C": "Seoul Peace Prize was initiated on 1995.", "D": "Kofi Annan, Angela Merkel were also Seoul Peace Prize winners."}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The right pick is option C. Narendra Modi did win the Seoul Peace Prize 2018 and donated the prize money to Namami Gange; past winners include Kofi Annan and Angela Merkel. The trap is statement (c): the prize was established in 1990, not 1995.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28016, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '''Green Peace and Air Visual Analysis of Pollution'' report declared the most polluted cities of World. Among 30 most polluted cities consists 22 cities of India. Arrange the following cities in increasing order of ranking in Air pollution. (a) Delhi (b) Noida (c) Gurugram (d) Gaziabad', '{"A": "(a), (b), (d), (c)", "B": "(c), (d), (b), (a)", "C": "(b), (a), (d), (c)", "D": "(c), (d), (a), (b)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. In the Greenpeace and AirVisual 2018 World Air Quality Report, Gurugram, Ghaziabad, Noida, and Delhi all sat among the world''s most polluted cities — the official answer orders them as Gurugram → Ghaziabad → Noida → Delhi in increasing rank order. Pollution rankings shift year to year, so treat this as the 2018-report sequence the paper expects.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28017, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Kazakhstan renames it''s capital ''Astana'' after its first President to honour him. The name of the new capital is _______', '{"A": "Nursultan", "B": "Tokayev", "C": "Nazarbayev", "D": "Jomart"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. In March 2019 Kazakhstan renamed its capital Astana to Nursultan, honouring its first President Nursultan Nazarbayev. Tokayev succeeded him as President; Nazarbayev is the person honoured, not the new city name itself.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28018, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Match the pairs : Book - Author (a) Capital in the Twenty First Century - (i) Caroline Criedo Perez (b) Pocket Piketty - (ii) Kevine Orarchy (c) A Short History of Brexit - (iii) Jesper Roine (d) Invisible Women - Exposing a Data Bias in a world design for men - (iv) Thomas Piketty', '{"A": "(a)-(i), (b)-(ii), (c)-(iii), (d)-(iv)", "B": "(a)-(iv), (b)-(iii), (c)-(ii), (d)-(i)", "C": "(a)-(ii), (b)-(iii), (c)-(i), (d)-(iv)", "D": "(a)-(iii), (b)-(iv), (c)-(i), (d)-(ii)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Go with option B. Thomas Piketty wrote ''Capital in the Twenty-First Century''; Jesper Roine condensed it as ''Pocket Piketty''; Kevin O''Rourke authored ''A Short History of Brexit''; Caroline Criado Perez wrote ''Invisible Women''. The paper spells some names loosely — match on the well-known titles.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28019, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Indian team has won the under 19 cricket world cup competition on 2018. For how many times the under 19 Indian cricket team has won the world cup ?', '{"A": "3rd time", "B": "4th time", "C": "5th time", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B is correct. India''s Under-19 team lifted the World Cup in 2018 at New Zealand — their fourth title after wins in 2000, 2008, and 2012. Third or fifth sounds close but miscounts one edition.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28020, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which statement/s is/are false about proposed ''Bullet Train'' ? (a) High speed Railway project between Mumbai and Ahmedabad. (b) Technical assistance and easy loan by Japan. (c) 20,000 people will get employment during construction. (d) World Bank will provide full loan for project.', '{"A": "(a) and (d)", "B": "Only (d)", "C": "(b) and (d)", "D": "(b) and (c)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Pick option B. The Mumbai–Ahmedabad bullet train is a Japanese-assisted high-speed project expected to employ thousands during construction. Only statement (d) is false — finance comes mainly from Japan, not a full World Bank loan.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28021, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '______ became second male tennis player to win 100 singles titles.', '{"A": "Stefanos Tsitsipas", "B": "Rafael Nadal", "C": "Roger Federer", "D": "Andre Agassi"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. Roger Federer became only the second man in the Open Era to reach 100 ATP singles titles, after Jimmy Connors. Nadal and Tsitsipas were active rivals but had not crossed that century mark when this question was set.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28022, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Antonio Guterres was recently in news. Which is not true about him ? (a) He was a Prime Minister of Portugal in 1995 - 2001. (b) He worked as United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees from June 2005 to December 2015. (c) He Co-chaired the First European Union - Africa Summit. (d) He founded the Portuguese Refugee Council.', '{"A": "(a), (b)", "B": "(b), (c)", "C": "(c), (d)", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option D. Antonio Guterres served as Portugal''s Prime Minister (1995–2002), led UNHCR (2005–2015), co-chaired the first EU–Africa Summit, and helped found the Portuguese Refugee Council — every statement in the stem holds. MPSC often tests biography details of the sitting UN Secretary-General.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28023, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Shruti Shrikhande has topped among girls in combined defence services examination, 2018. She hails from which of the following cities in Maharashtra ?', '{"A": "Pune", "B": "Mumbai", "C": "Ratnagiri", "D": "Nashik"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. Shruti Shrikhande from Pune topped among women in the Combined Defence Services Examination 2018, making Maharashtra news that year. Ratnagiri, Mumbai, and Nashik are plausible distractors for a state-specific current-affairs item.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28024, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Select the correct statement/s : (a) Pakyang Airport is the First Airport in Himalayan State. (b) Pakyang Airport is the 100th Airport in the India.', '{"A": "Only (a)", "B": "Only (b)", "C": "Both (a) and (b)", "D": "Neither (a) nor (b)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. Pakyong Airport in Sikkim, inaugurated in September 2018, was celebrated as India''s 100th operational airport. Statement (a) overreaches — Himalayan states like Jammu & Kashmir and Himachal already had airports before Sikkim got one.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28025, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'In which of the following ''Mission Indra Dhanush'' is concerned ?', '{"A": "Vaccination", "B": "Water Conservation", "C": "Artificial Raining", "D": "Irrigation"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The verified answer here is option A. Mission Indradhanush is the Union Health Ministry''s intensified immunisation drive to cover unvaccinated and partially vaccinated children and pregnant women. Water conservation, cloud seeding, and irrigation belong to entirely different missions.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28026, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Match the pairs : (91st Oscar Award) Category - Film (a) Best Film - (i) Bao (b) Best Short Film - (ii) Roma (c) Best Animated Short Film - (iii) Green Book (d) Best Foreign Film - (iv) Skin', '{"A": "a-III, b-IV, c-I, d-II", "B": "a-III, b-I, c-IV, d-II", "C": "a-III, b-II, c-I, d-IV", "D": "a-III, b-IV, c-II, d-I"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. At the 91st Oscars, ''Green Book'' won Best Picture, ''Skin'' Best Live Action Short, ''Bao'' Best Animated Short, and ''Roma'' Best Foreign Language Film. Best Picture and Best Foreign Film are the pair most students mix up.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28027, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Spicejet, the first Indian low-cost air carrier joined IATA. IATA stands for :', '{"A": "International Air Travel Association.", "B": "Indian Air Travel Association.", "C": "International Air Transport Association.", "D": "Indian Air Transport Association."}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Go with option C. IATA expands to International Air Transport Association — the global trade body for airlines. SpiceJet becoming its first Indian low-cost member was headline news around 2019; ''Travel'' instead of ''Transport'' is the usual distractor.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28028, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Two Nobel Prizes for 2018 and 2019 will be awarded this year in _______ category.', '{"A": "Peace", "B": "Chemistry", "C": "Medicine", "D": "Literature"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Pick option D. The Swedish Academy postponed the 2018 Nobel Prize in Literature because of a misconduct scandal, so both the 2018 and 2019 Literature prizes were awarded together in 2019. Peace, Chemistry, and Medicine followed their normal single-year schedule.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28029, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Consider the following statements : (a) The Governor is not an integral part of the State Legislature. (b) The Governor has no security of tenure. (c) The Governor may be removed by the President at any time. (d) The Constitution does not lay down any grounds upon which a Governor may be removed by the President.', '{"A": "All above statements are correct.", "B": "Statements (a), (b), (c) are correct.", "C": "Statements (b), (c), (d) are correct.", "D": "Statements (a) and (d) are correct."}'::jsonb, 'C', 'On this one, option C is correct. The Governor enjoys no fixed tenure and serves at the President''s pleasure, with no removal grounds spelt out in the Constitution. Statement (a) is wrong because Article 168 makes the Governor an integral part of the State Legislature.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28030, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Consider the following statements about ''State Election Commission'' : (a) It conducted rural and urban local body elections including the election of members of Maharashtra Legislative Council elected by the members of rural and urban local bodies. (b) The State Election Commissioner cannot be removed by the Governor, though appointed by him.', '{"A": "Statement (a) is correct.", "B": "Statement (b) is correct.", "C": "Both the statements are correct.", "D": "Both the statements are false."}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. A State Election Commissioner, though appointed by the Governor, cannot be removed at the Governor''s whim — removal needs the same tough process as a High Court judge. Statement (a) is false because SEC runs panchayat and municipal polls, not Legislative Council elections from local bodies.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28031, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which of the following statements are correct ? (a) For creation of Legislative Council, resolution must be passed by 2/3 majority of the members of the Legislative Assembly present and voting of concerned state is necessary. (b) For creation of Legislative Council, resolution must be passed by 2/3 majority of the members of the parliament is necessary.', '{"A": "Only (a)", "B": "Only (b)", "C": "Both (a) and (b)", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. Under Article 169, a state Legislative Assembly must pass a resolution by a two-thirds majority of members present and voting before Parliament can create a Legislative Council. Parliament enacts the law, but no separate two-thirds resolution of the whole Parliament is required as statement (b) claims.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28032, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which of the following has been wrongly listed as a recommendation of the ''Sarkaria Commission'' ?', '{"A": "It favoured change in the role of Rajya Sabha and Centre''s power to reorganise the states.", "B": "It favoured sparingly use of Article 356 of the Constitution.", "C": "It turned down the demand for the abolition of the office of the Governor.", "D": "It favoured implementation of the three language formula."}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. The Sarkaria Commission (1983) urged sparing use of Article 356, rejected abolishing the Governor''s office, and backed the three-language formula. It did not recommend reshaping Rajya Sabha''s role or the Centre''s power to reorganise states — that option is wrongly attributed.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28033, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Match the pairs : Articles - Subject matter (a) 243 A - (i) Elections of Panchayats (b) 243 D - (ii) Constitution of Panchayats (c) 243 B - (iii) Gram Sabha (d) 243 K - (iv) Reservation of Seats', '{"A": "(a)-(iii), (b)-(iv), (c)-(i), (d)-(ii)", "B": "(a)-(ii), (b)-(iv), (c)-(iii), (d)-(i)", "C": "(a)-(iii), (b)-(iv), (c)-(ii), (d)-(i)", "D": "(a)-(i), (b)-(ii), (c)-(iii), (d)-(iv)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. Article 243A covers the Gram Sabha; 243B the constitution of Panchayats; 243D reservation of seats; and 243K elections to Panchayats. Mixing 243B with elections and 243K with constitution is the standard distractor layout.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28034, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Whom does the Advocate General of the State submits his resignation ?', '{"A": "Chief Justice of High Court of the State", "B": "Governor of the respective State", "C": "President of India", "D": "Chief Minister of the respective State"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Go with option B. The Advocate General of a State holds office during the Governor''s pleasure and submits resignation to the Governor — the same appointing authority. The Chief Minister, Chief Justice, and President are high offices but not the constitutional addressee for this resignation.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28035, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which of the following writs in not specifically provided under Article-32 of the Constitution of India ?', '{"A": "Injunction", "B": "Prohibition", "C": "Quo-warranto", "D": "Certiorari"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Pick option A. Article 32 empowers the Supreme Court to issue five writs — habeas corpus, mandamus, prohibition, quo warranto, and certiorari. ''Injunction'' is a remedy under ordinary civil law, not one of the five constitutional writs listed in Article 32.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28036, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which of the following provision/s is/are not contained in Article-39 of the Indian Constitution ? (a) Equal pay for equal work for both men and women. (b) Organisation of Village Panchayats. (c) To secure a social order for promotion of welfare of the people. (d) The citizens, men and women equally, have the right to an adequate means of livelihood.', '{"A": "(a) only", "B": "(b) and (c)", "C": "(d) only", "D": "(a) and (c)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B is correct. Article 39 lists DPSPs such as adequate livelihood and equal pay for equal work — so (a) and (d) belong here. Organising village panchayats sits in Article 40, and securing a welfare social order is the broader thrust of Article 38, not Article 39.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28037, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which First Political Organisation was formed in Maharashtra in 1852 ?', '{"A": "Bombay Association", "B": "East India Association", "C": "Sarvajanik Sabha", "D": "Bombay Presidency Association"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The right pick is option A. The Bombay Association (1852) — led by Jagannath Shankar Seth and allied merchants — is counted as Maharashtra''s first political organisation. East India Association came later in London; Sarvajanik Sabha and Bombay Presidency Association belong to subsequent decades.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28038, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Match the pairs : Person - Role (a) Dr. Sachchidanand Sinha - (i) Objectives Resolution (b) Dr. Rajendra Prasad - (ii) Constitutional advisor of Constitutional Assembly (c) Sir B.N. Rao - (iii) Permanent President of Constitutional Assembly (d) Jawaharlal Nehru - (iv) Temporary President of Constitutional Assembly', '{"A": "(a)-(i), (b)-(ii), (c)-(iii), (d)-(iv)", "B": "(a)-(iv), (b)-(iii), (c)-(i), (d)-(ii)", "C": "(a)-(iii), (b)-(iv), (c)-(ii), (d)-(i)", "D": "(a)-(iv), (b)-(iii), (c)-(ii), (d)-(i)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option D. Dr Sachchidanand Sinha was the temporary (first) President of the Constituent Assembly; Dr Rajendra Prasad became its permanent President; Sir B.N. Rau served as constitutional advisor; Jawaharlal Nehru moved the Objectives Resolution. Swapping Sinha and Nehru''s roles is the common match-the-pairs trap.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28039, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'The primary objective of judicial control over administration is :', '{"A": "To restrict the discretion and arbitrariness of administrative agencies.", "B": "To help in redressing the grievances of citizens.", "C": "To safeguard the rights and liberty of the citizens.", "D": "To contain and penalise the wrongful acts of government officials."}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The examiner has marked option C. Judicial review over administration chiefly protects citizens'' fundamental rights and liberties against arbitrary official action. Redressing grievances and checking discretion are important effects, but safeguarding rights and liberty is the primary constitutional objective textbooks cite.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28040, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'After bearing public criticism which social reformer served lame, blind and leprosy persons ?', '{"A": "Dr. Anandibai Joshi", "B": "Anutai Wagh", "C": "Bhau Daji Lad", "D": "Lokhitwadi Gopal Hari Deshmukh"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The examiner has marked option D. Lokhitwadi Gopal Hari Deshmukh faced sharp public criticism for his reformist Lokhit articles in the Prabhakar, then turned to hands-on charity — serving the lame, blind, and leprosy patients. Anandibai Joshi, Anutai Wagh, and Bhau Daji Lad fit medicine or civic philanthropy elsewhere.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28041, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Who established the ''Prathana Samaj'' in Mumbai in 1867 ?', '{"A": "Dr. Atmaram Pandurang", "B": "Gopal Hari Deshmukh", "C": "Dadabhai Naoroji", "D": "Dr. Sitaram Desai"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The verified answer here is option A. Dr. Atmaram Pandurang founded the Prarthana Samaj in Mumbai in 1867 as a prayer-house reform society — monotheism, women''s uplift, and social service without idol worship. Gopal Hari Deshmukh (Lokhitwadi), Naoroji, and Sitaram Desai are linked to other reform streams.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28042, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which of the following statements are true about Lord Dalhousie ? (a) Started the Railway Era. (b) Establishment of independent public works department. (c) Establishment of Telegram Department in 1852. (d) Passed post law and started postal stamps in 1854.', '{"A": "(a), (b) and (c) only", "B": "(b), (c) and (d) only", "C": "(a), (c) and (d) only", "D": "All of the above"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. Lord Dalhousie''s tenure is remembered for the railway age (first line 1853), an independent Public Works Department, the telegraph network from 1852, and the Post Office Act with postage stamps from 1854 — all four statements in the stem are textbook milestones.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28043, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Indian Council of scientific studies established at __________.', '{"A": "Delhi", "B": "Calcutta", "C": "Madras", "D": "Bangalore"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. The paper''s ''Indian Council of scientific studies'' points to the Indian Association for the Cultivation of Science (IACS), founded in Calcutta in 1876 by Mahendra Lal Sircar — the cradle where C. V. Raman later did his Nobel work. Delhi, Madras, and Bangalore are later CSIR or IISc hubs, not this 1876 body.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28044, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Who is First national poet of modern India ?', '{"A": "D.P. Tarkhedkar", "B": "V.D. Savarkar", "C": "Vinayak", "D": "H.V. Derozio"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Go with option D. Henry Louis Vivian Derozio — leader of the Young Bengal movement and author of ''To India — My Native Land'' — is textbook-listed as the first national poet of modern India. Tarkhedkar, Savarkar, and the bare ''Vinayak'' label belong to Marathi-nationalist poetry, not this Anglo-Indian pioneer slot.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28045, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'The effects of uprising of 1857 are as follow. (a) The end of company rule (b) The Indians were not given jobs in administration (c) Became the inspiration for Indian Freedom struggle (d) Reorganisation of the military', '{"A": "(a), (b) and (c) only", "B": "(b), (c) and (d) only", "C": "(a), (c) and (d) only", "D": "(a) and (b) only"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Pick option C. The 1857 uprising ended East India Company rule, fired later freedom movements, and triggered a thorough military reorganisation — so (a), (c), and (d) hold. Statement (b) is the odd one out in the official answer''s reading: post-1857 policy did open some Indian recruitment, even while higher posts stayed largely European.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28046, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'In which Satyagraha Maharshi Vitthal Ramji Shinde was participated ? (a) Parvati Satyagraha (b) Wai Ganapati Mandir Satyagraha (c) Waykom Mandir Satyagraha (d) Laxmi-Narayan Mandir Satyagraha', '{"A": "(a) and (c)", "B": "(b) and (c)", "C": "(a), (b) and (c)", "D": "(a), (b), (c) and (d)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. Maharshi Vitthal Ramji Shinde joined the Parvati Satyagraha, Wai Ganapati Mandir Satyagraha, and Vaikom (Waykom) temple-entry movement — all three appear in his reform biography. Laxmi-Narayan Mandir Satyagraha is not counted in the official answer''s trio.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28047, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Who were hanged in Jacksan Murder case ?', '{"A": "Krishnaji Gopal Karve, Vinayak Narayan Deshpande", "B": "Brahmagiri Buwa, Ganesh Vaidya", "C": "Dattatray Pandurang Joshi, Siddhanath Kane", "D": "Vaman Phadake, Niranjan Pal"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'On this one, option A is correct. In the 1909 Jackson Murder case at Nashik, revolutionaries Krishnaji Gopal Karve and Vinayak Narayan Deshpande were hanged for assassinating Collector A. M. T. Jackson. The other name-pairs belong to different conspiracy or martyr episodes.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28048, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'In which place fourth conference of Indian National Congress was held ?', '{"A": "Mumbai", "B": "Allahabad", "C": "Ahmedabad", "D": "Madras"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Working through it, option B is the one. The fourth session of the Indian National Congress met at Allahabad in 1888 under George Yule''s presidency. Mumbai hosted the first (1885); Ahmedabad and Madras came in later years.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28049, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'In which provinces was ''Rayatwari System'' started during British reign ?', '{"A": "Madras, Mumbai", "B": "Bengal, Punjab", "C": "Calcutta, Nagpur", "D": "Delhi, Himachal Pradesh"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The right pick is option A. The Ryotwari (Rayatwari) settlement — direct revenue agreement between the cultivator and government — was chiefly applied in the Madras and Bombay presidencies. Bengal and Punjab are associated with zamindari or mahalwari systems instead.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28050, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Who among the following helped Mahatma Jyotiba Phule for running girl''s school ? (a) Sakharam Yashwant Paranjape, Sadashiv Govind Hate (b) Sadashivrao Balal Govande, Moro Vitthal Valvekar (c) Vishnupant Thatte, Keshav Shivram Bhavalkar (d) Devrao Thosar, Mrs. E.C. Jones', '{"A": "(a) and (b) only", "B": "(a), (b) and (c) only", "C": "(b), (c) and (d) only", "D": "All of the above"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Straight to the answer — option D. Mahatma Jyotiba Phule''s girls'' schools drew support from a wide circle: Paranjape–Hate, Govande–Valvekar, Thatte–Bhavalkar, and Thosar–Mrs. E. C. Jones — all four bundles in the stem are credited in Maharashtra school history.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
INSERT INTO pyq_questions (id, topic, subject, exam, year, question, options, correct, explanation, tags, difficulty)
VALUES
  (28051, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which statements are true regarding 1935 Act ? (a) Anglo-Indian, Indian Christian, Shikh Constituencies were created. (b) Establishment of Federal Court. (c) Creation of Indian High Commissioner. (d) Rajgopalachari stated that ''Worse than dyarchy'' regarding the Law.', '{"A": "(a), (b), (c) statements are correct.", "B": "(b), (c) statements are correct.", "C": "(a), (c) statements are correct.", "D": "(a), (b), (d) statements are correct."}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The examiner has marked option D. The Government of India Act 1935 created separate Anglo-Indian, Indian Christian, and Sikh constituencies, set up the Federal Court, and drew Rajagopalachari''s ''worse than dyarchy'' verdict — (a), (b), and (d). The Indian High Commissioner post dates to the 1919 Act, not 1935, so (c) drops out.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28052, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Match the following : a. Tarabai Shinde - I. Sharada Sadan b. Tanhubai Birje - II. Formation of ''Hindu Ladies Social Club'' c. Pandita Ramabai - III. ''Stri-Purush Tulana'' book d. Ramabai Ranade - IV. India''s First Woman Editor', '{"A": "a-iv, b-iii, c-ii, d-i", "B": "a-iii, b-iv, c-i, d-ii", "C": "a-ii, b-i, c-iv, d-iii", "D": "a-i, b-iii, c-ii, d-iv"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B is correct. Tarabai Shinde wrote ''Stri-Purush Tulana''; Tanhubai Birje was India''s first woman editor; Pandita Ramabai founded Sharada Sadan; Ramabai Ranade helped form the Hindu Ladies Social Club — the a–iii, b–iv, c–i, d–ii map.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28053, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Match the pairs of small scale industry and their places of Maharashtra. a. Chaddar - I. Nagpur b. Himrushawl - II. Sawantwadi c. Wooden Toys - III. Solapur d. Silk Sari - IV. Aurangabad', '{"A": "a-iii, b-iv, c-ii, d-i", "B": "a-ii, b-iii, c-iv, d-i", "C": "a-i, b-ii, c-iii, d-iv", "D": "a-iv, b-i, c-ii, d-iii"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Pick option A. Solapur chaddar (blanket) weaving, Aurangabad Himru shawls, Sawantwadi wooden toys, and Nagpur silk saris are the standard Maharashtra handicraft–district pairings in state geography lists — a–iii, b–iv, c–ii, d–i.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28054, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Examine the trueness of following statements. Statement (A) : Godavari river basin is separated from Tapi river basin due to the Satmala-Ajintha mountain ranges. Statement (B) : Godavari river basin is separated from Bhima river basin due to the Shambhu-Mahadeo mountain ranges.', '{"A": "Statement (A) and (B) both are correct.", "B": "Statement (A) and (B) both are incorrect.", "C": "Statement (A) is true and (B) is incorrect.", "D": "Statement (A) is incorrect and (B) is true."}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The examiner has marked option C. Statement (A) is correct: the Satmala–Ajintha ranges divide the Godavari basin from the Tapi basin in Maharashtra. Statement (B) swaps the divider — the Shambhu–Mahadeo range does not separate Godavari from the Bhima basin in the official answer''s reading.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28055, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which of the following rivers generate maximum hydel power?', '{"A": "West flowing rivers of western ghat", "B": "East flowing rivers of south", "C": "Rivers in middle India", "D": "Ganga river valley"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Go with option B. Peninsular rivers flowing east — Krishna, Godavari, Kaveri and their tributaries — carry the bulk of India''s installed hydel capacity through the Western Ghats gradient and numerous dam cascades. West-flowing Konkan streams are shorter; Ganga valley and middle-India shares are smaller in comparison.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28056, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which type of settlement pattern is having following features ? (a) Roads are parallel to each other. (b) Roads are rectangular to each other. (c) Houses are in rows. (d) Highway or Railways are crossing to each others.', '{"A": "Linear", "B": "Radial", "C": "Circular", "D": "Chess board pattern"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The verified answer here is option D. Parallel and rectangular street grids, houses in rows, and a highway or railway cutting across the blocks define the chess-board (grid-iron) settlement pattern — typical of planned colonial towns and cantonments.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28057, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'To the north of Maharashtra ............ mountain range and to its east ............ hills are found.', '{"A": "Sahyadri and Nandurbar", "B": "Satpuda and Gavilgad", "C": "Balaghat and Bhamragad", "D": "Gavilgad and Mahadeo"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B is correct. The Satpuda range forms Maharashtra''s northern boundary, while the Gavilgad hills lie along the eastern side toward the Amravati–Chhindwara belt. Sahyadri is the western escarpment; Balaghat and Bhamragad are not the standard north–east pairing.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28058, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'River Hugli is the distributory of ............ river.', '{"A": "Damodar", "B": "Brahmaputra", "C": "Ganga", "D": "Padma"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Go with option C. The Hugli (Hooghly) is a distributary of the Ganga that branches westward near Farraka and flows through Kolkata to the Bay of Bengal. Damodar joins it downstream; Brahmaputra and Padma belong to the eastern Bengal system.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28059, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '_______ fort is called Eastern Gibralter by Britishers.', '{"A": "Janjira", "B": "Karnala", "C": "Raigad", "D": "Lingana"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Straight to the answer — option C. British gazetteers and Grant Duff called Raigad the ''Gibraltar of the East'' for its sheer scarped cliffs and strategic hill-top seat of Maratha power. Janjira is a sea fort nickname distractor; Karnala and Lingana are nearby Sahyadri forts without that label.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28060, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Match the pairs : a. Tadoba - I. Nagpur b. Pench - II. Amravati c. Navegaon - III. Chandrapur d. Gugamal - IV. Gondia', '{"A": "a-iv, b-iii, c-ii, d-i", "B": "a-iii, b-ii, c-i, d-iv", "C": "a-ii, b-iv, c-i, d-iii", "D": "a-iii, b-i, c-iv, d-ii"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. Tadoba lies in Chandrapur district, Pench spans the Nagpur belt, Navegaon is in Gondia, and Gugamal (Melghat) falls in Amravati — the a–iii, b–i, c–iv, d–ii set. Swapping Pench with Chandrapur is the usual trap.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28061, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '"Operation Flood plan" is related with ________ .', '{"A": "Flood", "B": "Milk", "C": "Poultry", "D": "None of them"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. Operation Flood was NDDB''s White Revolution programme to expand organised milk collection, processing, and marketing nationwide — nothing to do with flood control or poultry.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28062, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Human migration from one place to other place, due to unavoidable circumstances takes place because of ............ factors.', '{"A": "Pull factors", "B": "Push factors", "C": "Scientific factors", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Pick option B. Migration forced by drought, famine, war, or persecution is driven by push factors — negative conditions at the origin that compel departure. Pull factors attract by choice; ''scientific factors'' is not a standard migration label in geography syllabi.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28063, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '_______ soil is covered largest area in India.', '{"A": "Black cotton soil", "B": "Red soil", "C": "Alluvial soil", "D": "Laterite soil"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The right pick is option C. Alluvial soils — spread across the Indo-Gangetic plain, Brahmaputra valley, and major river deltas — cover the largest geographical area among India''s soil types. Black cotton dominates the Deccan trap belt but not the national acreage total.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28064, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '________ state in India is a major Bauxite producing state.', '{"A": "Zarkhand", "B": "Madhya Pradesh", "C": "Chhattisgarh", "D": "Gujarat"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. The paper spells it ''Zarkhand'' — read that as Jharkhand, which sits on the eastern plateau bauxite belt and ranks among India''s top bauxite producers alongside Odisha and Gujarat.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28065, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'India''s first hydroelectric power station ''Shivsamudram'' is on ________ river.', '{"A": "Kaveri", "B": "Krishna", "C": "Tungbhadra", "D": "Godavari"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The right pick is option A. India''s first hydroelectric station (1902) was built at Shivanasamudra on the Kaveri in Karnataka — not Krishna, Tungbhadra, or Godavari.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28066, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Match the pairs of Column ''A'' and Column ''B''. (a) Lawyer - (i) Primary Activities (b) Transport - (ii) Secondary Activities (c) Flour mill - (iii) Tertiary Activities (d) Hunting - (iv) Quaternary Activities', '{"A": "(a)-(ii), (b)-(i), (c)-(iv), (d)-(iii)", "B": "(a)-(iii), (b)-(ii), (c)-(iv), (d)-(i)", "C": "(a)-(iv), (b)-(iii), (c)-(ii), (d)-(i)", "D": "(a)-(i), (b)-(iv), (c)-(iii), (d)-(ii)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. Hunting draws directly from nature (primary), a flour mill processes raw grain (secondary), transport is a service (tertiary), and a lawyer offers knowledge-based advice (quaternary) — match (a)-(iv), (b)-(iii), (c)-(ii), (d)-(i).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28067, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'The following are the beneficiaries of the integrated rural development program : (a) Minority farmers (b) Small landowner farmer (c) Landless agricultural labourers (d) Big farmers Which of the above statement/s are correct ?', '{"A": "Only (a)", "B": "(a) and (b)", "C": "(a), (b) and (c)", "D": "(a), (b) and (d)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Go with option C. IRDP targeted the rural poor — small and marginal farmers, landless agricultural labourers, and disadvantaged groups — not large landholders; big farmers were outside its beneficiary net.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28068, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Type of an Audit Programme may be ________.', '{"A": "Statutory", "B": "Permanent", "C": "Fixed or Flexible", "D": "Standard"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'On this one, option C is correct. An audit programme is planned as either fixed (standard steps for similar audits) or flexible (adapted case by case) — distinct from statutory mandate, permanence, or a single standard template.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28069, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '________ is a worlds largest ''Delta region'' of India.', '{"A": "Vrundavan", "B": "Rajmundri", "C": "Sundarban", "D": "Machhalipattan"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The examiner has marked option C. The Sundarbans delta — formed where the Ganga and Brahmaputra meet the Bay of Bengal — is the world''s largest delta and India''s best-known deltaic tract; Vrindavan, Rajahmundry, and Machilipatnam are towns, not that scale of delta.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28070, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Consider the following statements. (a) The purpose of Industrial Policy Resolution 1956 was to promote regional equality. (b) In 1955 the Village and Small Scale Industries Committee also called the Karve Committee. (c) In a small-scale industrial unit maximum investment allowed is rupees ten crore. Which of the statement/s given above is/are correct ?', '{"A": "(a) and (b)", "B": "(b) and (c)", "C": "(a) and (c)", "D": "All of the above"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Pick option A. IPR 1956 pushed licensed industrial growth to reduce regional imbalances, and the 1955 Karve Committee framed policy for village and small-scale industries — both (a) and (b) hold. Statement (c) is incorrect because the small-scale investment ceiling in syllabus years was far below ten crore.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28071, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Consider the following statements. (a) Maharashtra state has declared the organic farming policy in January 2013. (b) Maharashtra state has introduced Krishi Sanjeevani Yojana in 2011. (c) Maharashtra state has launched Agri-business Infrastructure Development Investment Programme with the assistance of world bank. Which of the statement/s given above is/are correct?', '{"A": "(a) and (b)", "B": "(b) and (c)", "C": "(a) and (c)", "D": "All of the above"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. Maharashtra announced its organic farming policy in January 2013 and rolled out Krishi Sanjeevani Yojana in 2011 — (a) and (b) stand. The World Bank-linked agri-business infrastructure line in (c) does not match the standard Maharashtra scheme list.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28072, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Consider the following statements. (a) Letter of credit is a primary function of commercial bank. (b) There is no difference between current account deposits and saving account deposits of a commercial bank. (c) Credit money is created by the central bank of a country. Which of the statement/s given above is/are incorrect?', '{"A": "(a) and (b)", "B": "(b) and (c)", "C": "(a) and (c)", "D": "All of the above"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Straight to the answer — option D. All three statements are wrong: accepting deposits and advancing loans are the core commercial-bank functions, not letter of credit alone; current and savings accounts differ in rules and interest; and credit money is created mainly through bank lending, not by the central bank printing notes.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28073, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which of the following thing is related to the Fiscal Policy in Indian Economy ?', '{"A": "Bank Rate", "B": "Tax and non Tax Revenue", "C": "Direct Action", "D": "Cash Reserve Ratio"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. Fiscal policy covers government tax and non-tax revenue plus public spending — bank rate and cash reserve ratio are monetary tools, and direct action is a central-bank market operation.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28074, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which commission performs the function of the distribution of financial resources at Central Level in India ?', '{"A": "Planning Commission", "B": "Finance Commission", "C": "Union Public Service Commission", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. The Finance Commission recommends how tax revenue is shared between the Union and the States — the Planning Commission planned development, and UPSC recruits civil servants.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28075, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which two of the following social factors are responsible to the high birth rate in India? (a) Poverty (b) Lower age at the time of marriage (c) Predominance of agriculture (d) Religious and social superstitions', '{"A": "(a) and (c)", "B": "(b) and (d)", "C": "(a) and (b)", "D": "(c) and (d)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. Early marriage widens the childbearing span, and deep-rooted religious and social customs favour larger families — (b) and (d) are the classic social drivers of high birth rates in India.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28076, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'How many types are of Government Budget ?', '{"A": "2", "B": "3", "C": "4", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Working through it, option B is the one. Government budgets are classified into three balance types — surplus (revenue exceeds spending), deficit (spending exceeds revenue), and balanced (both equal) — the standard trio in public-finance textbooks.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28077, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Literacy (Education) is mainly which type of the indicator of development ?', '{"A": "Human Resource Development", "B": "Geographical Development", "C": "Economic Development", "D": "Political Development"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Go with option A. Literacy/education measures human capital and skills — a human-resource development indicator — not purely geography, income alone, or political structure.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28078, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which economic problem creates in the economy due to "Deficit Finance" ?', '{"A": "Decrease in production", "B": "Loss to Banks", "C": "Increase in price level", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Pick option C. Deficit finance means spending beyond revenue by borrowing or printing money, which pumps extra purchasing power into the economy and tends to push up the general price level — inflation.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28079, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Consider the following statements : (a) World Trade Organisation was set up on 1 January 1995. (b) The purpose of WTO is to remove restrictions in international trade. (c) India is one of the founder member of WTO. Which of the statement/s given above is/are incorrect ?', '{"A": "(a) and (b)", "B": "(b) and (c)", "C": "(a) and (c)", "D": "None of these"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'On this one, option D is correct. WTO began on 1 January 1995 to liberalise world trade, and India was among the founding members — none of (a), (b), or (c) is incorrect.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28080, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'In which form "Density of population" can be measured ?', '{"A": "Per Hectors", "B": "Per Square Feet", "C": "Per Square Kilometer", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Straight to the answer — option C. Population density is always expressed as persons per square kilometre — the universal demographic unit; per hectare or per square foot are not standard census measures.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28081, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Match the following : (a) Gravity - (i) Coulomb/sec (b) Current - (ii) Ohms (c) Velocity - (iii) m/sec² (d) Resistance - (iv) m/sec', '{"A": "(a)-(ii), (b)-(i), (c)-(iv), (d)-(iii)", "B": "(a)-(iii), (b)-(i), (c)-(iv), (d)-(ii)", "C": "(a)-(iii), (b)-(iv), (c)-(ii), (d)-(i)", "D": "(a)-(iii), (b)-(iv), (c)-(i), (d)-(ii)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. Gravity is m/s², electric current is coulomb per second (ampere), velocity is m/s, and resistance is ohm — pair (a)-(iii), (b)-(i), (c)-(iv), (d)-(ii).', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28082, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'With reference to India which of the following is another important import item after crude oil ? (Economic Survey, 2016)', '{"A": "Electrical Machinery Apparatus and Appliances", "B": "Iron and Steel", "C": "Gold", "D": "Medical and Pharmaceutical"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The right pick is option C. Per the Economic Survey 2016, after crude oil, gold was India''s next major import by value — jewellery demand and safe-haven buying kept bullion high on the import bill.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28083, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'If the four colours on the carbon resistor are orange, blue, yellow and gold, the resistance value is ______.', '{"A": "46 × 10³ Ω", "B": "46 × 10⁴ Ω", "C": "36 × 10³ Ω", "D": "36 × 10⁴ Ω"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The verified answer here is option D. Colour bands: orange = 3, blue = 6, yellow = multiplier 10⁴, gold = ±5% tolerance — so resistance is 36 × 10⁴ Ω.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28084, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Out of the following which is not a planet ?', '{"A": "Pluto", "B": "Saturn", "C": "Uranus", "D": "Neptune"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'On this one, option A is correct. Pluto was reclassified as a dwarf planet in 2006; Saturn, Uranus, and Neptune remain the outer gas/ice giants in the eight-planet solar system.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28085, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which of the following resonating structure is not correct for CO₂ ?', '{"A": ":Ö=C=Ö: (two C=O double bonds)", "B": "⁻Ö-C≡O⁺ (single bond to left O with negative charge, triple bond to right O with positive charge)", "C": "⁺O≡C-Ö⁻ (triple bond to left O with positive charge, single bond to right O with negative charge)", "D": "⁻Ö-C⁺-Ö⁻ (single bonds to both oxygens, central C with positive charge, both oxygens with negative charge)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Go with option C. Valid CO₂ resonance keeps the carbon skeleton symmetric; the ⁺O≡C–O⁻ form with positive charge on oxygen breaks the usual electronegativity rule and is the structure examiners mark as incorrect.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28086, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Net dipole moment of carbon tetrachloride is zero because of ______.', '{"A": "Its planar structure", "B": "Its regular tetrahedral structure", "C": "Similar sizes of carbon and chlorine atoms", "D": "Similar electron affinities of carbon and chlorine"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. CCl₄ has a regular tetrahedral shape with four identical C–Cl bonds pointing symmetrically; the bond dipoles cancel out, so the net dipole moment is zero — planar structure (A) is wrong for carbon.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28087, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which one of the following statements regarding catalyst is not true ?', '{"A": "Catalyst decreases activation energy.", "B": "Catalyst reduces the time required for reaching the equilibrium state in the reaction.", "C": "Catalyst participate in the reaction and speed it up.", "D": "Catalyst is always in the same phase as the reactants and products."}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Pick option D. Catalysts can be homogeneous or heterogeneous — they need not sit in the same phase as reactants; solid catalysts in liquid reactions are everyday examples. Options A–C describe genuine catalytic effects.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28088, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Choose the correct alternative about the shark : (a) Mouth on ventral side (b) Viviparity (c) Cycloid scales (d) Cartilaginous endoskeleton', '{"A": "(a), (b) and (d)", "B": "(a) and (c) only", "C": "(b) and (d) only", "D": "Only (d)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. Sharks have the mouth on the ventral side, a cartilaginous skeleton, and many species are viviparous; they bear placoid scales, not cycloid scales — so (c) drops out.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28089, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Some statements are given below about animals. (a) All vertebrates are chordates. (b) All birds fly in the air. (c) All insects are parasites. (d) All molluscs bear shell. Which of the statement given above is/are correct ?', '{"A": "Only (b) and (c)", "B": "Only (a)", "C": "Only (c) and (d)", "D": "Only (b)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. Every vertebrate belongs to phylum Chordata, so (a) alone holds; not all birds fly, not all insects are parasites, and not all molluscs have a shell.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28090, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Select correct alternative in the place of question mark. Cockroach : Malpighian tubules :: Earthworm : ?', '{"A": "Typhlosole", "B": "Clitellum", "C": "Kidney", "D": "Nephridium"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Straight to the answer — option D. Malpighian tubules are the excretory organs in cockroach; in earthworm the same role is played by nephridia — typhlosole and clitellum serve other functions.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28091, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Bryophytes differ from pteridophytes in being ______', '{"A": "Vascular", "B": "Seeded", "C": "Non-vascular", "D": "Sporophytic"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The examiner has marked option C. Bryophytes lack true vascular tissue (xylem and phloem), whereas pteridophytes are vascular; that non-vascular trait is the basic difference the stem asks for.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28092, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Which pesticide is used to control powdery mildew ? (a) Bordo mixture (b) Sulphur (c) Endosulphon (d) Alum Which of the option given above is/are correct ?', '{"A": "(a) and (b) only", "B": "(b) only", "C": "(c) only", "D": "(d) only"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. Bordo mixture and sulphur are standard fungicides against powdery mildew; endosulphon is mainly an insecticide and alum is not the usual choice here.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28093, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Who proposed the natural system of classification of plants ?', '{"A": "Engler and Prantle", "B": "Bessey", "C": "Benthom and Hooker", "D": "Takhtajan"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Straight to the answer — option C. Bentham and Hooker''s natural system of classification (Genera Plantarum) is the classic answer; Engler–Prantl used a phylogenetic arrangement, not the natural system label.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28094, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Coliforms are used as indicator organisms of sewage pollution because :', '{"A": "They are pathogens.", "B": "They ferment lactose.", "C": "They are abundant in human intestine.", "D": "They grow within 48 hrs."}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. Coliform bacteria live in large numbers in the human intestine; finding them in water signals faecal contamination — the key marks abundance in the gut as the reason, not pathogenicity alone.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28095, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'The basic difference in the DNA and RNA is with respect to :', '{"A": "The type of sugar and the type of nitrogenous base.", "B": "The type of sugar and phosphoric acid.", "C": "Type of nitrogenous base and phosphoric acid.", "D": "Type of sugar, type of nitrogenous base and number of strands (single or double stranded)."}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option D. DNA has deoxyribose, commonly double-stranded, with thymine; RNA has ribose, is usually single-stranded, and carries uracil instead of thymine — sugar, base, and strand number all differ.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28096, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'The first transposons were discovered in Zea Mays, in 1948, by ______.', '{"A": "Barbara McClintock", "B": "Kary Mullis", "C": "Stanley Cohen", "D": "Herbert Boyer"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. Barbara McClintock discovered transposable elements (transposons) in maize (Zea mays) in 1948; Mullis, Cohen, and Boyer belong to PCR and recombinant-DNA work.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28097, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Study given information and conclusions based on it. Select logically correct conclusion/s. Four men are waiting at the airport. Two are doctors and the other two are businessman. Two speak Gujarati and two speak Tamil. Two are Muslims and two are Christen. No two men of the same profession are of same religion nor do they speak same language. The Tamil speaking doctor is a Christen. Conclusions : (I) Christen business man speaks Gujarati. (II) Gujarati speaking doctor is Muslim.', '{"A": "Only (I)", "B": "Only (II)", "C": "Both (I) and (II)", "D": "Neither (I) nor (II)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. The Tamil-speaking doctor is Christian, so the Gujarati-speaking doctor must be Muslim; no two doctors share religion or language. Conclusion (II) follows; (I) about the Christian businessman speaking Gujarati is not forced.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28098, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Study given information : Persons A, B, C, D and E are sitting on benches in the garden facing north. B is 50 m to the right of D, A is 60 m to the south of B. C is 40 m to the west of D, and E is 80 m to the north of A. Select most appropriate option that describes approximate minimum distance between C and E in metres.', '{"A": "It must be definitely greater than 110 m.", "B": "It must be definitely most nearest to 92 m.", "C": "It must be definitely most nearest to 91 m.", "D": "It must be definitely less than 110 m."}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. Plot the positions: C at (−40, 0) and E at (50, 20), so distance = √(90² + 20²) ≈ 92.2 m — nearest to 92 m among the choices.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28099, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'A is a daughter of B, C is a sister of A, B is a daughter of D and E is a brother of C. So what is the relation between E and D ?', '{"A": "Brother and sister", "B": "Daughter and mother", "C": "Grand mother and grand daughter", "D": "Grand son and grand mother"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The verified answer here is option D. A and C are daughters of B; E is their brother, so E is B''s son; B is D''s daughter — hence E is D''s grandson and D is E''s grandmother.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28100, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'By subtracting 5 from a number and dividing it by 7, the answer obtained is 2. Then find the value, by subtracting 4 from the same number and dividing it by 3.', '{"A": "5", "B": "6", "C": "7", "D": "8"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. (x − 5) ÷ 7 = 2 gives x = 19; then (19 − 4) ÷ 3 = 5 — work the first equation for x before substituting into the second.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
INSERT INTO pyq_questions (id, topic, subject, exam, year, question, options, correct, explanation, tags, difficulty)
VALUES
  (28101, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Among participants gathered for seminar 32 persons drink tea, 35 persons drink coffee and 22 persons drink tea and coffee. Select the number of persons gathered for seminar.', '{"A": "44", "B": "41", "C": "55", "D": "45"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option C. By inclusion–exclusion: 32 + 35 − 22 = 45 persons in the seminar — some drink only tea, only coffee, or both.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28102, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Ajinkya, Ramesh and Vaibhav got first, second and third rank. But not in this sequence. After asking them they replied two answers each. Out of which one is true and other is false. But not in the same sequence. Their answers are as following. Ramesh : I got first rank. Ajinkya got second rank. Vaibhav : I got first rank. Ramesh got second rank. Ajinkya : I got first rank. Ramesh got third rank. Which is not the rank of Ajinkya ?', '{"A": "First", "B": "Second", "C": "Third", "D": "Can''t say definitely"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. Each boy makes one true and one false claim; the consistent ranking is Vaibhav first, Ajinkya second, Ramesh third — so Ajinkya cannot be first.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28103, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'A, B, C and D are working on Mark''s farm. He gave in all twenty watermelons to all of them. One of them got two, another one got four, third one got six, and fourth one got eight. A got more melons than B and D got fewer melons than C. If C gets at least two more melons than D then select the statement/s that is always true. (a) A will always get more melons than C. (b) C will never have melons equal to that of A. (c) It is not possible for D to get more melons than any other person working with him. (d) B will always get fewer melons than A.', '{"A": "Either (a) or (b)", "B": "All", "C": "None", "D": "Only (d)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. Melons are fixed at 2, 4, 6, and 8; the stem already says A gets more than B, so B always gets fewer than A. A need not beat C, and D can hold 6 while another gets 8.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28104, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'A survey conducted among 480 students of two colleges C₁ and C₂ regarding the type of computers they use, resulted in the following data (table), with partial information. It is known that the ratio of number of students of C₁ and that of C₂ is 9 : 7. College | Desktop | Laptop | Both | None C₁ | — | — | — | 15 C₂ | 120 | — | 30 | — Total | — | 195 | 70 | 40 How many students of college C₁ have at least one system?', '{"A": "195", "B": "90", "C": "315", "D": "255"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Straight to the answer — option D. Total 480 in ratio 9: 7 gives C₁ = 270; with 15 students in C₁ having no system, at least one system = 270 − 15 = 255.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28105, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Choose the proper option for replacing question mark in the given number series. 4, 13, 38, __?__, 168, 289, 458', '{"A": "72", "B": "87", "C": "103", "D": "129"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. Successive odd-square jumps: +9, +25, +49, +81 … (3², 5², 7², 9²), so 38 + 49 = 87; the next steps 87 + 81 = 168 and 168 + 121 = 289 confirm it.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28106, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Two poles of equal heights are standing opposite each on either side of the road, which is 80 m wide. From a point between them on the road, the angle of elevation of the top of the poles are 60° and 30°, respectively. What is the height of the poles?', '{"A": "20 m", "B": "20√3 m", "C": "60 m", "D": "60√3 m"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Working through it, option B is the one. Equal poles, 80 m apart: if the point is 20 m from one base, height = 20 tan 60° = 20√3 m — the 60° and 30° angles fix the same height.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28107, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Sameer has purchased an old T.V. for ₹ 4,700 and spent ₹ 800 for its repairing. He sold it for ₹ 5,800. Find his percentage profit.', '{"A": "4 4/7%", "B": "5 5/11%", "C": "10%", "D": "12%"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. Total cost = ₹4,700 + ₹800 = ₹5,500; profit = ₹300; profit % = (300 ÷ 5500) × 100 = 5⁵⁄₁₁%.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28108, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Find the value of x in the following sequence. 3, 7, 15, 31, x, 127, 255, 511', '{"A": "59", "B": "60", "C": "62", "D": "63"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Straight to the answer — option D. Each term is double the previous plus one: 31 × 2 + 1 = 63; the chain 63 → 127 → 255 → 511 follows the same rule.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28109, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'The present ages of Swati and Priti are in the ratio 3 : 5. After 7 years they will be in the ratio 11 : 16. The present age of Priti is :', '{"A": "15 years", "B": "25 years", "C": "11 years", "D": "40 years"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. Present ages 3x and 5x; after 7 years (3x + 7)/(5x + 7) = 11/16 gives x = 5, so Priti''s present age = 5 × 5 = 25 years.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28110, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'The difference between the compound interest and simple interest for 2 years at 4% p.a. on a certain sum is ₹ 8. Find the sum.', '{"A": "₹ 3,000", "B": "₹ 4,000", "C": "₹ 5,000", "D": "₹ 6,000"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. For 2 years, CI − SI = P × (R/100)² = P × 0.0016; setting 8 = 0.0016P gives P = ₹5,000.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28111, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'Select logically appropriate triangular image without changing its position in the plane or flipping for completing hexagonal image having one part concealed. [Figure: A hexagon divided into six equilateral triangles; one triangle is concealed (cross-hatched). The remaining five triangles each show three symbols at the vertices — a solid black diamond, a hollow white diamond, and a curved clockwise arrow — in a rotational pattern. Four answer choices show candidate triangles with the same three symbols arranged differently.]', '{"A": "Option (1) in figure", "B": "Option (2) in figure", "C": "Option (3) in figure", "D": "Option (4) in figure"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A (Option 1 in the figure). The concealed triangle must carry the same three vertex symbols — solid diamond, hollow diamond, and clockwise arrow — in the rotation that completes the hexagonal pattern; without the printed diagram, follow the official answer for scoring.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28112, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'योग्य कथने ओळखा : (पद्म पुरस्कार, 2019) (a) तिजनबाई आणि अनिल कुमार नाईक यांना पद्म विभूषण पुरस्काराने सन्मानित करण्यात आले. (b) धरमपाल गुलटी आणि बचेंद्री पाल यांना पद्म भूषण पुरस्काराने सन्मानित करण्यात आले. (c) एस. थिमक्का आणि देवेंद्र स्वरूप यांना पद्म भूषण पुरस्काराने सन्मानित करण्यात आले. (d) मनोज वाजपेयी आणि सुदाम काटे यांना पद्मश्री पुरस्काराने सन्मानित करण्यात आले.', '{"A": "फक्त (a), (b)", "B": "फक्त (c), (d)", "C": "फक्त (a), (b), (d)", "D": "फक्त (a), (c), (d)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. Padma Vibhushan 2019 — Teejan Bai, Anil Manibhai Naik; Padma Bhushan — Dharampal Gulati, Bachendri Pal; Padma Shri — Manoj Bajpayee, Sudam Kate. विधान (c) चुकीचे; Saalumarada Thimmakka आणि Devendra Swarup यांना Padma Shri मिळाला, Padma Bhushan नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28113, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'कझाखस्तानच्या पहिल्या राष्ट्रपतीच्या सन्मानार्थ, कझाखस्तानची पूर्व राजधानी ''अस्ताना'' चे नाव राष्ट्रपतीच्या नावाने बदलण्यात आली आहे. नव्या राजधानीचे नाव _______ आहे.', '{"A": "नूरसुल्तान", "B": "टोकायाव", "C": "नजरबायेव", "D": "जोमार्त"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. March 2019 मध्ये Kazakhstan ने Astana हे नाव बदलून Nursultan ठेवले — पहिल्या राष्ट्राध्यक्ष Nursultan Nazarbayev यांच्या सन्मानार्थ. Tokayev नंतर राष्ट्राध्यक्ष; Nazarbayev हे व्यक्तीचे नाव, नवीन राजधानीचे नाव नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28114, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '''ग्रीन पीस अॅण्ड एअर व्हिज्युअल अनॅलिसिस ऑफ पोल्यूशन'' अहवालामध्ये जगातील सर्वाधिक प्रदूषित शहरे जाहीर करण्यात आली. त्यापैकी 30 सर्वाधिक प्रदूषित शहरांमध्ये 22 शहरे भारतातील आहेत. खालील शहरे वायु प्रदूषणाच्या क्रमवारीत चढत्या क्रमाने लावा. (a) दिल्ली (b) नोएडा (c) गुरूग्राम (d) गाझियाबाद', '{"A": "(a), (b), (d), (c)", "B": "(c), (d), (b), (a)", "C": "(b), (a), (d), (c)", "D": "(c), (d), (a), (b)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय B चिन्हांकित केला. Greenpeace आणि AirVisual च्या 2018 World Air Quality Report नुसार Gurugram, Ghaziabad, Noida, Delhi या चारही शहरे जगातील सर्वाधिक प्रदूषित शहरांमध्ये होती — अधिकृत उत्तर नुसार वाढत्या rank क्रमाने Gurugram → Ghaziabad → Noida → Delhi. प्रदूषण ranking दरवर्षी बदलते; 2018 अहवालातील क्रम MPSC ने अपेक्षित केला.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28115, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'अयोग्य कथन ओळखा - (सोल शांतता पुरस्कार)', '{"A": "पंतप्रधान नरेंद्र मोदी यांना ''सोल शांतता पुरस्काराने'' सन्मानित करण्यात आले.", "B": "नरेंद्र मोदी यांनी दोन लाख डॉलर (पुरस्कार रक्कम) नमामी गंगे मोहिमेस दान केले.", "C": "सोल शांतता पुरस्कार 1995 पासून सुरू झाला.", "D": "कोफी अन्नान, अँजेला मर्केल हे सुद्धा सोल शांतता पुरस्काराचे मानकरी होते."}'::jsonb, 'C', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय C. Narendra Modi यांनी Seoul Peace Prize 2018 जिंकले आणि रक्कम Namami Gange ला दिली; Kofi Annan, Angela Merkel यांसारखे विजेते. फसवणूक विधान (c) — हा पुरस्कार 1990 मध्ये सुरू, 1995 नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28116, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '______ हे 100 सिंगल टाईटल जिंकणारे दुसरे पुरुष टेनिस खेळाडू बनले आहे.', '{"A": "स्टेफनोस त्सित्सिपा", "B": "राफेल नदाल", "C": "रॉजर फेडरर", "D": "आंद्रे आगासी"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. Roger Federer Open Era मध्ये 100 ATP singles titles गाठणारा दुसरा पुरुष होता — Jimmy Connors नंतर. Nadal, Tsitsipas सक्रिय प्रतिस्पर्धी, पण प्रश्नाच्या वेळी century mark पार केले नव्हते.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28117, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'जोड्या लावा : ग्रंथ - लेखक (a) कॅपिटल इन द ट्वेन्टी फर्स्ट सेंच्युरी - (i) कॅरोलिन क्रायडो पेरेझ (b) पॉकेट पिकेटी - (ii) केविन ओरोर्की (c) अ शॉर्ट हिस्ट्री ऑफ ब्रेक्झिट - (iii) जेस्पर रॉईन (d) इनव्हिजिबल वुमेन - एक्सपोजिंग अ डाटा बायस इन अ वर्ल्ड डिझाइन फॉर मेन - (iv) थॉमस पिकेटी', '{"A": "(a)-(i), (b)-(ii), (c)-(iii), (d)-(iv)", "B": "(a)-(iv), (b)-(iii), (c)-(ii), (d)-(i)", "C": "(a)-(ii), (b)-(iii), (c)-(i), (d)-(iv)", "D": "(a)-(iii), (b)-(iv), (c)-(i), (d)-(ii)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. Thomas Piketty — ''Capital in the Twenty-First Century''; Jesper Roine — ''Pocket Piketty''; Kevin O''Rourke — ''A Short History of Brexit''; Caroline Criado Perez — ''Invisible Women''. काही नावे loosely लिहिलेली; ओळखीच्या शीर्षकांवरून जुळवा.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28118, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'योग्य कथन/ने ओळखा : (a) पकयांग विमानतळ हे हिमालयीन राज्यातील पहिले विमानतळ आहे. (b) पकयांग विमानतळ हे भारतातील 100 वे विमानतळ आहे.', '{"A": "फक्त (a)", "B": "फक्त (b)", "C": "(a) आणि (b) दोन्ही", "D": "(a) आणि (b) दोन्हीही नाही"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय B चिन्हांकित केला. Sikkim मधील Pakyong Airport (September 2018) भारताचे 100 वे operational airport म्हणून साजरे. विधान (a) अतिशयोक्ती — Jammu & Kashmir, Himachal यांसारख्या Himalayan राज्यांना आधीच विमानतळ होते.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28119, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'प्रस्तावित बुलेट ट्रेन शी संबंधित कोणते विधान/ने चुकीचे आहे/त? (a) मुंबई - अहमदाबाद दरम्यान द्रुत गति रेल्वे प्रकल्प (b) जपान कडून तांत्रिक साहाय्य आणि स्वस्त कर्ज (c) निर्माण काळात 20,000 लोकांना रोजगार मिळणार (d) प्रकल्पासाठी संपूर्ण कर्ज विश्व बँक देणार', '{"A": "(a) आणि (d)", "B": "केवळ (d)", "C": "(b) आणि (d)", "D": "(b) आणि (c)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. Mumbai–Ahmedabad bullet train Japan च्या मदतीचा high-speed प्रकल्प; बांधकामात हजारो रोजगार. फक्त विधान (d) चुकीचे — finance मुख्यत्वे Japan कडून, World Bank चे full loan नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28120, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'जोड्या लावा : (91 वा ऑस्कर पुरस्कार) वर्गवारी - चित्रपट (a) उत्कृष्ट चित्रपट - (i) बाओ (b) उत्कृष्ट लघुचित्रपट - (ii) रोमा (c) उत्कृष्ट अॅनिमेटेड लघुचित्रपट - (iii) ग्रीन बुक (d) उत्कृष्ट परकीय चित्रपट - (iv) स्कीन', '{"A": "a-III, b-IV, c-I, d-II", "B": "a-III, b-I, c-IV, d-II", "C": "a-III, b-II, c-I, d-IV", "D": "a-III, b-IV, c-II, d-I"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय A येतो. 91 व्या Oscars — ''Green Book'' Best Picture, ''Skin'' Best Live Action Short, ''Bao'' Best Animated Short, ''Roma'' Best Foreign Language Film. Best Picture आणि Best Foreign Film ही जोडी विद्यार्थी चुकवतात.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28121, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '19 वर्षाखालील क्रिकेट वर्ल्ड कप भारताने 2018 साली जिंकला. भारताच्या 19 वर्षाखालील संघाने हा विश्वचषक कितव्यांदा मिळवला आहे ?', '{"A": "तिसऱ्यांदा", "B": "चौथ्यांदा", "C": "पाचव्यांदा", "D": "यापैकी नाही"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय B. भारतीय Under-19 संघाने 2018 मध्ये New Zealand मध्ये World Cup जिंकला — 2000, 2008, 2012 नंतरचे चौथे विजय. Third किंवा fifth जवळ वाटते, पण एक edition चुकते.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28122, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'ॲन्टोनिओ गुटेरेस इतक्यात बातम्यांमध्ये होते. त्यांच्याबाबत काय खरे नाही ? (a) ते 1995 - 2001 मध्ये पोर्तुगालचे पंतप्रधान होते. (b) जून 2005 पासून डिसेंबर 2015 पर्यंत त्यांनी संयुक्त राष्ट्राच्या शरणार्थी विभागात उच्च आयुक्त पदी कार्य केले. (c) प्रथम युरोपियन युनियन-अफ्रिका शिखर परिषदेचे ते उपाध्यक्ष होते. (d) त्यांनी पोर्तुगीज शरणार्थी परिषदेची स्थापना केली.', '{"A": "(a), (b)", "B": "(b), (c)", "C": "(c), (d)", "D": "वरीलपैकी नाही"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय D. Antonio Guterres — Portugal चे PM (1995–2002), UNHCR (2005–2015), पहिल्या EU–Africa Summit चे co-chair, Portuguese Refugee Council ची स्थापनेत भूमिका — प्रश्नातील सर्व विधाने बरोबर. MPSC sitting UN Secretary-General ची माहिती विचारते.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28123, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '''राज्य निर्वाचन आयोगाबाबत'' खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या : (a) ग्रामीण व शहरी स्थानिक संस्था सदस्यांद्वारे निवडण्यात येणाऱ्या महाराष्ट्र विधान परिषदेतील सदस्यांच्या निवडणुकीसह ग्रामीण व शहरी स्थानिक संस्थांच्या निवडणुका याद्वारे घेतल्या जातात. (b) राज्य निर्वाचन आयुक्तांची नियुक्ती जरी राज्यपाल करीत असले तरी ते राज्य निर्वाचन आयुक्तांना पदावरून दूर करू शकत नाही.', '{"A": "विधान (a) बरोबर आहे.", "B": "विधान (b) बरोबर आहे.", "C": "दोन्हीही विधाने बरोबर आहेत.", "D": "दोन्हीही विधाने चुकीची आहेत."}'::jsonb, 'B', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय B चिन्हांकित केला. State Election Commissioner Governor appoint करतो, पण Governor चya इच्छेने काढता येत नाही — High Court judge सारखी कठोर प्रक्रिया. विधान (a) चुकीचे — SEC पंचायत/नगर polls चालवते, local bodies मधून Legislative Council निवड नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28124, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'कम्बाइन्ड डिफेन्स सर्व्हिसेस परीक्षेत, 2018 मध्ये देशात मुलींमध्ये प्रथम आलेली श्रुती श्रीखंडे ही महाराष्ट्रातील खालीलपैकी कोणत्या शहराची रहिवासी आहे ?', '{"A": "पुणे", "B": "मुंबई", "C": "रत्नागिरी", "D": "नाशिक"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. Shruti Shrikhande (Pune) Combined Defence Services Examination 2018 मध्ये महिलांमध्ये अव्वल — त्या वर्षी Maharashtra च्या बातम्या. Ratnagiri, Mumbai, Nashik state-specific current-affairs साठी वाजवी फसवणुका.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28125, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या : (a) राज्यपाल हा राज्य विधानमंडळाचा एकात्मिक भाग नाही. (b) राज्यपालास कार्यकाळाची सुरक्षितता नसते. (c) राज्यपालास केव्हाही राष्ट्रपती पदावरून हटवू शकतो. (d) राज्यपालास राष्ट्रपती कोणत्या कारणास्तव पदावरून हटवू शकतो याबाबत राज्यघटनेत कोणताही उल्लेख नाही.', '{"A": "वरील सर्व विधाने बरोबर आहेत.", "B": "विधाने (a), (b), (c) बरोबर आहेत.", "C": "विधाने (b), (c), (d) बरोबर आहेत.", "D": "विधाने (a) आणि (d) बरोबर आहेत."}'::jsonb, 'C', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय C. Governor ला fixed tenure नाही; President च्या pleasure वर; Constitution मध्ये removal grounds नमूद नाहीत. विधान (a) चुकीचे — Article 168 नुसार Governor State Legislature चा अविभाज्य भाग.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28126, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'सरकारिया आयोगाच्या शिफारशीबाबत खालीलपैकी कोणती शिफारस ही चुकीची नमूद करण्यात आलेली आहे ?', '{"A": "आयोगाने राज्यसभेची भूमिका आणि राज्यांच्या पुनर्रचनेच्या केंद्राच्या अधिकारात बदलासाठी अनुकूलता दाखविली होती.", "B": "आयोगाने राज्यघटनेच्या अनुच्छेद-356 चा अगदी क्वचितच वापराबाबत अनुकूलता दाखविली होती.", "C": "आयोगाने राज्यपाल पद संपुष्टात आणावे ही मागणी फेटाळली होती.", "D": "आयोगाने तीन भाषा सूत्राच्या अंमलबजावणीस अनुकूलता दाखविली होती."}'::jsonb, 'A', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय A येतो. Sarkaria Commission (1983) — Article 356 sparing वापर, Governor पद रद्द करण्याची मागणी नाकारली, three-language formula समर्थन. Rajya Sabha ची भूमिका किंवा Centre चे states reorganise करण्याचे अधिकार बदलण्याची शिफारस नाही — ते option चुकीच्या attributions.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28127, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'स्पाईसजेट, भारतातील पहिली वाजवी दराची/स्वस्त विमान कंपनी आता IATA शी जोडली गेली आहे. IATA चा अर्थ _______ होतो.', '{"A": "इंटरनॅशनल एअर ट्रॅव्हल असोसिएशन", "B": "इंडियन एअर ट्रॅव्हल असोसिएशन", "C": "इंटरनॅशनल एअर ट्रान्सपोर्ट असोसिएशन", "D": "इंडियन एअर ट्रान्सपोर्ट असोसिएशन"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'पर्याय C निवडा. IATA म्हणजे International Air Transport Association — airlines ची global trade body. SpiceJet first Indian low-cost member 2019 चya बातम्या; ''Travel'' ऐवजी ''Transport'' सामान्य फसवणूक.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28128, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '''मिशन इंद्रधनुष्य'' खालीलपैकी कशाशी संबंधित आहे?', '{"A": "लसीकरण", "B": "जल संवर्धन", "C": "कृत्रिम पाऊस", "D": "जलसिंचन"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय A. Mission Indradhanush Union Health Ministry चा intensified immunisation drive — न लसीकरण/अपूर्ण लसीकरण असलेल्या मुलांसाठी आणि गर्भवती महिलांसाठी. Water conservation, cloud seeding, irrigation वेगळ्या missions.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28129, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'यंदाच्या वर्षी 2018 आणि 2019 दोन्ही वर्षांचे नोबेल पारितोषिक _______ श्रेणीत दिले जाईल.', '{"A": "शांती", "B": "रसायनशास्त्र", "C": "औषध", "D": "साहित्य"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. Swedish Academy ने misconduct scandal मुळे 2018 चा Nobel Literature Prize स्थगित केला; 2018 आणि 2019 दोघे 2019 मध्ये एकत्र दिले. Peace, Chemistry, Medicine सामान्य single-year वेळापत्रक.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28130, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'जोड्या जुळवा : व्यक्ती - भूमिका (a) डॉ. सच्चिदानंद सिन्हा - (i) उद्दिष्टांचा ठराव (b) डॉ. राजेंद्र प्रसाद - (ii) घटना परिषदेचे संवैधानिक सल्लागार (c) सर. बि. एन. राव - (iii) घटना परिषदेचे कायमस्वरूपी अध्यक्ष (d) जवाहरलाल नेहरू - (iv) घटना परिषदेचे तात्पुरते अध्यक्ष', '{"A": "(a)-(i), (b)-(ii), (c)-(iii), (d)-(iv)", "B": "(a)-(iv), (b)-(iii), (c)-(i), (d)-(ii)", "C": "(a)-(iii), (b)-(iv), (c)-(ii), (d)-(i)", "D": "(a)-(iv), (b)-(iii), (c)-(ii), (d)-(i)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय D. Dr Sachchidanand Sinha — temporary (first) President; Dr Rajendra Prasad — permanent President; Sir B.N. Rau — constitutional advisor; Jawaharlal Nehru — Objectives Resolution. Sinha आणि Nehru चya roles अदलबदल — सामान्य जोड्या जुळवा फसवणूक.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28131, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'खालीलपैकी कोणती विधाने योग्य आहेत ? (a) विधान परिषद निर्माण करण्यासाठी संबंधित राज्याच्या विधान सभेने हजर राहून मतदान करणाऱ्या सदस्यांच्या 2/3 बहुमताने ठराव पास करणे आवश्यक आहे. (b) विधान परिषद निर्माण करण्यासाठी संसदेत 2/3 सदस्यांच्या बहुमताने ठराव पारीत करणे गरजेचे आहे.', '{"A": "फक्त (a)", "B": "फक्त (b)", "C": "(a) आणि (b) दोन्ही", "D": "वरीलपैकी एकही नाही"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. Article 169 — Legislative Council निर्मितीपूर्वी राज्य विधानसभेने present and voting सदस्यांच्या two-thirds बहुमत resolution आवश्यक. Parliament कायदा करते, पण (b) सारखी Parliament ची स्वतंत्र two-thirds resolution गरज नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28132, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'जोड्या जुळवा : अनुच्छेद क्रमांक - विषय (a) 243 क - (i) पंचायतींच्या निवडणुका (b) 243 घ - (ii) पंचायतींची स्थापना (c) 243 ख - (iii) ग्रामसभा (d) 243 ट - (iv) जागांचे आरक्षण', '{"A": "(a)-(iii), (b)-(iv), (c)-(i), (d)-(ii)", "B": "(a)-(ii), (b)-(iv), (c)-(iii), (d)-(i)", "C": "(a)-(iii), (b)-(iv), (c)-(ii), (d)-(i)", "D": "(a)-(i), (b)-(ii), (c)-(iii), (d)-(iv)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. Article 243A — Gram Sabha; 243B — Panchayats constitution; 243D — reservation; 243K — Panchayats elections. 243B elections आणि 243K constitution mix — सामान्य फसवणूक.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28133, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'राज्याच्या महाधिवक्ता आपल्या पदाचा राजीनामा कोणाकडे सोपवितो ?', '{"A": "राज्याच्या उच्च न्यायालयाचा मुख्य न्यायाधीश", "B": "संबंधित राज्याचा राज्यपाल", "C": "भारताचा राष्ट्रपती", "D": "संबंधित राज्याचा मुख्यमंत्री"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. राज्याचे Advocate General Governor च्या pleasure वर; राजीनामा Governor ला — appoint करणारा authority. Chief Minister, Chief Justice, President उच्च पद, पण या resignation चे constitutional addressee नाहीत.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28134, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'भारतीय राज्यघटनेच्या अनुच्छेद-39 मध्ये खालीलपैकी कोणती/कोणत्या तरतूद/तरतुदींचा समावेश नाही ? (a) पुरुष व स्त्रिया या दोघांनाही समान कामाबद्दल समान वेतन. (b) ग्रामपंचायतींचे संघटन. (c) लोक कल्याणाच्या संवर्धनासाठी समाज व्यवस्था प्रस्थापित करणे. (d) उपजीविकेचे पुरेसे साधन मिळण्याचा हक्क स्त्री व पुरुष नागरिकांना सारखाच असावा.', '{"A": "फक्त (a)", "B": "(b) आणि (c)", "C": "फक्त (d)", "D": "(a) आणि (c)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय B. Article 39 — adequate livelihood, equal pay for equal work ((a), (d)). Village panchayats Article 40; welfare social order Article 38 चा broader thrust, Article 39 नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28135, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'भारतीय राज्यघटनेच्या अनुच्छेद-32 अन्वये खालीलपैकी कोणत्या प्रकारच्या आदेशाची तरतूद सुस्पष्टपणे केलेली नाही ?', '{"A": "निषेधाज्ञा", "B": "प्रतिषेध", "C": "अधिकार-पृच्छा", "D": "उत्प्रेक्षण"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. Article 32 — पाच writs: habeas corpus, mandamus, prohibition, quo warranto, certiorari. ''Injunction'' ordinary civil law मधील remedy, Article 32 मधील पाच constitutional writs पैकी नाही.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28136, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'इ.स. 1852 मध्ये महाराष्ट्रात स्थापन झालेली पहिली राजकीय संघटना कोणती होती ?', '{"A": "बॉम्बे असोसिएशन", "B": "ईस्ट इंडिया असोसिएशन", "C": "सार्वजनिक सभा", "D": "बॉम्बे प्रेसिडेन्सी असोसिएशन"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय A. Bombay Association (1852) — Jagannath Shankar Seth व merchants — Maharashtra चे first political organisation म्हणून मोजले. East India Association London मध्ये नंतर; Sarvajanik Sabha, Bombay Presidency Association पुढच्या decades.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28137, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'प्रशासनावरील न्यायिक नियंत्रणाचा मुख्य उद्देश .......... हा असतो.', '{"A": "प्रशासकीय अंगाची मुखत्यारी आणि मनमानी काबूत ठेवणे", "B": "नागरिकांच्या तक्रारींचे निराकरण करण्यास साहाय्य करणे", "C": "नागरिकांच्या अधिकाराचे आणि स्वातंत्र्याचे रक्षण करणे", "D": "सरकारी अधिकाऱ्यांच्या चुकीच्या कृतींना आळा घालणे व शिक्षा करणे"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय C चिन्हांकित केला. प्रशासनावर judicial control मुख्यत्वे नागरिकांचे fundamental rights आणि liberty arbitrary official action पासून संरक्षित करते. Grievance redress, discretion check महत्त्वाचे परिणाम, पण rights-liberty safeguard हे primary objective.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28138, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'लॉर्ड डलहौसीच्या बाबत पुढीलपैकी कोणती विधाने बरोबर आहेत ? (a) रेल्वेयुग सुरू केले. (b) स्वतंत्र सार्वजनिक बांधकाम खाते निर्माण केले. (c) 1852 मध्ये तार विभागाची स्थापना केली. (d) 1854 मध्ये पोस्ट कायदा संमत करून टपाल तिकिटांची सुरूवात केली.', '{"A": "(a), (b) आणि (c) फक्त", "B": "(b), (c) आणि (d) फक्त", "C": "(a), (c) आणि (d) फक्त", "D": "वरील सर्व बरोबर"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय D येतो. Lord Dalhousie काळ railway age (1853 पहिली रेल्वे), independent Public Works Department, 1852 पासून telegraph network, आणि 1854 Post Office Act व postage stamps — प्रश्नातील चारही statements पाठ्यपुस्तकातील टप्पे.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28139, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'जॅक्सन खून खटल्यात कोणास फाशीची शिक्षा देण्यात आली ?', '{"A": "कृष्णाजी गोपाळ कर्वे, विनायक नारायण देशपांडे", "B": "ब्रम्हगिरी बुवा, गणेश वैद्य", "C": "दत्तात्रय पांडुरंग जोशी, सिद्धनाथ काणे", "D": "वामन फडके, निरंजन पाल"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय A. 1909 Jackson Murder case Nashik — Krishnaji Gopal Karve, Vinayak Narayan Deshpande Collector A. M. T. Jackson हत्या साठी फाशी. इतर name-pairs वेगळ्या conspiracy/martyr episodes.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28140, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'लोकनिंदा सहन करून आंधळ्या पांगळ्यांना व महारोग्यांना मलमपट्टी आणि औषधपाणी देण्याची सेवा कोणत्या सुधारकाने केली ?', '{"A": "डॉ. आनंदीबाई जोशी", "B": "अनुताई वाघ", "C": "भाऊ दाजी लाड", "D": "लोकहितवादी गोपाळ हरि देशमुख"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय D चिन्हांकित केला. Lokhitwadi Gopal Hari Deshmukh यांना Prabhakar मधील Lokhit लेखांसाठी टीका सहन करावी लागली, नंतर lame, blind, leprosy रुग्णांना direct seva. Anandibai Joshi, Anutai Wagh, Bhau Daji Lad medicine/civic philanthropy elsewhere.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28141, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'आधुनिक भारताचा पहिला राष्ट्रीय कवी कोण ?', '{"A": "डी.पी. तरखडकर", "B": "व्ही.डी. सावरकर", "C": "विनायक", "D": "एच.व्ही. डेरोझियो"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. Henry Louis Vivian Derozio — Young Bengal leader, ''To India — My Native Land'' — first national poet of modern India पाठ्यपुस्तकातील स्थान. Tarkhedkar, Savarkar, ''Vinayak'' Marathi-nationalist poetry; Anglo-Indian pioneer slot नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28142, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '1857 च्या उठावाचे परिणाम खालीलप्रमाणे होते. (a) कंपनीच्या शासनाचा शेवट (b) भारतीयांना प्रशासनात नोकऱ्या दिल्या नाहीत (c) स्वातंत्र्य आंदोलनास प्रेरणा (d) सैन्याची पुनर्रचना', '{"A": "(a), (b) आणि (c) फक्त", "B": "(b), (c) आणि (d) फक्त", "C": "(a), (c) आणि (d) फक्त", "D": "(a) आणि (b) फक्त"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'पर्याय C निवडा. 1857 uprising Company rule संपवले, freedom struggle प्रेरणा, military reorganisation — (a), (c), (d) बरोबर. (b) अधिकृत वाचन मध्ये odd out: post-1857 Indian recruitment काही extent वर, higher posts European.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28143, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'मुंबई येथे इ.स. 1867 मध्ये प्रार्थना समाजाची स्थापना कोणी केली ?', '{"A": "डॉ. आत्माराम पांडुरंग", "B": "गोपाळ हरी देशमुख", "C": "दादाभाई नौरोजी", "D": "डॉ. सीताराम देसाई"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय A. Dr. Atmaram Pandurang यांनी 1867 मध्ये Mumbai मध्ये Prarthana Samaj स्थापन — prayer-house reform, monotheism, women''s uplift. Gopal Hari Deshmukh (Lokhitwadi), Naoroji, Sitaram Desai इतर reform streams.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28144, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'ब्रिटिश काळात ''रयतवारी पद्धतीचा'' प्रारंभ कोणत्या प्रांतात झाला ?', '{"A": "मद्रास, मुंबई", "B": "बंगाल, पंजाब", "C": "कलकत्ता, नागपूर", "D": "दिल्ली, हिमाचल प्रदेश"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय A. Ryotwari (Rayatwari) settlement — cultivator–government direct revenue — Madras, Bombay presidencies. Bengal, Punjab zamindari/mahalwari systems.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28145, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'महर्षी विठ्ठल रामजी शिंदे यांचा कोणत्या सत्याग्रहात सहभाग होता ? (a) पर्वती सत्याग्रह (b) वाई गणपती मंदिर सत्याग्रह (c) वायकोम मंदिर सत्याग्रह (d) लक्ष्मी नारायण मंदिर सत्याग्रह', '{"A": "(a) आणि (c)", "B": "(b) आणि (c)", "C": "(a), (b) आणि (c)", "D": "(a), (b), (c) आणि (d)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. Maharshi Vitthal Ramji Shinde — Parvati Satyagraha, Wai Ganapati Mandir Satyagraha, Vaikom (Waykom) temple-entry — तीनही reform biography. Laxmi-Narayan Mandir Satyagraha अधिकृत trio मध्ये नाही.', '{"History","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28146, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'जोड्या जुळवा : अ. ताराबाई शिंदे - I. शारदा सदन ब. तान्हूबाई बिर्जे - II. हिंदू लेडीज सोशल क्लबची स्थापना क. पंडिता रमाबाई - III. स्त्री-पुरुष तुलना ग्रंथ ड. रमाबाई रानडे - IV. भारतातील पहिली महिला संपादक', '{"A": "अ-iv, ब-iii, क-ii, ड-i", "B": "अ-iii, ब-iv, क-i, ड-ii", "C": "अ-ii, ब-i, क-iv, ड-iii", "D": "अ-i, ब-iii, क-ii, ड-iv"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय B. Tarabai Shinde — ''Stri-Purush Tulana''; Tanhubai Birje — India''s first woman editor; Pandita Ramabai — Sharada Sadan; Ramabai Ranade — Hindu Ladies Social Club; a–iii, b–iv, c–i, d–ii.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28147, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '1935 च्या कायद्याविषयी कोणती विधाने बरोबर आहेत ? (a) अँग्लो इंडियन, भारतीय ख्रिश्चन, शिख हे मतदारसंघ तयार केले. (b) संघ न्यायालयाची स्थापना. (c) भारतीय उच्च आयुक्त पदाची निर्मिती. (d) ''दुहेरी शासनव्यवस्थेपेक्षा वाईट कायदा'' असे वर्णन राजगोपालाचारी यांनी केले.', '{"A": "(a), (b), (c) विधाने बरोबर आहेत.", "B": "(b), (c) विधाने बरोबर आहेत.", "C": "(a), (c) विधाने बरोबर आहेत.", "D": "(a), (b), (d) विधाने बरोबर आहेत."}'::jsonb, 'D', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय D चिन्हांकित केला. Government of India Act 1935 — Anglo-Indian, Indian Christian, Sikh constituencies, Federal Court, Rajagopalachari ''worse than dyarchy'' — (a), (b), (d). Indian High Commissioner 1919 Act; 1935 नाही — (c) बाहेर.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28148, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'खालीलपैकी कोणत्या नद्यांपासून जास्त जलविद्युत निर्मिती होते ?', '{"A": "पश्चिम घाटातील पश्चिम वाहिनी नद्या", "B": "दक्षिणेतील पूर्व वाहिनी नद्या", "C": "मध्य भारतातील नद्या", "D": "गंगेचे खोरे"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. East-flowing peninsular rivers — Krishna, Godavari, Kaveri — Western Ghats gradient व dam cascades मुळे installed hydel capacity जास्त. West-flowing Konkan streams लहान; Ganga valley, middle-India share comparatively कमी.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28149, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'भारतीय वैज्ञानिक अभ्यास परिषदेची स्थापना __________ येथे करण्यात आली.', '{"A": "दिल्ली", "B": "कलकत्ता", "C": "मद्रास", "D": "बेंगलोर"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय B. paper मधील ''Indian Council of scientific studies'' Indian Association for the Cultivation of Science (IACS) कडे — 1876 मध्ये Calcutta मध्ये Mahendra Lal Sircar यांनी स्थापन; C. V. Raman यांचे Nobel work येथेच. Delhi, Madras, Bangalore नंतरचे CSIR/IISc hubs — 1876 संघटना नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28150, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'मुलींची शाळा चालविण्यासाठी महात्मा ज्योतिबा फुले यांना खालीलपैकी कोणी सहकार्य केले होते ? (a) सखाराम यशवंत परांजपे, सदाशिव गोविंद हाटे (b) सदाशिव बल्लाळ गोवंडे, मोरो विठ्ठल वाळवेकर (c) विष्णुापंत थत्ते, केशव शिवराम भवाळकर (d) देवराव ठोसर, सौ. इ.सी. जोन्स', '{"A": "(a) आणि (b) फक्त", "B": "(a), (b) आणि (c) फक्त", "C": "(b), (c) आणि (d) फक्त", "D": "वरील सर्व बरोबर"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय D. Mahatma Jyotiba Phule girls'' schools — Paranjape–Hate, Govande–Valvekar, Thatte–Bhavalkar, Thosar–Mrs. E. C. Jones — चारही bundles Maharashtra school history मध्ये credit.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
