  (28184, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'खालीलपैकी कोणते विधान उत्प्रेरकासाठी योग्य पर्याय नाही ?', '{"A": "उत्प्रेरक ॲक्टिव्हेशन ऊर्जा कमी करतात.", "B": "उत्प्रेरक अभिक्रिया समतोल स्थितीत पोहोचण्यासाठी लागणारा वेळ कमी करते .", "C": "उत्प्रेरक अभिक्रियेत भाग घेतो आणि वेग वाढवितो.", "D": "अभिकारक, उत्पादन व उत्प्रेरक हे नेहमी सम प्रवस्थेत असतात."}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. Catalysts homogeneous/heterogeneous — reactants शी same phase नसतात; solid catalyst liquid reaction मध्ये common. A–C genuine catalytic effects.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28185, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'शार्कबाबत योग्य तो पर्याय निवडा : (a) अधर बाजूस मुख (b) जरायुज (c) सायकवॉईड खवले (d) कास्थीमय अंत:कंकाल', '{"A": "(a), (b) आणि (d)", "B": "फक्त (a) आणि (c)", "C": "फक्त (b) आणि (d)", "D": "फक्त (d)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय A येतो. Shark चे mouth ventral बाजू, cartilaginous skeleton, अनेक species viviparous; placoid scales — cycloid नाहीत — (c) बाहेर.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28186, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'कार्बन टेट्राक्लोराईडची डायपोल मोमेंट ______ मुळे शून्य आहे.', '{"A": "त्याचा समतल आकार", "B": "त्याचा रेग्युलर टेट्राहेड्रल आकार", "C": "कार्बन आणि क्लोरीनच्या अणूंचा सारखा आकारमान", "D": "कार्बन आणि क्लोरीनची इलेक्ट्रॉनची सारखी आसक्ती"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय B. CCl₄ चे regular tetrahedral आकार — चार समान C–Cl bonds सममितीने; bond dipoles cancel होतात, net dipole moment शून्य — planar structure (A) carbon साठी चुकीचे.', '{"Science","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28187, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'प्राण्यांच्या बाबतीत खाली काही विधाने दिली आहेत. (a) सर्व पृष्ठवंशीय प्राणी समपृष्ठरज्जू प्राणी आहेत. (b) सर्व प्रकारचे पक्षी हवेत उडतात. (c) सर्व किटक परपोपी आहेत. (d) सर्व मृदुकाय प्राणी कवचधारी आहेत. वरीलपैकी कोणते/ती विधान/विधाने बरोबर आहेत ?', '{"A": "फक्त (b) आणि (c)", "B": "फक्त (a)", "C": "फक्त (c) आणि (d)", "D": "फक्त (b)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय B. प्रत्येक vertebrate Chordata मध्ये — (a) एकटे बरोबर; सर्व birds उडत नाहीत, सर्व insects parasites नाहीत, सर्व molluscs ला shell नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28188, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'डीऑक्सीरायबोन्यूक्लीइक ॲसिड (DNA) व रायबोन्यूक्लीइक ॲसिड (RNA) यातील मूलभूत फरक खालीलप्रमाणे आहे.', '{"A": "शर्करेचा व नायट्रोजन बेसचा (क्षार) प्रकार.", "B": "शर्करेचा व फॉस्फोरिक आम्लाचा प्रकार.", "C": "(क्षार) नायट्रोजन बेसचा प्रकार आणि फॉस्फोरिक आम्लाचा प्रकार.", "D": "शर्करेचा प्रकार, (क्षार) नायट्रोजन बेसचा प्रकार आणि त्यातील धाग्यांची संख्या (एक वा दोन)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय D. DNA: deoxyribose, double-stranded, thymine; RNA: ribose, single-stranded, uracil — sugar, base आणि strand number तिन्ही वेगळे.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28189, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'ब्रायोफायटा ______ या बाबतीत टेरिडोफायटा पेक्षा वेगळे असतात.', '{"A": "वाहिनीयुक्त", "B": "बीजे", "C": "बिगर-वाहिनीयुक्त", "D": "बिजुकधारी"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय C चिन्हांकित केला. Bryophytes मध्ये true vascular tissue (xylem, phloem) नाही; pteridophytes vascular — non-vascular हा मूलभूत फरक.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28190, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'मनुष्य व प्राण्यांच्या आतड्यातले जीवजंतू हे मैला प्रदूषणाचे द्योतक आहेत कारण :', '{"A": "हे जंतू रोगकारक आहेत.", "B": "ते दुग्धशर्करेचे विघटन करतात.", "C": "ते मनुष्याच्या आतड्यात खूप मोठ्या संख्येने आढळून येतात.", "D": "ते 48 तासांत वाढतात."}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. Coliform bacteria human intestine मध्ये मोठ्या प्रमाणात; पाण्यात सापडल्यास faecal contamination — अधिकृत उत्तर human gut मधील abundance कारण म्हणते.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28191, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'वनस्पती वर्गीकरणाची नैसर्गिक पद्धत कोणी मांडली ?', '{"A": "एंजलर आणि प्रॅन्टल", "B": "बेस्सी", "C": "बेन्थम आणि हुकर", "D": "तक्ताजॅन"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय C. Bentham आणि Hooker यांची natural system (Genera Plantarum) — classic उत्तर; Engler–Prantl phylogenetic arrangement वापरतात.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28192, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'भुरी रोगाच्या नियंत्रणासाठी कोणत्या रोगनाशकाचा वापर करतात ? (a) बोर्डो मिश्रण (b) सल्फर (गंधक) (c) एन्डोस्ल्फॉन (d) तुरटी वरीलपैकी कोणता पर्याय/पर्याय बरोबर आहेत ?', '{"A": "(a) आणि (b) फक्त", "B": "(b) फक्त", "C": "(c) फक्त", "D": "(d) फक्त"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय A येतो. Bordo mixture आणि sulphur powdery mildew वर standard fungicides; endosulphon insecticide, alum येथे सामान्य निवड नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28193, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'प्रश्नचिन्हाच्या जागी योग्य पर्याय निवडा. झुरळ : माल्पिघिअन नलिका :: गांडूळ : ?', '{"A": "आचवलन", "B": "प्रमेखला", "C": "मूत्रपिंड", "D": "वृक्कक"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय D. Cockroach मध्ये Malpighian tubules excretory; earthworm मध्ये ती भूमिका nephridia — typhlosole आणि clitellum वेगळे काम.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28194, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'अजिंक्य, रमेश व वैभव यांना प्रथम, दुसरा व तिसरा क्रमांक मिळाला. पण क्रमाने नव्हे. त्यांना विचारले असता ते प्रत्येकी दोन उत्तरे देतात. त्यांपैकी एक खरे व दुसरे खोटे असते. पण त्याच क्रमाने नव्हे. त्यांची उत्तरे खालीलप्रमाणे आहेत. रमेश : मला प्रथम क्रमांक मिळाला. अजिंक्यला दुसरा क्रमांक मिळाला. वैभव : मला प्रथम क्रमांक मिळाला. रमेशला दुसरा क्रमांक मिळाला. अजिंक्य : मला प्रथम क्रमांक मिळाला, रमेशला तिसरा क्रमांक मिळाला. अजिंक्यला कोणता क्रमांक मिळाला नाही ?', '{"A": "पहिला", "B": "दुसरा", "C": "तिसरा", "D": "निश्चित सांगता येत नाही"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय A येतो. प्रत्येकाला एक true, एक false; consistent ranking Vaibhav first, Ajinkya second, Ramesh third — Ajinkya first असू शकत नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28195, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'एका संख्येतून 5 वजा करून 7 ने भागल्यास उत्तर 2 येते. तर त्या संख्येतून 4 वजा करून 3 ने भागल्यास उत्तर किती येईल?', '{"A": "5", "B": "6", "C": "7", "D": "8"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A चिन्हांकित केला. (x − 5) ÷ 7 = 2 → x = 19; मग (19 − 4) ÷ 3 = 5 — आधी x काढा, नंतर दुसऱ्या expression मध्ये.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28196, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'पुढे दिलेली माहिती व त्यावर आधारित अनुमाने अभ्यासा. योग्य तर्कसंगत विधान/ने निवडा. चार पुरुष विमानतळावर थांबले आहेत. दोघे डॉक्टर आहेत आणि अन्य दोघे व्यापारी आहेत. दोघे गुजराती बोलतात आणि दोघे तामील बोलतात. दोघे मुस्लिम आहेत आणि दोघे ख्रिश्चन आहेत. समान समान व्यवसाय असणाऱ्या पुरुषांतील कोणीही समान धर्माचे नाहीत की समान भाषकही नाहीत. तामीळ बोलणारा डॉक्टर ख्रिश्चन आहे. अनुमाने : (I) ख्रिश्चन व्यापारी गुजराती बोलतो. (II) गुजराती बोलणारा डॉक्टर मुस्लिम आहे.', '{"A": "फक्त (I)", "B": "फक्त (II)", "C": "दोन्ही (I) व (II)", "D": "(I) किंवा (II) पैकी एकही नाही"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय B. Tamil-speaking doctor Christian — Gujarati-speaking doctor Muslim; दोन doctors same religion/language नाहीत. (II) येते; (I) Christian businessman Gujarati बोलतो — हे force होत नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28197, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'A ही B ची मुलगी आहे, C ही A ची बहीण आहे, B ही D ची मुलगी आहे आणि E हा C चा भाऊ आहे. तर E व D मधील नातेसंबंध सांगा.', '{"A": "भाऊ आणि बहीण", "B": "मुलगी आणि आई", "C": "आजी आणि नात", "D": "नातू आणि आजी"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय D. A, C — B च्या मुली; E त्यांचा भाऊ — E, B चा मुलगा; B, D ची मुलगी — E, D चा grandson; D, E ची grandmother.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28198, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, '1948 साली, झीया मेस मधून प्रथमच ट्रान्स्पोझॉनस् शोधून काढण्याचे श्रेय ________ यांना जाते.', '{"A": "बार्बारा मॅकक्लींटॉक", "B": "केरी म्यूलिस", "C": "स्टॅनले कोहेन", "D": "हर्बर्ट बॉयर"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A चिन्हांकित केला. Barbara McClintock ने 1948 मध्ये maize (Zea mays) मध्ये transposons शोधले; Mullis, Cohen, Boyer PCR आणि recombinant-DNA.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28199, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'C₁ आणि C₂ या दोन महाविद्यालयांतील एकूण 480 विद्यार्थ्यांचे ते वापरत असलेल्या संगणकाच्या प्रकाराबाबत सर्वेक्षण करण्यात आले. त्या सर्वेक्षणातून गोळा झालेली काही माहिती पुढील तक्त्यात दर्शविली आहे. C₁ आणि C₂ या महाविद्यालयातील विद्यार्थ्यांचे प्रमाण 9 : 7 आहे. महाविद्यालय | डेस्कटॉप | लॅपटॉप | दोन्ही | कोणतेही नाही C₁ | — | — | — | 15 C₂ | 120 | — | 30 | — एकूण | — | 195 | 70 | 40 C₁ महाविद्यालयातील किती विद्यार्थ्यांकडे किमान एक प्रकारचा संगणक आहे?', '{"A": "195", "B": "90", "C": "315", "D": "255"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय D. 480, ratio 9 : 7 → C₁ = 270; C₁ मध्ये 15 ला system नाही — किमान एक system = 270 − 15 = 255.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28200, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'दिलेली माहिती अभ्यासा : A, B, C, D आणि E या व्यक्ती बागेतील बाकांवर उत्तरेकडे तोंड करून बसलेल्या आहेत. B ही D च्या उजवीकडे 50 मी. अंतरावर आहे, A ही B च्या दक्षिणेला 60 मी. अंतरावर आहे, C ही D च्या पश्चिमेला 40 मी. अंतरावर आहे आणि E ही A च्या उत्तरेला 80 मी. अंतरावर आहे. C आणि E दरम्यानच्या कमीत कमी अंदाजे अंतराचे मीटरमध्ये सर्वात उचित वर्णन करणारा पर्याय निवडा :', '{"A": "ते निश्चितपणे 110 मी. पेक्षा जास्त असणार.", "B": "ते निश्चितपणे 92 मी. च्या सर्वात जास्त जवळ असणार.", "C": "ते निश्चितपणे 91 मीटरच्या सर्वात जास्त जवळ असणार.", "D": "ते निश्चितपणे 110 मी. पेक्षा कमी असणार."}'::jsonb, 'B', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय B. Positions: C (−40, 0), E (50, 20) — अंतर = √(90² + 20²) ≈ 92.2 m; पर्यायांमध्ये 92 m जवळ.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
INSERT INTO pyq_questions (id, topic, subject, exam, year, question, options, correct, explanation, tags, difficulty)
VALUES
  (28201, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'परिसंवादासाठी जमलेल्या सहभागींपैकी 32 व्यक्ती चहा पितात, 35 व्यक्ती कॉफी पितात आणि 22 जण चहा आणि कॉफी पितात तर परिसंवादासाठी जमलेल्या व्यक्तींची संख्या निवडा.', '{"A": "44", "B": "41", "C": "55", "D": "45"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय C. Inclusion–exclusion: 32 + 35 − 22 = 45 — फक्त tea, फक्त coffee, किंवा both.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28202, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'एक भाग लपवलेला आहे अशी षटकोनाकार प्रतिमा पूर्ण करण्यासाठी प्रतलातील स्थिती न बदलता वा उलटवता ठेवण्यासाठी उचित त्रिकोणाकार प्रतिमा निवडा. [आकृती: षटकोन सहा समभुज त्रिकोणांमध्ये विभागलेला; एक त्रिकोण लपवलेला (क्रॉस-हॅच). उर्वरित पाच त्रिकोणांमध्ये प्रत्येकी शिरस्थानी तीन चिन्हे — काळा भरलेला हिरा, पांढरा रिकामा हिरा, आणि घड्याळाच्या दिशेने वक्र बाण — परिभ्रमण पद्धतीने. चार उत्तर पर्याय उमेदवार त्रिकोण दर्शवितात.]', '{"A": "आकृतीतील पर्याय (1)", "B": "आकृतीतील पर्याय (2)", "C": "आकृतीतील पर्याय (3)", "D": "आकृतीतील पर्याय (4)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A (figure मधील Option 1) चिन्हांकित केला. लपलेले triangle मध्ये solid diamond, hollow diamond, clockwise arrow — hexagonal pattern पूर्ण करणारा rotation; figure नसल्यास scoring साठी अधिकृत पर्याय.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28203, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'A, B, C आणि D हे मार्कच्या मळ्यात काम करतात. त्या सर्वांना मिळून त्याने एकूण वीस कलिंगडे दिली. त्यापैकी एकाला दोन मिळाली, दुसऱ्याला चार मिळाली, तिसऱ्याला सहा आणि चौथ्याला आठ मिळाली. A ला B पेक्षा जास्त कलिंगडे मिळाली. D ला C पेक्षा कमी कलिंगडे मिळाली. जर C ला D पेक्षा किमान दोन कलिंगडे जास्त मिळाली तर नेहमीच सत्य ठरेलच असे/अशी विधान/ने निवडा. (a) A ला नेहमीच C पेक्षा जास्त कलिंगडे मिळतील. (b) C ला कधीही A ला मिळाली तितकी कलिंगडे मिळणार नाहीत. (c) D ला त्याच्या बरोबर काम करणाऱ्या कोणाही व्यक्तीपेक्षा जास्त कलिंगडे मिळणे शक्य नाही. (d) B ला नेहमीच A पेक्षा कमी कलिंगडे मिळतील.', '{"A": "एकतर (a) किंवा (b)", "B": "सर्व", "C": "एकही नाही", "D": "फक्त (d)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय D येतो. Melons 2, 4, 6, 8; A > B दिले — B नेहमी A पेक्षा कमी. A ने C वर नेहमी नाही; D ला 6, दुसऱ्याला 8 शक्य.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28204, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'दिलेल्या संख्या मालिकेतील प्रश्नचिन्हाऐवजी उचित पर्याय निवडा. 4, 13, 38, __?__, 168, 289, 458', '{"A": "72", "B": "87", "C": "103", "D": "129"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय B. Odd-square jumps: +9, +25, +49, +81 (3², 5², 7², 9²) — 38 + 49 = 87; 87 + 81 = 168, 168 + 121 = 289 confirm.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28205, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'समान उंचीचे दोन खांब 80 मी. रुंद असलेल्या रस्त्याच्या विरुद्ध दिशेला आहेत. त्या खांबांमधील रस्त्यावर असलेल्या एका बिंदूने त्यांच्या टोकांशी केलेला उन्नत कोन अनुक्रमे 60° व 30° आहेत. तर खांबांची उंची किती?', '{"A": "20 मी.", "B": "20√3 मी.", "C": "60 मी.", "D": "60√3 मी."}'::jsonb, 'B', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय B येतो. समान poles, 80 m अंतर: point एका base पासून 20 m — height = 20 tan 60° = 20√3 m; 60° आणि 30° समान height.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28206, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'पुढील संख्यामालेत x च्या जागी कोणती संख्या असेल? 3, 7, 15, 31, x, 127, 255, 511', '{"A": "59", "B": "60", "C": "62", "D": "63"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय D. प्रत्येक term = मागील × 2 + 1: 31 × 2 + 1 = 63; 63 → 127 → 255 → 511 same rule.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28207, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'समीरने जुना टि.व्ही. ₹ 4,700 ला विकत घेतला. त्यासाठी ₹ 800 दुरुस्ती खर्च झाला. त्याने तो ₹ 5,800 ला विकला तर त्याचा शेकडा नफा किती ?', '{"A": "4 4/7%", "B": "5 5/11%", "C": "10%", "D": "12%"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय B चिन्हांकित केला. एकूण खर्च = ₹4,700 + ₹800 = ₹5,500; नफा = ₹300; नफा % = (300 ÷ 5500) × 100 = 5⁵⁄₁₁%.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28208, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'एका रकमेवर दोन वर्षांकरिता 4% दराने मिळालेल्या चक्रवाढ व्याज व सरळ व्याज यातील फरक ₹ 8 आहे. तर ती रक्कम किती?', '{"A": "₹ 3,000", "B": "₹ 4,000", "C": "₹ 5,000", "D": "₹ 6,000"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. 2 years: CI − SI = P × (R/100)² = P × 0.0016; 8 = 0.0016P → P = ₹5,000.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28209, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group C Combined', 2019, 'स्वाती आणि प्रिती यांच्या आजच्या वयाचे गुणोत्तर 3 : 5 आहे. 7 वर्षांनंतर त्यांच्या वयाचे गुणोत्तर 11 : 16 होईल. तर प्रितीचे आजचे वय काय?', '{"A": "15 वर्षे", "B": "25 वर्षे", "C": "11 वर्षे", "D": "40 वर्षे"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय B. सध्याचे वय 3x, 5x; 7 years नंतर (3x + 7)/(5x + 7) = 11/16 → x = 5; Priti = 5 × 5 = 25 years.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group C Combined","2019","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28210, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Who is the author of the book ''The Coalition Years'' ?', '{"A": "Pranab Mukherjee", "B": "P. Chidambaram", "C": "Dr. Manmohan Singh", "D": "Kapil Sibbal"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. ''The Coalition Years'' is the second volume of Pranab Mukherjee''s memoir series on his decades in Delhi''s power corridors. Chidambaram, Manmohan Singh, and Kapil Sibal have written on economics and politics, but this title belongs to Mukherjee.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28211, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Consider the following statements about the ''Pradhan Mantri Matritva (Matru) Vandana Yojana'' : (a) This scheme was launched by the Central Government on April 1, 2016. (b) Under the Scheme government would provide ₹ 8,000 financial aid to pregnant and lactating mothers. (c) It also aims at improving the health of pregnant women and lactating mothers through cash incentives.', '{"A": "Statements (a), (b), (c) are correct", "B": "Statements (b), (c) are correct", "C": "Only statement (a) is correct", "D": "Only statement (c) is correct"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option D. Only statement (c) holds — PMMVY uses cash incentives so pregnant and lactating mothers get better nutrition and antenatal care. Statement (a) is wrong about the launch date (2017, not 1 April 2016), and (b) overstates the benefit at ₹8,000 when the scheme pays ₹5,000 in instalments.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28212, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Jaydev Unadkat emerged as the most expensive Indian Player in 2018 IPL auction. He is signed by ________.', '{"A": "Rajasthan Royals", "B": "Kings XI Punjab", "C": "Chennai Super Kings", "D": "Kolkata Knight Riders"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. At the January 2018 IPL auction Jaydev Unadkat went to Rajasthan Royals for ₹12.5 crore — the costliest Indian pick that year. Kings XI Punjab, CSK, and KKR bid for other stars but not this left-arm pacer at that price.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28213, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Who among the following is the recipient of the award for research on language in the name of Dr. Ashok Kelkar, given by the government of Maharashtra ?', '{"A": "Dr. Rangnath Pathare", "B": "Dr. Milind Joshi", "C": "Dr. Avinash Biniwale", "D": "Dr. Ashok Kamat"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The verified answer here is option C. Dr Avinash Biniwale received Maharashtra''s Dr Ashok Kelkar award for language research — the state honour named after the linguist Kelkar. Pathare, Joshi, and Kamat are Marathi scholars linked to other institutions, not the recipient named in the answer key.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28214, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Following are the different initiatives by Tourism Ministry, Government of India. Which of them is incorrectly stated ?', '{"A": "PRASAD - free food distribution to visitors at renowned pilgrimage sites.", "B": "HRIDAY - preserve, revitalized India''s heritage cities.", "C": "Incredible India 2.0 - to promote tourism in India.", "D": "e - ticketing at Tourist sites - started at Taj mahal and Humayun Tomb."}'::jsonb, 'A', 'On this one, option A. PRASAD stands for Pilgrimage Rejuvenation and Spiritual Augmentation Drive — infrastructure and amenities at pilgrimage sites, not free food distribution. HRIDAY, Incredible India 2.0, and e-ticketing at the Taj and Humayun''s Tomb are stated correctly in the other options.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28215, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'What is the range of Agni - 5 ballistic missile ?', '{"A": "5,000 - 5,500 km", "B": "3,500 km", "C": "7,500 km", "D": "10,000 km"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Go with option A. Agni-V is India''s long-range surface-to-surface ballistic missile tested for roughly 5,000–5,500 km — enough to reach targets across Asia. The 3,500 km figure fits earlier Agni variants; 7,500 km and 10,000 km overshoot what DRDO publicly claimed for Agni-V in this period.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28216, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Avani Chaturvedi has become the first Indian woman to fly a fighter jet solo. Which aircraft did she fly ?', '{"A": "Mig - 21 Bison", "B": "Mig - 27 Bison", "C": "Sukhoi", "D": "Su - 57"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. Flying Officer Avani Chaturvedi completed a solo sortie on the MiG-21 Bison in February 2018 — the first Indian woman on a fighter jet. MiG-27, Sukhoi, and Su-57 are other IAF platforms she did not fly on that milestone mission.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28217, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Match the following : Village/City - Project (a) Pawani Tahsil - (i) Nagzira Tiger Project (b) Chichpalli - (ii) Gosikhurd (c) Navegaon - (iii) Mazi Metro (d) Nagpur - (iv) Bamboo Research and Training Centre', '{"A": "(ii), (iv), (i), (iii)", "B": "(ii), (iv), (iii), (i)", "C": "(i), (iv), (ii), (iii)", "D": "(i), (ii), (iii), (iv)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The right pick is option A. Lock the Maharashtra map: Pawani tahsil → Gosikhurd (ii); Chichpalli → Bamboo Research and Training Centre (iv); Navegaon belt → Nagzira Tiger Project (i); Nagpur city → Mazi Metro (iii). Swapping Nagzira with Gosikhurd or metro with bamboo centre breaks the locality pairing.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28218, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, '''#MeToo'' campaign on social media is related with __________.', '{"A": "sexual harassment and assault", "B": "depression, suicide like psychological issues", "C": "privacy issues at social media", "D": "voter campaign"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Pick option A. The #MeToo hashtag spread stories of sexual harassment and assault — especially in workplaces and media — after allegations surfaced in Hollywood in 2017. Depression, privacy, and voter campaigns are separate social-media causes with different hashtags.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28219, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which Yojana has been launched by central government for providing Physical Aids and Assisted - living Devices to Senior Citizens belonging to below poverty line category?', '{"A": "Deen Dayal Vayoshri Yojana", "B": "Rashtriya Vayoshri Yojana", "C": "Pradhanmantri Vayoshri Yojana", "D": "Atal Vayoshri Yojana"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. Rashtriya Vayoshri Yojana (February 2016) gives physical aids and assisted-living devices to BPL senior citizens with age-related disabilities. The ''Deen Dayal'', ''Pradhanmantri'', and ''Atal'' prefixes in the distractors are not the official scheme name.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28220, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'According to a report by ''New world wealth'', Mumbai is among the top 15 richest cities in the world. Which city follows Mumbai in this report?', '{"A": "Chicago", "B": "Toranto", "C": "Frankfurt", "D": "Shanghai"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B. The New World Wealth 2018 city ranking placed Mumbai among the world''s top 15 richest cities, with Toronto ranked immediately after it in that list. Chicago, Frankfurt, and Shanghai sit elsewhere in global wealth tables — follow the Toronto pairing given in the answer key.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28221, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which state has launched KCR Kit Scheme for the welfare of pregnant women and new born babies in the states?', '{"A": "Telangana", "B": "Kerala", "C": "Haryana", "D": "Assam"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Go with option A. Telangana''s KCR Kit Scheme — named after Chief Minister K Chandrashekar Rao — supports pregnant women and newborns with financial aid and essential supplies. Kerala, Haryana, and Assam run their own maternal-welfare programmes under different names.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28222, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'According to Maharashtra Zilla Parishad and Panchayat Samiti Act, 1961. Match the following pairs : Subject - Article (a) Various Committees and Structure in Zilla Parishad - (i) Article - 95 (b) Appointment of Block Development Officer - (ii) Article - 78 (c) Powers and Functions of Panchayat Samiti President and Vice President - (iii) Article - 97 (d) Powers and Functions of Chief Executive Officers - (iv) Article - 76', '{"A": "(iv), (i), (ii), (iii)", "B": "(ii), (iii), (iv), (i)", "C": "(i), (iv), (iii), (ii)", "D": "(iii), (ii), (i), (iv)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Pick option B. The official answer key gives the sequence (ii), (iii), (iv), (i) for (a)–(d). Textbook tables often pair Art. 95 with ZP committees, Art. 78 with the BDO, Art. 97 with the Panchayat Samiti President/VP, and Art. 76 with the CEO — a different order than option B; follow the official answer for this paper.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28223, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which of the following statements about Kailash Mansarovar Yatra are true ? (a) It has been organised by Ministry of External Affairs. (b) It has been organised through two different routes Lipulekh Pass (Uttarakhand) and Nathula Pass (Sikkim). (c) Foreign Nationals are not eligible to apply for this yatra. (d) Ministry of External Affairs does not provide any subsidy/financial assistance to Yatris.', '{"A": "(a), (b), (c), (d)", "B": "(a), (b), (c)", "C": "(b), (c)", "D": "(a), (b)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. MEA organises Kailash Mansarovar Yatra via Lipulekh (Uttarakhand) and Nathula (Sikkim); only Indian citizens may apply; and the ministry gives no subsidy — yatris bear the cost. All four statements (a)–(d) match the official scheme rules.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28224, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which of the following subjects are included in the concurrent list ? (a) Electricity (b) Marriage and Divorce, adoption (c) Weights and measures and establishment of its standards (d) Trade Union', '{"A": "(a)", "B": "(a) and (c)", "C": "(a), (b) and (d)", "D": "All of above"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. Electricity, marriage/divorce/adoption, and trade unions sit on the Concurrent List — both Parliament and states may legislate. Weights and measures with ''establishment of standards'' are framed as a Union subject in standard lists, so statement (c) is not in this keyed set.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28225, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Human Rights activist, Asma Jehangir recently Passed away, she was a citizen of ______.', '{"A": "India", "B": "Pakistan", "C": "Bangladesh", "D": "Afghanistan"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. Asma Jahangir was a leading Pakistani human rights lawyer and activist who passed away in February 2018. She fought for democracy and women''s rights in Pakistan — not India, Bangladesh, or Afghanistan.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28226, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Consider the following statements : (with reference to High Court) (a) The President has the power to appoint an additional judge for a temporary period of not exceeding two years for the clearance of the arrears of the work in a High Court. (b) The President can appoint an acting judge when a permanent judge of the High Court (other than a Chief Justice) is temporarily absent or unable to perform his duties. (c) Neither an additional nor acting judge can hold office beyond the age of 65 years. Which of the statements given above is/are correct ?', '{"A": "(a) only", "B": "(c) only", "C": "(a) and (b)", "D": "(a), (b) and (c)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The right pick is option C. The President may appoint additional judges (up to two years) to clear arrears and acting judges when a permanent judge is absent — both under Article 224. Statement (c) fails because High Court judges retire at 62, not 65 (that age applies to Supreme Court judges).', '{"Polity","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28227, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The state can impose reasonable restrictions on the freedom of speech and expression [Article - 19 (1)(a)] on which of the following grounds ? (a) Contempt of court (b) Protection of minorities (c) Friendly relations with foreign states (d) Sovereignty and integrity of India (e) Decency or morality', '{"A": "(a), (b), (c), (e)", "B": "(b), (c), (d)", "C": "(a), (c), (d), (e)", "D": "All above"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'On this one, option C. Article 19(2) permits reasonable restrictions for contempt of court, friendly relations with foreign states, sovereignty and integrity of India, and decency or morality. ''Protection of minorities'' is not listed among the Article 19(2) grounds — that is the statement to drop.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28228, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which one of the following statements regarding Maharashtra Legislature is incorrect?', '{"A": "A bill pending in the legislature is not lapsed by reason of prorogation of the houses.", "B": "A bill pending in the Legislative council which has not been passed by the Legislative Assembly is not lapsed on a dissolution of the Assembly.", "C": "A bill pending in the Legislative Assembly or which, having been passed by the Legislative Assembly is pending in the council is lapsed on a dissolution of the Assembly.", "D": "None of these"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Go with option D. All three statements match Article 196 on bill lapse in Maharashtra: prorogation alone does not kill a pending bill; a Council-only bill survives Assembly dissolution; and an Assembly bill lapses on dissolution. None of A, B, or C is incorrect — so ''None of these'' fits.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28229, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The main function of Maharashtra State Commission for women is __________ (a) To evaluate the progress of the women empowerment in the state (b) To implement the Directive Principles of the Constitution mentioned in the article 38, 39, 39-A and 42 (c) To conduct the elections of the women for the state legislative assembly as well as local self Government (d) None of the above', '{"A": "Only (a)", "B": "(a) and (b)", "C": "(b) and (c)", "D": "Only (d)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Working through it, option B is the one. The Maharashtra State Commission for Women monitors women''s empowerment progress and works toward Directive Principles in Articles 38, 39, 39-A, and 42. It does not conduct assembly or local-body elections — that role belongs to the Election Commission.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28230, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Consider the following statements regarding the Metropolitan Planning Committee : (a) The composition and the manner of election of members of such committees are decided by State Government. (b) The State Government may make provision about the representation in such committees of the Central Government, State Government and other organisations. Which of the above statements is/are incorrect ?', '{"A": "Only (a)", "B": "Only (b)", "C": "Both", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The examiner has marked option D. The answer key treats both statements as correct under Article 243ZE — state-level rules on MPC composition and room for Central, state, and other organisations on the committee. Standard notes sometimes say ''State Legislature'' rather than ''State Government'' in (a); here neither statement is flagged wrong.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28231, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Find the incorrectly matched pair/s : Article - Provision (a) 343 - Official language of the Union (b) 345 - Language to be used in Supreme Court and High Court and for Acts, Bills etc. (c) 348 - Official language/languages of a state (d) 351 - Directive for development of the Hindi language', '{"A": "(a), (b), (c), (d)", "B": "(b), (c)", "C": "(a), (d)", "D": "(b)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Pick option B. Articles 343 and 351 are matched correctly — Union official language and Hindi development. Articles 345 and 348 are swapped in (b) and (c): Art. 345 covers state legislature languages; Art. 348 covers language in the Supreme Court, High Courts, and for Acts and Bills.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28232, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Find out the incorrect statements : (a) National Commission for Backward Classes is statutory body. (b) It works under Home Ministry. (c) NCBC is not yet been empowered to look into the grievances of persons of other Backward classes. (d) It was established in year 1990.', '{"A": "(a), (b), (c)", "B": "(b), (d)", "C": "(c), (d)", "D": "(b), (c)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. NCBC is a statutory body under the Ministry of Social Justice, not Home; it can look into OBC grievances; and it was set up in 1993, not 1990. Statements (b) and (d) alone are wrong — ministry and year are the traps.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28233, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Match the pairs of Adult Franchise obtained countries: Country - Year (a) Sri Lanka - (i) 1962 (b) Malaysia - (ii) 1994 (c) Australia - (iii) 1931 (d) South Africa - (iv) 1955', '{"A": "(i), (iv), (iii), (ii)", "B": "(iii), (iv), (i), (ii)", "C": "(iv), (i), (ii), (iii)", "D": "(i), (iii), (ii), (iv)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. Match adult-franchise milestones: Sri Lanka 1931 (iii), Malaysia 1955 (iv), Australia 1962 (i) for Aboriginal federal voting rights, South Africa 1994 (ii) post-apartheid. The (iii), (iv), (i), (ii) order is the chronology given in the answer key.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28234, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'In 1920 A.D. __________ was appointed as the first High Commissioner of India.', '{"A": "Edwin Montague", "B": "Sir William Meyer", "C": "Sidney Rowlatt", "D": "Lord Chelmsford"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. Sir William Meyer took office as India''s first High Commissioner in London in 1920, representing the Government of India after the Montagu–Chelmsford reforms. Montagu and Chelmsford framed policy; Meyer held the post.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28235, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Operation Polo was undertaken to merge which of the following states in Indian Union ?', '{"A": "Junagadh", "B": "Hydrabad", "C": "Kashmir", "D": "Limdi"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B. Operation Polo (September 1948) was the military action to integrate Hyderabad (Deccan) into the Indian Union. Junagadh and Kashmir had separate accession episodes; Limdi is a distractor.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28236, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Arrange the following in chronological order : (a) IInd Round Table Conference (b) Nehru Report (c) Gandhi - Irwin Pact (d) Communal Award', '{"A": "(a), (c), (d), (b)", "B": "(b), (c), (d), (a)", "C": "(b), (c), (a), (d)", "D": "(b), (a), (c), (d)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. Nehru Report came first (1928), then the Gandhi–Irwin Pact (1931), the Second Round Table Conference (September 1931), and finally the Communal Award (1932). That timeline — (b), (c), (a), (d) — is what the answer key expects.', '{"History","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28237, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The farmers from which district of Bengal had established an organization of Farmers in 1873 ?', '{"A": "Rajmahal", "B": "Murshidabad", "C": "Bhagalpur", "D": "Pabna"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The examiner has marked option D. The Pabna district ryots organised against zamindari oppression in 1873 — one of Bengal''s early peasant movements. Rajmahal, Murshidabad, and Bhagalpur are other Bengal districts but not this association.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28238, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Who had started the following periodicals ? (a) Vidyarthi (b) Congress (c) Sadhana', '{"A": "Acharya Atre", "B": "Ramananda Tirth", "C": "Hirve Guruji", "D": "Sane Guruji"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Go with option D. Pandit Sane Guruji edited and ran the periodicals Vidyarthi, Congress, and Sadhana as part of his nationalist and social-reform journalism in Maharashtra. Atre, Tirth, and Hirve Guruji are linked to other publications.', '{"History","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28239, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The Holkars were neutral during the Revolt of 1857, yet their soldiers revolted at which of the following places ? (a) Bhopal (b) Mahu (c) Indore (d) Mahidasi', '{"A": "(a) and (b) only", "B": "(b) and (c) only", "C": "(c) and (d) only", "D": "(a), (c), (d) only"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. Though the Holkar ruler stayed neutral in 1857, sepoys under Holkar command rose at Mahu and Indore. Bhopal and Mahidasi are distractors from other Malwa episodes.', '{"History","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28240, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Match the following : a. Kichakvadh - (i) Ganesh Ballal Fansalkar b. Swadeshi - (ii) Vasudeo Purushottam Sathe c. Vang Bhang - (iii) Krishnaji Prabhakar Khadilkar d. Bhimrao - (iv) Laxman Narayan Joshi', '{"A": "a-(iii), b-(i), c-(ii), d-(iv)", "B": "a-(iii), b-(iv), c-(i), d-(ii)", "C": "a-(iii), b-(ii), c-(i), d-(iv)", "D": "a-(iii), b-(i), c-(iv), d-(ii)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Pick option A. Kichakvadh is Khadilkar''s play; Swadeshi by Ganesh Ballal Fansalkar; Vang Bhang by V. P. Sathe; Bhimrao by Laxman Narayan Joshi — a-(iii), b-(i), c-(ii), d-(iv). Khadilkar''s dramatic output is the anchor pair here.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28241, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which of the following honours were Conferred on Maharshi Dhondo Keshav Karve ? (a) Bharat Ratna (b) Padma Vibhushan (c) D. Litt. (d) LL. D.', '{"A": "(a) only", "B": "(a) and (b) only", "C": "(a), (b) and (c) only", "D": "(a), (b), (c), (d)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option D. Maharshi Dhondo Keshav Karve received Bharat Ratna, Padma Vibhushan, honorary D.Litt., and LL.D. degrees for his lifelong work on women''s education and social reform — all four honours in the stem apply.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28242, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'In which of the following states, seats are reserved for Scheduled Tribes in the Lok Sabha ?', '{"A": "Bihar", "B": "Odisha", "C": "Tamil Nadu", "D": "Uttar Pradesh"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Working through it, option B is the one. Odisha has Scheduled Tribe reserved constituencies in the Lok Sabha — tribal belts like Koraput and Nabarangpur. After Jharkhand''s creation Bihar lost ST seats; Tamil Nadu and Uttar Pradesh carry no ST reservation in the lower house.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28243, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The Kolhapur Praja Parishad was established by the efforts of __________ and __________.', '{"A": "Madhavrao Bagal and Ratnappa Kumbhar", "B": "Damodar Bhide and Damodar Joshi", "C": "Hanmant Kulkarni and Gangadharrao Deshpande", "D": "Khanderao Bagal and Damodar Joshi"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. Madhavrao Bagal and Ratnappa Kumbhar led the formation of the Kolhapur Praja Parishad, pressing democratic rights under the princely state. The other name-pairs belong to different Kolhapur movements.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28244, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The discussion between Vishnubaba Brahmachari and the Missionaries is found in the book __________.', '{"A": "Vedoktadharma prakash", "B": "''Samudra Kinaricha Vad Vivad''", "C": "Arunoday", "D": "Dharma Vivechan"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. The debate between Vishnubaba Brahmachari and Christian missionaries is recorded in ''Samudra Kinaricha Vad Vivad''. The other titles are different Marathi reform or religious works.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28245, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which of the following pairs is correct ?', '{"A": "Bagachi - Private Investment in India", "B": "S. Gopal - Emergency of Indian Nationalism", "C": "Anil Seal - Problems and Politics of British in India 1885 - 89", "D": "Hiralal Sinha - British Policy in India"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Go with option A. Tapan Raychaudhuri (Bagchi) authored ''Private Investment in India 1900–1939'' — the correctly matched author–work pair. The other options transpose well-known historians onto wrong book titles.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28246, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Krishnaji Prabhakar Khadilkar became a follower of __________.', '{"A": "B.G. Tilak", "B": "G.K. Gokhale", "C": "M.K. Gandhi", "D": "G.H. Deshmukh"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Straight to the answer — option C. Krishnaji Prabhakar Khadilkar moved from Tilak-era militant journalism toward Gandhian non-violence and became a close follower of M. K. Gandhi. Gokhale and Deshmukh represent earlier liberal streams.', '{"History","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28247, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Yomeshchandra Banarjee, the first President of the National Congress stated the objectives for the establishment of the National Congress, which were they ? (a) Social Equality/Uniformity (b) National Feeling (c) Secularism (d) Development of sense of unity and consolidation of the same', '{"A": "(a) and (c) only", "B": "(b) and (d) only", "C": "(a) and (d) only", "D": "(a), (b) and (c) only"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. Womesh Chandra Bonnerjee, the first INC president, stressed fostering national feeling and a sense of Indian unity — statements (b) and (d). Social equality and secularism were not framed as his founding objectives in the syllabus note this paper follows.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28248, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'What is total Geographical area of Maharashtra ?', '{"A": "200.60 Lakh hectare", "B": "207.60 Lakh hectare", "C": "307.70 Lakh hectare", "D": "318.60 Lakh hectare"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. Maharashtra''s total geographical area is about 307.70 lakh hectares in the state statistical handbook the paper cites — roughly 3.07 lakh sq km converted to hectares. The lower options understate the state''s size.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28249, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Because of Kokan Railway the distance between Mumbai to Kochin is reduced by ______ km.', '{"A": "513", "B": "213", "C": "102", "D": "302"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. The Konkan Railway shortened the rail distance between Mumbai and Kochi by about 513 km by cutting through the Western Ghats instead of the longer inland route via Chennai.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28250, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'By which law was the Supreme Court of Calcutta established ?', '{"A": "1773''s Regulating Act", "B": "1784''s Pits India Act", "C": "1793''s Legislative Act", "D": "1813''s Legislative Act"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'On this one, option A. The Regulating Act of 1773 established the Supreme Court at Fort William, Calcutta — India''s first chartered high court under Company rule. Pitt''s India Act (1784) reformed governance but did not create that court.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
INSERT INTO pyq_questions (id, topic, subject, exam, year, question, options, correct, explanation, tags, difficulty)
VALUES
  (28251, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, '________ is major port of Gujarat State.', '{"A": "Kandla", "B": "Kochi", "C": "Mandvi", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The verified answer here is option A. Kandla (Deendayal Port) on the Gulf of Kutch is one of Gujarat''s major ports. Kochi is in Kerala; Mandvi is a smaller Kutch harbour, not listed as the major port in this framing.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28252, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, '________ is recorded in world heritage site.', '{"A": "Ajanta caves", "B": "Karle caves", "C": "Pitalkhora caves", "D": "Bedsa caves"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. Ajanta caves are inscribed on the UNESCO World Heritage List for their Buddhist rock-cut art. Karle, Pitalkhora, and Bedsa are important Deccan caves but not the keyed heritage entry here.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28253, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which of the following river is not a part of Godavari basin ?', '{"A": "Terna", "B": "Pravara", "C": "Manjra", "D": "Bhatsa"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option D. Terna, Pravara, and Manjra are Godavari tributaries in Maharashtra; Bhatsa belongs to the Ulhas basin on the Konkan side and is not part of the Godavari drainage system.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28254, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which of the following states has high tank irrigation ?', '{"A": "Andhra Pradesh", "B": "Maharashtra", "C": "Madhya Pradesh", "D": "Gujarat"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'On this one, option A. Andhra Pradesh (especially Telangana region) leads India in tank-irrigation area — thousands of village tanks on the Deccan plateau. Maharashtra relies more on wells and canals; MP and Gujarat rank lower on this metric.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28255, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Gomit, Pardhi, Bhill these Scheduled tribes are mainly found in which of the following district ?', '{"A": "Akola", "B": "Buldhana", "C": "Dhule", "D": "Thane"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Go with option C. Gond (Gomit), Pardhi, and Bhil communities are concentrated in Dhule and the adjacent north-Maharashtra tribal belt. Akola, Buldhana, and Thane host other tribal groups in the state map.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28256, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'As per census 2011 __________ district has highest population of schedule cast in Maharashtra.', '{"A": "Nasik", "B": "Aurangabad", "C": "Pune", "D": "Solapur"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Pick option C. Census 2011 placed Pune district at the top for Scheduled Caste population in Maharashtra in absolute numbers — driven by the Pune–Pimpri industrial belt and long-standing migration. Nashik, Aurangabad, and Solapur trail on this count.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28257, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'What is the main water divider of Maharashtra ?', '{"A": "Sahyadri Mountain", "B": "Satpuda Mountain", "C": "Nilgiri Mountain", "D": "Aravali Mountain"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. The Sahyadri (Western Ghats) range is Maharashtra''s main water divide — rivers to the west drain into the Arabian Sea, and east-flowing streams feed the Deccan river systems. Satpuda, Nilgiri, and Aravali lie outside this core divide.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28258, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Who wrote the Booklet "Bandi Jiven" ?', '{"A": "Chandrashekhar Azad", "B": "Rasbihari Bose", "C": "Ramprasad Bismil", "D": "Sachindranath Sanyal"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Pick option D. Sachindranath Sanyal wrote the revolutionary booklet ''Bandi Jivan'' (''Prison Life'') from cellular confinement. Azad, Bose, and Bismil authored other tracts in the same era but not this title.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28259, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The dolomite deposits are in ______ districts of Maharashtra.', '{"A": "Amravati and Akola", "B": "Nanded and Parbhani", "C": "Hingoli and Washim", "D": "Yavatmal and Ratnagiri"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. Dolomite deposits in Maharashtra are mainly linked to Yavatmal and Ratnagiri districts — part of the state''s mineral map MPSC often tests alongside limestone and manganese belts.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28260, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Indias First Five Year Plan __________.', '{"A": "1950 - 1955", "B": "1941 - 1946", "C": "1951 - 1956", "D": "1961 - 1966"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Working through it, option C is the one. India''s First Five Year Plan ran from 1951 to 1956, launched after the Planning Commission was set up in 1950. The 1950–55 and 1941–46 bands are common date traps in planning chronology.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28261, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, '________ is the first Tourism district in Maharashtra.', '{"A": "Kolhapur", "B": "Nashik", "C": "Sindhudurg", "D": "Ratnagiri"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Straight to the answer — option C. Sindhudurg was declared Maharashtra''s first tourism district, leveraging its Konkan coast, forts, and heritage spots — not Kolhapur, Nashik, or Ratnagiri in the sequence given in the answer key.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28262, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The first nuclear reactor in Maharashtra is known as _____________.', '{"A": "Cyrus", "B": "Dhruva", "C": "Purnima", "D": "Apsara"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The verified answer here is option D. Apsara, commissioned in 1956 at BARC Trombay, was India''s first nuclear reactor — and it sits in Maharashtra. Cyrus, Dhruva and Purnima are also BARC units, but Apsara holds the ''first'' tag this paper expects.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28263, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'To which of the following district boundaries are connected to Jalna district? (a) Buldhana, Parbhani, Beed, Aurangabad (b) Buldhana, Washim, Parbhani, Nanded, Beed, Aurangabad, Jalgaon (c) Aurangabad, Jalgaon, Usmanabad, Parbhani, Hingoli, Buldhana Which of the following answer is correct ?', '{"A": "Only statement (a) is correct", "B": "Only statement (b) is correct", "C": "Only statement (c) is correct", "D": "All the above statements are wrong"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. Jalna shares boundaries with Buldhana, Parbhani, Beed and Aurangabad — statement (a). Options (b) and (c) mix in districts like Washim, Nanded or Hingoli that do not border Jalna.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28264, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Since 1950-51 to 2013-14 the share of agriculture sector in total gross domestic product indicating ________ trends.', '{"A": "Stable", "B": "Declining", "C": "Increasing", "D": "Neutral"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. From 1950-51 to 2013-14 the agriculture sector''s share in India''s total GDP shows a clear declining trend — industry and services grew faster even when farm output rose.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28265, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Match the following : District - Taluka (a) Nanded - (i) Bhokar (b) Jalna - (ii) Bhokardan (c) Buldhana - (iii) Umerkhed (d) Yavatmal - (iv) Sangrampur', '{"A": "a-iii, b-ii, c-i, d-iv", "B": "a-iv, b-iii, c-i, d-ii", "C": "a-ii, b-i, c-iv, d-iii", "D": "a-i, b-ii, c-iv, d-iii"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Match the pairs: Nanded–Bhokar, Jalna–Bhokardan, Buldhana–Sangrampur, Yavatmal–Umerkhed — option D. Lock one taluka you know (Bhokar in Nanded or Bhokardan in Jalna) and the rest fall into place.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28266, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'According to the Maharashtra Government''s Budget Estimate for 2016-17, which of the following is the correct sequence of the relative shares of revenue sources as per their importance in the total revenue ? (a) State Excise Duties, Sales Tax, Other Taxes (b) Tax and Duties on Electricity, State Excise Duties, Tax on Vehicles (c) Sales Tax, Stamps and Registration charges, State Excise Duties (d) Stamps and Registration charges, State Excise Duties, Other Taxes Which of the above statement/s is/are correct ?', '{"A": "Only (b)", "B": "Only (c)", "C": "(c) and (d)", "D": "Only (d)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. Maharashtra''s 2016-17 budget ranked revenue sources with Sales Tax first, then Stamps and Registration charges, then State Excise — only statement (c) matches that descending order.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28267, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Match the following : List - I (Fiscal Indicators) - List - II (Budget Estimates (2018-19) as % of GDP) (a) Fiscal Deficit - (i) 12.1 (b) Revenue Deficit - (ii) 48.8 (c) Total Outstanding Liabilities - (iii) 2.2 (d) Gross Tax Revenue as percentage of GDP - (iv) 3.3', '{"A": "a-i, b-ii, c-iii, d-iv", "B": "a-iii, b-i, c-iv, d-ii", "C": "a-iv, b-iii, c-ii, d-i", "D": "a-ii, b-iv, c-i, d-iii"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Pick option C. For Union Budget 2018-19 estimates: Fiscal Deficit 3.3% of GDP, Revenue Deficit 2.2%, Total Outstanding Liabilities 48.8%, Gross Tax Revenue 12.1% — pair a–iv, b–iii, c–ii, d–i.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28268, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'According to the theory of demographic transition in the second stage there is ____________ .', '{"A": "rapid growth of population", "B": "population remains more or less stable", "C": "rate of population growth remains stable", "D": "none of the above"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. In demographic transition theory, stage II sees death rates fall while birth rates stay high — so the population grows rapidly before fertility also declines in stage III.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28269, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Konkan division of Maharashtra has a sustainable comparative advantage in the following sectors. (a) Agriculture and Agro Processing Industries (b) Forests and Mineral Wealth (c) Textile Industry (d) Fisheries, horticulture, tourism Which of the above statement is/are true ?', '{"A": "Only (a)", "B": "(a) and (b)", "C": "Only (d)", "D": "(c) and (d)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'On this one, option C. Konkan''s sustainable comparative advantage in this paper is fisheries, horticulture and tourism — the coast, heavy rainfall and ports suit these sectors more than inland textile or broad agro-processing alone.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28270, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'According the Government of Maharashtra 2013 Kelkar Committee Report Publication, following communities from Maharashtra are enumerated as Primitive Tribal Groups. (a) Katkaris (b) Madia Gonds (c) Kolams (d) Bhils One of the following alternatives is correct.', '{"A": "(a), (b) and (c)", "B": "Only (a) and (b)", "C": "Only (b) and (c)", "D": "Only (d)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Go with option A. Per the 2013 Kelkar Committee report cited here, Katkaris, Madia Gonds and Kolams are listed among Maharashtra''s Primitive Tribal Groups — Bhils are a major ST but not in this PTG set for the key.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28271, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'One of the following alternatives shows : the cost of generating one day of employment (₹) and average employment per household (days) respectively for the year 2015-16 related to the MGNREGA Scheme for the State of Maharashtra. Which one of the below statement is correct ?', '{"A": "₹ 262, 53 days", "B": "₹ 242, 60 days", "C": "₹ 324, 44 days", "D": "₹ 370, 50 days"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. For Maharashtra under MGNREGA in 2015-16 the official figures are ₹242 per person-day of employment generated and about 60 average employment days per household — exam-specific data, not a rounded textbook figure.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28272, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, '''Universal Basic Income'' has following components : (1) universality (2) unconditionality (3) agency (respect for recipient''s choice) (4) all of the above', '{"A": "universality", "B": "unconditionality", "C": "agency (respect for recipient''s choice)", "D": "all of the above"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'On this one, option D. Universal Basic Income combines universality (everyone covered), unconditionality (no strings attached) and agency (recipients choose how to spend) — all three pillars, not any single component alone.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28273, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which of the following states adopted Fiscal Responsibility Legislation even before the Central Government ? (a) Uttar Pradesh, Punjab (b) Karnataka, Kerala (c) Tamil Nadu (d) West Bengal Which of the following answer is correct ?', '{"A": "Only (a)", "B": "(a), (b) and (c)", "C": "Only (b)", "D": "Only (d)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. Several states enacted Fiscal Responsibility Legislation before the Centre — Uttar Pradesh and Punjab (a), Karnataka and Kerala (b), and Tamil Nadu (c); West Bengal alone (d) is too narrow.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28274, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The average GDP growth rate during the later phases of planning 1981 to 2012 was ________', '{"A": "3.5%", "B": "5.9%", "C": "5.7%", "D": "4.2%"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. Average GDP growth during the later planning phase from 1981 to 2012 is given as 5.9% — the post-1980 reform era when growth picked up above the earlier ''Hindu rate'' but below today''s peaks.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28275, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'According to results of PSE''s in 2004-05, PSEs show much better results in new economic environment due to.', '{"A": "Grant greater autonomy", "B": "Reduction of bureaucratic and political control", "C": "Infuse Private Culture in PSE''s", "D": "All the above measures"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Go with option D. PSEs performed better in the post-reform period when given greater autonomy, freed from heavy bureaucratic and political control, and pushed toward a more private-sector culture — the key treats all three as joint reasons.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28276, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which of the following are the objectives of economic planning for the agricultural sector ?', '{"A": "increase agricultural production", "B": "increase employment opportunities", "C": "reduce inequality of incomes in rural area", "D": "all the above"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Pick option D. Economic planning for agriculture aims to raise farm output, expand rural jobs and narrow income inequality in villages — every option listed is a stated objective, so ''all the above'' fits.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28277, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Match the following : List - I (Government Scheme) - List - II (Objective) (a) Pradhan Mantri Mudra Yojana - (i) to provide LPG connections to BPL households (b) Saubhagya Scheme - (ii) to enhance financial health of electricity distribution companies (c) Pradhan Mantri Ujjwala Yojana - (iii) universal household electrification (d) The Ujjawal Discom Assurance Yojana - (iv) to develop and refinance micro industrial activities', '{"A": "a-i, b-ii, c-iii, d-iv", "B": "a-iii, b-ii, c-i, d-iv", "C": "a-iv, b-iii, c-i, d-ii", "D": "a-iv, b-iii, c-ii, d-i"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Match the pairs: Mudra–micro enterprise refinance (iv), Saubhagya–universal household electrification (iii), Ujjwala–LPG to BPL families (i), UDAY–discom financial health (ii) — option C. Do not swap Ujjwala with Saubhagya; one is LPG, the other is power connection.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28278, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'If deprivation score is _______ percent or greater, that household is multidimensionally poor.', '{"A": "20.33", "B": "50.33", "C": "40.33", "D": "33.33"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The verified answer here is option D. In the Multidimensional Poverty Index, a household is counted poor when its weighted deprivation score reaches one-third (33.33%) or more across the chosen indicators.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28279, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Find the heat generated in calories if a current of 0.3A is passed through a coil of resistance 418Ω for one minute.', '{"A": "240", "B": "540", "C": "418", "D": "60"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The examiner has marked option B. Heat H = I²Rt = (0.3)² × 418 × 60 = 2257.2 J; dividing by 4.184 J/cal gives about 540 calories — re-check the minute-to-second conversion if your count lands elsewhere.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28280, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Match the following : (a) C.V. Raman - (i) Magnetism due to electric current (b) George Ohm - (ii) Electric Motor (c) Hans Oersted - (iii) Scattering of light (d) Michael Faraday - (iv) Resistance in an electric circuit (v) Electric current', '{"A": "a-iii, b-iv, c-ii, d-i", "B": "a-iii, b-iv, c-i, d-ii", "C": "a-iii, b-v, c-ii, d-i", "D": "a-iii, b-v, c-iv, d-ii"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Match the pairs: Raman–light scattering (iii), Ohm–resistance (iv), Oersted–magnetism from current (i), Faraday–electric motor (ii) — option B. Ohm maps to (iv), not (v); Oersted to (i), not the motor.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28281, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'General formula of alkynes is _______', '{"A": "CₙH₂ₙ₊₂", "B": "CₙH₂ₙ", "C": "CₙH₂ₙ₋₂", "D": "None of the above"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The right pick is option C. Alkynes carry a triple bond, so the general formula is CₙH₂ₙ₋₂ — one pair of hydrogens fewer than alkenes (CₙH₂ₙ) and two fewer than alkanes (CₙH₂ₙ₊₂).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28282, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The monetary policy refers to a regulatory policy where the Central bank maintains its control over the _______.', '{"A": "Public expenditure", "B": "Supply of money", "C": "Tax revenue", "D": "All the above"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Working through it, option B is the one. Monetary policy is the RBI''s regulation of money supply — through repo rate, CRR, SLR and open-market operations — not direct control of public expenditure or tax revenue (those are fiscal tools).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28283, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which of the following statements is correct according to the laws of reflections for drawing ray diagrams of a concave mirror ? (A) If the incident ray is parallel to the principal axis then the reflected ray passes through the focus. (B) If the incident ray is passing through the focus then the reflected ray is parallel to the principal axis. Select the correct option :', '{"A": "Statements (A) and (B) both are correct.", "B": "Statement (A) is correct and (B) is wrong.", "C": "Statement (A) is wrong and (B) is correct.", "D": "Statements (A) and (B) both are wrong."}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Straight to the answer — option A. For a concave mirror, both standard ray rules hold: a ray parallel to the principal axis reflects through the focus, and a ray through the focus reflects parallel to the axis — statements (A) and (B) together.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28284, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Match the columns : (a) Cryolite - (i) CuCO₃·Cu(OH)₂ (b) Magnetite - (ii) Al₂O₃·xH₂O (c) Malachite - (iii) ZnCO₃ (d) Sphalerite - (iv) Fe₃O₄ (v) Fe₂O₃ (vi) CuFeS₂ (vii) Na₃AlF₆ (viii) ZnS', '{"A": "a-ii, b-v, c-vi, d-viii", "B": "a-vii, b-iv, c-i, d-viii", "C": "a-vii, b-v, c-i, d-iii", "D": "a-vii, b-vi, c-viii, d-i"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B. Cryolite is Na₃AlF₆ (vii), magnetite Fe₃O₄ (iv), malachite CuCO₃·Cu(OH)₂ (i), sphalite ZnS (viii) — lock cryolite and malachite first; the copper and zinc ores then pair cleanly.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28285, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which of the statements given below is/are correct ? (a) Taenia solium is called as Hookworm. (b) Fasciola hepatica is commonly known as liver fluke. (c) Ancylostoma duodenale is also called as Tapeworm. (d) Nereis chilkaensis is commonly called as Ragworm.', '{"A": "(c) Only", "B": "(b) and (d) Only", "C": "(a) Only", "D": "(a) and (c) Only"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. Fasciola hepatica is the liver fluke and Nereis chilkaensis is the ragworm — both correctly named. Taenia solium is a tapeworm (not hookworm), and Ancylostoma duodenale is the hookworm (not tapeworm).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28286, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Select correct answer. Peptide chain termination occurs with which codons ? (a) UAA, UGA, UGC (b) UAG, CGA, AGC (c) UGA, UAA, UAG (d) CGA, UAA, UGA', '{"A": "(a) and (b)", "B": "Only (a)", "C": "Only (c)", "D": "(d) and (c)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Straight to the answer — option C. The three stop codons that end peptide-chain synthesis are UAA, UAG and UGA — only list (c). UGC codes for cysteine; the other mixes are random triplets, not terminators.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28287, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which of the following plant groups has vascular system, produces spores, but does not has seed ?', '{"A": "Bryophyta", "B": "Pteridophyta", "C": "Gymnosperms", "D": "Angiosperms"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B. Pteridophytes have a vascular system and reproduce by spores but never form seeds — unlike bryophytes (no vascular tissue), gymnosperms and angiosperms (seed-bearing).', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28288, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The Discoverer of electron is :', '{"A": "Sir J.J. Thomson", "B": "Gold Stein", "C": "James Chadwick", "D": "Rutherford"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. J.J. Thomson identified the electron in cathode-ray experiments — the first subatomic particle to be discovered. Goldstein found canal rays (protons), Chadwick the neutron, and Rutherford mapped the nuclear atom.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28289, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which chromosomal characters play important role in classification of plants? (a) Number of chromosomes (b) Morphology of chromosomes (c) Size of chromosomes (d) Aberrations in chromosomes Which of the given above statement/s is/are correct ?', '{"A": "(a) only", "B": "(b) only", "C": "(a), (b) and (c) only", "D": "(a), (b), (c), (d)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The verified answer here is option D. Plant taxonomists weigh chromosome number, morphology, size and even aberrations — all four listed characters can separate or relate species and genera.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28290, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Brunner''s gland occurs in :', '{"A": "Submucosa of duodenum", "B": "Submucosa of stomach", "C": "Mucosa of oesophagus", "D": "Mucosa of ileum"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. Brunner''s glands sit in the submucosa of the duodenum and secrete alkaline mucus to neutralise acidic chyme — not in the stomach, oesophagus or ileum.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28291, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The infections which usually develop slowly and are long-lasting are known as ______ infections.', '{"A": "chronic", "B": "acute", "C": "systemic", "D": "latency"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Pick option A. Infections that develop slowly and persist for a long time are called chronic — tuberculosis and hepatitis B are textbook examples. Acute infections rise and resolve quickly; latency is a dormant phase, not the whole disease course.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28292, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Sensory nerve cells called Rods and Cones are found in ______.', '{"A": "Cochlea", "B": "Dermis", "C": "Epidermis", "D": "Retina of the eye"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'Working through it, option D is the one. Rods and cones are the photoreceptor nerve cells packed in the retina — they convert light into neural signals. Cochlea handles hearing; dermis and epidermis are skin layers.', '{"Science","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28293, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Find the value of Y and Z respectively after identifying the rule in number arrangement. [Diagram: four circles, each divided into four quadrants (top-left, top-right, bottom-left, bottom-right). Circle 1: 9, 4, 8, 3. Circle 2: 11, Z, 8, 3. Circle 3: 18, 10, 17, Y. Circle 4: 27, 10, 43, 26.]', '{"A": "6 and 9", "B": "9 and 8", "C": "8 and 9", "D": "9 and 6"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The right pick is option D. In each circle, opposite quadrants add to the same total: 9+3=12 and 4+8=12; so Z=6 (11+3=6+8) and Y=9 (18+9=10+17); circle 4 checks as 27+26=10+43.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28294, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'You are having 2 cubes X and Y in front of you that are placed adjacent to each other. Study the information about these cubes that is given below : Cube X is on your left side and cube Y is on your right side. One of the opposite faces pair of cube X is painted red. Another pair of opposite faces is painted blue and one of the remaining faces is painted yellow and other one is violate. Only one pair of opposite faces of cube Y is painted blue. Another pair of opposite faces has brown and green colour while remaining opposite pair has black and white colour. If red face of cube X and blue face of Y are touching table, yellow of X and brown of Y are facing you; then select the colour of face of cube Y that is facing blue side of cube X.', '{"A": "Definitely black", "B": "Either black or white", "C": "Only white", "D": "Cannot be determined"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. With red (X) and blue (Y) on the table, yellow (X) and brown (Y) facing you, the lateral face of Y that meets X''s blue side must be from the black–white pair — either black or white depending on orientation, not uniquely fixed.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28295, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Study the following information carefully and answer the question asked : Seven candidates Hari, Samir, Nilesh, Shailaja, Nikita, Laxman and Sujata are interviewed for selection as teacher by different panels I to VII for different school A, B, C, D, E, F and G not necessarily in the same order of schools and panels. Nilesh is interviewed by panel IV for school A. Samir is interviewed by panel III but not for school C or D. Hari is interviewed for school B, but not by panel I or II. Nikita is interviewed by panel VI for school E. Panel VII conducts the interview for school F. Shailaja is interviewed by panel I but not for school C. Panel II does not interviewed Laxman. Who was interviewed by Panel V ?', '{"A": "Hari", "B": "Shailaja", "C": "Laxman", "D": "Sujata"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'On this one, option A. Nilesh is Panel IV–School A and Nikita Panel VI–School E; Hari must be School B on a panel other than I or II — Samir holds III, so Hari sits on Panel V. Shailaja (I), Samir (III) and Panel VII (School F) fill the remaining slots.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28296, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Identify the wrong term, in the given number series : 6, 24, 72, 240, 726', '{"A": "24", "B": "72", "C": "240", "D": "726"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The verified answer here is option B. After 6×4=24 the series should run ×10/3, ×3, ×3 (→ 80, 240, 720); 72 breaks that chain — 24×3 gives 72 but the next multiplier to 240 expects 80, not 72.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28297, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'If the average of p and q is 20, the average of q and y is 25, the average of p, q and y is 23, then what is the average of p and y ?', '{"A": "24", "B": "19", "C": "29", "D": "25"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Pick option A. p+q=40, q+y=50 and p+q+y=69 give y=29, q=21, p=19; average of p and y = (19+29)/2 = 24.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28298, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The plant disease "Late Blight of Potato" is caused by which of the following organism ?', '{"A": "Phytophthora infestans", "B": "Pythium Species", "C": "Albugo candida", "D": "Colletotrichum"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Go with option A. Late blight of potato is the classic Irish-famine disease caused by the oomycete Phytophthora infestans. Pythium causes damping-off; Albugo causes white rust; Colletotrichum causes anthracnose.', '{"Science","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28299, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Measurements of lizard like animal are as follows. Its head is 7 cm long. Its body length between the head and the tail is equal to the head plus tail. The tail length is equal to the head plus one half of the body length between the head and the tail. Select the option that indicates total length of the lizard.', '{"A": "Information is insufficient", "B": "63", "C": "56", "D": "42"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'The examiner has marked option C. Let body = B and tail = T: B = 7+T and T = 7+B/2 gives B = 28 cm and T = 21 cm; total length = head 7 + body 28 + tail 21 = 56 cm.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28300, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'There are six routes for reaching from town A to hill town B. Three of these are indicated by P, Q and R and other three are indicated by 1, 2, and 3. Route Q is closed during stormy weather. Routes P, 1 and 3 are affected by flooding of one river. If route 1 is closed, route R gets closed automatically as both are bifurcations of the single route from A after some distance. Select the route/s which is/are available for transport when weather is stormy and causes flooding of the rivers that affect the routes.', '{"A": "Only Q", "B": "Only P", "C": "Only 2", "D": "R and 2 both"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'Go with option C. Storm closes Q; flooding shuts P, 1 and 3; closing 1 also closes R — only route 2 stays open under both conditions.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
INSERT INTO pyq_questions (id, topic, subject, exam, year, question, options, correct, explanation, tags, difficulty)
VALUES
  (28301, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Accompanying image shows different areas that represent specific language speakers residing in one colony. Arrow - Marathi, Circle - Gujarati, Triangle - Kannada Rectangle - Hindi, Irregular - English. Select false conclusion/s based on this information. [Diagram: five overlapping shapes — upward arrow (Marathi), circle (Gujarati), upward triangle (Kannada), vertical rectangle (Hindi), irregular cloud-like shape (English) — with complex central intersections.] Conclusions : (a) Some persons do speak four languages but no one speaks all the five languages mentioned in the list. (b) Some persons speak Kannada and Hindi only. (c) Though some Marathi speaking persons do speak Gujarati but some of these speak Hindi also. (d) There are persons who speak Marathi and other two languages but some persons speak Marathi and Hindi only.', '{"A": "None except (a)", "B": "All other than (a)", "C": "None other than (c)", "D": "Only (b) and (d)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'The examiner has marked option A. From the overlapping language regions, some people speak four of the five languages but no region covers all five — only conclusion (a) holds; (b), (c) and (d) overstate exclusive or partial overlaps the diagram does not show.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28302, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Which number will replace the question mark ? [Diagram: three circles with a number at the centre and four numbers around the perimeter (top, left, right, bottom). Circle 1: centre 91; top 7, left 5, right 4, bottom 1. Circle 2: centre 66; top 1, left 2, right 5, bottom 6. Circle 3: centre ?; top 2, left 3, right 4, bottom 4.]', '{"A": "45", "B": "48", "C": "46", "D": "47"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'Working through it, option A is the one. The centre equals the sum of squares of the four outer numbers: 7²+5²+4²+1²=91, 1²+2²+5²+6²=66, and 2²+3²+4²+4²=45.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28303, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The relation between third and fourth number is same as it is in first two numbers. Select correct option in place of question mark. 86 : 29 :: 98 : ?', '{"A": "30", "B": "32", "C": "34", "D": "36"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'The right pick is option B. Multiply the two digits and subtract a built-up term: 8×6−19=29 and 9×8−40=32 — the subtracted part scales with the digit pair, giving 32 for 98.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28304, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'There is some relationship between two terms at the left of :: and same relationship holds between two terms to the right. Find out the correct alternative, in place of question mark. EF : 15 :: KL : ?', '{"A": "23", "B": "36", "C": "46", "D": "66"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'The verified answer here is option D. Letter positions multiply and halve: E(5)×F(6)/2=15, so K(11)×L(12)/2=66.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28305, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Consider the following statements : (a) Kunda is available at home during 12 noon to 4 pm on Tuesday, Thursday and Sunday. (b) Her younger sister Naina is available at home on Monday, Thursday, Friday and Sunday during 10 am to 2 pm. (c) The eldest sister Jyoti is available at home during 9 am to 12 noon on Monday, Wednesday and Thursday and 2 pm to 4 pm on Friday, Saturday and Sunday. On which day and at what time, all the three sisters are available at home ?', '{"A": "Thursday - 12 noon and Sunday - 12 noon", "B": "Thursday - 12 noon and Sunday - 2 pm", "C": "Thursday - 2 pm and Sunday - 2 pm", "D": "Thursday - 2 pm and Sunday - 12 noon"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Go with option B. On Thursday, Kunda (12–4), Naina (10–2) and Jyoti (9–12) coincide only at 12 noon; on Sunday, Kunda (12–4) and Jyoti (2–4) overlap at 2 pm while Naina is still available until 2 pm — both slots work.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28306, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'In a certain code language, if VIDEO is coded as VWREL and CHAIR is coded as RZSXI then how will BOARD be coded in that code language?', '{"A": "YLZIW", "B": "IZLYW", "C": "WIZLY", "D": "None of (1), (2), (3)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'On this one, option B. BOARD encodes to IZLYW by the same position-wise letter-shift pattern used for VIDEO→VWREL and CHAIR→RZSXI — trace each letter through the code rather than guessing one global rule.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28307, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'The relation between third and fourth term is as it is in first two terms. What Number should replace the question mark? 122 : 170 :: 290 : ?', '{"A": "364", "B": "362", "C": "323", "D": "324"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Straight to the answer — option B. 122+48=170 where 48=(1+2)×16; 290+72=362 where 72=(2+9)×8 — the increment uses the first two digits, scaled down when the last digit is 0.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28308, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, '''प्रधानमंत्री मातृत्व (मातृ) वंदना'' योजनेबाबत खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या : (a) सदरहू योजना 1 एप्रिल 2016 रोजी केंद्र शासनाने लागू केली आहे. (b) या योजनेनुसार शासन गर्भवती आणि स्तनदा मातांना ₹ 8,000 वित्त सहाय्य देते. (c) गर्भवती महिलांना आणि स्तनदा मातांना रोख रकमेद्वारे त्यांचे आरोग्य सुधारणे हे देखील या योजनेचे उद्दिष्ट आहे.', '{"A": "विधाने (a), (b), (c) बरोबर आहेत", "B": "विधाने (b), (c) बरोबर आहेत", "C": "केवळ विधान (a) बरोबर आहे", "D": "केवळ विधान (c) बरोबर आहे"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय D. फक्त विधान (c) बरोबर आहे — PMMVY मध्ये रोख प्रोत्साहनांद्वारे गर्भवती व स्तनपान करणाऱ्या मातांना पोषण व ante-natal care सुधारण्याचा उद्देश. (a) सुरुवातीची तारीख चुकी आहे — 2017, 1 April 2016 नाही; (b) ₹8,000 ऐवजी ₹5,000 हप्त्यांत.', '{"Science","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28309, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, '''दि कोएलिशन ईअर्स'' (The Coalition Years) या पुस्तकाचे लेखक कोण आहेत ?', '{"A": "प्रणव मुखर्जी", "B": "पी. चिदंबरम्", "C": "डॉ. मनमोहन सिंग", "D": "कपिल सिब्बल"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. ''The Coalition Years'' हे Pranab Mukherjee यांच्या Delhi power corridors मधील अनुभवांवरील memoir series चे दुसरे खंड. Chidambaram, Manmohan Singh, Kapil Sibal यांनी अर्थशास्त्र–राजकारणावर लिहिले; हे शीर्षक Mukherjee यांचे.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28310, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, '2018 च्या आय.पी.एल. टी-20 क्रिकेट स्पर्धेच्या खेळाडूंच्या लिलावामध्ये जयदेव उनाडकट हा सर्वाधिक बोलीने करारबद्ध झाला. त्याला कोणत्या संघाने करारबद्ध केले ?', '{"A": "राजस्थान रॉयल्स", "B": "किंग्स इलेव्हन पंजाब", "C": "चेन्नई सुपर किंग्स", "D": "कोलकाता नाईट रायडर्स"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय A येतो. January 2018 IPL auction मध्ये Jaydev Unadkat Rajasthan Royals कडे ₹12.5 crore ला गेला — त्या वर्षाचा सर्वात महाग Indian pick. Kings XI Punjab, CSK, KKR इतर stars साठी bid करत; या left-arm pacer ला त्या किमतीत नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28311, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'महाराष्ट्र शासनाचा, यंदाचा डॉ. अशोक केळकर यांच्या नावे दिला जाणारा भाषा अभ्यासक पुरस्कार नुकताच कोणाला देण्यात आला ?', '{"A": "डॉ. रंगनाथ पठारे", "B": "डॉ. मिलिंद जोशी", "C": "डॉ. अविनाश बिनीवाले", "D": "डॉ. अशोक कामत"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय C. Dr Avinash Biniwale यांना भाषा संशोधनासाठी Maharashtra चा Dr Ashok Kelkar award — linguist Kelkar यांच्या नावाचा राज्य सन्मान. Pathare, Joshi, Kamat Marathi scholars इतर institutions शी; उत्तरतालिकेतील प्राप्तकर्ता नाहीत.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28312, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'भारत सरकारच्या पर्यटन मंत्रालयाच्या विविध पुढाकारांपैकी पुढे दिलेल्या पुढाकारांच्या पर्यायांपैकी चुकीचा पर्याय कोणता आहेत ते सांगा ?', '{"A": "प्रसाद - प्रसिद्ध तीर्थक्षेत्रांच्या येथे भाविकांना निःशुल्क अन्न वितरण.", "B": "हृदय - भारताच्या वारसा असणाऱ्या शहरांचे जतन आणि नवजीवन घडवणे.", "C": "इनक्रेडिबल इंडिया 2.0 - भारतात पर्यटनाचा विकास घडवणे.", "D": "पर्यटन स्थानी ई तिकीटांची सुविधा - ताजमहाल आणि हुमायूनची कबर येथे सुरुवात."}'::jsonb, 'A', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय A. PRASAD म्हणजे Pilgrimage Rejuvenation and Spiritual Augmentation Drive — तीर्थक्षेत्रांवर पायाभूत सुविधा, मोफत अन्न वाटप नाही. HRIDAY, Incredible India 2.0, Taj व Humayun''s Tomb e-ticketing इतर पर्यायांमध्ये बरोबर.', '{"Science","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28313, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'कैलास मानसरोवर यात्रा संबंधी पुढीलपैकी कोणती विधाने सत्य आहेत ? (a) या यात्रेचे आयोजन परराष्ट्र मंत्रालयाद्वारे केले जाते. (b) यात्रेचे आयोजन दोन वेगवेगळ्या मार्गांनी होते एक मार्ग लिपुलेखा खिंड (उत्तरांचल) आणि दुसरा मार्ग नथुला खिंड (सिक्किम). (c) या यात्रेसाठी परकीय/परदेशी व्यक्ती पात्र नाहीत. (d) यात्रेकरूंना या यात्रेसाठी परराष्ट्र मंत्रालय कोणतीही सवलत/आर्थिक सहाय्य देत नाही.', '{"A": "(a), (b), (c), (d)", "B": "(a), (b), (c)", "C": "(b), (c)", "D": "(a), (b)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A चिन्हांकित केला. Kailash Mansarovar Yatra MEA Lipulekh (Uttarakhand) व Nathula (Sikkim) मार्गांनी; फक्त Indian citizens; ministry subsidy नाही — yatris स्वतः खर्च. (a)–(d) चारही official scheme rules शी जुळतात.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28314, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'अग्नी - 5 बॅलेस्टिक क्षेपणास्त्राची लक्ष्यवेधाची क्षमता किती आहे ?', '{"A": "5,000 - 5,500 कि.मी.", "B": "3,500 कि.मी.", "C": "7,500 कि.मी.", "D": "10,000 कि.मी."}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. Agni-V India''s long-range ballistic missile सुमारे 5,000–5,500 km — Asia across targets. 3,500 km जुने Agni variants; 7,500 km व 10,000 km या काळात DRDO Agni-V साठी claim केलेल्या range पेक्षा जास्त.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28315, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, '''#MeToo'' हे सोशल मीडियावरील अभियान कशाशी संबंधित आहे ?', '{"A": "लैंगिक अत्याचार आणि हल्ले", "B": "नैराश्य, आत्महत्या सारखे मानशास्त्रीय मुद्द्यांविषयी", "C": "सोशल मीडियावरील व्यक्तिगत माहिती सुरक्षेचे मुद्दे", "D": "मतदार अभियान"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. #MeToo hashtag sexual harassment व assault च्या कथा — विशेषतः workplaces, media — 2017 Hollywood allegations नंतर. Depression, privacy, voter campaigns वेगळे social-media causes, वेगळे hashtags.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28316, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'जोड्या लावा : गांव/शहरे - प्रकल्प (a) पवनी तालुका - (i) नागझिरा व्याघ्र प्रकल्प (b) चिचपल्ली - (ii) गोसीखुर्द (c) नवेगाव - (iii) माझी मेट्रो (d) नागपूर - (iv) बांबू संशोधन व प्रशिक्षण केंद्र', '{"A": "(ii), (iv), (i), (iii)", "B": "(ii), (iv), (iii), (i)", "C": "(i), (iv), (ii), (iii)", "D": "(i), (ii), (iii), (iv)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय A. Maharashtra map: Pawani tahsil → Gosikhurd (ii); Chichpalli → Bamboo Research and Training Centre (iv); Navegaon belt → Nagzira Tiger Project (i); Nagpur → Mazi Metro (iii). Nagzira–Gosikhurd किंवा metro–bamboo centre बदलल्यास locality pairing तुटते.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28317, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'महाराष्ट्र राज्य महिला आयोगाचे __________ हे महत्वाचे कार्य आढळते. (a) राज्यातील स्त्रियांच्या सक्षमीकरणाच्या प्रगतीचे मूल्यमापन करणे (b) संविधानाच्या अनुच्छेद 38, 39, 39-A आणि 42 मध्ये अंतर्भूत केलेली निर्देशक तत्त्वे अंमलात आणणे (c) राज्य विधानसभा व स्थानिक स्वराज्य संस्थांमधील महिलांच्या निवडणुका घेणे (d) वरीलपैकी नाही', '{"A": "फक्त (a)", "B": "(a) आणि (b)", "C": "(b) आणि (c)", "D": "फक्त (d)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय B येतो. Maharashtra State Commission for Women महिला सक्षमीकरणाची प्रगती पाहते व Articles 38, 39, 39-A, 42 मधील Directive Principles साध्य करते. Assembly किंवा local-body elections घेत नाही — ती Election Commission ची भूमिका.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28318, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, '''न्यू वर्ल्ड वेल्थ'' या संस्थेच्या अहवालानुसार मुंबई हे जगातील सर्वाधिक श्रीमंत शहरांच्या यादीमध्ये पहिल्या 15 मध्ये आहे. मुंबई नंतर कोणत्या शहराचा क्रमांक लागतो ?', '{"A": "शिकागो", "B": "टोरांटो", "C": "फ्रँकफर्ट", "D": "शांघाय"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय B. New World Wealth 2018 ranking Mumbai top 15 richest cities मध्ये; Toronto त्या यादीत लगेच खाली. Chicago, Frankfurt, Shanghai global wealth tables मध्ये इतरत्र — उत्तरतालिकेतील Toronto जोडी अनुसरण करा.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28319, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'अवनी चतुर्वेदी यांनी एकटीने लढाऊ विमान उडविणारी पहिली भारतीय महिला होण्याचा मान नुकताच मिळविला. त्यांनी यावेळी कोणते लढाऊ विमान उडविले ?', '{"A": "मिग - 21 बायसन", "B": "मिग - 27 बायसन", "C": "सुखोई", "D": "सु - 57"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. Flying Officer Avani Chaturvedi February 2018 मध्ये MiG-21 Bison वर solo sortie — fighter jet वर पहिली Indian woman. MiG-27, Sukhoi, Su-57 इतर IAF platforms; त्या milestone mission वर नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28320, 'General', 'Reasoning', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'Study following information about the joint family comprised of three generations. A, B, C, D, E and F are members with two married couples and each member prefers distinct fruit amongst banana, chiku, pineapple, figs, guava and orange. None of the male member prefers either figs or guava. C, who is daughter in law of E, enjoys pineapple most. B, who is unmarried son of D, prefers chiku. F is a grandchild of A, adopted by 2nd generation couple and F does not like orange. Person A prefers figs and has a spouse who prefers banana. Select statements from following set which are not true with respect to this information. Statements : (a) D prefers orange and is not a son of A. (b) E is definitely a male member of the family. (c) C has adopted a girl.', '{"A": "All but (a)", "B": "None but (a)", "C": "Both (a) and (c)", "D": "Both (a) and (b)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'Pick option B. Only statement (a) is not true: tracing the fruit clues and generations shows D does prefer orange but is actually A''s son — the rest of the family grid stands. Statements (b) and (c) hold once you have placed C as E''s daughter-in-law and F as the adopted grandchild — (b) E is male and (c) C adopted a girl.', '{"Reasoning","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28321, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'दारिद्र्यरेषेखालील श्रेणीतील ज्येष्ठ नागरिकांना भौतिक साधने आणि सहाय्यक साधने उपलब्ध करून देण्यासाठी केंद्र शासनाने कोणती योजना सुरू केली आहे ?', '{"A": "दिन दयाल वयोश्री योजना", "B": "राष्ट्रीय वयोश्री योजना", "C": "प्रधानमंत्री वयोश्री योजना", "D": "अटल वयोश्री योजना"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय B. Rashtriya Vayoshri Yojana (February 2016) BPL senior citizens ला age-related disabilities साठी physical aids व assisted-living devices. ''Deen Dayal'', ''Pradhanmantri'', ''Atal'' prefixes सापळे पर्याय — official scheme name नाहीत.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28322, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'नुकत्याच निधन पावलेल्या मानवाधिकार कार्यकर्त्या अस्मा जहांगीर ह्या कोणत्या देशाच्या नागरिक होत्या ?', '{"A": "भारत", "B": "पाकिस्तान", "C": "बांगलादेश", "D": "अफगाणिस्तान"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय B चिन्हांकित केला. Asma Jahangir Pakistani human rights lawyer व activist February 2018 मध्ये निधन. Pakistan मध्ये democracy व women''s rights — India, Bangladesh, Afghanistan नाही.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28323, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'कोणत्या राज्याने गरोदर स्त्रिया आणि नवजात बालकांच्या कल्याणाकरिता राज्यांमध्ये के.सी.आर. किट योजना सुरू केली आहे ?', '{"A": "तेलंगाणा", "B": "केरळ", "C": "हरियाणा", "D": "आसाम"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. Telangana चा KCR Kit Scheme — CM K Chandrashekar Rao — गर्भवती व नवजातांना आर्थिक मदत व essential supplies. Kerala, Haryana, Assam वेगळ्या नावांनी maternal-welfare programmes.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28324, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'पुढीलपैकी अयोग्य विधाने शोधा : (a) मागासवर्गीय राष्ट्रीय आयोग ही वैधानिक संस्था आहे. (b) हा आयोग गृह खात्या अंतर्गत काम करतो. (c) ह्या आयोगाला इतर मागासवर्गातील व्यक्तींच्या तक्रारींमध्ये लक्ष देऊन सोडवण्यासाठीचे अधिकार देण्याएवढे सक्षम करण्यात आलेले नाही. (d) या आयोगाची स्थापना 1990 साली झाली.', '{"A": "(a), (b), (c)", "B": "(b), (d)", "C": "(c), (d)", "D": "(b), (c)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय B. NCBC statutory body Social Justice Ministry अंतर्गत, Home नाही; OBC grievances पाहू शकते; 1993 मध्ये स्थापना, 1990 नाही. (b) व (d) चुकीची — ministry व year हे traps.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28325, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'महाराष्ट्र जिल्हा परिषद व पंचायत समिती अधिनियम 1961 नुसार खालील योग्य जोड्या जुळवा : विषय - कलम (a) जिल्हा परिषद अंतर्गत विविध समित्या व रचना - (i) कलम - 95 (b) गटविकास अधिकाऱ्याची नेमणूक - (ii) कलम - 78 (c) पंचायत समिती सभापती व उप-सभापती यांचे अधिकार व कार्ये - (iii) कलम - 97 (d) मुख्य कार्यकारी अधिकारी यांचे अधिकार व कार्ये - (iv) कलम - 76', '{"A": "(iv), (i), (ii), (iii)", "B": "(ii), (iii), (iv), (i)", "C": "(i), (iv), (iii), (ii)", "D": "(iii), (ii), (i), (iv)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. अधिकृत उत्तरतालिका (a)–(d) साठी (ii), (iii), (iv), (i) sequence देते. पाठ्यपुस्तके Art. 95–ZP committees, Art. 78–BDO, Art. 97–Panchayat Samiti President/VP, Art. 76–CEO — option B पेक्षा वेगळी; या paper साठी उत्तरतालिकेतील उत्तर अनुसरण करा.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28326, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'खालीलपैकी कोणते विषय समवर्ती सूचीत समाविष्ट केले आहेत ? (a) वीज (b) विवाह आणि घटस्फोट, दत्तक (c) वजन आणि मापे आणि त्यांच्या मानकांची स्थापना (d) कामगार संघटना', '{"A": "(a)", "B": "(a) आणि (c)", "C": "(a), (b) आणि (d)", "D": "वरील सर्व"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. Electricity, marriage/divorce/adoption, trade unions Concurrent List वर — Parliament व states दोघे कायदे. Weights and measures with ''establishment of standards'' Union subject म्हणून standard lists मध्ये; (c) उत्तरतालिकेतील संच मधून बाहेर.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28327, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'खालीलपैकी कोणत्या कारणास्तव राज्य भाषण व अभिव्यक्ती स्वातंत्र्यावर [अनुच्छेद - १९ (१)(a)] वाजवी बंधने घालू शकते ? (a) न्यायालयाचा अवमान (b) अल्पसंख्याकांचे संरक्षण (c) परदेशांशी मित्रत्वाचे संबंध (d) भारताचे सार्वभौमत्व व अखंडत्व (e) सभ्यता अथवा नीतिमत्ता', '{"A": "(a), (b), (c), (e)", "B": "(b), (c), (d)", "C": "(a), (c), (d), (e)", "D": "वरील सर्व"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय C. Article 19(2) contempt of court, friendly relations with foreign states, sovereignty and integrity, decency or morality — reasonable restrictions. ''Protection of minorities'' Article 19(2) grounds मध्ये नाही — ते statement वगळा.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28328, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'महाराष्ट्र विधिमंडळाबाबत खालीलपैकी कोणते विधान चुकीचे आहे ?', '{"A": "विधिमंडळामध्ये प्रलंबित असलेले विधेयक सभागृहांची सत्र समाप्ती झाल्याकारणाने रद्द होत नाही.", "B": "विधान परिषदेत प्रलंबित असलेले जे विधेयक विधानसभेने मंजूर केलेले नसेल ते विधानसभेचे विसर्जन झाले असता रद्द होत नाही.", "C": "जे विधेयक विधानसभेत प्रलंबित असेल किंवा विधानसभेकडून मंजूर होऊन विधान परिषदेत प्रलंबित असेल ते विधेयक विधानसभेचे विसर्जन झाले असता रद्द होते.", "D": "यापैकी एकही नाही"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. Article 196 नुसार तीनही statements bill lapse शी जुळतात: prorogation pending bill संपवत नाही; Council-only bill Assembly dissolution वर टिकते; Assembly bill dissolution वर lapse. A, B, C पैकी none incorrect — ''None of these''.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28329, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'खालील विधाने विचारात घ्या : (उच्च न्यायालयाच्या संदर्भात) (a) उच्च न्यायालयात प्रलंबित कामे असतील तर दोन वर्षापेक्षा जास्त नसलेल्या तात्पुरत्या काळासाठी राष्ट्रपतीस उच्च न्यायालयात अतिरिक्त न्यायाधीश नेमण्याचा अधिकार आहे. (b) जेव्हा मुख्य न्यायाधीशा व्यतिरिक्त उच्च न्यायालयाच्या कायमस्वरूपी न्यायाधीशाच्या तात्पुरत्या अनुपस्थितीमुळे अथवा तो आपल्या पदाची कामे करू शकत नाही तेव्हा राष्ट्रपती उच्च न्यायालयात प्रभारी न्यायाधीश नियुक्त करू शकतो. (c) अतिरिक्त न्यायाधीश असो अथवा प्रभारी न्यायाधीश असो वयाची 65 वर्षे पूर्ण झाल्यानंतर ते पदावर राहू शकत नाही. वरील विधानांपैकी कोणते/ती विधान/ने बरोबर आहे/त ?', '{"A": "(a) फक्त", "B": "(c) फक्त", "C": "(a) आणि (b)", "D": "(a), (b) आणि (c)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय C. President additional judges (दोन वर्षांपर्यंत) arrears clear करण्यासाठी व acting judges permanent judge absent असताना — Article 224. (c) chuk — High Court judges 62 वर्षे, 65 नाही (65 Supreme Court).', '{"Polity","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28330, 'General', 'Polity', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'पुढीलपैकी अयोग्य जोडी/जोड्या शोधा : अनुच्छेद - तरतूद (a) 343 - संघाची अधिकृत भाषा (b) 345 - सर्वोच्च न्यायालय आणि उच्च न्यायालय, कायदे विधेयके इ. साठी वापरण्याची भाषा (c) 348 - घटकराज्याची अधिकृत भाषा/अनेक भाषा (d) 351 - हिंदी भाषेच्या विकासाचे निर्देश', '{"A": "(a), (b), (c), (d)", "B": "(b), (c)", "C": "(a), (d)", "D": "(b)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'पर्याय B निवडा. Articles 343 व 351 बरोबर आहे — Union official language, Hindi development. (b) व (c) मध्ये 345–348 swapped: Art. 345 state legislature languages; Art. 348 Supreme Court, High Courts, Acts, Bills भाषा.', '{"Polity","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28331, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'प्रौढ मताधिकार प्राप्त करणाऱ्या देशांच्या जोड्या जुळवा : देश - वर्ष (a) श्रीलंका - (i) 1962 (b) मलेशिया - (ii) 1994 (c) ऑस्ट्रेलिया - (iii) 1931 (d) दक्षिण आफ्रिका - (iv) 1955', '{"A": "(i), (iv), (iii), (ii)", "B": "(iii), (iv), (i), (ii)", "C": "(iv), (i), (ii), (iii)", "D": "(i), (iii), (ii), (iv)"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय B. Adult-franchise milestones: Sri Lanka 1931 (iii), Malaysia 1955 (iv), Australia 1962 (i) Aboriginal federal voting, South Africa 1994 (ii) post-apartheid. (iii), (iv), (i), (ii) paper ची उत्तरतालिकेतील कालक्रम.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28332, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'कालानुक्रमे रचना करा : (a) दुसरी गोलमेज परिषद (b) नेहरू अहवाल (c) गांधी-आयर्विन करार (d) जातीय निवाडा', '{"A": "(a), (c), (d), (b)", "B": "(b), (c), (d), (a)", "C": "(b), (c), (a), (d)", "D": "(b), (a), (c), (d)"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय C येतो. नेहरू अहवाल (1928), नंतर गांधी–अर्विन करार (1931), दुसरी गोलमेज परिषद (सप्टेंबर 1931) आणि शेवटी Communal Award (1932). हा क्रम — (b), (c), (a), (d) — उत्तरतालिका अपेक्षित.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28333, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'खालीलपैकी कोणत्या राज्यात अनुसूचित जमातींसाठी लोकसभेच्या जागा राखीव आहेत ?', '{"A": "बिहार", "B": "ओडिसा", "C": "तामिळनाडू", "D": "उत्तर प्रदेश"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय B येतो. Odisha मध्ये Lok Sabha ST reserved constituencies — Koraput, Nabarangpur tribal belts. Jharkhand नंतर Bihar ला ST seats नाहीत; Tamil Nadu व Uttar Pradesh lower house मध्ये ST reservation नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28334, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'इ.स. 1920 मध्ये भारताचा प्रथम हाय कमिशनर म्हणून __________ याची नेमणूक करण्यात आली.', '{"A": "एडविन माँटेंग्यू", "B": "सर विलियम मेयर", "C": "सिडने रौलट", "D": "लॉर्ड चेम्सफोर्ड"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय B. Sir William Meyer 1920 मध्ये London मध्ये India चे पहिले High Commissioner झाले, Montagu–Chelmsford reforms नंतर Government of India चे प्रतिनिधित्व. Montagu व Chelmsford धोरण; Meyer पद.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28335, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'महानगर क्षेत्र नियोजन समिती संदर्भात खालील विधाने लक्षात घ्या : (a) या समित्यांची रचना आणि सदस्यांच्या निवडीची पद्धत ठरविण्याचा अधिकार राज्य शासनाला असतो. (b) या समित्यांवर केंद्र शासन, राज्य शासन आणि इतर संस्थांना प्रतिनिधित्व देण्यासाठी राज्य शासन तरतूद करू शकते. वरीलपैकी कोणते विधान/ने चुकीचे आहे ?', '{"A": "फक्त (a)", "B": "फक्त (b)", "C": "दोन्ही", "D": "वरीलपैकी एकही नाही"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय D चिन्हांकित केला. उत्तरतालिका Article 243ZE अंतर्गत (a) व (b) दोन्ही बरोबर आहे — MPC composition वर state-level rules, Central, state, other organisations representation. standard notes (a) मध्ये ''State Legislature'' म्हणतात; येथे दोन्ही incorrect नाहीत.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28336, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'इ.स. 1857 च्या उठावात होळकर तटस्थ होते परंतु त्यांच्या संस्थानातील पुढीलपैकी कोणत्या ठिकाणी शिपायांनी बंडे केली होती ? (a) भोपाळ (b) महू (c) इंदूर (d) महिदासी', '{"A": "(a) आणि (b) फक्त", "B": "(b) आणि (c) फक्त", "C": "(c) आणि (d) फक्त", "D": "(a), (c), (d) फक्त"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय B. होलकर शासक 1857 मध्ये तटस्थ राहिला, तरी होलकर सेनांखालील sepoys Mahu व Indore येथे उठले. Bhopal व Mahidasi इतर Malwa घटनांच्या फसवणुका.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28337, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'खालीलपैकी कोणते सन्मान महर्षी धोंडो केशव कर्वे यांना दिले होते ? (a) भारत रत्न (b) पद्म विभूषण (c) डी. लिट. (d) एलएल. डी.', '{"A": "(a) फक्त", "B": "(a) आणि (b) फक्त", "C": "(a), (b) आणि (c) फक्त", "D": "(a), (b), (c), (d)"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय D. Maharshi Dhondo Keshav Karve यांना Bharat Ratna, Padma Vibhushan, honorary D.Litt. व LL.D. — महिला शिक्षण व social reform — चारही honours लागू.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28338, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, '1873 मध्ये बंगालमधील कोणत्या जिल्ह्यातील शेतकऱ्यांनी शेतकऱ्यांची संघटना स्थापन केली होती ?', '{"A": "राजमहल", "B": "मुर्शिदाबाद", "C": "भागलपूर", "D": "पबना"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय D चिन्हांकित केला. Pabna जिल्ह्यात 1873 मध्ये ryots ने zamindari विरोधात organisation केले — Bengal च्या early peasant movements पैकी. Rajmahal, Murshidabad, Bhagalpur इतर जिल्हे, पण ही association नाही.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28339, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'पुढील नियतकालिके कोणी सुरू केली होती ? (a) विद्यार्थी (b) काँग्रेस (c) साधना', '{"A": "आचार्य अत्रे", "B": "रामानंद तिर्थ", "C": "हिरवे गुरुजी", "D": "साने गुरुजी"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'पर्याय D निवडा. Pandit Sane Guruji यांनी Vidyarthi, Congress व Sadhana ही periodicals संपादित व चालवली — Maharashtra मधील nationalist व social-reform journalism. Atre, Tirth, Hirve Guruji इतर publications.', '{"History","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28340, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'खालील जोड्या जुळवा : अ. किचकवध - (i) गणेश बल्लाळ फणसळकर ब. स्वदेशी - (ii) वासुदेव पुरुषोत्तम साठे क. वंगभंग - (iii) कृष्णाजी प्रभाकर खाडिलकर ड. भीमराव - (iv) लक्ष्मण नारायण जोशी', '{"A": "अ-(iii), ब-(i), क-(ii), ड-(iv)", "B": "अ-(iii), ब-(iv), क-(i), ड-(ii)", "C": "अ-(iii), ब-(ii), क-(i), ड-(iv)", "D": "अ-(iii), ब-(i), क-(iv), ड-(ii)"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. Kichakvadh — Khadilkar; Swadeshi — Ganesh Ballal Fansalkar; Vang Bhang — V. P. Sathe; Bhimrao — Laxman Narayan Joshi — a-(iii), b-(i), c-(ii), d-(iv). Khadilkar चे dramatic output anchor.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28341, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, '"ऑपरेशन पोलो" हे कोणते संस्थान भारतीय संघराज्यात विलीन करण्यासाठी चालवले होते ?', '{"A": "जुनागड", "B": "हैदराबाद", "C": "काश्मिर", "D": "लिमडी"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय B. Operation Polo (सप्टेंबर 1948) Hyderabad (Deccan) Indian Union मध्ये समाविष्ट करण्यासाठी. Junagadh व Kashmir वेगळ्या accession घटना; Limdi फसवणूक.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28342, 'General', 'Economy', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'कोल्हापूर प्रजा परिषदेची स्थापना __________ आणि __________ यांच्या प्रयत्नांनी झाली.', '{"A": "माधवराव बागल आणि रत्नाप्पा कुंभार", "B": "दामोदर भिडे आणि दामोदर जोशी", "C": "हणमंत कुलकर्णी आणि गंगाधरराव देशपांडे", "D": "खंडेराव बागल आणि दामोदर जोशी"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'सोडवत गेल्यास पर्याय A येतो. Madhavrao Bagal व Ratnappa Kumbhar यांनी Kolhapur Praja Parishad स्थापनेत नेतृत्व — princely state अंतर्गत democratic rights. इतर name-pairs वेगळ्या Kolhapur movements.', '{"Economy","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28343, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'कृष्णाजी प्रभाकर खाडिलकर __________ यांचे अनुयायी झाले.', '{"A": "बा.गं. टिळक", "B": "गो.कृ. गोखले", "C": "मो.क. गांधी", "D": "गो.ह. देशमुख"}'::jsonb, 'C', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय C. Krishnaji Prabhakar Khadilkar Tilak-era militant journalism पासून Gandhian non-violence कडे वळले व M. K. Gandhi चे close follower झाले. Gokhale व Deshmukh earlier liberal streams.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28344, 'General', 'Science', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'विष्णुबाबा ब्रह्मचारी आणि मिशनरी यांच्यातील वाद __________ पुस्तकात आढळतो.', '{"A": "वेदोक्त धर्मप्रकाश", "B": "समुद्रकिनारीचा वाद विवाद", "C": "अरुणोदय", "D": "धर्म विवेचन"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'येथे खात्रीशीर उत्तर पर्याय B. Vishnubaba Brahmachari व Christian missionaries यांचा debate ''Samudra Kinaricha Vad Vivad'' मध्ये. इतर titles वेगळी Marathi reform किंवा religious works.', '{"Science","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28345, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'राष्ट्रीय काँग्रेसचे पहिले अध्यक्ष व्योमेशचंद्र बॅनर्जी यांनी राष्ट्रीय काँग्रेसच्या स्थापनेची मूलभूत उद्दिष्टे सांगितली ती कोणती ? (a) सामाजिक समता/समानता (b) राष्ट्रीय भावना (c) धर्मनिरपेक्षता (d) ऐक्यभावनेचा विकास व दृढीकरण', '{"A": "(a) आणि (c) फक्त", "B": "(b) आणि (d) फक्त", "C": "(a) आणि (d) फक्त", "D": "(a), (b) आणि (c) फक्त"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय B चिन्हांकित केला. Womesh Chandra Bonnerjee, पहिले INC अध्यक्ष, national feeling व Indian unity — (b) व (d). Social equality व secularism या paper च्या syllabus note मध्ये founding objectives नाहीत.', '{"History","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28346, 'General', 'History', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'खालीलपैकी कोणती जोडी बरोबर आहे ?', '{"A": "बागची - प्रायव्हेट इन्व्हेस्टमेंट इन इंडिया", "B": "एस. गोपाल - इमर्जन्सी ऑफ इंडियन नॅशनॅलीझम्", "C": "अनिल सिल - प्रॉब्लेम्स अँड पॉलीटीक्स ऑफ ब्रिटिश इन इंडिया 1885 - 89", "D": "हिरालाल सिन्हा - ब्रिटिश पॉलिसी इन इंडिया"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'पर्याय A निवडा. Tapan Raychaudhuri (Bagchi) यांचे ''Private Investment in India 1900–1939'' — बरोबर author–work जोडी. इतर पर्याय well-known historians चुकीच्या book titles वर.', '{"History","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28347, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'कलकत्यास सुप्रीम कोर्टाची स्थापना कोणत्या कायद्याने करण्यात आली ?', '{"A": "1773 चा रेग्युलेटिंग अॅक्ट", "B": "1784 चा पिट्स इंडिया अॅक्ट", "C": "1793 चा सनदी कायदा", "D": "1813 चा सनदी कायदा"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'या प्रश्नात पर्याय A. Regulating Act 1773 ने Fort William, Calcutta येथे Supreme Court स्थापन — Company rule अंतर्गत India चे पहिले chartered high court. Pitt''s India Act (1784) governance reform; court तयार केले नाही.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28348, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'खालीलपैकी कोणती नदी गोदावरी खोऱ्याचा भाग नाही ?', '{"A": "तेरणा", "B": "प्रवरा", "C": "मांजरा", "D": "भातसा"}'::jsonb, 'D', 'योग्य उत्तर पर्याय D. Terna, Pravara, Manjra — Maharashtra मधील Godavari tributaries; Bhatsa Konkan side Ulhas basin मध्ये, Godavari drainage system चा भाग नाही.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28349, 'General', 'Geography', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'कोकण रेल्वेमुळे मुंबई ते कोचीन दरम्यानचे अंतर ______ कि.मी. ने कमी झाले.', '{"A": "513", "B": "213", "C": "102", "D": "302"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'थेट उत्तर — पर्याय A. Konkan Railway ने Mumbai–Kochi rail distance सुमारे 513 km ने कमी केले — Western Ghats मधून, Chennai व inland route ऐवजी.', '{"Geography","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium'),
  (28350, 'General', 'General Studies', 'MPSC Group B Combined', 2018, 'जागतिक वारसा शिल्पस्थानात ________ या लेणीची नोंद केलेली आहे.', '{"A": "अजंठा लेणी", "B": "कार्ले लेणी", "C": "पितळखोरा लेणी", "D": "बेडसा लेणी"}'::jsonb, 'A', 'परीक्षकाने पर्याय A चिन्हांकित केला. Ajanta caves UNESCO World Heritage List वर — Buddhist rock-cut art. Karle, Pitalkhora, Bedsa महत्त्वाची Deccan caves; उत्तरतालिकेतील heritage नोंद नाहीत.', '{"General Studies","MPSC Group B Combined","2018","General"}'::text[], 'Medium')
